  ('zcrm_1579374000123780003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294010', 'Christopher Kelly', NULL, '8-18-2023:  Chris'' kids now have other "ins", so he wants to remove them.  He was filling out the memb chg form &amp; wanted to conf what some of the sections meant.  He knows to make sure he submits it TODAY to get a 9/1/2023 eff date.  We disc what happens if he removes them &amp; it turns out they need to come back to healthsharing (dropped out of school, summer, etc.) &amp; if they then have a pre-x item = coming back doesn''t work.  He''s okay w/that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-18 10:32:30', '2023-08-18 11:15:56'),
