  ('zcrm_1579374000123674092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123699044', 'Ben DiSalle', NULL, '8-16-23 Ben called and introduced himself. He''s a financial advisor and has other clients who may need assistance with health insurance.  Often times clients want to retire but think they can''t bc of the cost and limitation of health ins. He''s thrilled to have someone to refer his clients to, to help with affordable, viable solutions. He came to me via Melinda Niemczyk since she''s been thrilled with my services.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-17 15:45:52', '2023-08-17 15:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123674084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123724002', 'Thomas, Sr. Mastroianni', NULL, '8-17-23 Tom is choosing CARE+ for Sept. 1st start date $2500/$480 and many kids with one due in August. Assuming that goes smoothly they will cancel their regular ins. for Sept. 1st. All set to go! Super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-17 15:21:25', '2023-08-17 15:36:14'),
