  ('zcrm_1579374000123700080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055771107', 'Marcy Oppenheimer', 'Spouse aging into Medicare eff 10/1/2023', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor - 8/17 via Outlook
Member submitted Change form to remove her husband eff 10/1/23.  I will reprocess.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-17 13:33:08', '2023-09-06 12:37:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123674059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095555002', 'Kyle Larsen', NULL, 'Kyle called the concierge and said the has yet to utilize his plan and wanted to know what he needs to do in order to schedule his annual physical. I explained in detail the email I sent him while on the phone, with the link to search for a provider in the PHCS Network. Once he finds a provider, I told him to call that office verifying they in fact are participating in the PHCS Network. Once verified, he can schedule out the appointment, and lastly just make sure he brings his Planstin card with him to hand upon arrival to his appt. The providers office will have all the info they need on that card to bill Planstin directly and reach out to Planstin if need be. I let Kyle know that is all he himself needs to do as Planstin takes care of the rest of the process moving forward. Kyle was extremely grateful for the help and mentioned he was surprised how helpful and kind I was with his member support, at most places out there are either automated, or people are rude with not much help at all. He thanked me kindly. I let him know if he needs anything else we are here for him anytime he needs at MPB. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-17 13:13:28', '2023-08-17 13:13:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123700074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811231', 'Jerry Brown', 'Spouse aging onto Medicare eff 10/1/2023', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor -8/17 via Outlook
Member submitted Change Form to remove spouse processed - 9/7', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-17 13:03:23', '2023-09-07 09:11:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123674049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121443002', 'Sajindra Gunawardane', NULL, 'Sajindra called just wanting come support knowing he did the right thing when he started the process of looking for a provider and facility in the PHCS Network for needing to schedule out a colonoscopy screening. He spoke with Cari yesterday and just wanted to let me know if he can call with the person from the authorization department in the facility, he found searching int he PHCS Network the 7th of this month, August, if they have any questions or need further clarification. I told him of course he can have them call, along with him anytime he needs help with anything in regard to this situation or any situation with is MPB Plan. I did tell him Planstin would probably be even more of support when it comes to the billing aspect though of the colonoscopy. After we spoke for a little while me explaining all of this, etc. He in fact did call back with Leah on the line from the facility. Leah said she spoke to someone over at Planstin and they told her the same thing I let Sajindra know that there really isn''t anything else needed to be authorized for this other than making sure they are in fact in the PHCS Network. So, she asked me to verify so, which I pulled up Multiplan to make sure and they in fact came up. She then said OK everything is good to go and Sajindra can now officially make an appointment for his colonoscopy screening. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-17 12:58:32', '2023-08-17 12:58:32'),
