  ('zcrm_1579374000123674044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8-17-23 Figge called bc Louisville Dental Assoc doesn''t know how to process this. There''s a Provider # on his email that they need to call to process the discount.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-17 11:23:02', '2023-08-17 11:23:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123698008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109018002', 'Cathie Kovacs', NULL, '08.17.2023 Cathie called to clarify if she would be covered for any vision eyewear or exam. I assured her that her plan does not carry any dental nor vision coverage. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-17 11:09:35', '2023-08-17 11:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123674039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123819010', 'Peter Mueller', NULL, '8-17-23 Peter Mueller cancelled successfully with Zion directly.  I will help him re-enroll upon their return on the 21st. 

Dear Peter Mueller,

We have loved having you as a member of the Zion HealthShare cost-sharing community!

This message serves to confirm that we have received and processed your request to withdraw your membership from Zion HealthShare. We wish you all the best in your future endeavors, and should you decide to return, know that we will be here to assist you.

Your membership withdrawal is effective as of 09/01/2023.

Kindly remember that if you choose to reinstate your membership, you will have a 30-day window from your withdrawal effective date to sign back up, ensuring your membership remains uninterrupted.

As our Zion HealthShare community continues to expand, we highly value member feedback as it helps us enhance the overall member experience. Please feel free to share your Zion Health experience with us, your community, family, and friends! Below, we''ve provided some helpful links where you can leave us a review. We regularly monitor our reviews and take each member''s feedback into careful consideration.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-17 10:56:07', '2023-08-17 10:56:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123674029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986163', 'Sylvie Bloch', NULL, '8-17-23 Eli and Sylvie decided to go with Freedom Health instead since they have underwriting and Sylvie is super healthy. Here''s what Eli said, 
"As you know, I have been paying $653 a month for a high deductible plan with Friday, which will stop my coverage in about two weeks.  You offered me another option with Rocky Mountain insurance company, that will charge me close to $800 a month, for even a "worse" plan that I currently have with "Friday."  After further research on my part, I was able to find a plan outside the Connect for Health Colorado program, with Freedom health insurance.  This plan which naturally, also comes with high deductible amount, only charges me $499 per month!!  Naturally, I had to go through the underwriting process, which was actually an advantage for me (my wife) due to the fact that my wife is in an excellent health (knock on wood...).  Apparently, the Connect for health Colorado, HAS to accept everyone, regardless of his or her medical history and condition.  That means that more healthy participants, like my wife, in essence, subsidize less healthy participants.  That is why the premium is relatively high.

Anyway, I thank you for your time and effort.  Let''s talk again next year.  Hopefully, there will be an even better plan available then.

Regards,

Eli"

I called him to discuss it but it''s what they preferred. Sylvie wants regular ins.  They will talk with me in a year or sooner. He will recommend me to his friends as well. All is well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-17 10:38:10', '2023-08-17 10:38:10'),
