  ('zcrm_1579374000123689028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '8/17/23 - Rachel called to find out how she has her ultrasound coded in order for it to be paid by Planstin. Rachel advised that she does not get a normal mammogram, but instead receives a prev ultrasound and that this has been paid by Planstin in the past. I told Rachel that I was unsure about that situation because as far as I know, mammo''s are covered but not ultrasounds. I did have to transfer Rachel to Planstin to get her answer on this situation. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-17 10:00:08', '2023-08-17 10:00:08'),
