  ('zcrm_1579374000123689023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735010', 'John Wech', NULL, '8/17/23 - John called in because he went to his wellness exam and the doctor found a lump on his collar bone. They have done an x-ray and ultrasound, but now want to do a CT scan with contrast. I will be sending John a list of imaging facilities in his area and I did transfer him to Zion to get his member portal set up for this need. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-17 09:40:59', '2023-08-17 09:40:59'),
