  ('zcrm_1579374000123689018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086852002', 'Brandon Ciullo', NULL, '8/17/23 - Brandon called in today because he received a bill from a recent doctors appointment. Upon our discussion we realized that this appointment was specifically for him to have a years worth of refills on a medication. I explained the cash pay process and advised him to call his docs office to ask for the cash pay price for a discount. Brandon was thankful and will be calling us for any further assistance. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-17 09:21:31', '2023-08-17 09:21:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123674008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123690002', 'Sheala Smith', NULL, '8-17-23 Sheala is enrolling in CARE+ since she doesn''t have self-employment income and her husband is choosing to remain on his plan for now. She understands pre-x and has bursitis on hip recently diagnosed. Stretching on her own first and then PT or possible steroid shot. She deals with depression which she handles with meds. She''s choosing Sept. 1st start date and paying with ACH. She''s very nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-17 09:18:52', '2023-08-17 09:21:42'),
