  ('zcrm_1579374000123635038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106694002', 'Renee Hornor', NULL, '8-16-2023:  Diane Border created ticket #: 2925.  She frustrated that the concierge told Renee we do not know anything about the new copay plan & feels like we are not supporting the sales field.  However, unless it was during her ''Welcome call w/Vanessa, I don''t see that we told her we do not know her program.  I asked Diane to please let Renee know the best way to get ahold of the concierge is to call our phone line (gave her our # & hours of opperation).  I asked Diane to call me tomorrow so I can answer her questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-16 22:56:22', '2023-08-16 22:57:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123637034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964297', 'Brooke Bangart', NULL, '08.16.2023 Brooke submitted a ticket re: opening a medical need with Zion, and seeing/learning how the HMA (matching) portion of her plan functions with this circumstance. 
I called her at the number provided in CRM, and we spoke. Zion was already closed, so I prefaced that I did not want the day to go without me haven called her, and shared a bit what to expect re: opening the medical need with Zion. I also guided her to speak to Jonathan Masters, her advisor, to get more clear on the HMA part. I reminded her that Zion closes at 5pm MTN and to be sure to call prior to that. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-16 17:40:54', '2023-08-16 17:40:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123635024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121443002', 'Sajindra Gunawardane', NULL, '8-16-2023:  Sajindra called.  He''s sure he''s going to have trouble w/getting his screening colonoscopy becasue he''s "been in healthcare before and knows this is just going to be difficult."
     - ''Prev Care'' Screening Colonoscopy:  Present Planstin card.  As long as all prov will bill Planstin for him, & it stays a ''screening'', they will cover this for him.
     - IF they pull polyps, Sajindra knows to call us after he gets home & recovers (a day or two) and we will help him move this to a diagnostic colonoscopy w/his healthshare comp Zion = he will be resp for the 1k IUA.
     - Planstin:  Caden conf e-mail & phy add (I conf w/Sajindra before calling Planstin) & Caden sent the pdf copy while we were on the phone.  Then he ordered the hard copy cards too.  I told Sajindra to expect the pdf today, however the hard copy cards can take 2-4 weeks (to give it plenty of time).
     He had lots of ''what if'' scenarios:
          - "what if they won''t call out to get conf?"  I reminded him they asked him for the ph # to call to conf.  But, if something goes wrong, he can call us & we can do a conf call so they can talk to us, since he may need to auth that.
          - "what if they don''t understand":  We can try to help them understand if needed.  That''s what we are here for.
          - "what if they say they don''t take PHCS ins":  I let him know if the prov will bill Planstin for him, Planstin will still pay for the ''screening'' colonoscopy for him.  
     Those are just a few examples.  We may hear from him again, esp since Planstin is having such a diff time guiding our memb & helping w/their cov right now.
     Sajindra seems like he prepares & panicks.  Hopefully, this will go well for him and he''ll feel more confident in using his healthcare in the future.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-16 17:03:30', '2023-08-16 17:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123635019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102604002', 'Cynthia Shelden', NULL, '8-16-2023:  Cynthia called the concierge line (after an incredibly quiet morning) late afternoon while Nahla was alone (I was at the tail-end of my lunch).  She panicked when she tried us 4 times in a short 3-minute period, so she went to Karen for help.  Karen pinged me while I was at lunch, so I responded & called Cynthia when I got back (~1/2 hour later).  According to Karen, Cynthia had already called Zion since she couldn''t get ahold of us.  I let Karen know it''s worth letting the memb know, we were just on the phone & we will call them back if possible.  That way we can guide them so the process is easier for the member.  
     - ILM for Cynthia letting her know how sorry we are they are going thru this.  That we were just overwhelmed w/14 calls in about 12 min, so I''m returning her call & am here to help.  Gave her the concierge line''s #, hours, & what not getting thru means.  To please call us if we can support them in any manner.  [Nahla caught all but 2 of the calls, it just so happens Cynthia was one of those 2 calls.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-16 16:29:36', '2023-08-16 18:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123621088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110552002', 'Sheryl Hadley', NULL, '8-16-23 Playing phone tag with her to answer some questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-16 16:08:49', '2023-08-16 16:08:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123621078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '8-16-23 Julie called to clarify wellness screenings, network and when to show the card, etc. Her vm is full. I sent a long text explaining how to handle it one more time. Actually I''ll send the RBP doc to them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-16 15:57:45', '2023-08-16 15:57:45'),
