  ('zcrm_1579374000123637003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122378001', 'Amy Donnell', NULL, '08.16.2023 Jeff called needing to open a medical need with Zion. I went over the steps that he might expect with all the new loops members are having to go through with Zion, gave him their number, and direct transferred him. 
