  ('zcrm_1579374000123618023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714162', 'Christine Lair', NULL, '8/16/23 - Glen called because he wants to cancel the family''s entire plan due to some major life events that have happened. He advised that he spoke with his advisor, Stuart, who suggested he call into the concierge line to cancel. I sent the cancellation email to the Lair''s but also called the number we have on file for Stuart to let him know that this member requested cancellation. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-16 14:46:20', '2023-08-16 14:46:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123635008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904304', 'Katherine Waller', NULL, '8-16-2023:  Katherine called.  She''s completely frustrated.  From what I gather the bills that go clear back to 2022 that Redirect should have paid, because she''s submitted them as directed on the app, are still lingering.  In March 2023, I tried again to help Katherine & those too sit unpaid.  Since I have had no luck in making progress on her issues w/Redirect (annual prev appt, annual labs, chiropractic visits), I brought Jennifer Thorin in and she''s going to see if she has any better luck.  I''ve tried calling Redirect, submitting thier extra help items, etc.  No wonder Katherine is so frustrated.  She paying for their service & nothing is being taken care of...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-16 14:19:16', '2023-08-16 14:24:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123635003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028645001', 'Heather Ferrante', NULL, '8-16-2023:  Heather (spelled: Healther in their Admin123 file.  She knows we''ll need to fix that) called.
     - Her daughter had someone else do her taxes & is being told she has almost a 1k fine for not having ins.  Heather says they all live in CA & I do not see a MEC, so that is completely possible.  Heather mentioned it might be time to upgrade & if no pre-x that might be a good idea so they are compliant w/CA laws.  Michele looks like she enrolled them, but is out, so I sugg she LM for JK (whose name is also in the file).  If she hasn''t heard from him by Friday, she''ll let us know and we can try again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-16 13:49:22', '2023-08-16 13:49:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123621053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152148', 'Justin Acker', NULL, '8-16-23 Justin and I finally connected and his wife is leaving her company ins and they want to add the rest of the family. It looks like at the $1500 IUA for PSDHC it will be $695.97 for Sept. Then wife turns 40 in October and price will be $715.97 moving forward. He''s fine with that. I''ll send him the form to complete and he''ll do it by Friday 8/18/23.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-16 12:34:12', '2023-08-16 12:34:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123621045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '8-16-23 I changed ICQuotes from Pending to Active status for her new plan and adjusted the amount to $297.92 from .91. I cancelled her current plan as of 8/31/23 with the help of Sean. I called Cigna for Brokers at 877-244-6215 and spoke with George. He could see the app was submitted on 8/12/23 and suggested to wait until early next week to check on the app to be moved from Submitted status to Approved since it''s still in the Work Queue with Cigna since she doesn''t have to show proof of SEP since she was a Friday Health client.  Her app ID is HS20188932. Sean suggested I make sure her account is successfully set up with the Binding Payment and Auto Pay all set to go as well!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-16 12:24:57', '2023-08-16 12:25:56'),
