  ('zcrm_1579374000123618003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, '8/16/23 - Paul called in this AM with questions regarding opening a need for a recent ER visit. We went over the process and I advised him that he will have to speak with Zion to request his member portal information but if he needs assistance once he is in to give us a call. Paul also inquired about a recent prev care visit and the fact that he never knew he had to present his Planstin card at his prev appointments. I advised him that it has been done this way since the beginning when Kelly Anne did his call with him and then he remembered that he saw a holistic doc that would not bill insurance. I advised Paul that moving forward he will present his Planstin card for prev care and that he can attempt to ask for a reimbursement from Planstin but it would not be guaranteed since this provider will not bill. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-16 09:46:15', '2023-08-16 09:46:15'),
