  ('zcrm_1579374000123578016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121749002', 'Stuart Skok', NULL, '8-15-2023:  RX Quotes - Stuart went from KS to Walgreens when KS could not supply everything, but it''s about a $70 price diff.  So, he''s going to try to get what he can from KS & will get what he can''t from Walgreens.  Therefore, I sent him coupons for all of the prescriptions w/the cheapest pricing on each for both KS & Walgreens, so he has whatever he needs.
