     - Gen Adderall 30mg, #30 tabs = $10.22 @ KS on Sngl Care & $16.40 @ Walgreens on WebMD
     - Gen Valtrex 500mg, #90 tabs = $32.78 @ KS on Sngl Care & $102.97 @ Walgreens on BuzzRX
