  ('zcrm_1579374000123580003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '08.15.23:  My response by John Kach to my ticket, wrote that Amy & Sean were billed $795 for June, July and August.  I noted a $110 charge for the HSA-Mec in June, but I didn''t see that charge for July in Admin123 and I didn''t see any charges for August either.  I emailed Amy explaining both fees ($795 for SECURE and $110 for Planstin HSA-MEC) that I was told were billed and to re-check her bank statements to confirm this.  Also to let me know if she doesn''t see the Planstin fee appearing on her statements.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-08-15 12:03:49', '2023-08-15 12:05:13'),
