  ('zcrm_1579374000123546013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082153001', 'Raluca Socander', NULL, '8/15/23 - Raluca called this AM because her OBGYN and PCP both told her they do not accept her "insurance". I advised that Raluca ask if they are willing to bill Multiplan/Planstin directly for her prev care services and if not, she may have to find a different provider. We also spoke about a medical need she wants to open for a recent ER trip. She is currently having issues with her Zion member portal. She is going to contact Zion again today and then reach out to us if she needs assistance with submitting her information to Zion. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-15 09:04:32', '2023-08-15 09:04:32'),
