  ('zcrm_1579374000123465095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, '08.14.2023 Carol called to remember what the site''s name that we shared with her where she can search and review doctors. I reminded her of the email sent out back on 6/16, and offered her healthgrades.com and also the multiplan link. Carol was jovial and receptive in learning. She is searching for a doctor for emergency situations. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-14 15:02:23', '2023-08-14 15:16:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123465081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105872022', 'David Wyatt', NULL, '08.14.2023 Katrina called to attain the cancellation form. She asked who to put down as the advisor, and I shared that the only thing showing here as her advisor is HSLDA. She remembered which organization that was that referred her to MPB, and just put that on the form. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-14 14:33:28', '2023-08-14 14:46:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123465068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114514002', 'Kevin Bayerlein', NULL, '08.14.2023 Talitha called to change her payment information on her account. She was not in front of a computer, so I offered to send her the form, to open it when she can to make that change. Talitha seemed a bit bothered, but reassured her that the system will not let me make that change for her. I emailed her the form via CRM.
*********************************************************************************
Talitha had to call back b/c the form was not allowing her to move forward to submit the form, so I tried Patti to see if she''s still in the office. I did not get a response, so I let Talitha go to talk to Patti tomorrow morning, to help her.  Talitha says that Patti helped with this form in the past, b/c it would not let her  complete the task last time as well. I was not sure how Patti would be able to do that, but I reassured Talitha that I am not set up to be able to do it myself.
*********************************************************************************
Patti ended up still in the office, and messaged me via teams. I had already let Talitha go though. So I offered her Talitha''s phone number and full name. 
Patti confirmed via teams  "I don''t take Payment updates over the phone I want a record of the member changing it."       NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-14 14:27:13', '2023-08-14 14:44:03'),
