  ('zcrm_1579374000123486085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113582001', 'Jennifer Levine', NULL, '8-14-2023:  Jennifer called in.     DIRECT Plan:
She had a lot of questions because she''s having back pain from hurting her back a few weeks ago.  It doesn''t seem to be healing & she wasn''t sure how to use her plan:
     - no referral req''d.  We walked thru HCBB together & she has used healthgrades.com, so she seem to take to the system quite well.
     - We disc how her healthsharing comp works: how IUAs work, issue specific & 3/12mos rolling period w/4th+ beyond >$500 IUA waived, no ins, no ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' discount, & then we have 6mos from DOS to sub the expenses, which are issue specific & we can submit as they come along w/the 6mos deadline per srvc in mind.  She will call once she''s seen a doc & has a better idea of what they will want to do so we can give her inst on sub a ''med need''.
     - PT, chiro, etc., let''s get the treatment plan & get pre-approval from the healthsharing comp to make sure they will share.
      - Direct Plan:  we disc in depth how the $175 for an office visit (only) & poss pap work = once per 12mos, prob wait to mo 13 to be certain.  Could use for above issue, but then wouldn''t go twds her IUA.  Also disc how colonoscopies & mamm work w/direct, limitations, etc., read directly from the curr Zion Prev Care in their guidelines.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-14 13:55:45', '2023-08-14 17:24:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123530008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108946002', 'Charles Warner', NULL, 'Charles reached out to the concierge line earlier this morning trying to figure out if his doctor was participating in the PHCS Network. I told him and confirmed with him his email address and let him know I was sending the link with step-by-step instructions on how to navigate the website in order to search for his provider in the network. Along with any other providers or facilities. He thanked me and is all set. No further assistance needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-14 13:21:49', '2023-08-14 13:21:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123486080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111230001', 'Larisa Falcon', NULL, '8-14-2023:  Larisa is trying to understand her plan.     DIRECT PLAN
     - Ck''d her ACH acct # & all is good.  She was thinking cc pymt, but didn''t want to incur the 3% fee.
     - She was open to accepting another invitation for her ''Welcome Call'' & acknowledged we''d tried before.  It sounded like she was sched when we got off the phone.
     - We talked about how to present (which for her is consistent for both the few ''prev care'' items allowed on the Direct Plan & for her healthsharing items:  No "Ins", No ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc.  We talked opt of getting written est & sub to get pre-pd cc if desired.
     - Disc how the few ''prev care'' items work, limitations, etc.  She''s past the 6mos waiting period, so we read the limits, etc from Zion''s curr ''Prev Care'' in their guidelines.  She seemed to understand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-14 13:16:29', '2023-08-14 18:34:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123465047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '08.14.2023 Joel went in for his physical TODAY. They wanted to do lab work outside of the standard lipid panel, and he is checking to see if any or all of it is covered. I told him that what we have seen covered so far is the standard lipid panel only. Anything else needs to be separated from the preventative appointment, and presented as a cash pay item. I guided him to use the lab discounted sites if he chooses to go that route: JasonHealth.com and WalkInLabs.com. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-14 12:44:02', '2023-08-14 12:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123486061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116003002', 'Robert Hanley', NULL, '8-14-2023:  Andrea called looking for counseling for her 11 &amp; 13 yr olds.  We went to the Mazz &amp; Sull site together &amp; went over the sm ntwk, paying during waiting periods, pattern of pd for visits, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-14 12:24:17', '2023-08-14 12:24:17'),
