  ('zcrm_1579374000123465023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108514002', 'Diana Novak', NULL, '08.14.2023 Ralph called with a lot of energy towards cancelling his wife''s, Diana Novak, plan with MPB.
Given that I did not see Ralph on the plan nor is there a permission form filled out, I could not speak to Ralph on the matters of Diana''s plan, even if it is cancelling.
I told Ralph that, but he quickly became difficult by talking over me, repeating himself, and disregarding what I was saying "I am not able to speak to you on Diana''s behalf, given that you are legally not on the plan" - He kept on saying that he needed it to stop charging the account, they found another company, and that he set it up anyways-why can''t he cancel it?.
I explained the process, he said Diana was right there next to him and ask if I wanted her to speak to me and I said that would be fantastic. A person got on the phone, who TO ME, did not sound like an adult female. I could be wrong, but it sounded like a teenager mimicking an adult voice. 
The other part I offered is for them to contact their advisor, he knew who I was talking about by saying "You mean Whitney ..?" I said yes, have you spoken to her yet, he said that he cannot catch her, and if I''m going to transfer him to stay on the line to make sure she is there to pick them up to talk. I did that. I spoke to Whitney who concurs that Ralph has not been a pleasant member to correspond with, and she would be happy to take him off my hands to settle the matter. I appreciate Whitney in that matter and transferred Ralph over with "Diana". NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-14 10:27:50', '2023-08-14 10:35:26'),
