  ('zcrm_1579374000123484064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975002', 'Lynn O''Malley', NULL, '8-11-23 Lynn applied for NLG 250K 20Yr Term for $86.68. The Hope Institute will pay $25 towards the policy. She will likely move it to 10-YR Term and can''t pay much more than the $25. Her health record was super clean! She will likely be rated up from Standard for a better rate. Once we get a response from NLG, she can decide what she wants to do for price. Her income is $40K, very little debt of $57 for mortgage and has 2 older cars without debt. Clean profile. Net worth $428K.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-11 15:07:56', '2023-08-11 15:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123486013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '8-11-2023:  Carolyn called.  She was admitted to the ER last Sat for an extreme migraine.   
