  ('zcrm_1579374000123484023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123690002', 'Sheala Smith', NULL, '8-11-23 Sheala is 50 and was referred by her boss Ronald Johnson who was Tupac Manzanarez''s client. So, Tupac is not with MPB anymore. Her husband gets benefits through school system as a teacher. However he also coaches on the side and gets a 1099. If he joins, they can join SECURE. If not, I gave her pricing on CARE+ and DIRECT and explained differences. Their open enrollment ends Aug. 17th for the school. For adding Sheala on the plan they are looking at is $550 for her only or EF is $1396. The cheapest plan is $415 to add her only to his plan or $1180 EF.  She does have a new hip pain that is possible bursitis. She understands if it''s cancer or something terrible, it''s at her cost. She will make sure she figures out what it is before making a decision. Knows it will be considered pre-x. She also takes depression meds. Taking Trintellix 20mg x 84tabs $291.58 + $9.95 shipping thru WorldMed RX. Also Pharmacy Checker is showing as low as $67 for 28 tablets or $180 for 84 tablets!  This is within reach for her to pay. She''s already paid about $2K through her current ins and now pays $10 co-pay. But, pretty brutal. The rest of the family is healthy and no pre-x. Daughter is 16 and son is 14.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-11 12:01:41', '2023-08-11 12:01:41'),
