  ('zcrm_1579374000123442069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100781002', 'Shannon McIlwaine', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/1/23 citing now receiving employer coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-11 10:24:32', '2023-08-11 10:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123484003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '8-11-23 Carolyn called Zion to see what pres med coverage they have and they recommended she adds on their pres drug program for $15 a month. She''s happy with Zion. She''s been having migraines lately but her blood pressure is too low to be put on the typical migraine med. So the other options are expensive meds. I called and left her a vm with the MPB Concierge Team # to call for pricing out these new meds to see if she can get them at a reasonable rate.  If not, perhaps with the MEC she already has access to OptumRX. I''m not sure. But, that''s the next step I''d go down before having her spend more money.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-11 10:20:35', '2023-08-11 10:20:35'),
