  ('zcrm_1579374000123465008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781018', 'Michele Brooks', NULL, 'Pamela from the Montrose Memorial called directly back after I transferred her, and she said Zion could not find any sort of information under any info Richard provided. I let her know that he is not the primary and is the spouse under Michele Brooks. BUT, Zion should have still been able to pull him up giving his name, DOB, etc. I gave her more info spelling out Michele''s full name, that Zion would be pulling the account under her being the primary. Lastly, I further explained that until Richard pays his IUA, there is no sort of authorization needing and the Hospital won''t need any sort of policy # Pamela is looking for until AFTER Richard pays the $2000 in full of his IUA. Along with the fact that Richard has to be the one to reach out to Zion Health, or Michele, and submit his bills and receipts after he pays. Once he submits everything and pays the IUA in full, Zion will then contact Montrose Memorial and take it from there to negotiate the billing and payment thereafter. She''s fully aware now and all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-11 09:31:30', '2023-08-11 09:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123465003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058781018', 'Michele Brooks', NULL, 'An employee named Pamela Hightower from Montrose Memorial Hospital called in regard to Ronald Reed under Michele''s plan with us here. Pamela stated she was calling about authorization for Richard''s medical care he has just been admitted for in the ER department. I told her the only sort of authorization would be through Zion Health after he pays his IUA responsibilities of $2000. I told Pamela Richard is a cash paying patient only for his IUA amount and everything else he would submit into Zion. I provided Zion''s phone number and did a direct transfer over to Zion. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-11 09:24:40', '2023-08-11 09:24:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123442024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121185002', 'Allison Carman', NULL, 'Spoke to Angela about this member.  She shared that she &amp; advisor have not heard anymore from this member re: pushing of her start date.  I pushed it until 10/1 to avoid her being billed.  Angela to let me know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-11 09:20:37', '2023-08-11 09:20:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123442013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123149001', 'Michael DeVivo', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of September 1st. Sent email to do so. Also gave Patti member''s business EIN #. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-08-11 07:59:20', '2023-08-11 09:15:39'),
