  ('zcrm_1579374000123386013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118784002', 'Sharma Atkinson-Staten', NULL, '8-10-2023:  Sharma sub an RX Quote req.  One item is a compound drug w/an active Pet Medication in it.  We do not have a source for discounted compound drugs.  She''s also requesting a pharmacy that does not have a contract on any site (N FL Pharm Main).  So, I ran the other 3 items &amp; WinnDixie is least exp at $32.60, but am waiting for a call back to make sure she''s ok w/that.
     Sharma = Sharmacare.com = DPC Practice from the VM.  ILM letting her know I need to disc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-10 17:55:02', '2023-08-10 17:55:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126944001', 'Daniel Kimble', NULL, '8-10-23 Daniel called me back and asked his questions.  First I asked how he found us and he said via google search. I asked who he spoke with and he believes it was a co-founder. My only guess is John Kach, not Wiley Long.  However, there are no records of anyone on our team talking with him. He lives in CA and wants to make sure he understands how it qualifies for ACA compliance. I explained. I shared the pre-x clause again for him and he doesn''t have anything.  He''s getting his EIN and ACH information to enroll. He wants a Sept. 1st start date. He seems to have a good grasp of the membership and wants SECURE $1000/$375 and he got the $25 discount since it''s not showing on the enrollment now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 17:52:44', '2023-08-10 17:54:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120206002', 'Nick Jones', NULL, '08.10.2023 Logan put in an RX request. I emailed via Outlook the following:
I am glad I was able to find these deals for you, and I hope they are to your liking, and convenient for you, based on the zip code provided, 97530. The pharmacy you listed as a preference did not come up in any of the 8 sites that I searched. I was able to narrow all meds down to Safeway. 
