The total for all 3 prescriptions at: Safeway = $52.37.   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-10 17:28:10', '2023-08-10 17:28:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064227248', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '8-10-23 Ann called bc she got some mail that made it sound like her plan was ending. It sounds like a scam. I looked up her account in C4 and everything looks active and she told me she''s been paying successfully without interruption. She should be all set. She asked about dental and I sent her the 1dental link and suggested the Preferred Plan and she can start right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 16:57:03', '2023-08-10 16:57:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '08.10.2023 Elsa called to get help in opening a medical need with Zion. After going over the steps to expect with Zion''s process, gave her their number, I direct transferred her to them NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-10 16:54:21', '2023-08-10 17:04:10'),
