  ('zcrm_1579374000123396023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124216002', 'Bradon Erickson', NULL, '8-10-23 I left a vm with Bradon to help him and I sent him an email with the video link to begin learning. Quote form shows he looking at the $5K IUA in 30-49 age group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 15:56:54', '2023-08-10 16:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123690002', 'Sheala Smith', NULL, '8-10-23 I was given this lead by Kelly and it''s showing up on Wiley''s Team. Not sure what''s happening. I just sent her an email before I saw this. I''ll inquire with Kelly. This is the 2nd one like this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 15:52:09', '2023-08-10 15:52:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '08.10.2023 Jason called to see if dermatology is covered by Planstin. I did inform him that it is not. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-10 15:47:18', '2023-08-10 15:47:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126944001', 'Daniel Kimble', NULL, '8-10-23 This lead was passed to me but now I see it''s connected to Wiley''s Team. I left Daniel a vm before seeing this. So, I''m inquiring with our team to see if they know what''s going on with this client, if nobody responded to him or not. I will make sure if he needs to speak with Wiley''s team. System is showing no contact has been made yet.  
UPDATE, Nahla showed me that Daniel managed to call JD 5 times while he was on this lunch break today. So, JD was checking with the Concierge Team to see if he''d been helped yet and that''s when Nahla reached out to me.  She''s not sure the status of the lead. I''ll inquire with Daniel if/when he calls me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 15:42:55', '2023-08-10 15:42:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975002', 'Lynn O''Malley', NULL, '8-10-23 Lynn and I will walk through the application for life ins tomorrow for $250K max for 10 or 20 yr term. We''ll have her apply for 20 Yr and can always drop it to 10 year depending on the final cost. She''s not comfortable paying much more over the $25 that THIA is giving to them. She might be able to do another $25 or so. She knows it''s important but money is tight.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 15:28:20', '2023-08-10 15:28:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123386008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109363024', 'Jeremy Stillman', NULL, '8-10-2023:  Jeremy called to see if dental was part of his plan.  I let him know general dentistry, cleanings, maint, are not - it would have to cross into ''medical'' or be due to a qualified issue &amp; gave the accident that includes your teeth (falling on the ice) type scenario.  He did want to see if his advisor Zack Masters offers anything, so I transferred him there (he has his ph#).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-10 14:15:24', '2023-08-10 14:15:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123386003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '8-10-2023:  Pulled up this profile when the caller was having trouble w/the Zion Memb Port recognizing them to sub a ''med need''.  (I''m assuming I was talking w/Brooke.)  Told her I thought they had fixed that glitch, but since she''s still having trouble Zion would be able to help her thru it.  Made sure she has their ph#, then trans her to them.  She knows to connect w/cust srvc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-10 14:05:24', '2023-08-10 14:05:24'),
