  ('zcrm_1579374000123346036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, 'After speaking w/Guy this member still wanted to cancel.  Her reasoning is because she doesn''t want to have to do so much work.   I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-10 12:36:59', '2023-08-10 12:36:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123379013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123382001', 'Erik Rubin', NULL, '8-10-23 Erik is 37 and wife is 35 and they live in PA with 3 kids all under the age of 7. They own their own biz, healthy, no tobacco. One takes sertroline/zoloft. They also asked about maternity, so I let them know about the 60 day waiting period and sent the maternity brochure. I sent him the video to watch as well. They want SECURE $1000/$715. Enrollment complete. They are super nice and excited for this option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 12:19:04', '2023-08-10 12:21:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123379003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '8-10-23 Carey and Craig updated their income to $40K Est for Craig after subtracting about $5K for expenses and $48K for Carey after subtracting about $7200 expenses for Carey annually. This increase in income then increased their cost for plans which was a shock to them. The Cigna Connect Bronze 0 is about $589 per month after their $680.93 APTC. This will be tough on them. So, I suggested the SECURE membership as an alternative if they use the $2500 IUA it brings the cost down to $550. Craig sees a cardiologist to check his cholesterol meds. Not sure how that makes sense. He''s on Lipitor. He also gets his prostate checked. So, we will need to be 100% certain there aren''t underlying pre-x that they aren''t sharing. Carey takes Adderall ER and hormones. Otherwise they are healthy and they are both self-employed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-10 12:02:38', '2023-08-18 15:47:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123352023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118784002', 'Sharma Atkinson-Staten', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-08-10 10:58:37', '2023-08-10 10:58:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123373008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102746002', 'David Mix', NULL, '8-10-2023:  David called.  Jennifer''s ER visit from 7/4/2023 invoices, etc, are ready.  We walked thru how to sub a ''med need'' to Zion.  He has their # &amp; I trans him at the end of the call &amp; after letting him know what to do, what to expect, etc.  He asked if he can pay Zion his 1k IUA &amp; I told him yes, once the need is going you can just call them w/that pymt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-10 10:55:29', '2023-08-10 10:55:29'),
