  ('zcrm_1579374000123272026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111987001', 'Veronique Benoit', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove children  eff 9/1/23 from membership because they now have Employer benefits.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-10 09:00:42', '2023-08-10 09:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123343008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088078001', 'Nathaniel Grabau', NULL, 'Nathan called the concierge line and also messaged via SalesIQ, needing help logging in for CirrusMD. I got his info and saw that there is not registration date stating he actually was fully registered. I went to register him and have the registration email sent to him to create a password & account with CirrusMD, but I got an error message stating there are no records matching his personal info. I got with John Kach, and he will help show me what to do to solve Nathan''s issue with getting set up with CirrusMD after a brief meeting John was starting. I reached out to Nathan to let him know we are working on it, and I will be reaching out to him with a solution shortly. Nathan actually responded back to me via email letting me know no need to do anything as he was able to get into his account, which is great news! So, Nathan is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-10 08:51:22', '2023-08-10 08:51:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123344008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122571002', 'Andrew Thomson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-08-10 08:48:29', '2023-08-10 08:48:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123272008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form to revert payment back to bank account on file', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-10 07:44:29', '2023-08-10 07:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123300059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124293077', 'Paul Dreyer', NULL, '8-9-23 Paul is 50 and his wife is 46 and they live in Lyons. They have Friday Health now and are searching for other options and found MPB online. No kids, healthy, no smoking, both are self-employed 1099 contract workers. Paul had a total knee replacement 1 year ago and is still managing that. I immediately explained the pre-x clause and suggested he remains on ins and his wife can join MCS. I proceeded to explain MCS start to finish and explained SECURE since his wife likes to do he annual wellness checks. They know of HSA''s but don''t have one.  They want to keep their drs. They need a Sept. 1st start date and I told him the deadline. He wants some info to read through and review.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-09 18:04:46', '2023-08-09 18:04:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123286056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093898002', 'Matthew Hoit', 'Selina''s/Main E-mail eff 8/9/2023:  selina@hoitengineering.com', '8-9-2023:  Selina called & tt JD.  He asked us to update her e-mail.  I called Selina & helped her fill out the form.  She prev set-up their CirrusMD accts as
     - Matthew: matt@hoitengineering.com, & her old e-mail: selina@fusemail.com.  After the  change to her new e-mail: selina@hoitengineering.com (which will now be the only one that will be listed on the CRM acct just like hers was the only one before), hopefully we can make sure CirrusMD is accurate too.  They don''t want everything going to Matt since she takes care of everything.  There doesn''t seem to be a way to chg her e-mail w/in her CirrusMD app.  She''s super nice and hopefully, this won''t make CirrusMD difficult.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-09 17:23:32', '2023-08-09 17:31:58');
