  ('zcrm_1579374000123296061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 9/1/23 due to the fact that he now is eligible for his new spouse''s insurance.  Per note below, Wendy has spoken to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-09 14:27:32', '2023-08-09 14:27:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123296051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110261002', 'Lance Casey', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing the fact that he needs coverage for Pre-Ex.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-09 14:20:53', '2023-08-09 14:20:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123277048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238233', 'Michelle McCaster', NULL, '08.09.2023 Michelle was really upset, as a matter of fact a bit frantic when she called b/c not only someone with little knowledge spewed out statements like "you don''t have coverage", but b/c of the trauma that had occurred that rendered her to the hospital where that person worked. I talked her off that ledge, but then she told me what happened (traumatized by someone who broke her window, came in, punched her in the face multiple times, cut her cheek open. Michelle had to go to the emergency room to get stitches.
I explained that she is covered, but is responsible for the $500 IUA, and later explained that is a one time fee towards ONE specific need. I emailed her via CRM the instructions to submit bills to Sedera.
She then said she is getting headaches, I asked her if she got an MRI, she said no, she''s healthy, then I said, you need to make sure nothing happened when he hit you....please get an MRI....She said she is going to talk to her Doctor to get a referral, to get an MRI.
I left Michelle at better ease at the end of the conversation, and that was comforting to know she is going to take the right steps to take care of herself after such incident. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-09 13:46:39', '2023-08-09 15:18:25'),
