  ('zcrm_1579374000123177130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '08.08.2023 Kallie called to follow up on any progress with addressing why Planstin is not covering the anesthesiologist from her colonoscopy.
