  ('zcrm_1579374000123177116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121506002', 'Brian Tollefson', NULL, '08.08.2023 Laura called back to clarify how to present herself for her doctor''s visit on Thursday. She is getting a specialist to review her blood results from her annual check up. I guided her to present herself as a cash pay patient. She asked what if they refused her, and asked for insurance, I said, you can tell them  you have insurance but it is purely for preventative purposes only. I explained the difference self-pay, and cash-pay. Laura was receptive and understanding. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-08 15:44:34', '2023-08-08 15:44:34'),
