  ('zcrm_1579374000123177103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, '08.08.2023 Debbie called to confirm colonoscopies are covered. I said they are under preventative covered, but if they pull polyps then it turns into diagnostic and we will open a medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-08 15:06:03', '2023-08-08 15:06:03'),
