  ('zcrm_1579374000123217045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095867002', 'Jennifer Tibbetts', NULL, '8-8-2023:  Jennifer was trans to us from Zion.  She wanted to get a quote for adding her college age son.  Zion quoted her a price of $100/mo to cover him on his own membership.  When I look at memb + child on her curr plan, it adds $300.  We went over the addl benefits w/our memb, but he is an Alaskan native (or something like that), so all of his care is covered when he''s at home.  She only needs something to take care of him while he''s away at school.  With the $200/mo price diff she''s stuggling.  I reminded her one thing that would be diff = 3 IUA/membership = 2 memb = 3 per person/yr.  May never get to that, but at least it''s something to be aware of.
     I recommended she tt her advisor Wiley Long (she had no idea who that was).  I gave her his ph # & she will call back & ask for me if he cannot help her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-08 14:01:27', '2023-08-08 14:12:08'),
