  ('zcrm_1579374000123158071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986163', 'Sylvie Bloch', NULL, '8-8-23 I called and let Eli know that her only option through C4 is RMHP. But, I will check to see if Anthem outside of C4 is an option.  All Anthem plans Off-Exchange are Pathway plans, so her Dr. won''t accept them. Her Dr. won''t accept Pathway, Enhanced or Surefit plans with Anthem, Cigna Connect plans. They will accept RMHP/UHC but the lowest price is $778.co which he was shocked by.  So, I mentioned MCS and he''s now more open minded since it''s $375 for the best plan. They have some rental properties to show self-employment income with both Eli and Sylvie''s name on them. She can keep her Dr. and have more freedom of choice! I sent him the video to watch and share with his wife.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-08 11:41:30', '2023-08-08 13:21:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123158066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111173009', 'Jonathan Surdam', NULL, '8-8-23 Talked with Tom Surdam, Jonathan''s father to help find a new plan. He wanted mental health but hasn''t used it yet and has a med Fluvoxamine showing for $30 25 mg 90 day supply on GoodRX rather than paying $35 co-pay for 30 day supply through ins. He will relay to Jonathan. Income remains at $36K.

