  ('zcrm_1579374000123177041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, '08.07.2023 Megan called to clarify how to proceed with taking her children for their annual check up. I guided Megan to present her Planstin card and the information on the back of it, request that they maintain this appointment as preventative. If they need to deviate from that for any reason, just ask them to please separate that from the preventative part.  I referred Megan to the healthcare.gov information on All adults, Women and Children. She asked about immunizations, and I listed a few that were on the site/ I emailed her the link with some reminders on how to present. Megan was happy to peruse the site at her own leisure, due to her driving during the call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-07 15:21:32', '2023-08-07 15:25:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123177031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '08.07.2023 Normandie called to better understand how to present at her consultation with the surgeon for removal of the gall bladder for gall stones.
