  ('zcrm_1579374000123153034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094775002', 'Jamie Johnson', NULL, '8-7-2023:  Jamie called.  Her son Gunnar is have such bad lower abdomen pain he can hardly walk, so she''s taking him to the ER.  We went over how to present: No "ins", No ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, resp for 1st 1k, if prescribed RX outside of the hosp w/can look for best pricing, etc.  She will call us afterwards &amp; we can help her sub ''med need'' since they just chg''d the process.  She''ll take our # in case she has questions while they are doing everything.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-07 12:32:59', '2023-08-07 12:38:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123153029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120981009', 'Anne Steegman', NULL, '8-7-2023:  Kassie (= Anne) called.  She has some muscle detatchment(?) that the doc thinks can be repaired w/PT.  This is a completely new discussion/issue, so we went over getting a treatment plan, seeing how much they expect, how to present: no "ins", no ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, 6 mos deadline re: sub so even if not at 1k IUA only way to prot initial expenses if any chance it will be ongoing.  She''s going to get the treatment plan & will call us for help in sub a ''med need''.     - CA

[Note:  I forgot to tell her, the doc''s appt where it was diagnosed & any follow-ups, etc., are also a part of this ''issue'' & hence sb sub w/the treatment plan to go twds the IUA.]', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-07 12:27:52', '2023-08-07 12:41:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123177008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '08.07.2023 Heather called inquiring about having her chiropractic sessions covered. I read to her the guidelines, and how the sessions need to be part of a qualifying medical need. I recommended that she speak to Zion for more clarification on this matter, as they are the ones that make the decisions on their shareable items. She requested that I send her the verbiage to refer to when she speaks to Zion. I could not transfer her, cause she had to go. She will call them. I did send her the below information:
https://zionhealthshare.org/member-guidelines/
Simultaneously, click the Ctrl button & the letter ''F''
Type: Therapeutic in the search field that comes up in the upper right hand corner
It will take you to:. Alternative or Integrative Medical Practices
Click on Therapeutic Treatments > it will take you to alternative services that could be covered, including Chiropractic.                 NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-07 12:23:39', '2023-08-07 12:23:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123164008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123149001', 'Michael DeVivo', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-07 12:11:34', '2023-08-07 12:11:34'),
