  ('zcrm_1579374000123147016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114634022', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '8-7-23 I showed Abe the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 which is $502.59 or Anthem  Bronze Pathway X HMO 7450 for HSA at $412.01 to help bring keep cost down close to his current Friday at $411.27. C4 is showing his account never went into effect but Friday is showing it as Active! So, I will leave it alone. It sounds like he''s gotten services all along. Hopefully pushing through a new enrollment will correct his C4 account. Also, Abe was interested in MCS but now he has a pre-x he''s tending to which is elevated PSA and has done many tests, MRI, etc. It''s currently stable but still elevated, however it''s not cancer. But, I let him know it''s best to wait 2 years to get pas pre-x clause from last symtoms, treatment and diagnosis, etc. He took my recommendation and will remain with insurance for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-07 11:21:31', '2023-08-07 11:48:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123113045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '08.07.2023 Ruth placed an RX request for Losartan Potassium/HCTZ 50/12.5MG, 90 Tablets.
