  ('zcrm_1579374000123135003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, 'Kelly reached out to me via SalesIQ responding to my greeting message when Kelly appeared online the chat system. Kelly explained her issue to me with the fact that when she reached out to Zion Health to start a Need with them by submitting some bills/statement''s, Zion''s response was to Kelly that she does NOT have an account/membership with them. After she gave me her full name, I searched across the CRM & Admin123. She in fact DOES have an ACTIVE account with us, with her start date of 12/1/2022. After seeing her CRM profile, I remembered her as I am the first person, she spoke to at MPB.Health when she was looking for a Healthcare Plan and I passed her info off to Leonardo who enrolled her into the system as an Active Member with us under the DIRECT Plan we provide. There are no issues with her account on our end, so I created a Member Support Ticket with our Ticketing System here at MPB and put her ticket as HIGH Priority. I confirmed her call back number and let her know either myself or possibly John Kach will be calling her back with a solution sometime after 12pm Est today. Lastly, I also messaged John Kach on Teams letting him know the issue and that I put a ticket in and gave him the Ticket #2901 that I created.  I will update here in the Notes with the solution once an answer is given. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-08-07 09:53:30', '2023-08-07 09:53:30'),
