  ('zcrm_1579374000123113016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109886002', 'James Evans lll', NULL, '08.07.2023 James called to confirm that he DOES have preventative care as part of his plan. After confirming his account through various elements, cause his email was not on his mind to be on this plan, I explained to him that he certainly does not have MEC/Preventative. He does however have and I shared with him, the Telehealth service through CirrusMD. I explained how it works and its limitations. He seemed to be appeased with having that being the service to use for primary care.
