  ('zcrm_1579374000123109003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084375002', 'Troy Axelson', NULL, '08.07.2023 Lisa called re: the declined mamm. again. A collection agency reached out to her, and she thought it was taken care of and settled. After reading the notes, I was able to ask her effective questions.
