  ('zcrm_1579374000123047008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975002', 'Lynn O''Malley', NULL, '8-4-23 Lynn called bc she thought she had added her husband but when doing the Welcome Call, he wasn''t showing on the account. I looked back at my written notes and notes here in the CRM and she never finalized with me to add her husband. She thought she had just asked me to do it. But, I can''t do it and when I showed her the Add/Remove Member Form she didn''t seem to recognize it. She spoke with her husband and he''s ok with starting on Sept. 1st. They remembered her calling or texting to get his SS#, which is true. I needed that for adding him to the dental plan on July 17th. But, she hadn''t decided about medical quite yet, if memory serves me well. Either way, she added him today and I notified Stacey Pieron, Kirk Bennett and Lauren Selken to make sure it''s added on the invoice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-04 14:21:23', '2023-08-04 14:21:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000123046011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118280002', 'Julia Bower', NULL, '8-4-2023:  Julia called, her son is going away to college &amp; needs the proof of healthcare cov.  She tends to interrupt, but I finally got out that Planstin sb able to provide both the prev proof thru Planstin &amp; Zion''s healthsharing membership.  Made sure she has their ph # &amp; hours, then trans her directly to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-04 14:05:27', '2023-08-04 14:05:27'),
