  ('zcrm_1579374000123015027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120756012', 'Ernest Stafford', NULL, '08.04.2023 Jenette called to see if there are better options for the Type2 diabetic medicine, Synjardy XR 12.5/1000mg x 180tabs $239.42 (sold under the name Jardiamet), for Ernest.
Reid was able to beat the prices found on the discounted websites (~$1200 for just 120 Tablets), with $239.42 for 180 Tablets.
