  ('zcrm_1579374000123007006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '08.03.23:  Recvd. email from Cindy.  They''ve decided to stay w/SECURE.  Asked questions about both MEC options.  Wants more specifics on what the Co-pay MEC covers.  I responded to her email with answers to her questions. She responded that they''ve decided to keep the HSA MEC.  She asked if she needs to do anythng differently when using the MEC.  She has a gynecologist appt. coming up in September.  Asked if this is different than the network situation.  I responded she should now be able to use the RBP method of payment by showing her card for the preventive visit and having the office submit a claim to Planstin for it.  I asked if she received a new card from Planstin with the "RBP" indication on it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-08-04 09:20:15', '2023-08-04 09:23:25'),
