  ('zcrm_1579374000122899091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123149001', 'Michael DeVivo', NULL, '8-3-23 Michael is 55 and wife is 50 or 51. They live in Boulder. He''s deciding if he wants to take the plan offered by a new company he''s working for. It may only be a short-term work situation for 6 months. So, he wants to find a solution long-term and more affordable. He and his wife are working towards adopting. They also have a side biz with real estate, so they can show proof of self-employment and his wife has a small side biz in addition. They are healthy, no tobacco. He has slightly elevated blood pressure that he''s handling with diet and exercise, no meds. Wife takes progesterone and hormones. She pays for those on her own already. He wants to decide by the 9th or 10th. We have a meeting set up for next week. He''s curious about dental, vision and HMA as well. I described the HMA 10000 at $140.   He also already knows of Zion. They were the favorite sharing organization in his research.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-03 19:20:45', '2023-08-03 19:20:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122899086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '8-3-23  Estefania chose Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 Ded for Sept. 1st. Next step is to enroll in Cigna via CignaForBrokers.com but site is down right now. Then once that''s complete wait until after the 15th and change in ICQuotes from Pending to Active for Sept 1st. This will allow current reports to run properly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-03 17:00:45', '2023-08-03 17:00:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122937095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121048002', 'Irene Tammaro-Tallia', NULL, '08.03.2023 I called Irene, per Karen Torsoe''s request, to chat more about the RBP and the MAP program. It did not go anywhere, as Irene''s doctor where she goes for preventative IS NOT GOING to participate in the RBP model. IDK a work around for her to share with her doctor so she can see him, but she seemed really stressed and all of a sudden needed to get off the phone to answer an emergency call for her dad (he''s ill and she''s been taking care of him). 
I never got to go over the MAP program. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-03 16:29:03', '2023-08-03 16:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122937090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '08.03.2023 Elsa called to learn how her daughter''s chiropractic sessions, due to a severe back pain, could be covered/shared. I explained that chiropractic sessions may be shared, cause it''s all up to Zion, via pre-approval first, by attaining a treatment plan from the DC. Then together we can open a medical need.
Elsa also asked about dental coverage, and I told her, unless she bought a product companion on the side/extra to the plan she bought through us, then she does not have dental coverage. I told her the best person to talk to about that is her advisor, Wendy. I gave her Wendy''s number, and briefly mentioned the dental program that she has through Dental1 ( if I remember correctly ). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-03 16:04:38', '2023-08-03 16:04:38'),
