  ('zcrm_1579374000122899081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986163', 'Sylvie Bloch', NULL, '8-3-23 Eli called and they want Anthem or Cigna but her Dr. Jennifer Tamblyn is not showing up in the network. Only RMHP''s are showing up. Perhaps we can try direct with Anthem but not sure if that will be allowed with the SEP. He will call the Drs. office and ask which carrier and network they accept for C4 Plans.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-03 15:29:25', '2023-08-03 15:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122899076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113410109', 'Jeremy Colbert', NULL, '6-3-23 Jeremy was super nice and appreciative of my call and email. He''s late and driving now into the mountains and will lose service. I will send him instructions about how to proceed. His account is looking a little broken. It shows no plan on the first page or home page, but it does show his chosen plan when I click to Review Plans. Hopefully once he pushes this SEP through it will show up properly moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-03 15:10:29', '2023-08-03 15:10:29'),
