  ('zcrm_1579374000122937064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', NULL, '08.03.2023 Suchada called asking: the CPAP machine for sleep apnea will be out of pocket, correct? I said yes it is not shareable. Then she asked: Do we (MPB) partner with any manufacturing company that makes CPAP machines, where we can offer discounts?
I consulted with Cari on this, and she confirmed that we do not have partnership that would offer discounts, but a great idea to suggest to the admin office to add a coupon for via WHLC. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-03 13:32:05', '2023-08-03 13:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122937056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119540009', 'James Wehner', NULL, '08.03.2023 Just had a conversation with Crystal from Planstin. Saying that James Wehner, called them requesting a copy of his card (not sure if he wanted a hard copy or just virtual), and Crystal was not seeing that he has Preventative at all, HOWEVER, James is on the new plan CoPay HSA-MEC, IUA 1000.
