  ('zcrm_1579374000122953052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119540009', 'James Wehner', NULL, 'Member called in and gave me Children''s SS #''s.  Also he had questions about where he could get a refresher.  I told him he could have as many Welcome calls as he needed.  We spoke a bit about Preventative and he said that he did not receive a Planstin card.  I gave him the number to contact them and get a card.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-03 13:06:49', '2023-08-03 13:06:49'),
