  ('zcrm_1579374000122895070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097899002', 'Amy Jones', NULL, '08.02.2023 Amy called, and offered her last name at first as Roth, which I could not find anywhere. I asked her would it under a different name (in my head I was thinking a different name as a primary or with a spouse) (in her head she gave me the last name). Needless to say, she either needs to change her name on file,  OR, she needs to realize we have her under a different name and specify that up front.
