  ('zcrm_1579374000122899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '8-2-23 Figge called in panicked bc he had a dental appt today and they couldn''t find his dental plan as active anymore. I don''t see any record of helping him sign up for Delta Dental''s Clear Plan. He found proof that it was cancelled in 2022, I think.  If we join today he won''t have access until Sept. 1st and implants will cost $2500! So, we checked out 1Dental and he joined today and it''s available immediately to get discounts from 15%-60% . He can call his dentist to get the discounts for his visit today. Then he has a bigger issue that he thinks falls within  the implant category. Louisville Dental Associates in in the Aetna Dental Access Network!  He understands he has two networks for the price of one and to use whichever one gives him the best discount for any given dentist. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-08-02 12:09:53', '2023-08-02 12:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122894003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521016', 'Catherine Jaimes Llanos', NULL, '08.02.2023 Catherine called to learn how to make use of the prescription program in her plan. I explained the process: filling out a form on line, one of us three will research 7-8 discounted sites to find the best deal coupon, if nothing there, then we move to our international shopper. One of the sites we search is a mail in order, so that she has numerous options. I added that we use her email to send her the best coupon, and her phone number to call and clarify some RX questions.
Catherine also asked, again, about the fees that members are required to pay upon enrolling, and if she will need to pay them again, when she comes back from being abroad. After consulting with Jen and Cari and Julia via teams, the consensus is that we usually have a code for advisors to use, but it is not for advertising to the members. However, at the moment, we do not have a code, due to numerous changes in the admin office. 
I encouraged her to contact Paul to get deeper insight on that matter. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-08-02 11:50:21', '2023-08-02 11:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122885145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963082', 'callie Salmon', 'New membership eff 9/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-08-02 11:28:27', '2023-08-02 11:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122875083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105831009', 'Dariusz Szteborowski', NULL, '8-2-2023:  Dariusz called.
     - Both of his legs were very swollen & the doc sent him to the ER.  They''ve done a ton of tests, couldn''t find anything.  They sent him to the cardiologist, didn''t find anything conclusive, so they are now doing an echo later this month.
        I got him to start a ''med need'' w/Zion.  He''s calling to request his memb portal invite.  We discussed how to upload & some of the curr challenges (the site keeps timing out really quickly), so have everything prepared, so you can just fill in w/cut & pastes, pdf & jpeg uploads, etc.  He liked the idea of paying the bal of his IUA to Zion once his ''med need'' is started, so he doesn''t have to worry about keeping track.  W/the ER bill & everything else, it seems like he will easily hit his IUA.
     - IUA:  Went over in detail how these work.  $2500 x 3 issues/rolling 12 mo period.  4th & beyond during a 12 mo rolling period > $500 = IUA waived for that(those) issues.  3 per membership, not per person.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-08-02 11:17:13', '2023-08-02 11:48:08'),
