  ('zcrm_1579374000122888021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '8/2/23 - Martha called in again while I was on the phone with another member so I had to call her back. Martha decided that she was going to read me the riot act about having Daniels email as the primary email on this plan because she pays all of the bills and makes all of the appointments. She wanted to know how we could decide without asking her first who to send emails to in regard to their plan. I let Martha know that the information on file is the information that was submitted when they enrolled and that is how the information is inputted into our system. Martha was frustrated, so I asked if she had requested from Zion that her login information for her member portal be sent to her email to which she stated harshly that she even spelled it out for the Zion rep because "they just weren''t getting it". I apologized to Martha and explained that unfortunately she does have to be the one to request this information from Zion due to HIPAA. She then slung back to me that I had transferred her to the wrong entity the first time to which I apologized to Martha again. I did have to transfer her to Zion again (I made sure it was the correct phone #) and asked that she give them a gentle reminder to make sure they are sending it to her email address...she huffed and said "fine!". JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-02 09:19:28', '2023-08-02 09:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122885057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121048002', 'Irene Tammaro-Tallia', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-08-02 09:11:54', '2023-08-02 09:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122888008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '8/2/23 - THIS MEMBER IS RUDE AND UNMANAGEABLE! 

Martha called in frustrated because she was locked out of her HCBB account. When I advised Martha that she would have to speak with HCBB''s customer service team via their help app she became upset and exclaimed that she has absolutely NO time for this! I  had assisted Martha yesterday and knew that she had a broken wrist so I was trying to be understanding about her attitude. When I advised Martha that resetting her account through HCBB is the only option for resetting her account but I would be happy to take a look on my end she became even more frustrated and angry, even during my attempt to look the facility up that she was inquiring about. I finally let Martha know that I understood she was in pain but that I was trying to help her so her patience and understanding would be greatly appreciated. She then got angrier and requested to not speak with me. Unfortunately since I am the only concierge on duty in the mornings, I transferred Martha to Zion to see if this is a facility that they prefer for pricing. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-02 08:47:56', '2023-08-02 08:47:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122885031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122803002', 'Peter Fenwick', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled his welcome call after his start date of September 1, 2023. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-08-02 08:02:42', '2023-08-02 08:02:42'),
