  ('zcrm_1579374000122864003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115938061', 'Susan Lee', NULL, '7/31/23 - Susan had Karen Torsoe open a ticket for her regarding why she is being denied prev care services. I was brought in WEEKS after this ticket was opened which I find very unprofessional.  Several people were involved in this ticket (#2812) prior to it being assigned to me so I have requested any information they may have to be relayed to me so that I may follow up with Susan. I do believe we need to develop a new system for assigning tickets for this reason alone. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-08-01 07:34:07', '2023-08-01 07:34:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122781108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123819010', 'Peter Mueller', NULL, '7-31-23 Cindy signed up Peter directly with Zion not realizing they would be eliminating many of the benefits and savings tools we discussed. They are leaving for Peru early tomorrow until Aug. 20th. Per JT, MPB can transfer their account back to MPB. They chose CARE+ $1000/$265, $125/$25 and they will now get an Aug. 1st start date. Taggart will be off the river Aug 7th and he can reach out to me to sign up before the 20th on his own for Sept 1st. Cindy will have him call me.   They will check their emails the first two days while they''re in Lima, Peru and then they will be out of internet service once they''re deeper in the mountains.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-31 18:17:54', '2023-07-31 18:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122774143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086964002', 'Lani Cordova', NULL, '7/31/2023:  Lani called &amp; LM asking for guidance on what is cov on the ''Prev Care''.  I called her back &amp; sugg we talk tomorrow so I can show her the site when she''s at her comp.  Gave her the concierge # &amp; told her to ask for me.     - CA

