  ('zcrm_1579374000122781103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114233002', 'Dilan Bollmann', NULL, '7-31-23 Dilan called and said he talked with Patti and went ahead and updated his cc payment earlier today. He''s hoping it goes through without any further problems. He should be all set unless we hear again from Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-31 17:31:23', '2023-07-31 17:31:23'),
