  ('zcrm_1579374000122781063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625123', 'Casey Zahorik', NULL, '7-31-23 Casey lost his job and ins on May 31st. He forgot about the deadline of 60 days on Friday, June 28th. I was already on my way to my final appt with Teresa, so I couldn''t help him. Now we are at 61 days. He put on the app that he''s opting out of Cobra on Aug. 31st. He will have double coverage for Aug. if they allow him to join. He chose Cigna Healthcare Cigna Connect HSA Bronze 6500
Bronze/EPO $301.27, APTC $0, 877-900-1237.  His income is unemployment now at $760 a week which is $39,520. He put in $39720 which won''t matter. He would have gotten a subsidy if he completed the app on time. But, he''s paying $301.27 instead of $600 through Cobra. Kim Gangwish, his mom will pay until he gets a job. He''s all set for Aug. 1st start if they accept his SEP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-31 16:38:01', '2023-07-31 16:38:01'),
