  ('zcrm_1579374000122774122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '7/31/2023:  Ashley called.  The pediatrician wants to have some of Summer''s blood levels checked ( ie: iron + others).  Ashley was in the car, but there is a Quest w/in 2 miles of their home.  She''s going to call back so I can walk thru the site w/her & we can price compare.  The doc said Yale has a specialized pediatrican dept that can do the blood draw, so we are just going to do this so she has an idea of the price diff.  She knows this is diagnostic = healthsharing & they have their 1k IUA if something does show up.

