  ('zcrm_1579374000122774114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '7-31-2023:  Eric called.  He had a seizure on July 18th.  When he called Redirect, they told him he had to call us.  I made sure he has Sedera''s ph # &amp; trans him there.  (He did not want the video to show him how to take care of setting up a ''med need''.)  I warned him to make sure to do the 2nd MD if they req it to make sure they pay properly = an educ piece.  He knows to conf his IUA w/Sedera as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-31 13:14:26', '2023-07-31 14:00:06'),
