  ('zcrm_1579374000122781033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123624010', 'Heli Ananda', NULL, '7-31-23 Heli and Tony came to me via Christina Johnson. They are currently on the 7K Sierra plan but they are no longer allowing non Native Americans to participate. So, that''s ending Aug. 31st. They prefer holistic care mostly. Heli is now on bion identical hormones and no other meds. She prefers thermography if/when she needs that and does the pap screening every 5 years now. Otherwise, they just like to check their blood with labs on occasion. I suggested they use the MPB Concierge team for that when they want any tests. They are looking at one other option and then we will meet again on Wed. Aug. 9th. Super nice! They are both self-employed. Heli is 48 and Tony is 58 and live in CO. Tony is not interested in doing a colonoscopy. They are most interested in CARE+.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-31 12:35:16', '2023-08-02 10:03:52'),
