  ('zcrm_1579374000122799003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119069002', 'Jeffrey Davenport', 'Uyen goes by:  Terri', '7-28-2023:  Terri (Uyen) called back.  Zion didn''t even offer her the invite for creating the Zion Memb Port & of course our current temp (she thinks that''s what Kelly F sent) is not up-to-date or really working since Zion''s sites still have so many glitches in their new process.
