  ('zcrm_1579374000122781018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119069002', 'Jeffrey Davenport', NULL, 'Uyen called in and she had thought she was calling Zion as to she has been dealing with a diagnosis of something with her ear, she has used CirrusMD first, they suggested she be seen in person with an urgent care, which she did and from there was diagnosed, and has been seeing 2 different ear doctors. She knows about the $1000 IUA of hers and has been paying cash so far of one increment of $300+ and just now of $130+. I transferred her over to Zion so she can submit her bills and statement''s to start the Need. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-28 09:39:46', '2023-07-28 09:39:46'),
