  ('zcrm_1579374000122781008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, 'Cynthia called into the concierge line asking a few questions about her SECURE plan with us here. She first asked if her first appointment with her new doctor having a "meet & greet"/ annual physical. I let her know that yes it would be, and she had already checked about the providers and doctors'' office being accepted with Planstin. So, I told her all she has to do is present her Planstin card, which she does have when I asked, and they will bill Planstin with all the information on the front and back of the card. She secondly asked about her issue she has with hemorrhoids if it is through being a diagnostic care. I explained yes and that she is subject to her $1000 IUA and anything more she is to submit through Zion, which she said she knows how but I sent her the email with the link and Zion''s number just so she has on hand. She was very thankful for everything and said I helped her understand and confirm for her greatly. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-28 09:01:09', '2023-07-28 09:01:09'),
