  ('zcrm_1579374000122685047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110554002', 'Dirk Anderson', NULL, '7-27-2023:  Dirk called:  his daughter is going to college &amp; he needed proof-of-ins.  I explained his healthsharing comp sister comp Planstin should be able to provide that &amp; gave him their ph # &amp; hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-27 17:33:54', '2023-07-27 17:33:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122680065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '07.27.2023 Heather called to inquire if the solution for preparing for the colonoscopy is covered. After consulting with Cari via teams, she shared that there are several but not covered under the Planstin insurance Optum RX. I shared that with Heather, and offered to look up a couple of coupons to give her an idea of what it costs. She did not have the name of the med on her, but will call back to search for it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-27 16:31:02', '2023-07-27 16:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122695041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693002', 'William Spiccia', NULL, '7-27-23 Nahla shared with William my 1dental site for discounts on dental for an upcoming visit for him. I''ll send him a quick note, in case he has any questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-27 16:19:15', '2023-07-27 16:19:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122695036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '7-27-23 Dan is exploring doing SECURE $1000/$715. The only issue he has is scoriasis. He might even be able to handle that on the virtual healthcare app. They are currently only paying $54 a month through C4. However, they''re going to call their accountant to best estimate their income for 2023. He''s guessing perhaps $55K. That gives them a $589 APTC and their cost with Cigna Connect Flex Bronze is $359.34 but with the risk of $18,200 of something bad happens. If they join SECURE their risk is really $3K worst case. So, once they better nail down their income they will be better able to decide. He''ll keep me posted after they talk with their accountant. Looking at Sept. 1st start date
Also, Dan called me back bc he had been introduced to Zion via a Therapist Group he''s part of and shared this other pricing model which was way cheaper that SECURE or even CARE+  - https://zionhealthshare.org/companies/.  I explained how the MEC adds cost and the other benefits are superior as well bringing the cost up. He''d consider CARE+ and to just pay for wellness for his daughter and skip it for themselves and forego the HSA. We''ll see.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-27 16:00:24', '2023-07-27 16:27:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122695031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123724002', 'Thomas, Sr. Mastroianni', NULL, '7-27-23 To Tony who is no longer with MPB from Tom.

