Sincerely,

Tom

I''ve sent him an email and left him a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-27 15:11:54', '2023-07-27 15:11:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122680057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', NULL, '07.27.2023 Jon called to confirm how to present at a non preventative appointment for his wife. I guided him to present as a cash pay patient and to collect all the receipts just in case this situation ends up needing further services, so we can open a medical need. They will just have to meet the IUA of $2500. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-27 15:03:45', '2023-07-27 15:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122680052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693002', 'William Spiccia', NULL, '07.27.2023 William called back to follow up on how to proceed with his immediate dental/endodontist work for a root canal. He also was checking on the fee for the referral program, and if the billing mishap of not being charged in June for July was taken care of. I shared that the referral fee is in process but takes a couple of weeks to reach the member. I still do not have an answer re: his dental work, nor if his billing issue has been addressed. I offered him a call back b/c I needed to investigate with Cari to offer him responses. 
William is a little frantic b/c his appointment is on Monday, and some dental offices are closed on Friday and he may not be able to reschedule or find another office. 
Spoke with Cari - she shared Wendy''s 1Dental Broker site - I emailed it to William after having a brief conversation about it. I told him I would let him know about having an advisor reach out to him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-27 14:57:57', '2023-07-27 15:49:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122685024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090048002', 'Lisa Chlysta', NULL, '7-27-2023:  Lisa called.  She had several items to go over:                 [NOTE: Care+ membs]
     - Walter ''med need'' (hurt himself working in the yard I think she said):  Lisa said they''ve had trouble getting the invoices for Walter''s hosp stay/''med need''.  The hosp keeps trying to force them thru their financial dept where they have to divulge all their incomes, etc, just because they are "self-pay".  I sugg she call the billing dept & let them know she is a ''cash-pay'' patient, no "ins" but if it gets bad enough they may have help, ask for a ''cash-pay'' disc, & hopefully they can send an adj inv in the curr 10-day anticipated time line.  She already started this ''med need'' & had questions that only Zion can answer, so I made sure she knows their ph # & which ''menu'' # to push for the ''med needs dept''.  She will call if she needs more help.  
     - Son - Luke ''med need'':  6/1/23 Luke crashed on his bike.  He hurt his knee & has had a few dr appts & x-rays.  Next step is an specialist.  They are no where near the $2500 IUA, but I made sure she knows they have a 6mos deadline from orig DOS to incl those exp twds the IUA & since it''s a knee, it''s prob worth sub a need "just in case".  She agreed, however maybe after the specialist appt since then they''ll have a better idea of what is happening.  She will call us for help w/Zion''s new sub process.
     - Chg of address: Lisa was surprised that they forgot to update both their physical & mailing addresses (PO Box).  We went online & she completed the form & submitted while we were talking.  Both new phy & new po box are on her new form.
     - Move to lower IUA?:  With 2 issues in a short period, we disc what a 1k IUA for FUTURE issues would look like financially each month, and compared this situation w/the scenario where you have NO ''med needs'' that year.  She knows she must sub a chg req by 19th of the mo, to take effect w/60-day waiting period the following month, otherwise it pushes the start of the waiting period to the following month.  She seemed to think this might be worth it.  I sugg Karen may have input & may offer an accident policy that would be another way to cover the $2500 IUA?
     - CRM corr of Lisa''s b-date:  sent e-mail to Dayra asking her to update the CRM info.  Conf w/Lisa the Admin123 DOB for her is accurate.
     - Lisa would like the MPB.Health refernce cards from the new memb pkt, but w/the chg of add, I let her know we should wait until that is completed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-27 14:53:31', '2023-07-27 18:19:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122695026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '7-27-23 Adam has been refunded the entire $125 instead of just $100. I just notified him via email. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-27 14:48:53', '2023-07-27 14:48:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122680044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116303002', 'Jamey Reichow', NULL, '07.27.2023 daughter broke her arm in May. Have bills to submit to Zion. I walked her through what to expect while having Zion help her set up a medical need request. I gave her their number and coached her what button to push to get through. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-27 13:48:54', '2023-07-27 13:53:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122695021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '7-27-23 Hilary has many health issues she''s been addressing this year and has already paid her full ded. None of the options she wants will honor her ded that she''s paid already. We should look at Cigna''s options moving forward for Sept. 1st. She has an MRI she''s waiting to hear back about. She wants to keep Dr. Chan. She will also find out which C4 plans they accept. We are reconnecting on Aug. 8th to pick a plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-27 13:28:26', '2023-07-27 13:28:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122680039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '07.27.2023 Jim called to get pricing for his 27 YO daughter to join MPB. I forwarded him to Julia after consulting with her via teams. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-27 13:24:05', '2023-07-27 13:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122680031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689144', 'Lori Altman', NULL, '07.27.2023 Lori called learn of a better way to cover blood work. I offered her the JasonHealth.com, and she seemed confident in how it works. She asked if it was priced similarly to walk in labs, but I could not answer that due to lack of experience with walk in labs. She has been to walk in labs, so I asked her if she can compare the pricing that pops up on the screen with JasonHealth.com.
