  ('zcrm_1579374000122680026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119080002', 'Drew Workman', NULL, '07.27.2023 Shelly called to confirm how to present for a preventative appointment for her daughter. I coached her in two ways: 1-Start by asking if they are part of the PHCS network, it is the easiest route, 2- IF NOT, then have them call Planstin with the number from the back of the card. Either way, they will need the Planstin card, and to tell them the appointment needs to remain Preventative. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-27 12:47:13', '2023-07-27 12:47:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122681078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, 'Received members change form adding daughter eff 8/1/23.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-27 12:21:13', '2023-07-27 12:21:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122695008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108399107', 'James Leo Durocher', NULL, '7-27-23 Leo was happy with Friday and his ortho accepted them at Panorama Ortho. He will call them to find out which C4 plans they accept. Cigna didn''t work with the Connect network. Next might be Anthem to try. His son Paolo, 37 needs ins as well and might be a good candidate for MCS instead. He''s young and healthy, no pre-x and earns $60K-$70K for CO Window Washing. He will share the MCS video with his son. We will reconnect next week to complete his change and enroll his son as well into something.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-27 12:16:04', '2023-07-27 12:26:40'),
