  ('zcrm_1579374000122664003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, 'I received a VM regarding this member wanting to add her daughter eff 8/1.  She asked for a quote and also if it was not possible, that she would have to cancel her membership.   I will make an one time exception in this case if I get this in today.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-27 07:42:41', '2023-07-27 07:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122649048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '7-26-2023:  Asiye sub an RX req:  Larin 24FE (a generic bcs).  
     - She then called in less than 2 hours later wondering why we hadn''t done it yet.  I went over info w/her and what she pd prev is just not available anymore.  Due to the drastic increase I at least ck''d w/Reid (our intl shopper) and what I''m finding online is still much better.
     It seems that she waited until she had to run pickup her pkt.  She knows to call us when she hits the last week of her pills to give us time to get her quotes run and back to her.  She was very nice about this.  I also tt her about getting 3 mos at a time because it''s a drastic savings (cheapest 1 mo supply = $12.99 on Sngl Care & 3mos supply = $18.96 on RXSaver).  Did let her know the prices are generally honored, but we don''t have guarantees. 
     She''s going to see if the pharmacist would allow her to get 3 mos this fill, instead of the 1 mo she picked up.  If so, she call for the coupon.  Otherwise, she will call us about 7-days ahead next time so we have more time to help her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-26 18:54:29', '2023-07-26 18:54:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122649037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079147335', 'Stacia Montenegro', NULL, '7-26-2023:  Went to his annual physical & thought any physical was covered.  Optum bought out his old doc''s appt.  Doc billed Planstin for him, and then Planstin declined payment due to:  out-of-network?  Or something else?  He will get answers from Planstin tomorrow (they are already closed today) so we can see if we need to help with this declined item.
     - He mentioned he has a ''CatScan'' tomorrow for his arteries.  So, we went over how to present & to ask if this is a screening or diagnostic since they are concerned about blockage.  He we present as no "ins", no ID card [will confirm doc''s off didn''t give them his prev care ins info so it doesn''t get billed wrong.  Knows that will not be valid for this regardless.]. ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, etc.  Once he finds out the results, he knows we have 6mos from 1st DOS on this issue to sub a ''med need'' if necessary.   He will contact us after the catscan to see if we need to do anything or if it''s just completely out-of-pocket.
     - After we got off the phone, Nahla said he was asking about prostate testing or something earlier & he did not bring that up in our conv.  He''ll be calling us back so we can address his prostate then too?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-26 18:38:29', '2023-07-26 18:40:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122647103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120756012', 'Ernest Stafford', NULL, '07.26.2023 RX REQUEST

We were able to price your Rx requests for:
