  ('zcrm_1579374000122614044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844131', 'Adam Nolan', NULL, '7-26-23 Adam is enrolling now. He was unexpectedly fired without a 2 week notice. He was very unexpectedly fired without the required 2 weeks notice. He was fired after being honored as the Employee of the Month.  So, he will be without insurance as of Aug. 1st. He enrolled in CARE+ $1000/$240. He was also curious if he should get MCS for his son who''s back east with the baby''s mom and on her insurance. He wasn''t sure if he should have backup protection but he''s sure his ins is effective. So, he''s really all set.  I''m asking for Aug. 1st start if possible but he knows it may be too late.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-26 12:38:45', '2023-07-26 12:38:45'),
