  ('zcrm_1579374000122647028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109481002', 'Lucy Pirner', NULL, '07.26.2023 Lucy called to make sure she takes the appropriate steps towards her preventative colonoscopy. I looked up the hospital/facility where she would like to go to, and the hospital showed up but the facility did not. I guided her to offer the Planstin information when she is making the appointment, and ask them if they are on the PHCS network. If they are not, I told her to just guide them to call Planstin directly to collaborate pricing and billing.
