  ('zcrm_1579374000122649003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119178002', 'Jackson Sobbing', NULL, '7-26-2023:  Debbie called.  Their oldest daughter Peyton needs to have her wisdom teeth out & she wondered if this new plan would help pay for that.  I told her I believe that''s ''dental'', rather than medical, but she''s going to ask both the dentist & oral surgeon what it is usually considered.  If they say medical, she''ll call us back for help sub a ''med need''.  If they say dental, I gave her Misty''s ph # & she will see if she has a stand alone dental policy that would help (I let her know that sometimes the policy isn''t very helpful).  Or, maybe by the time she has the surgery, their HSA will have funded?  She''ll let us know if she needs more help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-26 11:13:06', '2023-07-26 11:21:45'),
