  ('zcrm_1579374000122647003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693002', 'William Spiccia', NULL, '07.26.2023 William called again, only this time it is regarding if his toothache that he went to the  dentist for, and needs a root canal, could be shareable via Zion. I double checked with the guidelines, and nothing under dental, teeth, mouth, or oral came up for coverage or anything else. I consulted with Cari via teams, and she said most likely it WILL NOT be shareable, as there is  a fine line between medical and dental. I reiterated that to William. 
