  ('zcrm_1579374000122635003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107496002', 'Rebekah Liberty', NULL, 'Rebekah called in and she spoke with an MD via Telehealth (not sure if it was CirrusMD with her plan, she didn''t say it was, but I would hope and assume it was) and the provider recommends she goes in person to see a doctor. Rebekah stated this is the first time she will need to use her plan and asked how she would go about making an appointment, finding a provider, and payment to the provider. I told her I am going to put a Support ticket in and sometime after 12pm Est when Cari gets online with the concierge, will reach out to Rebekah and explain everything to her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-26 08:04:11', '2023-07-26 08:04:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122614034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122624002', 'Keith Damiano Jr.', NULL, '7-25-23 Keith is 30 and lives in PA, self-employed. He is on his wife''s ins now but she''s scheduled for a c-section in 3 days 7/28/23 and then their ins will go up to $1000! So, he wants to get off of that and move to MCS and he prefers the non-religious versions. He heard of the religious ones through his cousin and then found MPB via Google search. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco and healthy. He input in EIN for his self-employment and he''s hoping for Aug. 1st if I can get it approved. Otherwise, Sept. 1st and will hope no issues in Aug. Chose SECURE $1000/$300 and the $25 fee was not showing up so he doesn''t have to pay the $25 but is charged the $100. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-25 17:17:12', '2023-07-25 17:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '07.25.2023 Willa called to learn how to set up mental wellness sessions. I guided her through our member portals and updates page to the MAP page. Provided her with the code and perused the elements of the M&amp;S page and apps. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 16:37:16', '2023-07-25 16:37:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122614029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662001', 'Kim Kuhljuergen', NULL, '7-25-2023:  Kim called today &amp; he was in a very difficult mood.
     -      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-25 16:24:25', '2023-07-28 18:25:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '07.25.2023 Andrew called because his doctor''s office has emailed Planstin to receive verification of coverage, via the recent RBP price model.
Ryan (female) from his doctor''s office (Yampa Valley Medical Associates) emailed a week ago, and has not received a response. Crystal from Planstin said that they usually respond within 1-3 business days, and that she is one of the representatives that respond to those requests. I asked her what is Andrew''s best option at this point, and she said to have the office call them directly, It is easier, faster and more reliable. I shared that information with Andrew and he will communicate that to Ryan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 15:39:55', '2023-07-25 15:39:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111923312', 'Matthew Joppich', NULL, '07.25.2023 Matt called to learn how to complete paperwork asking for his insurance information and wants to what the deal is with the "DEDUCTIBLE" amounts at the back of his Planstin card.
I told him his insurance information would be Planstin and the medical cost sharing is Zion.
I guided him to find both cards in his emails. He has Planstin hard copy but not Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 14:03:54', '2023-07-25 14:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120906098', 'Janice Hinds', NULL, '07.25.2023 Janice called to have her welcome call scheduled. I went into Bookings to help her schedule her session. She preferred to have it in the afternoon, so I knew to choose Jennifer. She shared the 8th of August would work for her, at 3:00, on her landline (254) 780-1881. I inserted all the information: Name, email, phone #, and preferred time and date, and clicked send. Janice said she was able to see the message for the welcome call confirmation, but I did not see it on the Bookings calendar.
I messaged Jen and Cari via teams, and Jen is looking into it to see if it is showing up. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 13:49:33', '2023-07-25 13:52:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '07.25.2023 Kim called due to the amount she ended up paying at the lab, for the 4 tests requested by her doctor. She wanted to know what other options she had to avoid that high cost.
I introduced her to JasonHealth.com, but there weren''t any labs near her, and in CA and NV instead.
I then introduced her to UltaLab Tests site, and she was able to look up the tests that she took to compare pricing. Kim was glad to find out her options for next time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 13:26:50', '2023-07-25 13:26:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122614021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297467', 'Sheila Sewell', NULL, '7-25-2023:  Shelia called.  
     - MAP:  She wanted to learn what is availble re: counseling.  We walked thru the site, req referrals for counselors, the challenges, pattern, etc.  She loves this program &amp; will let us know if she need further support.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-25 13:17:10', '2023-07-25 13:17:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122599124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059150079', 'Heather Palentchar', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add newborn Maisie.  I will add to A123.  No change in price due to already a family membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-25 13:16:32', '2023-07-25 13:16:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121672002', 'William Parker', NULL, '07.25.2023 William Parker called to confirm his WC. I requested his confirmation from Vanessa. I email it to him via Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 13:05:22', '2023-07-25 13:05:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122599114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064056212', 'Daryl Mackie', NULL, 'Member submitted Change of Address I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-25 12:57:31', '2023-07-25 12:57:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122614016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059150079', 'Heather Palentchar', NULL, '7-25-2023:  Heather called.
     - Deliverd her baby girl Maizy (sp?) Saturday = 7/22/2023.  We walked to & thru the ''add a family member'' chg form.  She knows we will need the ss# once avail & how to get around that today.
     - During the babies initial ck, they hurt a slight heart murmur, but told her this isn''t unusual.  She asked how this will work.  She understands this could become a separate ''med need'' for the baby w/a sep IUA.  We decided, she''s going to turn it in under the maternity need - knowing full well they could come back & say it needs to be a sep ''med need'', but at least she will have tried.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-25 12:52:47', '2023-07-25 13:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122599104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090892002', 'Amy Morin', NULL, 'Member submitted Address Change, however that was previously submitted to us on 7/11, processed on 7/12/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-25 12:45:40', '2023-07-25 12:45:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122599094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'Member submitted 2nd Change of address after previously submitting on 3/10.  I will email and let her know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-25 12:40:49', '2023-07-25 12:40:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611010', 'Margo Hrabak', NULL, '07.25.2023 Mamm and part pharm', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 12:22:27', '2023-07-25 12:22:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122614008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '7-25-2023:  Thelma called.
     - She''s still having trouble finding a PCP, but has questions on ''blood work''.
     - Prev ''blood work'':  We went over the one item we see pd for on ''prev care'' = std lipid panel.  She said she isn''t understanding what ''prev care'' is, so we discussed in detail.  She thought the monitoring they do for a past issue, was ''prev care'' since they are trying to prevent it from happening again.  When we got done talking, I think she understood the difference better.
     - Extra ''blood work'':  I explained to Thelma, that we can sometimes help her get discounted lab testing thru some discout sites, but it must be done before the tests as you prepay, then take that receipt into the lab.  She didn''t seem upset, but I was sad because we might have been able to help her.  
     - Monitoring ''blood work'':  She has items the doc monitors.  We discussed the above again, but I also noted that IF at some point the lab work is part of a qualified & approved ''med need'' thru her healthshare, we need to sub the receipts here & or for the "extra" above if it''s diagnostic.  That generally maintenance items were not part of the plan.
     -     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-25 12:10:08', '2023-07-28 18:22:57'),
