     - healthcare.gov', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-25 11:35:41', '2023-08-06 00:04:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122582048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117964015', 'Muhammad Asif', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-25 11:17:53', '2023-07-25 11:17:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122602003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109093012', 'Yuwen Cen', NULL, 'Yuwen had called in about an hour ago requesting for me to double check her results of a doctor to look up in the PHCS Network via MultiPlan. She gave me the name of a doctor and zip code, but unfortunately the provider did not show up. After telling Yuwen this, she explained to me that the practice this doctor works through IS in the PHCS Network and a few of the other doctors she found to be participating in the PHCS Network, but the provider in network there was unavailable for new patients. So, the practice in network gave her 2 other doctors that are available for new patients. Both doctors she had me look up were not in network. After telling her the 2nd doctor was not in network, she then became EXTREMELY frustrated with the situation stating that she is very disappointed in her "insurance" with as for not having any doctors in network, or ones that are don''t take new patients. Instead of ending the discussion and leaving her with nothing, I asked for her phone number and told her I will have someone from the Concierge Team give her a call back to further assist her. Jennifer told me she will have Cari or Nalah call Yuwen back to explain the new RBP module instead of the PHCS Network. So, Yuwen will have options to use and not be left without a solution. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-25 11:16:30', '2023-07-25 11:16:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122582038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117965009', 'Misty Johnson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-25 11:11:42', '2023-07-25 11:11:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107787002', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, '07.25.2023 Emily had her doctor''s office call on her behalf, Toan/receptionist, asking about her insurance and the card she presented (MPB card with the QR code). I told him that is the wrong card to use, and to help me look up her account. 
I asked if this is considered a preventative appointment, and Toan said no, this is a follow up. I told him then the Planstin card would not work either, since it is not preventative.
I asked him if he can put her on speaker so she can hear me and know what we are talking about her plan and how she needs to present herself. I guided her to present as a cash pay patient, collect her receipts to open a medical need if this follow up extends into more services for what she is going in for. I asked her if any of this sounds familiar, and she said no. So I asked her to give me call back when she can so I can go over it with more details. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 11:02:54', '2023-07-25 11:07:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122597003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '07.25.2023 Tyler had been calling 30 minutes prior to my shift starting @ 11am, he attempted to call 3 times and kept getting disconnected. Wendy called the concierge line around 10 past 11:00, and explained that Tyler is trying to get through, he is at the doctor''s office but they are not accepting his card. Both Wendy and I thought he was talking about the Planstin card.
I called Tyler at 719-659-2471, him and his wife were still at the doctor''s office, I shared that he does not have preventative in his plan, as it did not show', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-25 10:51:31', '2023-07-25 10:54:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122582028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117967012', 'Susan Baker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-25 10:45:59', '2023-07-25 10:45:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122523085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165383', 'Tyler McMahon', NULL, '7-25-23 After much back and forth and some confusion Tyler mentioned Planstin for his wellness visit. He doesn''t have Planstin, he has the Connected Worksite membership which includes one dr. visit per year and now the price is up to $175 instead of $250. Nahla and I helped him talk through it. He''s at the office now and he will pay cash and get the Super Bill. The visit should cost $250 cash and they will do the labs in office. Next time he will do the labs on his own by calling the Concierge Team.  He''s calm now and knows what to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-25 10:37:11', '2023-07-25 10:37:11'),
