  ('zcrm_1579374000122513076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116000002', 'Wenn Chaston', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-25 09:43:31', '2023-07-25 09:43:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122510098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116606002', 'Louis Mitri', NULL, 'Louis called and is one of the members affected by the separate charge of $50 for the Planstin MEC portion of his plan on his billing statements. He called wanting an explanation of why this has happened, and he sees separate charges. I told him I would have Patti call him back to explain this, as she is part of the Billing department and has been the one answering members'' calls/emails regarding all of this. Patti is unavailable at this time as she is in a meeting with John T, John K, Rod, and others. I let Lousi know I would have Patti call him back, but it seems the meeting is going to be going on for a long time. I asked Angela if she could call Louis and explain what needs to be done as Louis is very frustrated with this. Angela agreed and Louis called again wanting an answer. I had Angela answer the call and she is taking care of this issue. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-25 09:14:41', '2023-07-25 09:14:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122510083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111778002', 'Lin Qian', NULL, 'Lin called in and said she has never used her plan yet and her son has gone to the doctor with some sort of foot problem. I was trying to explain to her that I would put a Support Ticket in for someone from the Concierge to call her back today sometime after 12pm est. They would be able to schedule a welcome call and sit down with her to explain her plan and how it works. She didn''t want to do that and all she said was she just wanted an email or a portal where she can view all of that info. There was a slight language barrier as I don''t think she was understanding what I was trying to say. I was able to explain to her what she needs to do in order to start a need for her son''s foot issue, along with I sent and told her, that I will send her emails with Zion''s contact info and link explaining how to start a need, etc. I also sent her her member portal login info with the link to get to the portal(s). She is all set and happy with the end results. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-25 08:33:06', '2023-07-25 08:33:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122510058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121962055', 'Nicholas Shiver', NULL, 'Still have not received Nicholas'' Agent Onboarding forms to complete his Agent onboarding with wanting to join MPB''s Agent team. I still need the signed MPB Agent Agreement, the signed MPB Commissions & license form, completion of the MPB Agent test with a passing score, and lastly the form to request a landing/click funnel page. I sent him an email to let him know what is still needed with the links and steps explaining where to do so and how. I will send another update email requesting the same or if he missed anything upon responding with what is needed, in 2-3 days from now on 7/27/23 or 7/28/23. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-25 08:11:14', '2023-07-25 08:11:14'),
