Member updated CC I will rerun -7/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-25 07:49:29', '2023-07-25 11:27:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122575006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121660002', 'Amendoa Hopper', NULL, 'Member called in asking about Cirrus MD services.  I advised that her benefits did not start until 8/1.  Told her that on her Welcome call that they would make sure she was registered for Cirrus.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-25 07:43:06', '2023-07-25 07:43:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122513056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120678002', 'Michael Hand', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-25 07:34:40', '2023-07-25 07:34:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122517032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109378024', 'Lorie Somermeyer', NULL, '7-24-2023:  Lorie called.  She has her ''prev care'' appt tomorrow.  We disc all guidelines:   
     - Planstin:  Only time "ins" = Y, present Planstin ID Card ( will never present a card for anything else), must stay w/in the ''prev care'' items so everything is med coded as ''prev care''.  We went to Healthcare.gov together so he can see an up-to-date list.  She knows in or out of ntwk okay as long as doc will bill for you.  Warned her to tell doc''s off next time (it it is not ''prev care'') that she doesn''t have "ins" & the card they have on file is not effective (so it doesn''t get billed & he has to pay a disc price, instead of a ''cash-pay'' price).
     -', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-24 23:21:52', '2023-08-06 00:03:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122523077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122615085', 'Paul Emmons', NULL, '7-24-23 Paul is 57 and wife is 58. They are both currently unemployed with job changes. They''ve heard about MCS options for years and wanted to explore and better understand. However, they have health issues. He is borderline diabetic and has neuropathy of the feet. She is diabetic and takes a medication for it and takes blood thinners, cumadin to avoid blood clots. But, the clincher is that they both vape. So, I told him it''s not a good option. They can get on Medicaid in TN for now while they aren''t working. He was very nice. I told him if they stop vaping for a year to revisit this option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-24 16:46:06', '2023-07-24 16:46:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122523072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122554002', 'Felipe Juncadella', NULL, '7-24-23 Felipe is 30 and self-employed. He missed open enrollment and has been without ins for a while.  He''s on anti depressant''s that are only $60 generic. He doesn''t want wellness or HSA. He likes the idea of CARE+ and his works makes him travel all over the US. So, MCS is perfect for his scenario. He and Alexandra Novo are living in Denver now and moved from FL. He chose CARE+ $2500/$185 and Aug. 1st start date. I gave Alexandra the $100 for his enrollment and Rosana Bowman credit for Alexandra''s enrollment. They are all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-24 16:33:00', '2023-07-24 16:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122523067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122554002', 'Felipe Juncadella', NULL, '7-24-23 Felipe is Alexandra Novo''s boyfriend. She put him on the call after she and I talked. He missed his window to get on trad ins and wanted to see what other options were available. He''s self-employed and doesn''t have any ins at the moment. He''s healthy except takes anti depressants which are generic and cost $60 a month. I made it clear to contact the MPB Concierge Team to price out his med to get the best price. He will. He works all over the US, so MCS is ideal. He''s doesn''t want wellness or HSA. I explained CARE+ and he chose $2500/$185.  He wants Aug. 1st start date and he already scheduled his Welcome Call right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-24 16:03:48', '2023-07-24 16:03:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122523062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122567002', 'Alexandra Novo', NULL, '7-24-23 Alexandra came via Rosana Bowman since Alexandra just moved to CO. She''s 27 and looking for a job. She would qualify for Medicaid or expects to earn $50K-$70K annually. I gave her instructions to join C4. Then he passed me off to her boyfriend who missed any chance of trad ins but is healthy and MCS will work well. She heard the entire conversation and realizes she prefers MCS as well. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, she takes Vyvanse which is expensive but she''s willing to pay for it or find another one to try. She doesn''t take it every day. It''s about $400. She will ask the Concierge to see if they can find it cheaper. My search wasn''t pulling up anything great. It took a bit for her to understand there aren''t co-pays for dr. visits but it''s not worth paying the additional monthly fee for co-pays since she''s healthy. She does want the wellness and HSA. So, she chose SECURE and will fund the HSA to pay for medication and any costs she has to pay. She moved here June 15th. She needs Aug. 1st start date and will cancel her plan in FL since she can''t really use it anyhow. They best drs. were no longer part of any of the ACA plans. So, she''s thrilled to choose her own dr. I explained the pre-x clause and she said she doesn''t have anything. Patti changed her membership to Aug. 1st already. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-24 15:59:33', '2023-07-24 15:59:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122513046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109093012', 'Yuwen Cen', NULL, '07.24.2023 Ruby Yu Deng called on behalf of Yuwen Cen re: opening a medical need, what the process is, and what she needs to submit the need. 
At first I was cooperative in providing the steps to that concern, HOWEVER her questions (and spoken through a very heavy and loose annunciation of verbiage) continued to branch out.
I eventually requested that she has Yuwen, who does speak English so I am confused as to why the advisor is the one calling us, call us at the concierge line and we will go over the details of her plan as needed. 
In the meantime, I offered to sent Yuwen some brief instructions on how to submit a medical need, given the glitches that are presently part of the experience. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-24 15:21:06', '2023-07-24 15:21:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122513041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, '07.24.2023 Stephen called b/c he missed his welcome call last thursday and could not find the email with the link to reschedule. I resent him a fresh email with the link. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-24 14:45:14', '2023-07-24 14:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122517027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141001', 'Kevin M Ryan', NULL, '7-24-2023:  Kevin called the concierge line.  I helped him find the chg of address form &amp; he sb all set there (he had it up &amp; was working on it as we talked).
     - He also asked about becoming an advisor.  He''s not curr ins lic, so I let him know that is req''d since a sm portion of our product req the lic.  If he decides to get that, he''ll call back &amp; we can get him to the corp office.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-24 14:24:13', '2023-07-24 14:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122562001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141001', 'Kevin M Ryan', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3179 Question : I am unable to login. I am unable to update my address. My new address is 3901 E Pinnacle Peak Rd #345 Phoenix, AZ 85050. my ID number is MPWRBEN000682-01', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-07-24 14:11:10', '2023-07-24 14:11:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122546054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122554002', 'Felipe Juncadella', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-24 14:01:21', '2023-07-24 14:01:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122546049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122460002', 'Shary Chen', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-24 13:51:54', '2023-07-24 13:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122513031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767140', 'John Parks', NULL, '07.24.2023 John messaged SalesIQ regarding shoulder pain with a possible strained or torn muscle. I emailed him via Outlook the below:
Here at MPB, we strongly encourage members to be empowered in knowing how to learn more about the medical service providers, prior to connecting and making an appointment or more. The tool we mostly use to research providers, specialists, hospitals and/or facilities, is Healthcare Bluebook. Below are simple directions on how to access this wonderful and resourceful site to build your confidence in who will care for your health.

Directions to accessing Healthcare Bluebook:
Healthcare Bluebook
Access with code MPB
Enter name and birthday
Begin search (sometimes entering the first few letters of your search broadens the list to choose from).
Directions to perusing Healthcare Bluebook:
Make sure the preloaded zip code is accurate for the location you are searching in
On the left-hand side search bar, enter the first few letters of your preferred search
For most PROCEDURES: a color-coded bar will appear that shares the fair price and explains where the money would be divided
Below you should see one or two columns in the results that appear.
One column will be regarding the fair pricing
Second column will be regarding the provider quality
The results will be rated via color coding: Green, Yellow and Red. When you scroll over each one, it provides a tine synopsis of what each mean.
If you click on one of the results, it''ll take you to the quality rating of variety of services that this result option has.
Attached is a sample of what you can find in Healthcare Bluebook for Orthopedic.
We would love to walk you through this process if you are interested. Please do give us a call if you wish to be personally guided further or have any questions.            NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-24 13:45:29', '2023-07-24 13:45:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122517022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767140', 'John Parks', NULL, '7-24-2023:  John''s wife called.  She doesn''t have a "perm to disc form on file" so we talk generalizations of how our plans work & what to do in certain situations.  
     - She is going to get w/John and call back while they are at the computer so:
               1) They can complete the "perm to disc form" - then next time we can talk specific IUA, comp, etc.
               2) We can teach them how to easily use HCBB to look for highest quality, fair price doc.
     - Gave her general way to present to a doc w/our plans: ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, save receipts & Inv, then call us for guidance in starting a ''med need'' w/healthsharing comp.  Resp up to the chosen IUA, then qual needs have sharing once apprv''d.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-24 13:28:59', '2023-07-24 13:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122550016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108041001', 'Frederick Schilling', 'Completed Welcome Call', 'WC complete on 7/24/23 by JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-24 13:18:48', '2023-07-24 13:18:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122546034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108424017', 'Jennifer Eisenberg', NULL, 'Member  submitted Change from to add newborn to membership.  I will add to the membership.  No change in price because already Member &amp; Ch.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-24 13:17:07', '2023-07-24 13:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122546019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', 'Decline of 8/23 Share Amount', 'Member submitted updated Pmt info prior to me send her out  a email.  I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-24 12:49:48', '2023-07-24 12:49:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122517017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107133002', 'Preston Jones', NULL, '7-24-2023:  Preston called.  They moved to AL &amp; are looking for new docs, so he wanted to understand Planstin''s req.  I let him know, re: ''prev care'', as long as the doc will bill Planstin directly, they can select the doc of their choice.  He was thrilled.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-24 12:37:18', '2023-07-24 12:37:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122523040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '7-21-23 
Hi Wendy,
Please see a collections letter for lab work.
Silly stuff.
