  ('zcrm_1579374000122513021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120891002', 'Douglas Hill', NULL, '07.24.2023 Douglas is looking into getting his chiro sessions covered, explained that chiro sessions need pre-approval with a treatment plan and a referral from the PCP to identify the need for treatment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-24 10:50:24', '2023-07-24 10:50:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122513016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109364009', 'Nina Martinek', NULL, '07.24.2023 Nina called to confirm the best way to fulfill the IUA, with different providers or straight to Zion, NOW THAT her need is open and approved. I explained either way works, but paying Zion directly would be the cleanest, especially now that she has a need open and has the treatment plan/letter of good faith from the providers.
