  ('zcrm_1579374000122507023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091197001', 'Mira Adhikari', NULL, 'Member Bishnu Adhikari (spouse) called in and wanted to know why he was being charged $190 every month after he cancelled.  After much digging, member shared that he also pays for his spouse.  I advised that it was her membership that he was paying for.  Member to change payment method on this membership  I sent form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-24 10:17:29', '2023-07-24 10:17:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122507018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111963451', 'Bishnu Adhikari', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know why he was being charged $190 every month after he cancelled.  After much digging, member shared that he also pays for his spouse.  I advised that it was her membership that he was paying for.  Member to change payment method I sent form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-24 10:16:22', '2023-07-24 10:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122517003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '7-24-2023:  Joel called.  He''s having his ''prev care'' appt mid Aug.
     - Planstin:  Only time "ins" = Y, present Planstin ID Card ( will never present a card for anything else), must stay w/in the ''prev care'' items so everything is med coded as ''prev care''.  We went to Healthcare.gov together so he can see an up-to-date list.  He had already picked a PHCS doc, but I let him know in or out of ntwk okay as long as doc will bill for you.  Warned him to tell doc''s ''NO to "ins" next time (it it is not ''prev care'') that he doesn''t have "ins" & the card they have on file is not effective (so it doesn''t get billed & he has to pay a disc price, instead of a ''cash-pay'' price).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-24 10:15:38', '2023-07-25 10:14:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122513003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, '07.24.2023 Tal emailed me yesterday (Sunday), sharing that he''s having trouble opening that medical need with Zion. I emailed him via Outlook (given that is where he emailed me responding to the instruction sent to him back on the 27th). I sent him the below...and more:
Temporary Steps to Opening a Medical Need with Zion:
Because the website is not recognizing you as a member, we need to call Zion: 888-920-9466 ________ Choose #6 for Customer Service
After Speaking to a Zion representative, they will send you an invitation to start your medical need process (Stay on the phone with them with this)
The 2nd main glitch is not allowing you to upload your documents/recognizing you again as a member, SO Zion will send you an email to correspond with them (work around).
Don''t hesitate to call them afterwards, if you need additional assistance: __________ this time choose #5 medical need.
Their hours are Mon – Fri: 7am – 5pm Mountain Time. 
I''m glad you reached out to us, please do give us a call if you would like us to go over this again and transfer you to Zion.             NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-24 10:07:49', '2023-07-24 10:07:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122507008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122456010', 'Olivia Dopp', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-24 10:04:20', '2023-07-24 10:04:20'),
