  ('zcrm_1579374000122382009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108891001', 'Sarah Stokes', NULL, '7-20-2023:  Sarah called.  
     - HSA:  Sarah wanted to set up her HSA w/us.  We did some education.  We qualify her, but she can select the fin inst she''d like to utilize.  Warned her about fees.  She has an Edward Jones fin planner, but may look at a few other options so she can compare if EJ planner does have something.
