  ('zcrm_1579374000122361013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120922012', 'Kaitlyn Kirkham', NULL, '7-20-23 Left vm for Kaitlyn to submit her life app.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-20 16:36:37', '2023-07-20 16:36:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122361008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120922020', 'Myrna McAfee', NULL, '7-20-23 We completed Myrna''s life ins app via video. It''s submitted and we will change it from $500K to $200K to meet her request. It looks like she will need a paramed, blood and urine sample. But, we''ll await their response first. I also let her know her SECURE membership will be cancelled on July 31st and  I''ll connect her with Jane for Medicare in AZ.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-20 16:03:15', '2023-07-20 16:03:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122354026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '07.20.2023 Christophe has a colons prev next wednesday. He is making sure he is covered not only in a preventative appointment, but also in healthsharing should they find polyps. I assured him that he is, in how he presents himself in either situation. He will call us to submit a need, should they find polyps. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-20 15:46:13', '2023-07-20 15:46:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122353021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082153001', 'Raluca Socander', NULL, '7-20-2023:  Raluca called.  She says she''s called us several times, ea time they''ve told her we''d call her back shortly, but she hasn''t heard anything.  There is one ticket from early this am, so I think she''s tt the Back Off Betties, but no idea why there is only one ticket.  She says she tt 2 diff people.  I encouraged her to call during our concierge hours (she says she called at 9am today, but from the time of the ticket, she prob called right before) because that way she''ll talk to us.  M-F  9am-8pm eastern
     - ''Welcome Call'':  sent her the invite.  She sched w/Jennifer next Mon 4:30pm. while we were on the phone.
     - In the last 2-3 mos, she''s had a neck pain.  They''ve done an MRI.  She has another appt, to review.  It''s a bulging disk.  
        ''PT'':  They want her to do PT for the bulging disk & she has a treatment plan.  I sugg we submit all of this as a ''med need'' right away so she can get the pre-approval to the PT.  She''s getting receipts & det inv together so we can do this.
     - ''GI'' appt - recently having issues & needs to have an endoscopy.  We went over this is generally considered diagnostic and is not ''prev care''.  She''ll save receipts & det inv so we can sub another ''med need'' since this is a sep issue.  She knows she will have a sep 1k IUA for the separate issues.  
     - IUAs: Went into detail on how IUAs work, 3/12 mos period, etc.  If her colonoscopy, endoscopy, & bulging disc are all > 1k, tech she could have 3 ''med needs'' & 3 sep IUAs almost at the exact same time.  Discussed what happens w/4th, etc.  
     - Colonoscopy: can be screening, but IF polyps pulled moved from ''prev care'' to diagnostic.  Totally diff component.  Goes from a free screening, to diagnostic & 1k IUA.  Call us w/in a few days & we will go over how to sub this ''med need''.
     - ''Prev Care'' - Planstin: Only time you will say"ins"-Y; only time you''ll present an ID card, stay all ''prev for proper medical coding and pymt!  Any doc willing to bill is ok, but NO pt reimb.  Will rec e-mail resource after Mon''s ''Welcome Call'' that will have a link to see what the gvmt considers ''prev care''.  If something slightly > std care, call Planstin 1st to make sure covered (ie: 3D mamm, instead of std 2D = 3D not covered).  
     - Labs:  ''Prev Care'' = Lives in NY where they cannot utilize disc lab sites.  We looked up & about 30-miles away in CT, she could access some.  I let her know it can be worth the drive, so to consider touching base prior to just having them done.  Std lipid panel only item we are seeing consistently pd for on ''prev care.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-20 14:32:32', '2023-07-20 17:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122339053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107379001', 'Richard Wright', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to increase IUA to $2500 eff 8/1/23.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-20 13:48:49', '2023-07-20 13:48:49'),
