  ('zcrm_1579374000122339038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', 'Previous Zion Membership', '1/1/22-5/31/22 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-20 13:07:17', '2023-07-20 13:07:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122354021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109620011', 'Monique Koen', NULL, '07.20.2023 Monique called to get connected with a couples therapist. I guided her through our Member Portal &amp; Updates to the Mazzitti &amp; Sullivan collaborative page with MPB. We went over the different resources on there and the different ways to connect with them, including the app resource. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-20 12:43:35', '2023-07-20 12:43:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122354016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081151002', 'April Kocsis', NULL, '07.20.2023 April called to confirm her coverage is still in good standing, b/c she has not seen her payment/portion extracted from her account. I double checked her CRM and Admin123 profiles, and confirmed that her $309 has been approved to be charged today/tonight. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-20 12:09:09', '2023-07-20 12:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122353008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098495002', 'Rebecca Abma', NULL, '7-20-2023:  Rebecca called.  She is having trouble knowing where things are on her Zion ''med need''.  She found the conf e-mail they sent after her orig sub, but they were rather slow & did not resp until 6/20/2023.  Now, she is just waiting.  I let her know they may be waiting for her to sign the HIPPA form & to make sure she monitors the registered e-mail add constantly because that is how they will communicate.  
