I did review your account information and I see here that you have a MEC (Minimum Essential Coverage) plan. Your MEC plan, APEX HDHP MEC, is the one that handles preventive and routine types of visits and usually requires their members to stay within the network of Doctors(PHCS). I apologize if the list of Doctors we sent to you from the concierge is not aligned with what you were expecting. Unfortunately, our price ship feature is simply for cash-pay-friendly providers. I''d encourage you to reach out to your MEC administrator since they will be able to better assist with finding a provider with the network. Their contact number is 800-795-7772.
 
