  ('zcrm_1579374000122229011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122145002', 'Matthew Jacobson', NULL, '7-19-2023:  Matt called.  He enrolled just yesterday, but has just become self-emp &amp; wasn''t sure how to handle the proof of self-emp.  Because his situation is so new, I trans him to Patti.  He will LM if he does not catch her &amp; he knows she may need to get him to someone else as we are restructuring.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-19 11:24:35', '2023-07-19 11:24:35'),
