  ('zcrm_1579374000122212033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122226002', 'Karin Nance', NULL, '7-18-23 Karin joined for herself only for now and will cancel her US Health. She''s saving almost 50% she said. She joined CARE+ $1000/$265 for Aug. 1st. She now has a good understanding of MPowering Benefits is the umbrella over all of the benefits within the membership.  She doesn''t want any of the traditional wellness visits. If she uses virtual healthcare, it will be on the computer since they don''t have cell phones in their family.  They try to be as healthy as possible. I should look at the Weston Price Conference. Could be a great clientele. She''s all set for now and may include the rest of her family later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-19 11:10:13', '2023-07-19 11:10:13'),
