  ('zcrm_1579374000122176003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109411002', 'Stacy Gloster', NULL, '7/19/23 - Stacy emailed in asking if her request to cancel her membership by email was accepted. I do not see an email in the info@ account so I am not sure where she submitted her cancelation. I sent Stacy the cancelation link in an email and advised her to have it submitted by 3 PM EST today so that she may avoid her charge for next month. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-19 07:13:43', '2023-07-19 07:13:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122123089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '7/18/2023:  Shirley contacted me to see where we are on the RBP so she can have her mamm done.  I sent her all of the details &amp; let her know it was finally released on 7/1/23.  In my e-mail I went over all details, how to present, included the healthcare.gov link, etc.  Mentioned must stay ''screening'' &amp; 2D to be what the gvmt pays for.  If anything but std screening always call Planstin to conf before hand.  Offered to make an appt to talk because I know it''s a lot.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-18 18:30:19', '2023-07-18 18:30:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122123081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086964002', 'Lani Cordova', NULL, '7/18/2023:  Sherdon called & left me a VM.  He''s needing a colonoscopy.  We disc how to present on Planstin = as long as the providers will bill for him (& it stay a screening), he can utilize them w/no copay.  We disc how to handle if they pull polys & it moves to healthsharing & the 1k IUA.
     - Sherdon turns 50 in Aug, so I also brought up the chg in age bracket & let him know the monthly contribution will go to $905 (per Patti''s e-mail).  Also called to make sure Lani was aware (she pays the bills) & we discussed why it was happening & that this is the highest age bracket.  
     - Lani is sure she has the Planstin card, but she''ll let me know if not.  [Turns out Sherdon had his colonoscopy a few hours ago.  She will find out if the office will bill for him & try to get their reimb since he presented as ''cash-pay.]', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-18 16:58:56', '2023-07-18 17:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122123076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '7-18-2023:  Jerry called.  Lori has an issue re: breathing/chest type thing.  W/her curr stage 4 cancer, they have to be careful since her immune system is compromised.  Therefore, we got Jerry a CirrusMD invite.  But, when I went to send one to Lori, it said it did not recognize her.  I sent support e-mail to CirrusMD to please add Lori.  Hopefully, they''ll get it done quickly in case she needs it.  Jerry asked what to do if not: I said always make sure you are taken care of:  Urg Care, or in an emergency the ER.  We went over how to present in case.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-18 16:42:57', '2023-07-18 16:42:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122123055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115993002', 'Paolo Gramcko-Tursi', NULL, '7-18-2023:  Paolo called.  The baby is crying & crying.  
     - ''Welcome Call'' invite sent.  Sugg he & his wife be on the call if at all possible.  He will get this sched.
     - ''Prev Care'':  Sent healthcare.gov site link & info.  He was under the impression they had a waiting period for the baby''s prev care.  Told him the ''prev care'' for all of them was effective with their plan.  Maybe they disc others plans (some do have the wait).  We disc keeping everything at appt ''prev'' (& I gave example: baby curr not feeling well.  If disc & treat this at a ''prev care'' baby appt, it may chg medical coding to something not cov.  Sugg tt doc to make sure separate appts.)  They took the baby in May for a wellness visit & he''s going to let the doc''s office know they forgot to present their ''prev care'' ID card - can they bill & then reimb once pymt rec''d?  
     - CirrusMD:  The baby has not been feeling well & although he''s been able to add the baby to his acct, they system is not allowing Angie to add baby Paolo.  I sent a support e-mail req they add baby Paolo to Angie''s acct (she''s a stay at home mom & dad Paolo isn''t always there to do the call himself.
     - Illness:  ie: baby may be sick right now = NOT prev.  Went over how to present: no "ins", no ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, pay & retain receipts & detailed inv; 6mos deadline to sub (even if not at 1k IUA yet) = if ongoing worth submitting in case.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-18 15:12:53', '2023-07-18 16:39:24'),
