  ('zcrm_1579374000122126050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122133002', 'Paul Szotek', NULL, '7-18-23 Paul has completed enrollment for SECURE $1000/$715.  He was hoping he could pay for DPC out of HSA. I sent him an article showing that it''s not allowed at this time but told him to talk with his tax advisor. He will. He''s all set to go for Aug. 1st. The Enrollment Confirmation emails are not going out anymore. They can''t sign up for the Welcome Call! I''ve put in a ticket and notified the team. Paul also wants instructions to set up the HSA and those are no longer pulling up in Zoho. I''m asking Jennifer if she has them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-18 14:35:49', '2023-07-18 14:36:20'),
