  ('zcrm_1579374000122115051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109799008', 'Reginald Ashby', NULL, '07.18.2023 Reginald and Karen called back asking if they NEED to see a cardiologist to attain a holter monitor for cardiac, or can they get it from another doctor. I consulted Cari on this one via teams, as I do not know a lot of the medical services answers. Cari said and I relayed that it could be any doctor, as long as the doctor has recommended it, and it would be covered under the medical need, when the IUA is approved. 
 I gave Reginald the directions to how to stay organized with his paperwork (fulfilling the IUA and the 6 month deadline), and needed to repeat that a few times for him. After a confirmation of him understanding the process of THIS NEW medical need process with Zion, I gave him Zion''s number and direct transferred him there to open a medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-18 13:50:18', '2023-07-18 13:50:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122126033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122130002', 'Erin VanBuren', NULL, '7-18-23 Erin is 44 and husband is 46 ( think she said). They are both healthy. Husband had appendix out within the past 2 years. Otherwise healthy. She wants SECURE $1000/$525. An insurance agent told her about a different MCS company. She didn''t like that one and found MPB. She researched MPB and chose this. Her agent then researched MPB and joined herself. I''m not sure who her agent was. Erin was working with Chris Ferris but he''s no longer with MPB, so Julia passed Erin over to me and I walked her through the enrollment process just now. They are slated for an Aug. 1st start date. I''ll send her my overview email and contact information. She seemed well versed. I explained the IUA again and how it works and made she she understood husband appendix removal will fall within pre-x clause. She''s ok with that since it''s out and can''t have any more complications with it. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-18 13:32:12', '2023-07-18 13:32:12'),
