  ('zcrm_1579374000122115043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335249', 'Terrie Parrott', NULL, '07.18.2023 Terrie called due to her account being overcharged twice $50. I messaged JK via teams, but he was busy with another valued member.
