  ('zcrm_1579374000122115008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842149', 'Abigail Vick', NULL, '07.18.2023 Abby called re: Genevieve''s doctor referring Genevieve to a Perinatal cardiologist. Abby wanted to know how to proceed to be be covered. I guided her to present herself as a cash pay patient, collect all receipts from what she pays, to demonstrate fulfillment of the $500 IUA. Sent her instructions to opening a medical need with Sedera, for when she is ready to upload her documents for coverage. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-18 10:09:33', '2023-07-18 10:09:33'),
