  ('zcrm_1579374000122107028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120108002', 'Penny Fallon', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-18 10:06:54', '2023-07-18 10:06:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122085038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104655002', 'Melissa Hernandez', NULL, 'I spoke to Planstin about the issue below and they said that this stems from the fact that we cancelled all the previous Secure memberships and re-enrolled them as "split" plans eff 6/1/23.  They advised that this should be fixed now.  Reached out to Diane and let her know.  She will let member know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-18 10:05:34', '2023-07-18 10:05:34'),
