  ('zcrm_1579374000122089019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107787002', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, 'Nathan called into the concierge line regarding the need to change his account that his monthly premium comes out of. I transferred him directly to Patti here as she is the one that deals with payment changes/updates. Patti took the call, and his request is taken care of, Nathan is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-18 08:53:47', '2023-07-18 08:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122089014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716704', 'Dawn Olson', NULL, 'Dawn reached out to the concierge line and stated this is going to be the first time she has needed to use her Health sharing portion of the plan since she enrolled and needed assistance on how she would go about handling a growth that she has gotten on the back of her leg. I explained the step-by-step process of what she needs to do with being a cash paying patient up to her IUA of $2500 and nothing more past her IUA. If this situation gets past her IUA, then she will need to contact Sedera and submit all of her bills, receipts, etc. into them to start a Need. I told her I would send her the email that explains exactly what she would need to do if the Need arises. She understood perfectly well and is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-18 08:51:57', '2023-07-18 08:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122085028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107787002', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, 'Member called into to update payment method.  I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-18 08:49:33', '2023-07-18 08:49:33'),
