  ('zcrm_1579374000122060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122133002', 'Paul Szotek', NULL, '7-17-23 Julia passed this to me and I called him immediately and sent him an email as well. I also let him know he can contact me via text if that helps.  Looks like this was dropped once Jeffrey left. So, I''m picking it back up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-17 12:26:35', '2023-07-17 12:26:35'),
