  ('zcrm_1579374000122019013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768243', 'Haley Collins', NULL, '7-17-23 Haley changed her IUA to 2500 bc she''s financially strapped right now. She was going to cancel and look for regular ins so her company will reimburse her. They won''t reimburse for MCS but will for ins. However, she can''t get on their plan now since it''s not open enrollment with them. She might move in the next bunch of month since she''ll be getting kicked out of her rental since the owners want to do airbnb for the winter months. She might have to move from Dillon to Edwards where it''s cheaper. She was hoping to go without ins at all but her mom and I gave her the same advice not to cancel in case something bad happens. So, chose to increase her IUA and now the price will be lower than what she was paying in the 18-29 age group. I also let her know I can help her find traditional ins options once she has an SEP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-17 10:18:35', '2023-07-17 10:18:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111686002', 'Byron Sealey', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request  eff 8/1 citing employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 10:02:05', '2023-07-17 10:02:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113526002', 'Laurie Linn', NULL, 'I received an email from Laurie asking me what to do for her situation.  She has some precancerous cells that will have to be biopsied.  She suspects it will be in excess of the $1000 IUA, so I told her to be in contact with Zion directly and they would be able to advise her how to proceed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 09:57:57', '2023-07-17 09:57:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122013002', 'Donald Hubbard', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 09:48:27', '2023-07-17 09:48:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121987002', 'Juan Starkmann', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 09:46:20', '2023-07-17 09:46:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121978010', 'Sara Suzanne Basham', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 09:44:32', '2023-07-17 09:44:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122011033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '07.17.2023 Michelle called b/c she''s having problems with her preventative portion of the plan. She also stated that her account in the MPB platform shares that her Secure portion is inactive.
I explained the platform shift with Planstin from PHCS to RBP, and what that entailed, how it is presented IF NEEDED at the doctors'' offices, and how billing is to be guided.
She shared the lab from her wellness visit testing for the standard lipid panel, got denied by Planstin, but they are resubmitting it presently.
Michelle had questions but had to take a call, so we hung, with the expectation that she calls back and asks for Nahla. 

Michelle called back and we talked about PHCS vs. RBP. She is extremely worried about not getting covered and getting "burnt" again, like in the past.
The doctors she found in the PHCS network in May are no longer showing on the list today. I offered her to proceed in two manners:
1-call and confirm they are still on the PHCS list, b/c  she found them in may but now they are no longer showing (BTW she was able at one point find the facility of one doctor, just not the doctor''s name specifically.
2-Have the doctor connect with Planstin directly via phone number in the back to collaborate pricing and billing.
I kept repeating the above to Michelle, but she was still nervous and was not wrapping her mind around it. To me it may be because she just does not want to deal with anymore mishaps from doctor''s billing offices. 
electronically sent from the doctors office and the lab. The Gyno said they cannot collaborate pricing and billing prior to the appointment due to lack of coding. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-17 09:34:16', '2023-07-17 11:10:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122011028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083452001', 'Peter Martino', NULL, '07.17.2023 Peter was transferred from Planstin regarding his child Lincoln''s bday that is wrong.
I guided him towards the member portal and updates page, had him bookmark it, and use the form to change to correct his son''s bday to November 1st from October 1st. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-17 09:28:37', '2023-07-17 10:36:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122012014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119540002', 'Albert deHombre', NULL, 'Member needed to reschedule welcome call. She was on road heading into mountain and she was going to lose service. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-17 09:18:44', '2023-07-17 09:18:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122011017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116383002', 'Liza Bakken', NULL, '07.17.2023 Liza called to speak to Jennifer but Jen was in the Monday morning meetings, so I offered to help her or have Jen call her back. Liza was glad to work with me, so she shared that she still has not received her Planstin card without the PHCS network on the back and have the RBP there instead. She needs the new card for her wellness visit tomorrow. She lives in a rural area and wants to make sure she is taking the right steps towards having the doctors bill properly. 
She has an appointment tomorrow and just wants to make sure she has the right card - I thought it did not matter what is on the card that all she needs to do is connect them with Planstin to collaborate pricing and billing, so I messaged Jen via teams to clarify what was stated to Liza, before going any further. I didn''t want to tell her anything different than what Jen and Wendy told her, so I offered her a call back once I learned more and connected with Planstin.
I consulted with Jen again via teams, and she said that she requests Planstin to send her the PROMISED card with the RBP information on the back and the REMOVED PHCS network logo.
However TWICE asked and TWICE Planstin has sent over the old card, with PHCS and no RBP information.
I called Planstin to discuss this once again from a more clarifying angle vs expectation based on information that was offered to us from layers of other parties. I left a VM for Planstin to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-17 09:11:00', '2023-07-17 10:39:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122019008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122013002', 'Donald Hubbard', NULL, '07.17.23:  Enrolled Donnie today in Care Plus - M/O.  Told him to schedule a Welcome Call after August 1 and to call me with any questions during his onboarding process. Emailed him to thank him for his enrollment.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-07-17 09:01:33', '2023-07-17 09:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122019003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122013002', 'Donald Hubbard', NULL, '07.14.23:  Called Cindy to see if Donnie is ready to enroll. She said yes and to contact him directly to schedule a time do enrollment.  Called Donnie and scheduled enrollment call for 7.17.23.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-07-17 08:59:56', '2023-07-17 08:59:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121984002', 'Susan Boysen', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 08:56:35', '2023-07-17 08:56:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975010', 'Nicole Schoch', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp  $2500 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 08:50:17', '2023-07-17 08:50:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122012003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120423002', 'Shannon Kenyon', NULL, '7-14-2023:  RX Quotes:  Shannon never ret''d my call.  Since it''s Friday now, I sent the following on her two items.  Do not really know how they feel about any of this.  These are the last 2 RX quotes to complete the 6 they submitted.
     From yesterday, this is still completely applicable.  "Their preferred pharmacy is Paradise Roots & not a sngl disc site has a contract w/them.  ILM for Shannon w/the following info & asking how she would like to proceed...
     3 mos supply of all items (& NO contracts on the Paradise Roots coupons, so no way to know if they will honor them)".  (Cost+ instructions for both Shannon''s & Todd''s quotes yesterday.  Even w/s&h they are less expensive than the coupon prices at Paradise Roots.) =
     - Lisinoptil 10mg, #90 tabs = 11.09 on BuzzRX 
     - Citalopram HBR 20mg, #90 tabs = $12.06 on Buzz RX     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-17 08:44:43', '2023-07-17 08:44:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000122011003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109795001', 'Elise Schadauer', NULL, '07.17.2023 Elise shared she spoke with someone earlier, who was super helpful, but she had more questions regarding the fair pricing for a Detached Retina Surgery she is experiencing. Elise shared that this would be considered as a PreX condition, but she is trying to find the best pricing as a cash pay patient. 
Elise wanted to better learn how does the cash-pay discount work? Wondering is it less expensive and how is it different from insurance billing. I explained that having insurance for doctors to bill, creates a third party and sometimes 4th party involved, so the pricing is not only different, but usually a lot more. When presenting as a cash pay patient, you as a patient eliminate the several layers between you and the doctor and his services, therefore more cash flow goes towards the Doctor and his/her office. 
Elise said she spoke to someone else earlier, I confirmed it was Jen, and Jen had supplied Elise with a list of Doctors, which later I learned was from the HCBB website.
I guided her to the HCBB and perused the site with her, so she can research at her own leisure, and learn more than who offers the procedure and their ratings. 
Elise felt helped and guided between Jen and I, and was confident to continue with her research for an Ophthalmologist for her Detached Retina Surgery. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-17 08:41:08', '2023-07-17 09:07:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121976011', 'Robin Kruel', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 08:31:30', '2023-07-17 08:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121993008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', 'New Membership eff 8/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 07:43:07', '2023-07-17 07:43:07'),
