  ('zcrm_1579374000121993003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, 'Sedera Membership 9/1/2020-7/31/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-17 07:24:32', '2023-07-17 07:24:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121992003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '7/17/27 - Jennifer called in so that she could be transferred to Zion to receive her member portal information so that she can open a maternity need for her daughter who is currently pregnant. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-17 07:19:30', '2023-07-17 07:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121988001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109795001', 'Elise Schadauer', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3164 Question : Where can I find an online list of physicians who see cash paying patients?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-07-16 22:07:30', '2023-07-16 22:07:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121976011', 'Robin Kruel', NULL, '7-14-23 Robin is Brent Kruel''s wife. Brent has benefits through the VA and is all set. But, he''s totally on board with MPB and wants to offer this to his employees at BioFunctional Health Solutions. So, Robin and Amelia Carter are starting first. Robin is healthy, no pre-x, no meds. She understands value of MPB and whole body health solutions which is what they do at BioFunctional Health Solutions. She enrolled in SECURE $1000/$300. The $125 was not billed but I prepped her that it will be part of the cost. I will send her and Brent the payment form to set up ACH. She didn''t have Brent''s account information when they were both enrolling. Brent had a conflict and couldn''t join our call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 21:11:17', '2023-07-14 21:11:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121978002', 'Amelia Carter', NULL, '7-14-23 Amelia works for Bio Functional Health Solutions with Brent and Robin Kruel. She is super fit, exercises, eats well, etc. She has Hoshimotos which she handles with her lifestyle choices and supplements as well as Synthroid (not the generic levothyroxine). She needs  a sonogram every year and was able to get it for about $600 last time in her endocrinologists office which she believes was much more affordable than going elsewhere. She knows she''ll have to pay for that definitely the first year and likely beyond assuming she doesn''t meet her IUA. She was apprehensive at first until she understood how the entire membership works and why. Once she also heard about cash pay and the discounts on alternative care that was beneficial to her, as well as virtual healthcare.  She was a pleasure to talk with. She''s very focused on whole body health.  She successfully enrolled in SECURE $1000/$375 and Brent and Robin Kruel with BioFunctional Health Solutions will pay for her entire membership. She wanted a discount by showing how fit and healthy she is. I explained that''s not an option at this time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 21:03:18', '2023-07-14 21:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, '7-14-23  Blood issue was in 2020. So, well beyond pre-x clause for anything.  Therefore, no pre-x. He cancelled his old CARE Plus CV with Sedera just now for July 31st. He enrolled in SECURE since he thinks he wants a colonoscopy soon and I encouraged him to fund an HSA to help offset the cost. He knows to complete the Welcome Call and save the Reference Guide. I''l send him the SECURE overview as well. He was charged the $100 but not the $25 and I couldn''t waive the $100 which I need to do since he''s a current member.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 16:58:41', '2023-07-14 16:58:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121974046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '7-14-2023:  Aimee called.  She needs to open another ''med need'' (2nd one & diff issue, diff pt), but the link we sent is not working.  I let her know Zion just updated the process & it has a few glitches.  She has Zion''s ph # & I trans her to ask for the Memb Portal Invite.  They close in about 10-minutes so we rushed thru instructions.  She''s leaving the country, so if the portal link to upload a need is still not working, she will use the e-mail address she''s been using w/a subj line of: Opening New Need: Patient Name & Issue, because she will not be able to call next week & when she gets back it''s time for (her son''s?) surgery.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-14 16:55:12', '2023-07-14 16:56:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121970043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118107002', 'Erik Bjur', 'TICKET ##2830##', '07.14.2023 Followed up on Erik''s mishap regarding his confusion about what benefits he has in his plan (being on Care+ but expecting Secure Benefits).
I went ahead and opened a ticket, for educational purposes (per guidance from the office), and emailed Louis to make sure he''s touched base with Erik.
Louis was kind and prompt with answering back, letting me know that Erik did reach out, Louis forwarded the Existing Member Change Form to him that same day (7/6), but after double checking  multiple platforms (together with Cari, to make sure I''m not missing a step here), we did not locate a submitted form by Erik to change his plan.
I responded to the ticket for documentation with:
Connected with Lou.
He had talked with Lou that same day and thought a change form was already submitted.
After searching for change forms or a cancellation form, I see nothing. 
He called Erik right away.
Erik says he will submit the form right away. At 7:06pm EST we hadn''t seen a form yet. 
I''m not sure where the confusion came from but believe this situation has been corrected.
Want to document this issue, in case there is pattern.                  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-14 16:42:12', '2023-07-14 17:16:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122226002', 'Karin Nance', NULL, '7-14-23  I met Nance  at the Naturally Inspired Health Summit and called her today. She tried to avoid the call through her son until I told him she and I talked and wanted to learn more. Once I talked with her, she''s a huge talker and like-minded. She''s thrilled to learn of a different way to protect for a catastrophic health event. She''s now home schooling her teens. She was isn''t working now but was an acupuncturist and homeopath. She handles most of the small health issues her family has on their own with diet, exercise, food and all natural ways. She does not ascribe to the formal wellness visits. They are all super healthy. Her husband did have a hernia surgery in the past few years and was bitten by a dog. Those are the only items recently. Even her mom is 89 and a retired physician without any meds and is very aware of our broken system. Karin is paying $1255 per quarter which is $418 a month. She thinks her husband is paying around $450 a month and then not a ton more for her kids. She will try CARE+ first for herself and then perhaps add family later. We will reconnect on Monday to possibly enroll after she shares this with her husband. She may also open a separate bank account for this expense since she''s not a fan of ACH. We had a great and long conversation. She''s also part of BSU but doesn''t have a cell phone. She gets info from her friend who does connect via the chats. She lives in Boulder and even her neighbor is well aware of the broken system.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 16:28:11', '2023-07-14 16:28:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, '7-14-23 Stephen called me back finally. He says he doesn''t read emails. But, phone calls work best. He was going to change the IUA to $1000 to bring down the cost until we realized he can move to SECURE and get his monthly back down to $375/$1000. He had a blood issue that was super rare and his dr. says it should never come back. If it does he has the leftover medication to deal with it moving forward. He''s not worried about it and understands the pre-x clause will start over by switching.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 15:11:33', '2023-07-14 15:11:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121948052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121978002', 'Amelia Carter', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-14 14:55:48', '2023-07-14 14:55:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121970029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '07.14.2023 Normandie had a mamm and presented her Planstin for the info from the back of the card, and requested the mamm be a preventative/screening only appointment.
She received a bill for $400. I guided her and Jen via teams second it, to call the facility back and let them know that she received a $400 bill directly from the radiology and want to know how they are involved. Did they read the images? Is that how they are involved?
Then call the radiology center and off them the Planstin card information so they can bill them directly. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-14 14:53:55', '2023-07-14 15:01:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121948047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121930002', 'Scott Faulconer', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-14 14:45:49', '2023-07-14 14:45:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121970024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120756012', 'Ernest Stafford', NULL, '7.14.2023 Jennette called and asked for Cari, to help her peruse and search for a physician. Cari had just gone to lunch, and she accepted that I help her through that.
I guided her to the email she received after her welcome call, and to HCBB. Got her to sign in with using the MPB code and her personal information to register, and together we perused the site, until she felt comfortable using it and learning the rest on her own. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-14 14:44:36', '2023-07-14 16:35:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121948042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121928001', 'Tanya Hagre', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-14 14:42:41', '2023-07-14 14:42:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121951013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107629002', 'Bryan McCay', NULL, '7/14/23 - Bryan called in today because when he logged into his MPB.Health member portal it stated that his Secure product has been inactive since May of 2023. I explained that it was within our system, that we had to change the coding on our products, so for that particular Secure plan it is not inactive. Bryan was grateful for the answer and will not worry any longer. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-14 14:37:12', '2023-07-14 14:37:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121951008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022809040', 'Pamela Finch', NULL, '7/14/23 - Pam called in because back in Oct. 2022 she had an urgent care visit that did not go well. The hospital advised Pam that they HAD to LEGALLY submit these bills to her "insurance" (Planstin), to which they did and Planstin denied the bill. Pam paid the original bill with a 31% discount but just recently received ANOTHER bill in May 2023 from the same urgent care, for the same exact visit, stating that her "insurance" accepted the revised bill with new coding. By Planstin accepting this second bill, Pam''s cash discounted price went from 31% to 10%!! Essentia ended up sending Pam a bill for another $231! I will be reaching out to Ashlee and Melissa at Planstin regarding this situation. Pam should not have to pay another $200+ for a service she has already paid for. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-14 14:31:58', '2023-07-14 14:31:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121948032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119385002', 'Carla Wells', NULL, 'Per note below, this member realized she still has spouse''s employer coverage through the end of the year so she will be cancelling.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-14 14:25:04', '2023-07-14 14:25:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121948027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881295', 'Lu Corvelli', NULL, 'Per note below this member was showing up in Planstin as active however was not showing as active w/Zion.  I spoke to Planstin and they updated her and made sure she was showing as active in their system.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-14 13:59:06', '2023-07-14 13:59:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121974029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110975002', 'Cathy Tiffany', NULL, '7-14-2023:  Cathy called.  She has her mamm next wk & wanted to find out if her doc was cov.
     - We disc = any prov (both imaging cntr & reader of the images) that will bill her Planstin ''prev care'' for her is acceptable.  Yes PHCS still on card, but it''s opened up to anyone that will bill.  
     - Did some educ:  Planstin ''prev care'' = only time you say yes I have ''prev care'' "ins", present your ID Card, do not pay.  (Can feel odd because it''s exactly opposite of how to present for other component(s), healthsharing.)
        Lately, there has been a lot of confusion for members, so we ended w/our hours of availability should she need extra help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-14 13:39:23', '2023-07-14 13:39:23');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000121970013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120906098', 'Janice Hinds', NULL, '07.14.2023 Janice called wanting to get help scheduling her welcome call. I led her to her email with the scheduling link that was sent out to her on the 13th by Vanessa, but she requested that I schedule it for her. I share that we don''t usually do this for the member, and empower them to use the link. She said the email (looking at it from her phone) says to either use the link or call the concierge.
I wanted to consult Jen and Cari via teams, because although I can view the Bookings app, I was not wanting to miss a step in scheduling a member. I brought Cari in, and she reiterated the most effective and best practice is for the member to use the link, b/c that way the member can have a broader view of the availabilities in congruent with their own schedule.
While we were merging Cari into the call, Janice had figured out how to access the schedule link via her phone. We asked Janice if she feels confident in moving forward on her own and she said yes.
******************************************************************************************
Janice had to call back b/c the app/bookings was not confirming her input towards reserving that time. She had all the information in there but it kept asking her to input information that is already there, and/or saying trying again something went wrong.
When I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, Jen went and tried to book herself and she was able to book flawlessly. Aside from Janice this week, there was another member who experienced the same issue.
Janice left the bookings page and came back in, to try for the 6th time and she had success. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-14 13:19:23', '2023-07-14 13:43:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121974024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, '7-14-2023:  Angie called again.  She''s making sure the hospital, doc, & anesthesiologist will bill for her, but now she''s confused all over again. 
     - According to her, she''s never mentioned being a healthsharing memb, but the hosp keeps telling her they do not bill healthsharing.  Maybe since her prim doc is in the hosp there''s some note confusing the issue?  Let her know Planstin is a little ''prev care'' ins policy.  Has nothing to do w/healthsharing.  She will call the diff entities to tell them her ''prev care'' is "ins".  
     - We confirmed again:  They must be willing to bill for her.  She cannot do the billing & she cannot be reimb when it comes to ''prev care''.
     - IF they pull polyps = no need to mention anything to the providers.  Call the concierge, and in the background we will guide her.  At that point, she would go back as:  since diagnostic, no "ins", no ID card, ''cash-pay'', offer ''cash-pay'' disc, & now resp for first 1k IUA, but, then she''ll have a pre-pd cc after we help her get it authorized to pay the balance.
     - She''s really struggling with this & I''m not sure how to help her.  Each time we get off the phone we end w/a plan of action.  Then she calls back & I feel like we are back to sq one.  She seems to understand, yet something is confusing the issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-14 13:01:41', '2023-07-14 13:01:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121974019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119385002', 'Carla Wells', NULL, '7-14-2023:  Carla''s husb called (Jonathan=this file came up from the ph #).  I did not confirm, but feel confidient it''s Carla.  Also, we did not discuss anything on this memb specifically, just general info.
     Jonathan found out Carla''s been on his health ins & will be thru this yr.  He wanted to pause this, but I told him we''d need to cancel, then re-enroll.  Made sure he has Louis'' ph #, told him the deadline for the curr cancellation = rec''d by 19th of this mo so no further mo cont taken, and let him know Louis may be able to waive the enrollment fee for him when he''s ready.  Trans him to Louis.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-14 12:53:41', '2023-07-14 12:53:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121974011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199001', 'Joseph Cozzoli', NULL, '7-14-2023:  Joe e-mailed me.  He''s doing his taxes and wondered how much the "ins" portion of his membership was.  Patti prev provided us with: Memb + Fam = $135/mo.  I replied to his e-mail.  Let him know Planstin sent out the e-mails at the end of Feb w/a link &amp; instructions for getting the tax form for 2022.   Included their ph # in case he cannot find that e-mail, letting him know they are the company that provides that info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-14 11:54:48', '2023-07-14 11:55:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120922012', 'Kaitlyn Kirkham', NULL, '7-14-23 I got Kaitlyn set up for dental and life ins through NLG for $500K 30Yr Term. I have NOT submitted it yet. I need to make sure the app is for 30 year, not 20 year and make sure my AZ license is active. I also need to do a video call when I speak with her next to finalize app', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 11:53:31', '2023-07-14 11:53:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121974003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120756012', 'Ernest Stafford', NULL, '7-14-2023:  Jennette feels a bulge right above her bellybotton.  I asked if it had been there a while since she just became eff 7/1/23 & she says no, just in the last few days/week.  She thinks she may have lifted something heavy last week & it''s really sore, protruding spot has appeared.
     She called CirrusMD & after talking w/the doc for a while, they think she should make an appt w/a general surgeon to look into hernia surgery.
     She wants to learn how to use HCBB, but will call me later do go over that.  We went over our hours & it sounds like we''ll talk later in the afternoon.  She''s away from home & wants to bet there to do this together.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-14 11:25:57', '2023-07-14 16:05:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121975002', 'Lynn O''Malley', NULL, '7-14-23 Lynn will watch the video and go get pet food and call me back when she''s available to discuss medical, dental and life ins. I need to send a video explaining how the dental discount plan works as well. Lynn will have an Aug. 1st start date for MCS. She called me back and we completed her SECURE $1000/$375 enrollment. She might add her husband before the 20th deadline. EC is now $650. He cost is $375. So, his cost is $275. Hope Institute will pay half of his membership fee meaning $275/2 is $137.50 for each party. She is thrilled about this!  She is super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. He has rosacea and takes med for it and also has slightly elevated blood pressure that she''s hoping he''ll be off soon once he loses a little weight. He used to pay cash for his meds when he didn''t have ins. So, she knows those are both affordable. He''s an executive chef and on a cruise ship right now. She''ll check in with him to make sure he''s ok with cancelling his current ins and joining SECURE. She''s thrilled. We completed her app after fighting with Chrome on her Mac. Once we cancelled and started over, it worked.  I forgot to go over dental and life ins. I sent her a text since vm is full. We can do that on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 10:58:01', '2023-07-14 11:38:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120995002', 'Lindsay Taylor', NULL, '7-14-23 I set up Lindsay and her entire family for the dental discount plan with 1Dental. I need to send her a video showing how to use it as well as each employee of Hope Institute. I reminded her to complete her Welcome Call and she said she''ll do that.  She believes her life ins policy carries over from her former job with the school district. If not, she will let me know and we will walk through the life ins process. She was very nice and she''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 10:54:13', '2023-07-14 10:54:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121970008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107788002', 'Kevin Byram', NULL, '07.14.2023 Jamie called to understand why she received a lab bill, when it is covered under her preventative. I learned from Jamie that the bill is $400, and they tested for two more tests other than the standard lipid panel. I coached her to call Quest Diagnostic back, have them bill Planstin the Standard Lipid panel, and present as a cash pay patient on the other two. In the future, now Jamie knows she can use JasonHealth.com for lab-work other than the standard lipid panel. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-14 10:37:16', '2023-07-14 10:37:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121971003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120995002', 'Lindsay Taylor', NULL, '6-20-23 Lindsay is 34 and husband is 50. She watched the video.  They have a 25, 19, 9 and 4 year old. They have enrolled for July 1st as part of the Hope Institute group. Lindsay was super nice and hard to reach since she''s taking kids to camp, etc. They are healthy, no tobacco, etc. She seemed to have a good grasp of the membership and with only a few questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-14 10:30:19', '2023-07-14 10:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121970003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '07.14.2023 Kim called to clarify how she should present at a dermatology appointment and the lab involved in the biopsy. Her husband, Joel, went in for the derm appointment and had the biopsy done at a lab. At first Kim requested to pay cash, but the doctor''s office told them', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-14 10:19:39', '2023-07-14 10:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121958033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120756012', 'Ernest Stafford', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Kory and Jennette. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-14 09:14:59', '2023-07-14 09:16:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121958023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120893013', 'Ashley Sargent', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-14 08:33:23', '2023-07-14 08:33:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121958013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117844002', 'Lilian Pontillo', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-14 08:01:42', '2023-07-14 08:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121948022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121927002', 'Brooke Singleton', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-14 08:01:05', '2023-07-14 08:01:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121958003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119081001', 'Gregory Curler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Greg and Laura. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-14 07:40:21', '2023-07-14 07:40:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121948006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111949018', 'Jonathan Smoot', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation  request eff 8/23 citing Employer Coverage as the reason.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-14 07:30:27', '2023-07-14 07:30:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121951003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116121002', 'Brayden Luna', NULL, '7/14/23 - Karen emailed in as a follow up to Brayden''s ticket. I advised Karen that both Cari and Nahla have reached out to Brayden to assist him but have never received a call back. I asked Karen to follow up with Brayden and have him call the concierge line to have Nahla or Cari assist him.', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-14 07:27:14', '2023-07-14 07:27:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121902034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '7-13-23 Derek Lee''s Ph # is 419-290-4722 in case I need to reach him in the future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-13 17:23:58', '2023-07-13 17:23:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111949018', 'Jonathan Smoot', NULL, '07.13.2023 Jonathan called to cancel due to receiving insurance through employment. I consulted with Cari and she asked if he is cancelling due to employment insurance, and if that''s the case then sending him the form will be fine. But we did not know who to send the cancellations to, if the advisor no longer works for MPB and it is not because of employment insurance.
I sent him an email with the link to the cancellation for ( he was not in front of a computer at the time of the call) and a reminder to cancel by the 19th of this month. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-13 17:04:55', '2023-07-13 17:13:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121914031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, '7-13-2023:  John called.  He had MOW surgery (= mole removal).  He pd cash & wants to send ''us'' his bill.  We did a bit of education on how his healthcare works.
     - MOW surgery:  He pd & was reimbursed = already > his 1k IUA.  Pathologist still unpaid.  His partner Jill, has been helping him & now they are confused.  After discussing this, we got him to Zion cust srvc to get an invite to create his memb portal.  Then, he''s going to try to upload this newest bill on that portal, yet knows it has been glitchy as they move to this new process.  So, he will submit the new bill to needs@...  saying in the subject line:  Open Need: his name, & Addl Doc.  Zion was closing in about 10-minutes, so we hurried him over there, but he knows our hours & will call back if he needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-13 16:35:36', '2023-07-13 17:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121914026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120816002', 'Michael Lam', NULL, '7-6-2023:  Samantha called.  
     - Sent her a copy of the curr Zion Memb Guidelines.  I let her know the ''prev care'' in those guidelines are not pertinent to her or her plan.  She has a different ''prev care'' plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-13 16:24:00', '2023-07-13 16:24:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082148002', 'Angela Johnson', NULL, '07.13.2023 Angela called because she was unable to access her portal with Zion to upload her bills for coverage. I explained the glitch Zion is going through regarding the medical need platform and what to expect as a turn around until they fix the glitch. I was able to transfer her to zion to complete her process in uploading her documents. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-13 14:48:05', '2023-07-13 14:48:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address I will process in CRM, A123 &amp; FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-13 14:00:34', '2023-07-13 14:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121914018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095678002', 'Jacob Daly', NULL, '7-13-2023:  Jacob called again.  He got approv on his vericous vein surgery.  The story of his open ''medical need'' was extremely confusing.  Since 7/1/2023 = his 2nd yr of memb & the 25k sharing level, he has already paid > than his 1k IUA & was wondering how to get reimb.
     It felt like we were talking in circles because I never could understand if he has a Zion Memb Portal, etc.  I finally let him know, since he says he has an ''open med need'' that has been approved, Zion''s med need dept can help him find the best was to submit his over 1k pymt for reimb & get pre-approval for the next treatment = 3k-ish.  Made sure he has their ph # & trans him to their line.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-13 13:58:55', '2023-07-14 16:24:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110554002', 'Dirk Anderson', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-13 13:49:27', '2023-07-13 13:49:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361908', 'Paula Ward', 'Member aging into Medicare eff 9/1/23', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor - 7/13
Member submitted cancellation.  I will process - 8/3', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-13 13:44:48', '2023-08-03 12:36:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121914013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, '7-13-2023:  Have not rec''d conf from CirrusMD that they''ve created the accts request.  Resent req.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-13 13:39:57', '2023-07-13 13:39:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', 'Member aging into Medicare eff 9/1/23', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor - 7/13
8/11-Member called in and asked about cancelling due to being eligible for Medicare 9/1/23.  I told her that an email was sent to her, however she said that she probably deleted it.  I directed her to the website and she grabbed the cancellation and then submitted it.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-13 13:39:56', '2023-08-11 10:33:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002724127', 'Paul DeFelice', NULL, '07.13.2023 Paul went to the hospital last night at 2AM. He unknowingly presented the Planstin card for coverage. I request, before we proceed further, to call the hospital back, and retract that and present himself as a cash-pay patient. When he has done that, to call us back and we will guide him in opening a medical need with Zion. To open the need I told him he will have to have at least two items: fulfilling the $2500 IUA or getting close to it, and have receipts and invoices and contact information of the doctors who are involved.
He saw a PCP today, and the doctor recommended that he see a Cardiologist  and GI doctor.
I guided him to the HCBB site to search for doctors, and reminded him that everything regarding this incident, he will need to present himself as a cash-pay patient, collect all receipts and invoices.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-13 13:32:30', '2023-07-13 13:49:33'),
