  ('zcrm_1579374000121869128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120896002', 'Nicola Cook', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-13 11:11:43', '2023-07-13 11:11:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121890003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, '07.13.2023 Heather called to confirm if the gynecologists'' visit that her PCP recommended she go so, during her wellness check up, is covered under her plan. I explained, under her preventative with Planstin and as a woman, Heather would get covered for not only a PCP wellness visit, but also a woman wellness visit. She was still unsure if she needs to pay or not, and I told her she does not need to pay, and please do not pay, because Planstin is not known to reimburse patients. They MUST collaborate pricing and billing with the doctor''s office only. She understood and repeated "OK I don''t pay". 
I did reiterate to her how to present the Planstin card so they have the information from the back of the card, and let them know this is a preventative appointment and it needs to remain as such, so no diagnosing or treatments. IF they have to or need to prescribe anything or take the services further THEN ask if they can separate that part from the preventative. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-13 11:10:24', '2023-07-13 11:10:24'),
