  ('zcrm_1579374000121878008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120756012', 'Ernest Stafford', NULL, 'Jennette called in and asked about an injury/illness type of situation she is dealing with and needed to know what she next steps are after she has spoken with CirrusMD. CirrusMD has suggested that Jennette be seen by a specialist doctor for what the provider Jennette was speaking to with CirrusMD, thinks she has what is called Umbilical Hernia. She has pain when right above her belly button are is touched, slightly put pressure on in any sort of way, etc. Jennette is not sure what now. I explained to her that she will need to get in contact with Zion Health as they are the ones that will handle everything moving forward after Jennette has paid her IUA of $1000 out of pocket. I gave her Zion''s #, emailed her the How to Submit Needs to Zion''s template, and lastly directly transferred her over to Zion''s customer service line. All Set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-13 09:37:22', '2023-07-13 09:37:22'),
