  ('zcrm_1579374000121789035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, '7-12-23 left vm for Carrie to help answer her questions re mental health and hopefully put her mind at rest.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-12 11:50:32', '2023-07-12 11:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121789030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, '7-12-23 Lorene needed a little more coaching before her Welcome Call scheduled on Monday. She had covid really bad and was freaked out that she almost went to the ER. But, she made it through with the help of CirrusMD. She didn''t realize she could simply request to elevate the texting to a phone call. She realizes now that it makes sense and she''ll know moving forward. When she was sick, she couldn''t think clearly and it would have helped to just talk with someone. But, she''s working to fully wrap her head around how it all works. I coached her about the Planstin card and when and why to use it as well as setting up an HSA account which she''s psyched to do as well. She is Super appreciative and wants to refer her friends to me as well. She really likes how these work even though it''s confusing.  I coached her on the wellness visits. She may need a colonoscopy in about 1 1/2 years from now. I recommended she call the MPB Concierge Team before going since it will be on the 5 year plan instead of 10 year plan. She will need help to follow the best procedure for that and stay up to date with the newest regulations for wellness at that time, since it keeps changing. She did her mammo in Sept. 2022. She knows it''s every other year now, so she''ll happily wait on that. Pap screening I think she''s set for now it sounded like.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-12 11:45:34', '2023-07-12 11:45:34'),
