  ('zcrm_1579374000121770023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, '7/12/23 - Rossana should not be on this plan. She was told by her provider and/or advisor that the concierge team members can look up coding and determine whether or not it is considered preventative care. When I advised Rossana that the concierge team does not do this, but that she can find a list of preventative care services on the healthcare.gov website. Rossana stated that she did not like my "generic" answer and needed to know now. I advised Rossana that this is not something that the concierge team does but if she''d like to talk to another member of the concierge team, she is more than welcome to. Rossana demanded to be sent to Planstin for her answers so I transferred her.

