  ('zcrm_1579374000121791032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092126001', 'Sandy Giacobbe', NULL, '07.12.2023 Melaine, from the Orthopedic office, called to better learn how to help Sandy in submitting his bills for reimbursement. I told her that all he needs to, which sounds like he already did, is to present himself as a cash-pay patient, save his receipt and give us a call to get guidance on how to submit his bills to Zion. Melaine was happy to share that information with him again. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-12 11:04:32', '2023-07-12 11:04:32'),
