  ('zcrm_1579374000121791013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109171001', 'Amy Hindman', NULL, '07.12.2023 Amy wanted to learn more if she had an HMA in her plan. I thought she may have been confused between the Care+ plan and the Secure plan, but she said she was under the impression that her Care+ plan would have an HMA. I reached out to Jen and Cari via teams, and Cari gracefully requested that I transfer the call to her, and I did. Later Cari offered that when it slows down, she will go over some training pointers when it comes to HMA (Health Matching Acct) = very different than the HSA (Health Savings Acct). I''m looking forward to broadening my horizons. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-12 10:37:16', '2023-07-12 11:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121791008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521016', 'Catherine Jaimes Llanos', NULL, '07.12.2023 Catherine wants to know if we can freeze her account, while she is out of the country. Via teams, Jen said no. Catherine also asked if she cancels, when would be the best time, until she leaves on 9/13. I told her to call us on the 12th, and she won''t be charged for october, and she will have coverage for the rest of September.
