  ('zcrm_1579374000121791003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116673002', 'Kevin Stanek', NULL, '07.12.2023 Kevin was following up looking for a script for making appointments, he was expecting from Jen.
I followed up with Jen via teams, she said she sent it to him and Ava. He double checked again and saw the email.
