  ('zcrm_1579374000121770008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119540002', 'Albert deHombre', NULL, '7/12/23 - Member was on SalesIQ requesting information on how to access her CirrusMD services. I called Jessie on the phone number she provided (601) 750-4120 and we walked through how to set up her services. We also walked through adding her dependent to the account. Hopefully her son will get the treatment he needs so that he can have fun on vacation. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-12 07:49:26', '2023-07-12 07:49:26'),
