  ('zcrm_1579374000121770003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120926001', 'Jeramy Taylor jr', NULL, '7/12/23 - Jeramy left a message with the Betties this AM requesting information about items that are "covered" in his plan. I called the phone number on file for Jeramy but there was no answer and I was unable to leave him a message. I sent Jeramy an email asking him to call the concierge line for more information. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-12 07:34:30', '2023-07-12 07:34:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121715033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121177002', 'Lynn Schauwecker', NULL, '7-11-23 I updated the profile here to reflect the change to Aug. 1st start date which Patti corrected in Admin123 on 6/29/23.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-11 21:26:14', '2023-07-11 21:26:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121742073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068093', 'JoAnna Gillette', NULL, '7-11-2023:  JoAnna called to find out if telehealth is part of their healthcare.
     - CirrusMD:  We got JoAnna registered, however it would not allow her to add her children.  I sub a support e-mail to create an account for Lucas (LGillette19@gmail.com) and have both minor children added to both parental accts.  
