  ('zcrm_1579374000121742065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, 'Out of sequence.  We were short handed today & too many calls to get all documentation done at time calls were coming in:

7-11-2023:  Emily called.  Joan instructed her to use our website & link to sub a ''med need'', but it wasn''t working.  I let her know Zion just started a new process and it req a call to Zion for an invitation to create her Memb Portal.  Went over what to expect.  Made sure she has their ph # & which dept to talk & when.  She knows she''s resp for the 1k IUA, but once a qual ''med need'' is approved, she can get pre-pd cc''s to pay her bills if she can get estimates before appts or pay bills if the providers are willing to bill her.  She seemed to understand, yet will call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-11 19:38:09', '2023-07-11 19:42:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121742054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '7-11-2023:  Jennifer called requesting 2 options for her RX refill.  Rite Aid is one of the few pharmacies near her:
