  ('zcrm_1579374000121742018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120746001', 'Jennifer Zrubek', NULL, '7-11-2023:  Jennifer called.  She''s been waiting for someone to call at 2:30 for her Welcome Call.
     - Welcome Call:  Jennifer Thorin went home sick & Kelly F sent out e-mails to notify people that they needed to reschedule (that was the plan).  Jennifer Zrubek doesn''t see an e-mail, but I let her know it may have gone to spam, or maybe something else went wrong.  She was very nice about it & I sent her an e-mail to reschedule.
     - Vision:  Jennifer Zrubek is having her eyes checked & wondered if that''s a part of her healthcare.  We went over dental & vision are not a part of the plan unless it moves from dental or vision to medical (& I gave some examples:  cataract surg is med & can be an option after a waiting period.  Also disc 2 eyes can mean 2 IUAs).  She will connect w/her advisor Wendy Scipione if she would like to look into a sep policy to cover dental/vision.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-11 14:42:37', '2023-07-11 16:32:10'),
