  ('zcrm_1579374000121742008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810493', 'Michael Lutfy', NULL, '7-11-2023:  Michael called.  Birgitte''s been going thru some gastrointestinal issues.  He''s paid > his $2500 IUA already (it started in June).  We walked thru the curr process of sub a ''med need''.  He understands Zion is going thru an adj in how to sub, will req the invite to start a ''memb portal'', will ask if he needs one for himself and one for Bigeitte too, knows if their site does not recognize him for sub the need online to call them back for help.  We went over 6mos deadline for future ref.  Talked about the 12mos or > = they close the ''med need'' & the IUA will start again.  He will call if he needs further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-11 14:31:15', '2023-07-11 16:36:26'),
