  ('zcrm_1579374000121723003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '07.11.23:  Called Emily and asked if she got the assistance she needed from the concierge. She said she did and she is now entering her bills and receipts into Zion''s Needs portal.  I told her to keep me posted on how she is doing.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-07-11 09:28:44', '2023-07-11 09:28:44'),
