  ('zcrm_1579374000121716008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108404009', 'Mark Carty', NULL, 'Mark called into the Concierge line earlier and asked if routine bloodwork that general practitioners generally order with the Yearly Wellness Visit are included for no out-of-pocket costs with his SECURE Plan he has. I let him know he is correct and routine bloodwork for yearly wellness visits are included, BUT only specific ones are. I told him I would email him the link to the list of all the ACA Mandated preventative care items, including which blood-work panels are 100% shared. Mark said that would be great for him to have and take a look at for his knowledge to know what is and isn''t 100% shared with hi SECURE Plan. I also told him that Planstin the organization that handles all of his Preventative care and that I would put their customer service number in the email as well. That way he can give them a call if he has more in-depth questions about anything related to preventative care. All set and email sent. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-07-11 08:58:57', '2023-07-11 08:58:57'),
