  ('zcrm_1579374000121667018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '07.10.23:  Emily called and explained she went to the ER last Thursday, as her left lung collapsed. She was in the hospital for 3 days and did not pay any fees while there.  I explained she had to open a Need w/Zion.  I showed her where on our site to find the area to submit a Zion need.  When she got to their portal, she entered her email and and error message came up saying that email wasn''t in their system.  I tried to use the link I have but it wouldn''t work so I told her to call the Concierge for help in accessing her Zion account and opening a Need. I told her to call me if there was a further issue or she couldn''t get hold of them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-07-10 14:17:27', '2023-07-10 14:17:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121651037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '7-10-2023:  Emily called.  Joan has her trying to submit a ''med need'' online, but Zion chg''d they process/system/etc. recently, so she was have issues.  
     - Zion ''Med Need'':  Went thru entire process.  Emily just got home (but, was super tight lipped', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-10 14:05:54', '2023-07-10 14:28:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121624058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110468002', 'Emma Mallon', 'SUBMITTED Ticket ### 2809 ##', '07.10.2023 Emma Mallon called wanting to start her journey on a sleep study and its equipment, CPAP machine. I accepted that conversation, looked up her account, and then pulled up the recent Zion guidelines from their site. I searched by pressing the Ctrl key and the F key and typed sleep. The verbiage that surfaced did not support Emma. Sleep studies and their equipment are not shared.
