  ('zcrm_1579374000121624048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115979002', 'Tony Hugar', NULL, '07.10.2023 Robyn called to learn how to get reimbursed/covered for the 2 hours ER visit she had last week, regarding kidney stones.
