  ('zcrm_1579374000121624038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120264002', 'Cheryl Powell', NULL, '07.10.2023 Cheryl returned my called regarding her RX request  to give the details of her prescription, which is a diabetic testing device called, Freestyle Libre 2, with sensors that last for 14 days.  
