  ('zcrm_1579374000121631046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115996020', 'Cord Dorcey', NULL, '7-7-2023:  Cord called w/Jessica in the background.  Difficult call all the way around.  Cord had his laptop & we tried to do several things, but even if I was specific, he was off doing other things & getting anything done was super hard:
     - Jessica will need to chg her name.  (Cord had limited time & we had to get off the phone before we got to this.)
     - HCBB:  I tried finding sugg radiology facilities yesterday & found there is very little in HCBB for the zip code I have on file.  HCBB is freezing up a bunch & basically super diff today.  I couldn''t figure out why Cord was always in a diff spot than I was, why we couldn''t see the same info, & he''d say things like he was searching something diff.  Between my HCBB freezing, his not working together, & finally we realized he was using a completely diff location to look at (zip: 91101*) it was a very diff experience.  I am not sure we solved anything.  Maybe we found some facilities they can call, but the procedures she''s having done were difficult to find anything on.
     * They are inbetween homes (& staying at a parent''s home) so will eventaully need to update their address.  When they are ready they''ll call for guidance in how to do that.
     - Cord said he had to go, but they will call to get instructions on changing name & add when they are ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-07 16:59:55', '2023-07-07 16:59:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121631041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, 'Cari is having to cut & paste this into the CRM notes because my system is not allowing me into the CRM today.

7-7-2023:  Andrew from an MRI facility''s office called on behalf of Rebecca, requesting "initiation of authorization" for an MRI. I was not familiar with this terminology and asked him what hey meant. He explained that Rebecca needs to get an MRI (a subject never discussed with MPB), and was wanting the go ahead. I asked him if there''s a reason Rebecca is not calling herself, he responded with a pause then "we already sent her to the facility". I then said, members usually call us directly to have a conversation and get guidance on how to proceed. No need to get permission for procedures. Then I asked, did you mean to call MPowering Benefits? He said yes that is the number on the card she gave me, MPB on it.

I then was sure she was a member, I check Admin123 ( did not have access to CRM today), and she DID NOT come up. I asked Cari to help, but she was preoccupied with another valuable member. I did tell Andrew that the process usually goes as such: The members are cash pay patients and they open a medical need for situations like this. I''d like to consult my co-worker as she knows more about this than I do, so we will have to call you back.

I called Andrew back, after Cari was able to find Rebecca under Naber and in the green side of Admin123, and she shared her screen for CRM to see the notes.

Rebecca has clearly received numerous chats on how to present, how to get coverage, and how to submit bills to Zion. HOWEVER she continued (LITERALLY from just a week ago) to present as an insured member and offering her MPB card during cash pay visits.

I explained the above to Andrew. He will speak to Rebecca on how to proceed. NT', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-07 16:44:13', '2023-07-28 11:59:42'),
