  ('zcrm_1579374000121646008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001653225', 'Isabelle Peyrichoux', NULL, '7-7-23 Isabelle''s income has drastically reduced and she might be able to pay almost nothing with Covered CA for now. She ultimately wants to come back to MPB as soon as her income improves again. But, she''s going to double check with Covered CA to make sure she can join for Aug. 1st. I showed her how to complete the cancellation form for if/when she''s ready to cancel. She is SUPER nice and appreciative of my help and honesty.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-07 14:52:12', '2023-07-07 14:52:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121631019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102746002', 'David Mix', NULL, '7-7-2023:  Jennifer had to go to the ER on the 4th of July.  They did great in presenting &amp; the ER offers 30% for ''cash-pay''.  No inv yet though &amp; he hasn''t pd anything.  We decided he will call us in the next few weeks when he gets a bill.  Maybe by then Zion &amp; thier new portal/sub of ''med needs'' will have the new glitches fixed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-07 13:52:46', '2023-07-07 13:57:16'),
