  ('zcrm_1579374000121631006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095678002', 'Jacob Daly', NULL, '7-7-2023:  Jacob called.  He waited until after the 7/1/23 anniv date so he''s in his 2nd yr of memb now = 25k sharing avail for this pre-x issue.  We talked about how to sub his Zion ''med need'' for his varicos veins (the pain has been horrible).  Walked him thru what to expect &amp; the glitches we''ve been experiencing w/their new system.  He knows what to expect, took Zion''s ph #, &amp; I trans him over.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-07 12:48:13', '2023-07-07 12:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121646003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120922020', 'Myrna McAfee', NULL, '6-19-23 Myrna lives in AZ. She''s 64 and turning 65 Aug. 31st and moving onto Medicare. She makes Hope Institute a group of 3 for July. They will be adding new hires for Aug. 1st to keep the group intact. She has seasonal allergies and takes meds off and on. She has rheumatoid arthritis and no meds for that. She''s active and walks and stretches. She didn''t reveal to me that she is a tobacco user. However, she has insurance through a Native American tribe that will be considered her primary ins. This is simply as backup and only for one month before moving to Medicare. I must include her when she''s part of the group.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-07 12:43:39', '2023-07-07 12:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121624008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121600002', 'Melissa Darding', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-07 12:40:23', '2023-07-07 12:40:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121624003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, 'I received a Change form from this member wanting to remove spouse from the membership and change the membership to Care +.  I reached out to her that she would have to re-enroll with Mike and that I would advise Planstin that they were continuing members.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-07 12:31:07', '2023-07-07 12:31:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121614003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125146002', 'Jacob Lee', NULL, '7/7/2023:  tt Jacob.  Curr w/Christian Health Ministries at $771/mo.  Their 19 yr old is now req''d to sign the "faith & bible" testiment and they are uncomfortable w/that.  So they are looking.
     - Jacob 42, wife 39, 5 kids - 1 turned 19yrs in March 2023, unsure on ages of other 4 kids
     - Jacob is partner in his law firm so does work for himself.
     - No smokers in the household
     - Discussed diff between how CHM  handles med needs/IUA (if you go over the 1k IUA, they reimb the entire thing!) -- he knows that''s not how Zion works & we went over in detail the 1k IUA x max 3 issues in rolling 12mo period, 4th & beyond $500+ = waive IUA.
     - He''s going to ck how long it has been since his wife had PT on her back so we know whether pre-x is an issue there.  We disc that pre-x incl symptoms as well, but he said there is nothing else.  Did go over how pre-x has phase-in period & limit where other items do not.
     - No RXs for anyone / Wife has IUD /  5 kids, done w/pregnancy
     - Like 1k IUA & appreciated the comparison I sent w/his $2500 req''d quote.
Sent him a copy of Zion''s curr Memb Guidelines, reminded him of 6mos deadline for sub needs, & to dbl ck last date of wife''s PT/treatment (included the pre-x details in the e-mail for ref too).  Sugg we disc this potential pre-x again to be careful.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-07 10:50:07', '2023-07-07 18:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121611008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, '07.07.2023 Travis called on his way to the hospital again, for more testing and treatments regarding intestinal issues. Travis and the doctors still do not know what is going on with his intestines. He''s reached around $500 from his last visit, and is expecting TODAY''s hospital visit to be way passed $1000. I emailed him how to submit bills into Zion, via CRM. 
