  ('zcrm_1579374000121612003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507177', 'Lisa Triepke', NULL, '7-7-23 Lisa is 59 in Aug. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco and same with her boyfriend who is 58. He''s interested in joining as well. He is self-employed and she may quit her W2 job and rely on her rental income as her sole income and self-employment income. They both do their annual wellness visit and funds HSA''s. She''s considering joining a local DPC. So, she''s currently interested in all options right now, Care+, SECURE and DIRECT.  She''s likely looking at an Oct. 1st start date. I gave her the newest prices for SECURE at $375/$1000 or $325/$2500. I will send all 3 to review.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-07 10:26:27', '2023-07-07 10:26:27'),
