  ('zcrm_1579374000121599003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089150002', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, '7/7/23 - Arsenault Dermatology called to verify that Hannah has "insurance coverage" for her derm visit. I advised the billing clerk that in this instance, Hannah would be responsible for the first $2500 of these bills and then the rest would be submitted to her medical cost sharing company. The billing clerk was adamant that she needed Zion''s billing information to which I told her that there is no bill for her to submit to Zion directly, that the member will have to pay her portion and then submit the balance of the bills to Zion for payment. The billing clerk stated that they are going to mark Hannah as a self-pay patient. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-07 09:15:42', '2023-07-07 09:15:42'),
