  ('zcrm_1579374000121553003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109664001', 'Rebecca Meighan', NULL, '7/6/23 - I attempted to follow up with this member via both number listed in this profile. The first number was not a working number; the second number seemed to be a business number that I was able to leave a vm on for the member. I am awaiting a returned call but closed the ticket due to the concierge team following through. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-07 07:07:08', '2023-07-07 07:07:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121552001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106694002', 'Renee Hornor', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 3151 Question : I would like to have someone call me about your small business offerings.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-07-07 07:06:05', '2023-07-07 07:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121529001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106694002', 'Renee Hornor', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 3149 Question : I want some information on small business benefits.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-07-07 05:54:22', '2023-07-07 05:54:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121505064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125146002', 'Jacob Lee', NULL, '7/6/2023:  E-mailed Jacob the requested Secure, M+F, age band: 30-49, (smoker unknows, so also gave surchg info).  He asked for $2500 IUA, but I included the 1k IUA as well because w/a sngl issue, the lower IUA saves them money at curr mo cont.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-06 23:27:42', '2023-07-06 23:27:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121505059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '7-6-2023:  Julie called very frustrated.  She''s trying to login to see what benefits this plan has and it''s req a memb #.  We did quite a bit of education.  She had a lot of complaints and I tried to encourage her to always connect w/the conc line to get guidance pro-actively, we understand it''s hard when you do not utilize this often.
     - Prev care:', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-06 18:43:16', '2023-07-06 18:43:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121505051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118826002', 'Cathy Baker', NULL, '7-6-2023:  Cathy re-sub an RX Quote w/new strength:
     - Estradiol Transdermal Patches 0.05mg/24h.  She did not specify day supply, so I sent both the 28 &amp; 84 day supply coupons.  She can save $12 saved over purch 28 day supplies each month:
               1 carton = #8 patches = $27.35 at KS on GoodRX
               3 cartons = #24 patches = $70.05 at KS on GoodRX

Reminded Cathy good to use coupons w/in ~ 7-days.  Let us know if she needs refreshed coupons.- CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-06 17:56:25', '2023-07-06 18:19:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121502061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119765002', 'Janice Saar', NULL, '07.06.2023 Janice called today while we were in a meeting, and Kelly answered and put in a ticket. ILM yesterday, but when they talked to Kelly it sounds like they hadn''t heard that message yet. According to Kelly Janice was very upset, saying "that no one has gotten back to her about not able to be logged into her CirrusMD and her prescription is now empty. She spoke to someone here yesterday and they said someone would get back to her and she hasn''t gotten anything".
I confirmed with Kelly that two VM''s were left for Janice, and John called me back once. I sympathize with Janice as she said she gets headaches without the medicine, but the technical difficulties seem out of MPB''s hands.
I sent Janice an email suggesting additional  strategies to trouble shoot. If Janice responds with unsuccessful results, I requested she email me back and we will reach back out CirrusMD. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-06 17:03:06', '2023-07-06 17:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121502056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107499002', 'Isser Zeilingold', NULL, '07.06.2023 Isser called wanting to learn how to use his plan. Isser has not been receiving his email due to a typo in the CRM platform as his contact, and also different and wrong as his LOG IN for his portal.
I email Isser via outlook, izielingold@gmail.com, an MPB change form, and the Multiplan link.
We talked briefly about the three elements in his plan, and how to proceed with each.
He was very curious, but was confused in the beginning. I resent him to schedule his welcome call via Outlook, since it is wrong in the CRM. I recommended he complete the change form tonight, and schedule his welcome call after they have fixed his email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-06 16:17:44', '2023-07-06 16:17:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121505029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662001', 'Kim Kuhljuergen', NULL, '7-6-2023:  Kim contacted us thru SalesIQ?  Jennifer Thorin fwd''d to me & I connected w/Kim.  His right hip has been bothering him the last few months (but it was after 1/1/2023).  GP doc wants him to have an MRI.  We went over how to present & ''med needs'' are ''issue'' spec.  He will save det inv, pymt rec, & call us to get guidance in sub ''med need''.  Knows he''s resp for 1k IUA & once he has a receipt we''ll guide him in how to get this going.  (no ins, no ID cd, ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, etc.)     - CA

I called Kim back to go over deadline.  He''s not planning to wait (which I felt in our conv), but I didn''t want to make a bad assumption.  He knows the deadline is based off the 1st DOS.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-06 16:03:14', '2023-07-06 16:21:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121505018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '7-6-2023:  Sara called.  She needed a few things:
     - She just rec''d another bill from the hosp & we "told her we''d pd for it already".  I explained it looks like that was thru her healthshare company Zion (see my 6/19/2023 note).  I made sure she has Zion''s ph # & trans her directly to them.
        [Did she not use the pre-pd cc they sent her to pay it herself?  Or maybe she had to go back to Zion because she was stuggling to know how to use the pre-pd cc?]     - CA
     
I called Sara back:  I''d assumed w/out conf this was for the same item we discussed back on 6/19/2023, so I called her back & ILM:  If this is for a screening/prev item, it may be a diff company.  Please call me back if so & I''ll help get you to your ''prev care'' comp instead of your healthsharing company.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-06 15:55:18', '2023-07-06 16:00:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121505013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051098033', 'Scott Wiatric', NULL, '7-6-2023:  Scott called wanting his Sedera memb #.  I made sure he has Sedera''s ph # &amp; trans him directly to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-06 15:35:53', '2023-07-06 15:35:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121502048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116121002', 'Brayden Luna', 'Rcv''d Permission to Discuss MPB Plan with Pam-Mother 7.06.2023', '07.06.2023 Brayden is in the hospital for gaul bladder surgery, his mom called on his behalf. I sent over the permission form to discuss with her and he completed it.
Pam wanted to learn how to proceed for coverage. I explained how to present themselves as cash-pay patient, fulfill the IUA as much as possible and the medical cost sharing portion will then kick in.
Brayden''s appointments are coming in fast, example, he''s seeing his doctor this coming up monday. SO I sent them another email to start the medical need process NOW and explained the process with Zion. I asked them to call us back if they have anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-06 15:29:12', '2023-07-06 15:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121502030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496027', 'Stephen Osteen', NULL, '07.06.2023 Stephen called to learn why the sent by Zion virtual cc to his wife''s email on 5/23, is not going thru after trying to pay twice with it. I consulted with Jen via teams and she confirmed it is a conversation he needs to have with ZIon. I direct transferred him to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-06 14:59:33', '2023-07-06 15:04:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121521028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '7/6/23 - Martha returned my call. She had a mammo done in a remote area in CO. She has always been reimbursed in the past, but Planstin said that because it was out of network they would not reimburse her for it. I am going to be reaching out to Ashlee at Planstin to see if anyone can assist us with this situation. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-06 14:52:34', '2023-07-06 14:52:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121521023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, 'Noticed a missed call from Martha, I called back and left a vm. We were having some issue with the phone not ringing to the concierge team. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-06 14:34:33', '2023-07-06 14:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121505008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881295', 'Lu Corvelli', NULL, 'Lu''s ph #: 571-334-4751

7-6-2023:  Lu called in.  She''s very upset & initially very difficult to help.  Wants to fight, not letting me help her.  By the end of the call, we seemed much better.
     - Planstin: I called & tt Nikita @ Planstin.  She was able/willing to send the pdf Planstin card to the e-mail on file: mljcorvelli@comcast.net & made the exception since Lu hasn''t had time to chg her e-mail on file yet to: lucorvelli@gmail.com.  Nikita can see Lu as active on Planstin, so I''m not sure why there is a Zion issue.
     - Zion: Lu just got off the phone w/Zion & they told her they do not have her on file.  I can see she is active in both the CRM & Admin123 (old side), so I notified Patti 7/13/2023 [we are working on communication, so I had to clarify a new process = hence, the delay.]
     - ''Prev Care'': Lu wanted the ''list'' of what is and is not included.  Sent her an e-mail with the healthcare.gov link & instructions on 7/7/23.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-06 14:13:59', '2023-07-13 17:13:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093811009', 'Sharon DePauw', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy member submitted cancellation eff 8/23 due to the fact that she will be getting employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 13:56:17', '2023-07-06 13:56:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095746002', 'Jamie Gambino', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 8/23 after speaking w/Zac.  Member will have access to Medicare in the next few months.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 13:38:48', '2023-07-06 13:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121502025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881295', 'Lu Corvelli', NULL, '07.06.2023 Lu called to learn more about her plan and how to use coverage for different appointments. I asked what type of appointments is she wanting to go to but she was vague, saying she needs the member ID and log in to see what''s covered. She mentioned mammogram and I took that as an example to coach how to present, who to go see, what to say. She asked for a Planstin card, I offered to call Planstin and have them send her a virtual one, and I did, but they did not pick up at 2:35 CT. She wanted her Zion member ID number, so I gave her the number and I transferred her to Zion. 
Lu is not an easy member to conversate with and coach, as she numerously interrupts you mid-sentence, with abrupt direction and/or more questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-06 13:36:50', '2023-07-06 13:36:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121521013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770009', 'Matthew Woltman', 'Completed Welcome Call', 'Welcome complete on 7/6/23 by JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-06 13:26:20', '2023-07-06 13:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291579', 'Darius Vasquez', NULL, 'Per note below member has spoken to advisor re:cancellation.  I will process eff 8/1/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 13:07:15', '2023-07-06 13:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109072001', 'Justin Mulholland', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 8/1/23 due to the fact that he will be going on spouses employer coverage.  I will process cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 12:49:41', '2023-07-06 12:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104887002', 'Elizabeth Gonzalez', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking w/Cindy.  She will be going on spouse''s  employer coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 12:43:44', '2023-07-06 12:43:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121506002', 'Brian Tollefson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 12:30:42', '2023-07-06 12:30:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121496002', 'Eric Patti', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 12:17:18', '2023-07-06 12:17:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121513003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118034011', 'Megan Knight', NULL, '07.05.23:  Spoke w/Denny Watkins re: incorrect monthly fee charged Megan since May 1.  JK asked Denny to notify him after Denny enrolled Megan to alert JK to change the incorrect pricing of $330.00 (which was on the enrollment platform) to the proper pricing of $321.95 on Megan''s account. Denny notified JK on 4/19/23.  The correct pricing was not changed and on 5/19/23 Denny emailed JK again to remind him to change the pricing and credit Megan.  No response from JK to date.  I discussed this issue w/Karina and she asked me to send her Denny''s email to JK and she will have him correct this pricing.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-07-06 12:14:45', '2023-07-06 12:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121509013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121443010', 'Brandon Allen', 'Additional Child', 'Noelle Allen   12/26/2017   520-79-0707', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 12:13:00', '2023-07-06 12:13:00'),
