  ('zcrm_1579374000121453033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120762002', 'Jody Peterson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-06 09:35:21', '2023-07-06 09:35:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121453028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-06 08:40:26', '2023-07-06 08:40:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121453018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120893013', 'Ashley Sargent', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-06 08:08:24', '2023-07-06 08:08:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121451016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117961010', 'Morgan Venham', 'Completed Script Quote', 'Completed script quote for Sotalol 120 mg x 180 tabs', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-06 07:53:16', '2023-07-06 07:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121453008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081858001', 'Michael Dawson', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-07-06 07:36:49', '2023-07-06 07:36:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121451003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120977018', 'Kimberly Alvarado', 'Completed Welcome Call', 'Welcome call completed on 7/5/23. Kim confirmed that her address was missing the apartment number so I added that to the CRM since it was correct in Admin123. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-06 07:32:44', '2023-07-06 07:32:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121450003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120979009', 'Robin Duarte Stevenson', NULL, 'I received an email from Amy asking when this members Welcome packet would be arriving as she wanted to cancel.  I replied that if she was going to cancel we wouldn''t need to send her out a packet.  Told Amy to submit the cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-06 07:29:08', '2023-07-06 07:29:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121448003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120762002', 'Jody Peterson', NULL, '7/6/23 - Jody called to confirm her 11:30 AM EST welcome call appointment with Vanessa today. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-06 07:20:36', '2023-07-06 07:20:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121436057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '07.05.2023 Julie called to confirm that her group ID and member ID numbers did not change in her plan for the Planstin wellness coverage.
I contacted Planstin and they sent her their new virtual card via email, Julie confirmed it did not change. She asked if she can start making her appointments even though the plan starts in august, I said yes. She asked about mamm. I confirmed they are covered.
I searched for a provider/facility near her, Valley View to confirm it is in the network, and it is. I downloaded the list and sent it to her via outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-05 16:58:54', '2023-07-05 16:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121442003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199026', 'Jayna Hart', NULL, '7-5-23 Jayna is getting married in a week or two. She will lose Medicaid bc their household income will become about $180K.  There are kids sounds like from both sides. She has celiac disease with multiple lab checks every year,  She has lupus with multiple lab checks and dr. visits per year. She also had a hip replacement this past year. She needs x-rays and MRI''s sometimes too. Not a good candidate for MCS. She has a Dr. Jill Gibson as a Rheumatologist. She doesn''t take any meds. She most prefers Dr. Matthew Karowe who is her gastro. She most prefers to keep him and can find a new rheumatologist since Dr. Gibson''s not in the Cigna Connect network.  Looking at  Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 Ded for about $426 or so and $9100 mop. This gives her benefits right away.  She didn''t know everyone''s SS#''s. She''ll work on completing the app tonight. I warned her about making the ongoing payment directly with the ins carrier. She was super appreciative and believes she can do the rest tonight. She''ll let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-07-05 16:18:11', '2023-07-05 16:18:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121438043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951174', 'Doreen Burbidge', NULL, '7-5-2023:  Doreen''s husband called to discuss her aging into Medicare.  He see''s Patti''s e-mail that includes the cancellation acknowledgement form.  They''ll get that in before the 19th of this month.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-05 16:15:11', '2023-07-05 16:15:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121436052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106694002', 'Renee Hornor', NULL, '07.05.2023 Renee called to learn how to remove the additional smoking fee for William from their plan. William has been smoke free for 6 months, since January. Congratulations William!!
I consulted the team via teams, and Jen shared that it is more complicated than just a form or transferring to someone. 
He will need to:
-consult with a pcp and share his smoke free journey
-in 12 months he will take a blood test to confirm the completion
-he then will send the results to Planstin and Zion
Renee then asked how would mammograms be covered, and I told her Care+ plan unfortunately does not have any preventative and it would be cash-pay, UNLESS it turns diagnostic, then it can be shared. 
Renee also asked how to locate the receipt payments from MPB, but we could not find them in the emails, so I guided her to located them in her portal from the member portal and updates page. I asked her to bookmark that page for future reference. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-07-05 15:04:01', '2023-07-05 15:04:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121422059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', NULL, '7/5/23 - Philip called regarding his daughter''s 7 year check-up and why it was not paid. Come to find out, he never presented his Planstin card at the time of service and paid cash for the appointment. I advised Philip to never pay for the preventative care services and instead present his Planstin card and let the office know he is part of a plan that uses Multiplan for the prev care. He understood but requested to be transferred to Planstin to see if he can be reimbursed. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-05 15:00:25', '2023-07-05 15:00:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121438038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119626010', 'Alicia Koscinski', NULL, '7-5-2023:  Alicia called.  She had questions on her prev care.  She says her advisor didn''t go over this w/her at all.  Also, in her mind, because she''d done her Zion welcome call,  she didn''t do ours.  She didn''t understand why they''d sent her to us for ''prev care''.  I''m not sure why either.  This is a DIRECT plan membship, so couldn''t they go over those details w/her too?  Either way, it got her to us & I encouraged her to always feel free calling us for assistance first & foremost.
     - Sent her our ''Welcome Call'' invite & she sched w/Jennifer Thorn next Monday.
     - We went over details on the sm amt of ''prev care'' this option provides.  She is NOT self-emp, so I let her know there isn''t another choice w/''prev''.  IF she becomes self-emp, that would open up other plan options.  6mos waiting period: colonoscopy, mamm, youth immun = we disc age restrictions on these too,  $175 = curr office visit fee (talked about off visit only w/pap) = 1/memb/12mos.  
        Her son has asthma spec appt next Tues so she knows that office visit would qual & may call for inst on how to request reimb afterwards.  She''s may ck to see if this off visit or his PCP is more & will go from there.
     - Her son''s asthma is pre-x.  We disc 1 yr waiting period & how the 2nd yr & on look w/initial 1k IUA for qual ''med need''.
     - RXs:  went over what we do, best to give us ~7 days before she needs when possible on maint meds, but we can push to do it faster (call in that case).
     - She seemed frustrated.  Saying this was not gone over with her, or in depth, by her advisor.  Since she''s tt Jennifer Thorin soon, I mentioned that would be a good thing to bring up so we can remind the advisors how important going over these details w/pot memb is for the membs.
     - DPC:  she''d never heard of a DPC doc.  We disc what they are, how they work, & how this option dovetails with that type of prac.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-05 14:48:59', '2023-07-05 17:23:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121426081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121440002', 'Nellie Nutting', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-07-05 14:45:09', '2023-07-05 14:45:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121438033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, '7-5-2023:  Travis noticed he had a missed call from this # & called us back.  He has no recollection of what he was trying to submit.  We did a bit of education since he was angry that we denied something he submitted to us back in 2022 & that wasn''t fair.  I encouraged him to always feel free to call the conc line prior to doing anything -- or shortly afterwards, because ea component has its own guidelines, rules, & those can chg, so we can help make sure he''s properly utilizing his diff comp.  
     Disc there is a deadline (just like w/trad ins) and my recommendation is to sub the med need within 4mos of the first DOS, even if not at his 1k IUA yet.  We discussed diff companies = diff components of the plan.  I offered to get him to Zion, if he thought it was his healthsharing that had denied the med need, as they can see those records.  But, he isn''t really feeling well, so this wasn''t the best time.
     When we got off the phone, he seemed to be in a much better place.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-07-05 14:32:22', '2023-07-05 17:32:23'),
