  ('zcrm_1579374000121422049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119626010', 'Alicia Koscinski', NULL, '7/5/23 - Alicia emailed in regarding her member portal information. I tried to call Alicia on the number provided in the CRM but it consistently went to a busy signal so I sent an email reply back to Alicia with her MPB portal info and how to contact Zion health for her member portal info. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-07-05 14:13:52', '2023-07-05 14:13:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121438023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078122113', 'Travis Olsen', NULL, '7-5-2023:  Travis LM while we were closed for the long holiday weekend. (although, it looks like somewhere the message was rec''d late Thursday night?)  The message says he had testing done & he ''s submitting the form to get reimbursed.  However, I do not know what form he''s discussing, don''t see any attachment to the e-mail (notification?  Not sure where this message came from.)  
