  ('zcrm_1579374000121436038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088688002', 'Perry Thomas', NULL, '07.05.2023 Lynn called to better understand how to maneuver a doctor saying "We don''t accept Planstin". I consulted with Cari via teams, b/c she had spoken with Lynn last week.
Cari confidently coached me with having the member not use the word Planstin, since that''s not an insurance company - it''s a Third Party Administrator. She also added to tell them that this is an ACA MEC (Affordable Care Act Minimum Essential Coverage) plan.  If the doctor will just call the # on the Planstin card, they may have better luck.
