  ('zcrm_1579374000121438008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, '7-5-2023:  Juan called.  His wife''s back is bothering her again.  It sounds like this is a pre-x condition as she had x-rays (or some other diagnostic tests) in Feb 2022.  We went over the phase-in period.  Chiropractic requires being a part of a larger need & pre-approval. & this year is the waiting period = no help until after Jan 1, 2024.  I let him know he can submit everything, but it''s issue specific & they do a 24-mo look back period prior to your eff date.
