  ('zcrm_1579374000121438003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079897013', 'Shawn Weiman', NULL, '7-5-2023:  Shawn called.  June 11:  CJ went to the ER w/back pain.  It sounds like the presented perfectly, pd their 1k IUA, and now just want to submit the balance of receipts as they are incoming.  Shawn & I went over what to expect since Zion just chg''d their submission process.  He knows there have been issues, but they should provide an e-mail address to submit to if they are still experienceing issues.  We also went over 6mos deadline for future reference, on-going = single IUA even if over yrs & that 12mos or > = reset of IUA.
