  ('zcrm_1579374000121436008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119765002', 'Janice Saar', 'Rcvd Permission to Discuss MPB Plan w/ John Saar 07.05.2023', '07.05.2023 John called while Janice was waiting online with CirrusMD for around an hour to complete the conversation and get anti-depressant refills.
