  ('zcrm_1579374000121298008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111530002', 'David Yurko', NULL, '06.30.2023 David put in a request YESTERDAY: Ketamine HCI troche, 100mg sublingual, once a week as needed for 90 days, AND Ketamine HCI Solution, 100ml, 50mg as directed 5 days.
