  ('zcrm_1579374000121281003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Member elected to change from Secure to Care + eff 10/1/22.  At that time his plan was changed in error to MS.  I spoke to Planstin and they told me to cancel erroneous plan and input correct plan eff 1/1/22.  No difference in price.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-30 09:28:02', '2023-06-30 09:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121276003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, '6/30/23 - Brian called in very frustrated that he could not get a Proof of Benefits letter from Zion for his sons school. Zion told him that due to them only being a part of the plan, it was MPB''s responsibility to provide this letter. I reached out to Zion personally and spoke with Alyssa from their member services team and she confirmed that her manager told her that information. After pleading my case, Zion and Alyssa agreed to send Brian the letter. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-30 09:21:20', '2023-06-30 09:21:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121245021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032070', 'Danielle Hatch', NULL, 'Danielle called requesting a list of in-network providers for her husband''s colonoscopy. I sent a list via email for the zip requested of 15317. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-30 07:32:27', '2023-06-30 07:32:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121221111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112304001', 'Lynn Ware', NULL, '6.29.2023 ultrasound - need? is it all diagnostic then? HCBB &gt; searching for ultrasound facilities. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-29 16:52:08', '2023-06-29 17:30:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121221103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855001', 'Tim Whitney', NULL, '06.29.2023 Dona called to get clarification on how the prescription program works. I guided her towards the prescription form on member portal and updates page, had her bookmark that page. Then I explained that the OptumRX is limited, part of the preventative with Planstin but limited to only some birth controls and the statins.
Dona also wanted to learn how to better make use of the CirrusMD, it looked like she was already registered and only had to change her passcode. I did reiterate that each adult has to use their own unique email, and children too if they are of age. If not, they should be added onto their accounts. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-29 16:51:06', '2023-06-29 16:51:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121245016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122117002', 'Leisa Heuple', NULL, 'F/U Email sent.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-06-29 16:29:20', '2023-06-29 16:29:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121211059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '6/29/2023:  April called on top of another call while I was at lunch &amp; Nahla was alone.  I called &amp; LM for April as soon as I came back (about 10-15 minutes after her incoming, missed call).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-29 16:08:50', '2023-06-30 20:17:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121221074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107486002', 'Julia Mickelson', NULL, '6-29-23 See Notes on Trevor Mickelson account for entire backstory of their membership progression. Their membership was requested to be backdated to their original start date of Oct. 1st 2020. Julia just referred Andrea Hutto to me and I spoke with Andrea today. Might not go for it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-29 15:25:40', '2023-06-29 15:27:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121221053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122049024', 'Brent Kruel', NULL, '6-29-23 Brent 53 came to the Walnut Gallery event from Brad Vilim''s invitation through me. Brent is on a VA plan and loves it. But, he''s looking at this for his wife Robin who is 49 and they have a kid or two. They used to use Medishare 2x. They have a group plan right now for just Robin and they are paying $980 for her only with a UHC Silver plan and a $9100 ded or something crazy high like that. They are wanting to sign up as a group. They have a mix of FT and PT staff. They want to figure out how much to offer each category of employees. They have Robin and one other employee that are likely to want to join initially and they will figure out if there are others to include in the group to create the List Bill and add employees as we go. Most of their employees are nurses. Their full time employees are mostly in CO and TX but their part time are spread around the country in 15 states right now. 
With his company they are looking to test the waters with us to see how well it works. If it''s a success, then he wants to introduce us to other employer groups on the Front Range to partner with his program and MPB''s offerings. They start with various testing such as food sensitivity testing, biomarker lab testing and put it through an extensive AI to provide feedback for best path towards healthy future. Some folks might need supplements, hormones or bioidentical hormones. They will help with this. They have vetted and tested various labs and found the best resources in the world. They have 3-D mobility health assessment. They offer much of what they do nationwide virtually, but they are focused on in-person solutions in the Dallas, TX area and the Front Range in CO. They will ultimately be working with Air Force Academy business owners around CO. This could be a phenomenal partnership. He also kept talking about Alchemy Health which I should research.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-29 15:14:15', '2023-06-29 15:14:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121221043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094942002', 'Tim Ottmann', NULL, '06.29.2023 Angela and Tim called due to an unexpected ER visit for Angela on 14 & 15 of June. Angela described what she had to be an inflammation in the colon area (food lodged in what formed and looked like a pocket). Anti-inflammatories were used, but no surgery. Angela''s hospital bill is definitely going to be over $5000, according to Angela. They wanted to better understand how to move forward in having his covered. I went through the process of fulfilling the IUA, saving the receipts/invoices or bills. I emailed them instructions on how to submit bills to Zion, and coached them to begin the process but know that they will need to speak to Zion to complete the set up due to their new platform. I also urged them to call the hospital back and rePRESENT themselves as cash pay patient VS using the Planstin card for the PHCS network. 
Angle and Tim asked to have Analisa send them out new BBA cards, although I did not know what that was, Analisa knew when I called her. She confirmed that she will send them new BBA cards. 
Angela asked about what would colonoscopy fall under, and I confirmed it is definitely preventative with the use of Planstin, and to remember P for preventative and P for Planstin.
Tim asked if presenting as cash-pay patients would be in all situations, and I explained presenting as a cash pay patient is only on non-preventative items (catastrophic and/or large medical bills....etc). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-29 14:56:56', '2023-06-29 15:16:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121245008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122117002', 'Leisa Heuple', 'Detail of Discovery Call w/Leisa', '6-29-2023

Husband Jeff is no longer employe so they have NO coverage right now.
She will be 53 on 7/4 and he is 55.

They have looked at "Ambetter" by Healthnet and "Universal Healthshare Fellowship". She didn''t go into detail but was not happy with the followup doc from them and all the little extra charges.

She is in great health, takes no meds. Had hysterectomy last year (fibroids); all is clear.
He takes statin med for high cholesterol.

She wants an HSA and since she is self-employed as a real estate agent, told her she can do that.

No tobacco usage by either. 

They both do all their wellness checks.

They will need the membership ASAP: Told her 8/1 is the earliest as long as they enroll with me by the 20th of July.

Sending her a followup email with a link to my agent page and have instructed her to watch the video and then set up a time with me on Calendly to get back together for enrollment.', 'Kirk Bennett', 'Kirk Bennett', '2023-06-29 14:55:39', '2023-06-30 17:04:16'),
