  ('zcrm_1579374000121211036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032492', 'Jani Osborne', NULL, '6-29-2023:  Jani called - extremely confused.
     - Sent a copy of her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail.
     - Address Chg:  Walked her to the form & it sounded like she was completing as we talked.  She moved from CA to NV, but still works in CA, so may look for certain services, pharmacies, there at times.
     - Zion:  Went over how to present, what the healthshare comp is for, deadline for sub ''med need'', etc.
     - Pymt:  We confirmed the bank account she has on file is still accurate.  Will her billing address need to be updated?  She''s going to watch to make sure her pymts don''t bounce back in the next mo or two.  If they do, she''ll call & we can get help updating that pymt too.
     - CirrusMD: She''s had kind of an odd pain in her chest twice a day recently.  Together we decided their instruction will be helpful.  Did discuss lmt scope, not free w/antibiotics, but she seems good with all of that.  We got her to her CirrusMD, but it won''t let her chg her zip.  She''s going to start a call & will be clear that she works in CA & lives in NV in case that matter w/the doc she tt.  She''ll let them know she just submitted the address update.  
     - RXs: Reminded her that we can look for the best price near her.  She sometimes still picks up RXs in CA when she''s at work, but generally this will now be NV.
     - MAP: Jani asked about counseling.  We got her to the Mazz & Sull site.  I walked her thru the site, how counseling works (she prev lived & still works in CA, but now lives in NV, so we talked about the 12 visits in NV vs CA.  She will let Mazz & Sull know we are updating her address to NV when she tt them re finding a counselor.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-29 11:33:35', '2023-06-30 12:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121224061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105287002', 'Isaac Griffin', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation due tot he fact that they are now going with Samartian.  All about less monthly fee and lower IUA.  Karen ok''d.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-29 11:27:12', '2023-06-29 11:27:12'),
