  ('zcrm_1579374000121221029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671011', 'Lynda Koch', NULL, '06.29.2023 Lynda left an online message requesting the following:
"I sent in a request for a specialist eye appointment. Do I just wait till they contact me or do you email me?
Lynda

Lynda Koch
----------"
Jen forwarded the request to via outlook to reach out, since Lynda and I have spoken in the past. I reached out to Lynda with the number we have on file, and her VM greeting requested that we contact her on: 5072598823, and I did that as well. I ended up leaving a VM on the second number including my name, number and MPB her health sharing company. 
***********************************************************************************
Lynda called us back, and I got to answer her. She is confused with the medical need process still, and is unsure if it was received or even open. I explained the usual process (note getting into the new platform dilemmas we are experiencing lately, since she is already confused), then I recommended that she speak to Zion directly regarding the status of her need and how to attain the next step and its coverage. She said she will call us back after speaking to Zion.
**********************************************************************************
Lynda left a VM on GoTo stating that they are waiting on documents/reports from her medical doctor, so she was going to call the doctor''s office to expedite the process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-29 11:00:24', '2023-06-29 12:08:50'),
