  ('zcrm_1579374000121221003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537076', 'Maria (Chris) Comfort', NULL, '6-29-23 Maria (Chris) is in her 3rd year of membership, so she has sharing up to $50K for anything deemed pre-x. She had an aorta thing pop up 8+ years ago. When she went in for her recommended scan every 3 years they found something on her lung that she believes is totally separate. However, when she created her new Need she saw a cap of $25K and panicked. I let her know they automatically cap it until they review her records to make sure it wasn''t pre-x. She certain this is brand new and the scan were for her heart not her lungs but this popped up on her lungs. She''s nervous to say the least and excited to move to Medicare in 1 1/2 years. But, she will proceed. She''s been on both sides of this coin with previous work she''s done. So, he understands how the process works. She''ll proceed through the process. She''s  scheduling her drs. appts next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-29 09:11:08', '2023-06-29 09:11:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121211018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120423002', 'Shannon Kenyon', NULL, '6/29/23 - Shannon called to schedule her Welcome Call, I sent her a scheduling link via email. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-29 08:54:55', '2023-06-29 08:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121211008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114236001', 'Carlos Salazar', NULL, 'Carlos responded back to my email blast I had sent out to all of our active members regarding the home office being closed both this coming Monday 6/3/23 & Tuesday 6/4/23 for the observance of the 4th of July. He thanked me and mentioned he still needs to complete his Welcone Call and asked how he can schedule it. I let Carlos know I will send him the link to the Welcome Call calendar scheduler directly to him. That way he can pick whichever day & time works best for him to get his Welcome Call complete. I sent the link and Carlos is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-06-29 08:29:09', '2023-06-29 08:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121194013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111530002', 'David Yurko', NULL, '6/29/23 - David called in to find out how prescriptions work. We went over the process and he will be submitting a script quote form today. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-29 08:02:08', '2023-06-29 08:02:08'),
