  ('zcrm_1579374000121167099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107797002', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, '06.28.2023 Sarah called wanting to connect with CirrusMD. She downloaded the app, but was not sure that she registered. I attempted to register her over on my end, but it notified me that she is already registered. I coached her to go ahead and enter her email and change her passcode, and she will probably answer a couple of questions then within a minute or so, she''d be chatting with a doctor on there. Sarah was willing to continue on her own from there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-28 15:16:50', '2023-06-28 15:16:50'),
