  ('zcrm_1579374000121167068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007057004', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, '06.28.2023 Joseph called after corresponding with Cari earlier. Cari left him a message saying  he is not with Liberty, he is with Zion/Care+. Joseph did not seem to understand that message b/c he did not share that part with me. Cari did via teams, and after I had already transferred him to Liberty.
