  ('zcrm_1579374000121127031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956089', 'C. Michaele Hogan', NULL, '6-27-2023:  Michaele called.  She''s struggling to get the ''med need'' submitted.  She has the Zion invite to create a memb portal & is struggling.  Zion sent her an e-mail to submit her receipts, invoices, etc.  She realized she hasn''t scanned the paperwork yet, so she''ll do that & then send in the info (once she finds the e-mail).

