  ('zcrm_1579374000121127021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014900054', 'Terry Talley', NULL, '6-27-2023:  Terry called.  His knee popped last week and it''s really hurting.  He tried his PCP & he can''t see him until Oct, so he wanted to look for an orthopedic surgeon in his area.  We tried to go to HCBB, but he''s during that timeline where they do not have access.  Truly a shame as I think he would do well w/access.
