  ('zcrm_1579374000121128003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '6-27-23 Kim called to check on her account. She also inquired bc Casey just got laid off about 2 weeks ago and needs ins. He doesn''t want it but she knows he needs it since he rides a motorcycle and such. She''ll pay for it. Cobra is $800-$900 for a 30 year old! His DOB is 9/30/92 and zip 80301 in Broomfield. He''s getting unemployment of about $2400 with $272 APTC on the safe side of the estimate, might be less. He doesn''t have any doctors and she doesn''t think he takes any meds.
