  ('zcrm_1579374000121127011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297375', 'Kathleen Gramzay', NULL, '6-27-2023:  Kathleen called trying to get into MAP "managing stress" &amp; it was requiring an ind acct, but it kept telling her the user name was already taken.  We got her in by changing the user name to something less common &amp; working on the pw to make it acceptable.  We talked a lot about what is available on the Mazz &amp; Sull &amp; she seemed happy she was in when we got off the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-27 10:55:42', '2023-06-27 20:12:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121127003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '6-27-2023:  Rebecca called.  She has a ton of bills and doesn''t know why they didn''t billed her ''ins''.  We started w/education.  Healthshare is not ''ins'' & there is no one for them to bill.  Went over how to present: no ins, no ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, resp for 1k IUA, issue spec, etc.  She''s already disclosed to me: these bills go back to May 2022!  Did let her know could be issue because Zion has 6-mos deadline.
     - May 2022 went in thinking she had strep.  Never tested positive for strep or covid, but they put her on an antibiotic.  She didn''t totally get better, so in Oct 2022 she started getting sick again.  She went in & w/tests doc says, now the issue has moved into sepsis because they gave her the wrong antibiotic.  Even has caused hearing loss.  
        She''s on summer vacay, so she''ll call all entities included & get pymt receipts, detailed inv, etc.  Says it took forever for them to start billing her & then they did not disclose what was done, so she didn''t know what she was being billed for.  She let it go long enough that it sounds like they did turn her into collections & I cannot tell where that stands.  Once she has something to turn in, she will call us so we can help her call Zion to set up new Memb Port.  
        I sugg creating a cover letter w/timeline, issues, billing slowness, etc, to sub when she sends everything thru.  Did say, prob won''t go back that far, but worth a try.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-27 10:48:34', '2023-06-27 20:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121126014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114147002', 'James Doyle', NULL, '06.27.2023 James called to learn how to use the telehealth. He was driving so he could not attend to any screens. I went ahead and entered his information in the CirrusMD site for registration, and asked him to look out for that invite to accept it, since it only lasts 24 hours. I coached him to go ahead and complete his registration, download the app on his phone or simply work from the laptop, and he''ll be able to speak to a licensed physician in less than 2 minutes. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-27 10:43:05', '2023-06-27 15:25:55'),
