  ('zcrm_1579374000121047104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '06.26.2023 Thelma Dillon called asking about the issue that came about last week regarding splitting the cost vs. not splitting the cost of MPB charges.
I consulted Cari via teams should she have come across an answer to it. She shared and I relayed to Thelma that email was for the members whose Zion portion was delayed.  They didn''t want a billing issue like last month where people were over charged, so instead of one draw, there are about 300 people who had to be hand billed.  The Planstin portion went out on the 20th & the Zion is a separate draw this month, which she should see in the next day or two.
I told Thelma that they might reverse it and redo it again in order to fix it, she said that she works for the bank and knows how they can process it with little worry to the member, and concurred the same thought. I understand from Cari via teams that that is not how MPB is approaching the matter. I''ll be sure to communicate this tomorrow with Thelma. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-26 16:18:55', '2023-06-26 16:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121082027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109491027', 'Allison McFee', NULL, '6-26-23 Allison called for help in updating her payment information. She chose to use her Savings Account this time to avoid further problems. She also asked about getting sharing for chiropractic care for neck pain from her work environment. This came on about 1 1/2 months ago. She''s just been paying cash so far and was super excited to learn about getting it pre-approved with diagnosis and treatment from her chiro with the help of the Concierge Team. I also suggested she asks them to help her with using WHLC for discounts as well if there''s a chiro near her in HI.  She was super appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-26 15:42:54', '2023-06-26 15:42:54'),
