  ('zcrm_1579374000121082022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '6-26-23 Tina and I went over her membership again answering her questions. She was frustrated bc the doctors she called to try to get in to see for her wellness visit never called her back. We can''t control that but I told her the network limitations are being removed now. For the new card, I suggested she calls our MPB Concierge Team to access the newest cards. She will do so. Then she was frustrated by the HMA rejecting her blood work as an expense. I told her that should work with her membership but the cc systems don''t always recognize everything as a medical expense. I suggested she call the HMA team to work on getting a reimbursement. I also explained that her account balance will continue to grow more and more over time but then when she uses it, it will be reduced by that amount. She can review it in her account. I shared with her that we have a new Co-Pay plan rolling out very soon in case that suits her needs better. She''s excited to see that and the difference in cost. It might not be worth the additional money in the long run. They will decide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-26 15:11:53', '2023-06-26 15:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121046098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121091002', 'Lisa Hill', NULL, 'Spoke to Lisa, nice lady, 60 years old retired, has a business and qualifies for Secure. Went over details and pricing, answered all questions, took her to the enrollment and got her signed up. August 1, start date', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-26 15:07:48', '2023-06-26 15:07:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121082017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121090002', 'Jeri Smith', NULL, '6-26-23 Jeri enrolled in SECURE $325/$1000 with Julie Perington as the person who referred her. She enrolled immediately to lock in the current price of $325 for SECURE before the rates are increased for her age group. I sent a note to Patti just now to confirm this is honored per our training call this morning as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-26 14:58:58', '2023-06-26 14:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121047091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066091021', 'Yadira Butkovich', NULL, '06.26.2023  Yadira called with Bill translating for her, right next to her.
