  ('zcrm_1579374000121074023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '6-26-2023:  Karen called back.
     - She accidentally got cut-off from her Nahla call (on her end).  She did LM for the billing company and will try to pay them with the pre-pd cc.  If it''s expired, she knows to go back to Redirect to see if they can get her a card w/a new exp date.  She said it''s been super hard to connect w/anyone at Redirect though, so she''s concerned about getting in touch w/them for a new card.
     - Labs:  > 6mos since she had the prev labs & they are still not paid.  She''s worried about getting sent to collections.  Says she''s tried Redirect''s extra help, leaving messages, etc.  We decided her advisor Wendy has had the best luck on Rediert recently, so she will connect w/her on this item.
     - Redirect:  Routine Endoscopy & Colonoscopy, doc has ordered & she has sent thru the request to Redirect in the text service.  She''ll see how that goes & let us know if she needs help.  She knows Redirect is supposed to set up these ''prev care'' appts.
