  ('zcrm_1579374000121082003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121090002', 'Jeri Smith', NULL, '6-26-23 Jeri is 57 and lives in Illinois. She''s divorced and had been covering the 2 kids but her x is now taking over the kids with his job. So, she''s just looking at SECURE for herself only. She''s healthy, no tobacco. She takes meds for her thyroid and bioidentical hormones. She understands she''s responsible to pay those ongoing since they are maintenance meds. She also understands her dr. visits will be her responsibility year one and likely onward for the thyroid since she likely won''t exceed $1000 for those check ups. She''s fine with it. She''s paying $600+ now for her traditional company plan. She owns her company and has been downsizing and not many employees anymore. She works out, eats well and is super healthy.  One of her kids is entering college and they are going to orientation now in MI. She''s psyched to get enrolled today to get the lower $325/$1000 IUA price before it''s changed. She''s aware of the $125/$25 fees as well. We will reconnect later today to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-26 12:34:27', '2023-06-26 12:50:40'),
