  ('zcrm_1579374000121047069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '06.26.2023 Karen called to better understand why the Mamm she just had at the facility she''s gone for, for many years, on 1/12/2023 was denied without haven sent her a bill.
