  ('zcrm_1579374000121047061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100495002', 'Paul Eckenrode', NULL, '06.26.2023 Paul called to change his banking information. I guided him to the member portals and updates page to all the change forms. Paul submitted his form and I saw that we received. 
