He was interested in learning whether the regional medical facility near would be acceptable to use, and I said certainly, as long as everything is done in a timely manner. He wanted to know how to search for doctors and facilities if needed, and I guided to and through the healthcare bluebook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-26 11:49:09', '2023-06-26 12:02:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121074008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364020', 'Toni Woods', NULL, '6-26-2023:  Toni called.  She''s very nice & very challenging.  She wanted to find out how to get reimb on her prev.  Says we told her to save her receipts and call us to submit them. [I''m not seeing that anywhere for ''prev care''.  Maybe she''s confusing ''prev care'' & ''catastrophic'' presentation.*]
     - RCI: She wanted to submit her receipts for reimb on her annual visit, her colonoscopy, & she''s about to have her mamm.  I let her know that w/her ''prev care'' the prov needs to bill for her.  She has her RCI card that shows where to bill and will try to call to have the prov bill.  She has labs w/her annual visit, her colonoscopy where they did pull polyps (yet full price is < her $1500 IUA w/Sedera), and soon her mammogram.  We discussed the MEC limitations, that w/RCI there is a req''d PHCS ntwk, on the colonoscopy the ''prev care'' vs diagnostic once they pulled polyps, staying in ntwk on everything (ie: mamm = images & reading providers).  She''s going to go back to the providers & let them know she forgot to give them her ''prev care'' ID Card so they can bill.
     - We discussed how to present in any other situation.  No ins, no card, ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, $1500 IUA = your resp for issue, & deadlines.

     *After getting off of the phone, I was able to go back & look at all the notes.  She did talk w/MPB Southern District Agents on 5/31/2022.  It was an issue w/them misguiding our members.  Maybe that''s where the confusion came from?  They had a very difficult time realizing there were diff plans, diff TPA, etc., & it was not uncommon for them to guide people not realizing the guidance was for another company.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-26 11:46:42', '2023-06-26 18:10:18'),
