Sod sulf-potass sulf-mag sulf (Generic) 17.5/3.13 g/g: at Walgreens = $27.55               NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-26 11:11:50', '2023-06-26 11:11:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121074003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114129002', 'Stephanie McCarter', NULL, '6-26-2023:  Stephanie called to update her pymt info.  She''s not at a computer, so I sent her the pymt update form link.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-26 10:54:53', '2023-06-26 10:54:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121050021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079033002', 'Lakshmi Murthy', NULL, 'Member emailed me asking for an explanation why he was billed twice.  I looked at the account and he was never refunded for the extra $50 he was charged.  I refunded.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-26 10:38:55', '2023-06-26 10:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121047032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '06.19.2023 Jatin called to confirm we received his cancellation form he submitted on the 22nd, since he did not see a confirmation or receipt of some kind.
I checked the Cognito forms database, and I could see his submission done on the 22nd around 2:42PM.
He was good with the fact that we could see his request, and can wait. He asked if he could get reimbursed for July, and I said he would need to speak to the billing department. I can bring it to their attention via message b/c right now they are in a meeting, and if he can to go ahead and contact us back in the afternoon regarding the reimbursement. 
*****************************************************************************************
4:44 EST - Jatin called back to speak to billing in hopes of receiving a refund. Patti was open to the conversation, I direct transferred him.      NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-26 10:34:29', '2023-06-26 14:44:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105468009', 'Stacy Musial', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 10:26:28', '2023-06-26 10:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121050008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109285002', 'Michael Danze', '7/23 Decline', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via EM &amp; VM - 6/26  Members phone disconnected me so I sent him a text.  Spoke to member and he directed me to rerun pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-26 10:19:37', '2023-06-26 14:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121047018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, '06.26.2023 Nicole called to follow up on being able to register and use the telehealth service with CirrusMD, TODAY.
Nicole had chatted with Jennifer earlier today for this, and Jennifer communicated via Outlook email to CirrusMD regarding adding Jennifer to the system, so she register and get set up. I consulted with Jen via teams, and Jen shared her communication with CirrusMD. 
It appears that CirrusMD needs a little more time to address/complete Nicole''s set up, and I urged Nicole to do just that, give them a little more time, no more than 24 hours.
Nicole asked if this is taking so long, due to it needing time to set up prior to being able to use. I confirmed with her that it is so, especially if there''s more than one adult, and even more if there are off-springs on the plan. She asked if I could help get her entire family set up, and I concurred that that would be wise, and if she can respond to the email I sent her with all the adults emails and everyone''s age and name. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-26 10:12:33', '2023-06-26 10:23:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119412010', 'Carie Mueller', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 10:10:04', '2023-06-26 10:10:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121047013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '06.26.2023 Jennifer called to learn how receive coverage for her daughter''s pregnancy. I emailed her the instructions to submitting billing to Zion. I explained the process and her options. She was glad to hear how easy it is, but due to her past experience with the preventative portion and how PHCS''s angles did not cover the physician she chose (despite choosing from the PHCS network according to Jennifer), she did not want to get stuck with an extremely large bill, if she did not follow the right protocol. I assured her, of all the medical needs submitted that the pregnancy one is the easiest and is not usually denied. 
I did share that momentarily members are having to converse with Zion directly to open their medical needs, so when her and I are done chatting I can transfer her to them and she can begin the process.
She asked a few questions about the plan, such as how to get coverage for attending a chiropractor, and I offered her two elements in her plan that would offer her savings or coverage for chiropractic sessions. One is through the whole health living site for coupons in her areas, two is through a medical need request, specifically for chiro sessions as an alternative treatment.
The chiro sessions are for the same daughter who is pregnant, so I recommended that when she gets in touch with them to talk about the pregnancy, to also discuss chiro options. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-26 09:51:50', '2023-06-26 10:44:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120543002', 'Alex Friedman', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 09:40:15', '2023-06-26 09:40:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120635002', 'Timothy Bush', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 09:35:28', '2023-06-26 09:35:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120678002', 'Michael Hand', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 09:32:08', '2023-06-26 09:32:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120690002', 'Feyisara Adaramola', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 09:24:17', '2023-06-26 09:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 09:19:53', '2023-06-26 09:19:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121060008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120746001', 'Jennifer Zrubek', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-26 09:16:14', '2023-06-26 09:16:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121050003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059299094', 'Randall Hettinga', NULL, 'Refunded member overcharged amt of $290 (difference between MF &amp; MC).', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-26 08:59:17', '2023-06-26 08:59:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121009053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121048010', 'Margaret Heaton', NULL, 'Margaret called in this evening from a web search. I went over all the details of the Secure Plan, and pricing for her, her husband, and 6 year old daughter. If she decides to move forward with the enrollment, she''d like a July 1 start date. I told her I would have to get authorization. I contacted John Kach, he approved it.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-23 18:21:03', '2023-06-23 18:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121021026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '06.23.2023 Randall called to understand why he cannot move forward with completing another medical need with Zion. I explained the new medical need application platform, and how it is rendering our services to guided/transfer the members to have a conversation with Zion to complete their "portal set-up" in order to begin a medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-23 15:56:46', '2023-06-23 15:56:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120954193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115821001', 'Nichole Baker', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code card. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-23 10:37:12', '2023-06-23 10:37:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121021008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109018020', 'Elisabeth Mullen', NULL, '06.23.2023 Elizabeth had an injury January. Started physical therapy in February. Met her 1000, but did not know she needed to submit a medical need request to get the rest covered/shared.
I urged her to have all of the elements towards opening a medical need done today, as she is getting really close to the deadline of bill submission. I emailed her the instructions to submitting bills to Zion and direct transferred her to them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-23 10:34:18', '2023-06-23 10:43:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120954185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117544002', 'Justin Hilgers', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-23 10:03:56', '2023-06-23 10:03:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120954175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735010', 'John Wech', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-23 09:57:07', '2023-06-23 09:57:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120954156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109781008', 'Lauren Guida', NULL, '6-23-2023:  Laruen called in frustrated.  She''s tt CirrusMD a few times & they have not been willing to prescribe an antibiotic until she gets further into this illness.  She''s sure it''s an upper resp infection and is super upset because she''s losing money because she can''t work & has no voice.  
     She wanted me to call around and find her the cheapest place for a doc''s visit.  When I asked if she had a PCP, she said no.  So, I let her know we don''t really call around to find best price for people & she got very upset, started sobbing, and told me "Jennifer always does this for me."  I tried offering, "would you like me to get Jennifer for you?", she got super angry and hung-up on me.  
     I tt Jennifer afterwards and she says she''s never done that for Lauren & that is not a service we supply.  So, we decided, Lauren will call back when she calms down possibly.  Jennifer''s also had a hard time w/Lauren understanding in the past, that she too needs to have a part in her healthcare.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-23 09:40:37', '2023-06-23 11:54:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121027003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000121022012', 'Tanya Crossman', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-23 08:40:28', '2023-06-23 08:40:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120954146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114987002', 'Melissa Dixon', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-23 08:04:32', '2023-06-23 08:04:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120954126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116114008', 'Robert Hunter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Robert and Lisa. Put in request to Kelly to resend out 3 QR Life code cards. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-23 07:54:40', '2023-06-23 07:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120954121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091198002', 'Robyn Hallet', NULL, '6-23-2023:  Robyn called to get more details on her ''prev care'' thru Planstin:
     - ''Planstin'':  Robyn hasn''t rec''d her new no ntwk req''d ID card.  I let her know we just learned that her old card will work, because they now can choose in or out of ntwk for care.  She found her card & will call the doc off to have them call Planstin to make sure they are willing to bill for her (her appt is in a few weeks).  The doc used to be in ntwk, but she doesn''t think they are any longer.  If they will not bill, she knows that will be an issue.
        We also went over staying ''prev care'' at appt, etc.
     - Labs:  Robyn went thru Ulta labs. She wondered if there was a way to get reimb.  We went over very little labs are cov''d & that ''prev care'' must be billed by the provider, lab, etc.  She seemed fine leaving the labs on her pymt since basic lipid panel is generally super cheap.
     - She also trav internationally (to Mexico), so we went over no ''prev care'', but how to handle an emergency if that comes up.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-23 07:53:57', '2023-06-23 08:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121021003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '06.22.23:  Jessica texted me to tell me her boys'' health plans, nor her partner''s health plan offer good coverage, so she wants to know what the cost would be to have them all on a MF plan.  Her partner is  age 56.  I texted her it would be $915/mo. w/the partner &amp; boys,  With just her and the boys it would be $525, however I didn''t think Logan, age 26 would be eligible to be on her plan but I would check it out tomorrow for sure.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-06-22 21:46:53', '2023-06-22 21:46:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120947026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '06.22.2023 Maurine called trying to upload additional documents in an already approved medical need, from what I understood. However it was telling her that the link she clicked on to get to the medical need request application is not recognized when she clicks on it, and that her member ID does not exist. 
I direct transferred her to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-22 15:19:30', '2023-06-22 15:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121009038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117973002', 'Kristall Laursen', 'Welcome Call', 'Completed on 6/22/23 by JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-22 14:48:43', '2023-06-22 14:48:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121009018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '6/22/23 - Melissa called in asking about her tax returns and how to file in NJ. I let her know that she would have to speak with an/her accountant. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-22 14:20:54', '2023-06-22 14:20:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120969351', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956089', 'C. Michaele Hogan', NULL, '6-22-2023:  Michaele called re: her ER visit on 6/1/2023.
     - She is finally getting #s, but not actual invoices yet.  We decided she doesn''t have anything to truly upload w/her ''med need'' yet, so she''ll call back to get her Zion portal & need started when she does.  She orig saw her chiro thinking her rib was out of place, & her doc for meds, but will upload those w/her ER bills.  She know the chiro may not be considered since it was not pre-approved, but maybe they''ll allow it to go twds her IUA?  She''s no worse off for trying.
     - 
     - Also, her ex-husb had a prev health issue, then went back in the hosp for the same issue yesterday.  They divorced in April, but this has come up again & it''s < 12 mos so hopefully, he prob won''t have to repay his IUA for that issue, but he''s now on his own memb.  They are amicable, so she''ll pass along info to him as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-22 14:16:52', '2023-06-22 18:20:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120982076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, '6-22-23 Leaving another message with Stephen about his payment and IUA options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-22 14:15:52', '2023-06-22 14:15:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120982071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, '6-22-23 I left a vm for Drew to update his payment method.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-22 14:13:25', '2023-06-22 14:13:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120969337', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937066', 'Margaret Tiscornia', NULL, '6-22-2023:  Margaret called.  Another memb told her we''d rem''d the ntwk requirement from the ''prev care'' & had questions.  We disc that you can now use PHCS ntwk or find a doc who is willing to bill for you for RBP pricing on ''prev care''.  I sent her the temp for ''prev care'' so she''d have the healthcare.gov link & can see what''s covered.  They have a pediatrician practice, where only one doc is in ntwk, but is out & they will be seeing another doc.  I told her check to make sure they will bill for her (the off can even call Planstin to confirm) and it should be fine for the child''s annual wellness visit either way.  Did disc staying ''prev'' only.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-22 13:53:27', '2023-06-22 14:01:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120947021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109363024', 'Jeremy Stillman', NULL, '06.22.2023 Alison called to get help in registering with CirrusMD. I confirmed her account and filled in her information to register for it and she received and confirmed the request while we were on the phone.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-22 13:43:56', '2023-06-22 13:43:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980182', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091225002', 'Robert Howell', NULL, 'Member submitted Change for to update address I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 13:30:23', '2023-06-22 13:30:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093638002', 'Jill Nagle', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address.  I will update in A123, CRM &amp; Ftni.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 13:24:04', '2023-06-22 13:24:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120969327', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064025010', 'Marie Kassouf', NULL, '6-22-2023:  Marie called.  She wants to cancel her membership.  She will call her advisor, Celina Dalton, to go thru the cancellation process w/her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-22 13:01:29', '2023-06-22 13:01:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120020002', 'John Mercer', NULL, 'Member''s spouse left me a VM after hours and had some billing questions.  She asked if they could save money in any way by giving us banking info.  I told her yes and sent her out the Payment Update form and added her email as secondary.  She also asked about the Welcome Call scheduler and I also sent that to her as well.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 12:41:21', '2023-06-22 12:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', 'Decline of 7/23 billing', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor  via EM &amp; VM - 6/22
6/22-member emailed me to rerun pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 12:13:36', '2023-06-22 14:21:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479010', 'Dennie Peterson', NULL, 'Member''s spouse was transferred to me because she had questions about billing.  Turns out she did not have a welcome call so she did not have a good understanding of the membership and how it works.  I added her email as secondary and will send her Welcome Call Scheduler.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 12:10:01', '2023-06-22 12:10:01');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000121009013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117650002', 'Paul Copeland', NULL, '6/22/23 - This member had called the sales number and Jeffrey answered. Paul was asking about updating his payment method and, in my opinion, was passed off onto Misty instead of being assisted at the time. I called this member today to follow up and he hadn''t heard from Misty as of yet. I went ahead and sent Paul the payment update form via email and he was thankful. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-22 11:55:33', '2023-06-22 11:55:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120983012', 'Yvette Parisi', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 11:54:40', '2023-06-22 11:54:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120969322', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058967087', 'Busia Stern', NULL, '6-22-2023:  Crystal (?) from Planstin called.  They rec''d a claim for a "Gloria" M Stern w/Busia''s b-date, but LM for the memb & had not heard back.  Crystal was able to conf all info & I let her know Busia''s middle inital is showing as ''G'' in our back off (Admin123), so potentially, since Busia is a more diff name, she''s Americanized it?  She has the prim ph # & Busia''s e-mail.  She''ll try contacting her again.  She will also try the secondary ph# too.  They just cannot process the claim until they can confirm this is Busia, or who it actually belongs to.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-22 11:25:32', '2023-06-22 11:25:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939017', 'Yvette Parisi', NULL, 'Due to financial issues, this member has now received Medicaid.  We will cancel this membership and spouse &amp; child will re-enroll separately eff 7/1/23.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 11:07:21', '2023-06-22 11:07:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000121003136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-22 10:59:41', '2023-06-22 10:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, 'Member called asking about billing I explained to him the situation and he asked about the extra charge for CC.  He wants to change to bank acct.  I will send him link to update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 10:39:33', '2023-06-22 10:39:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059299094', 'Randall Hettinga', 'New Plan eff 7/1/23', 'Member &amp; Child $1000 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 10:37:08', '2023-06-22 10:37:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120947013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115632002', 'Tatiana Hamawi', NULL, '06.22.2023 Tatiana called to better understand the charges showing in her portal account deactivation and activation message/label she was seeing. I asked her on the dates, and she shared end of May timeframe. I explained the process Planstin was taking to transition to the new RBP price model from the PHCS network, as it has been explained to us at the concierge team. 
Tatiana wanted know what changes were to be expected from this transition, I explained: Nothing regarding cost of billing, but it should look separated from the medical cost sharing portion. She said it did in May but not this month. This month it is jut one number, not separated. 
I explained that she will also receive a new card in the mail, and her list of doctor choices got bigger, as long as they are willing to collaborate pricing and billing. 
I consulted with Jen and Cari re: the whole number charge vs the split, and Jen said there was a billing issue yesterday with Zion (medical cost sharing portion). I''m waiting to hear back to know what next steps need to be taken.          NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-22 10:36:02', '2023-06-22 11:23:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059299094', 'Randall Hettinga', NULL, 'Member''s request to remove spouse was missed.  I will process and refund member the difference of $290 when we receive drop.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-22 10:31:39', '2023-06-22 10:31:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120969311', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107710002', 'Jana Baldwin', NULL, 'Pronounces her name:  "Jane - a"

6-22-2023:  Jana called.  
     - Doc doesn''t take cash...  is this normal?  
     - HCBB - we walked thru how to use this to find a diff doc together.
     - Discussed what a DPC doc is.  She seems to get it &amp; is interested as an option.
     - Called her back: reminder 6mos wait on ''prev care''  (colonoscopy, mamm)  w/Direct Plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-22 10:16:04', '2023-06-22 18:23:28'),
