  ('zcrm_1579374000120980053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065297375', 'Kathleen Gramzay', NULL, '6-20-2023:  Kathleen called to find out how to present if she ever needs to utilize her healthcare, & esp what to do in an emerg.  
We did component educ:  
     - ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative =only time you ''P''resent and ID card.  Sent her the ''prev care'' temp & told her about the ''healthcare.gov'' link.
     - CirrusMD = text first.  Lmtd scope, but great guidance.  
     - Catastrophic/Illness/Accident type moves to healthshare = Zion.  Let her know how to present: no ''ins'', no card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, if needs to pay something offer to pay your 1k IUA (she seems to understand issue spec & 3-IUAs/yr), then ask if they can bill her for the bal.  6-mos dead to sub ''med need''.  Call us & we can guide her in how to get that going.  New portal, but we can get you there.
     - Derm appts?  She asked if part of the ''prev care''.  Let her know gvmt does not include this & that''s how we got to my sending her the temp for ''prev care'' & the healthcare.gov site.
[We did not go into keeping receipts in case they find something & it could move to healthshare.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-20 16:55:32', '2023-06-20 17:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820032', 'Ottis Fausett', NULL, '6-20-2023:  Suzanne called.  She rec''d an e-mail from Zion saying to sign in to your site & in her mind that was our site.  Since she''s having trouble, I made sure she has Zion''s ph # & trans her there because their new portal has had some glitches & they sb able to help her.     - CA

Suzanne called back.  The Zion person rushed her off the phone saying they could not hold while she tried inputting her name, but as w/everyone else I''ve tt, she/they cannot enter the name of the memb for the need.  She thought I could help.  I let her know it''s been an issue & seems like a glitch in their new system.  Sadly, they have shortened their hours & when she called them back (like 2 min after she got off the ph w/them) they were closed.  She''ll try them tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-20 16:46:22', '2023-06-20 17:20:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608546', 'Paige Kaufmann', NULL, '6-20-2023:  Paige called thinking it was MPB she had to call for her doc''s appts.  
     - We realized for her daughter appt, she needs to tt Redirect (at least it sounded more like a std appt, not a medical need).  She has Redirect''s ph #.
     -& for her husb''s appt = may be looking at surgery = healthsharing & Sedera.  We went over how to present, no ins, ''cash-pay'', ask for disc'', & we talked about 2nd MD (how sharing % is based on completing that when req''d).  She''s done a ''need'' w/Sedera before, so I did send her the Sedera temp for sub a ''need'', but I made sure she has Sedera''s # & trans her there because she''s prob already set up their acct & she can talk dir to them about her husb situation (w/surgery she sure he''ll be > then their IUA).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-20 16:35:05', '2023-06-20 16:35:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120980033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101897001', 'Daniel Kane', NULL, '6-20-2023:  Daniel called, sure he''s never used CirrusMD before.  However, I can see Nahla helped him back in Jan.  I tried registering him in case &amp; he does already have an acct.  He was in &amp; sending the initial text to the doc when we got off the phone.  His leg is swelling &amp; per online that can be very dangerous.  I let him know they sb able to guide him &amp; if he needs me to guide him further once they tell him what they suggest, I''m here another 1.45 h tonight.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-20 16:13:52', '2023-06-20 16:13:52'),
