  ('zcrm_1579374000120980023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109791001', 'Sondra Sanfilippo', NULL, '6-20-2023:  Sondra called.  She kinda wanted me to do what is gone over in the ''Welcome Call'', which she hasn''t done yet.  So, I did super basic on the ''prev care'' thru Planstin so she can at least try to make her appts.  Then I sent her the ''Welcome Call'' invite &amp; told her to call me back after she has that call (cuz now she''ll have a basic understanding) &amp; I can then go into depth on details of what to do/be careful of in her ''prev care'' appts, where to see what is/&amp; isn''t cov, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-20 12:30:13', '2023-06-20 12:30:13'),
