  ('zcrm_1579374000120947003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115979002', 'Tony Hugar', NULL, '6/20/23 - Robin called in today to find out if she had benefits out of state. I let her know that if she were to need to go to the ER or Urgent Care she would have benefits. We went over the cash-pay process and Robin will call the concierge if anything urgent happens. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-20 07:40:28', '2023-06-20 07:40:28'),
