  ('zcrm_1579374000120869113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611018', 'Heather Locke', NULL, 'Heather called while I was driving home. She is getting employer benefits and wanted to cancel. I asked her if she knew who her advisor is, she answered Jane Kassel. I asked if she tried to contact Jane, she said yes, but Jane is out of the country. I emailed her the cancel form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-19 18:28:58', '2023-06-19 18:28:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120869108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120991001', 'Suchada Chaiwechakarn', NULL, 'Su called in, she found us online. She is a physician, an OB/GYN. I went over the Secure plan, answered all questions, and emailed her, details, pricing, and the enrollment tab.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-19 18:26:15', '2023-06-19 18:26:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120879060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, '6-19-2023:  Felicia &amp; partner Debbie Eubanks called.  Felicia cut her finger &amp; got stiches out today -- she was hoping  to call CirrusMD, but it''s not recognizing her info.  I sub a support e-mail to CirrusMD.  They will call back if they have not rec''d the link from CirrusMD to get in by 2pm mtn tomorrow.  We used this e-mail for Felicia:  FeleciaB77@hotmail.com.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-19 17:18:58', '2023-06-19 17:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120879055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, '6-19-2023:  Debbie & Felicia called.  Felicia Balderston cut her finger & got stiches out today -- she was hoping  to call CirrusMD, but it''s not recognizing her info.  I sub a support e-mail to CirrusMD.  They will call back if they have not rec''d the link from CirrusMD to get in by 2pm mtn tomorrow.
     - Debbie turns 65 in Nov, so we went over the process, incl her sub the signed acknowledgement that her MPB only goes thru 10/31/2023.  She''ll sub the signed form from the link she''ll receive mid Sept, between 10/1 & 10/19.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-19 17:17:46', '2023-06-19 17:20:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120879044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415323', 'Wallace James', NULL, '6-19-2023:  Dr Marquez recommended a procedure ~ 1 yr ago.  He''s been putting off his surgery, but is ready to get going now.  He wasn''t sure if it''s > a yr since he was working within his open ''med need''.  The billing for his doc (who he loves), was a nightmare - he pd, they said he hadn''t, sent him to collections, & eventually realized they had made the mistake.  I let him know to take that into consideration & ask the doc''s off "how do we prevent that from happening again?" 
     - Made sure he has Zion''s ph # & sugg he tt the ''med need'' dept to see if he happens to be w/in the 12 mos & can just continue on the same ''med need''.  He knows worstcase scenario, will need to repay the 1k IUA.
     - He thought we could help fix the billing, so I did educ on MPB, Zion, etc., & how that''s not something we do.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-19 16:10:25', '2023-06-19 16:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120878032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120922012', 'Kaitlyn Kirkham', NULL, '6-19-23 Kaitlyn is 26 and newly hired into Hope Institute and living in Scottsdale, AZ. She''s healthy, no tobacco and on anti-anxiety meds. She understands the IUA now and knows to show the MEC card for wellness only and self-pay otherwise. She also knows there''s no network for wellness but they must accept and bill to ins. She starts July 10th for her new job. She''s enrolled for SECURE - $1000/$275 and no up front fees. We had to use a fake ACH account number with a real routing # of Wells Fargo. She used all 1''s as the checking acct since the List Bill option wasn''t showing up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-19 15:45:45', '2023-06-19 15:45:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120878027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '6-19-23 James called to find out if ortho for removal of wisdom teeth is included and I let him know it is not. But, I will look for good dental discount plans or dental plans without waiting periods. She needs it done by Sept. So, not enough time for the HMA now either. The dentist is Dr. John Miller but the ortho is Dr. Collin Galbraith at Roaring Fork Oral Surgery in Glenwood Springs, CO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-19 15:39:58', '2023-06-19 15:39:58'),
