  ('zcrm_1579374000120918096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752240', 'Carolyn Decker', NULL, '06.19.2023 Caroyln and Collin called to get Collin set up with CirrusMD. I sent him an invitation but he did not receive it. Cari tried on her end and learned that he is not set up properly and we will have to put in a support ticket to CirrusMD. 
After the phone call, Cari reached out to identify why it is when I try to send an invitation, it does not reach the members. Cari learned and shared with me that I am using the wrong request link and shed light on the successful way to using that service with the members.
We also noted that the Colin''s birthday is showing in the CRM as 02/22/2002, when in fact it is, 02/26/2002. I emailed Dayra P, via Outlook, requesting to change that to reflect the birthday that shows in Admin123, b/c the birthday in Admin123 is what worked to help him register with CirrusMD.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 13:45:43', '2023-06-19 14:52:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120919109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199008', 'Astraea Davidson', NULL, 'Member reached out to me after hours due to the fact that she was wondering why her price went up.  She aged int  the 50 age band in 8/22 and then we had the Zion price increase, so we did not increase her price at that time.  When the Zion &amp; Planstin portions had to be split the price increase was applied eff 6/1/23.  I called and left VM for member to explain this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-19 13:35:34', '2023-06-19 13:35:34'),
