  ('zcrm_1579374000120879039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '6-19-2023:  Sara called us again re: the bills she rec''d &amp; Zion''s pre-pd cc''s to pay them.  She wanted to know how to pay the bills?  [The ph # on the ethos pathology # is wrong - I sugg she call the office that submitted to Ethos &amp; ask for a corr # so she can pay them.  Then, she doesn''t have bills for the other items, just the EOB from Planstin - I told her to call the billing office of the hosp/ER to see if they can help her &amp; take pymt.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-19 13:00:52', '2023-06-19 13:00:52'),
