  ('zcrm_1579374000120879034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118280002', 'Julia Bower', NULL, '6-19-2023:  Julia called.  Her 20 yr old son is going to college & needs to have immunizations to get in.  We started w/me making sure of the participating pharmacies near them: CVS & Walgreens (which they like) are both listed.  Let her know he will present his Planstin card & they will bill for him.
     - She started asking about specific immunizations.  I went to healthcare.gov & she started saying Planstin was not interpretting what covered correctly.  Then I let her know the information I was giving her was not Planstin''s, it''s the gvmt''s site, I took her there.  She continued to say she needed to talk to someone because the information was wrong.  More than once I told her the gvmt is the one who are responsible for that information, so I wasn''t sure who she''d talk to re: healthcare.gov site if she thinks it''s wrong.  I did tell her talking with Planstin, to make sure what we are seeing is accurate would be the next place to go.  (ie:  polio is listed for children (thru the 17yr) but not listed on the for adults site.  She''s does something in the medical field & says we are just wrong.  But, it''s the gvmt''s site... 
     - She also said he needs his COVID booster, which is not listed.  I sugg she let the pharmacy know that isn''t listed on the site, so maybe the gvmt is helping still?     [I paid for mine, but at this point, I was not going there w/her.  She''s just sure the gvmt site is wrong, to which I have no answer.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-19 12:36:22', '2023-06-19 12:36:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120918080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '06.19.2023 Melissa called to better learn on how the coverage works for her daughter''s eyes. Cayla is seeing grey spots, and her care is moving forward to seeing a specialist. Melissa knows that vision is not covered, but wants to know if there is any coverage for medical vision incidents, such as what Cayla is going through.
I coached Melissa to have a conversation with the health-sharing company to identify how they would categorize Cayla''s situation and move forward from there. I recommended that she do that after she speaks/sees the specialist. I gave her Zion''s phone number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 12:35:43', '2023-06-21 12:46:07'),
