  ('zcrm_1579374000120878013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120893013', 'Ashley Sargent', NULL, '6-19-23 Met up with Ashley at our reunion!  She''s getting divorced from Nick now and is receiving alimony and is starting her own coaching/consulting business. She''s getting her last paycheck from Burke in June and will be on her own July 1st. Kids will remain on Nick''s ins. Ashley is super healthy, no pre-x, no meds. She definitely does her annual wellness visits every year. She already did her first colonoscopy last year and will do the next one in 5 years. Kate is fighting off colon cancer and is doing well now!  Ashley is being extra cautious. She does a mammo every year but I told her ACA has changed it to every other year. So, she alreay did hers this year and is fine to wait one year between. She will go try to squeeze in her annual wellness visit now before the end of the month. She lives in VT and I need to make sure she doesn''t get penalized for non ACA membership. She signed up for CARE+ $1000/$240 EO for now. If she has to get her business license right away, she will.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-19 12:02:14', '2023-06-19 12:21:44'),
