  ('zcrm_1579374000120918061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113970002', 'Tracy Murphy', NULL, '06.19.2023 Tracy needs a mamm list to start prev care. I guided her through the PHCS network, given the lack of resources and guidance received to move forward with the RBP 100%, as of today.
I then coached her to on how to use the HCBB link to rate and research who she finds in the PHCS, as well as from a clean search.
Tracy asked about cholesterol check during her annual check up, and guided her to verbiage like "keeping the appointment preventative by only having the standard lipid panel done", giving her tools and resources such as the healtcare.gov link that she can peruse so her appointment remains preventative. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 10:51:54', '2023-06-19 11:17:22'),
