  ('zcrm_1579374000120918046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671011', 'Lynda Koch', NULL, '06.19.2023 Lynda tried opening a medical need but it would not recognize her as a member to choose from the drop down menu that they''ve embedded in the new medical need submission form - after consulting with Cari and Jen, I transferred her to Zion to resolve the glitch in their system. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 10:18:02', '2023-06-29 10:24:13'),
