  ('zcrm_1579374000120918041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, 'Christopher needed the MAP number. He was driving so I transferred him to 888-543-5080 and I emailed him that number and M&amp;S''s link with MPB. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 10:07:14', '2023-06-19 12:17:05'),
