  ('zcrm_1579374000120853024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122013002', 'Donald Hubbard', NULL, '06.19.23:  Called Cindy, asked if Donnie made a decision on his healthcare plan. She said she thinks he may want to go w/SECURE because of the HSA, but he may take DIRECT.  They won''t need to have him start until August 1.  Cindy said she''ll contact me when they''re ready.  She said she has a friend whose son hs been on her plan but it''s too expensive now and she''s looking for another healthcare plan for him.  Cindy gave her my phone number and referred me to her.  The son is healthy and in his 20''s.  Also, Cindy got an impressive testimonial from one of our members who said he loves our plan.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-06-19 08:55:42', '2023-06-19 08:55:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120918021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', NULL, '06.19.2023 Patricia called extremely frustrated and wanting ways to solve issues of the facility and PCP not accepting to follow the RBP process, and saying that they now consider her a ''self-pay'' patient.
Patricia had a 3D mammogram done in April, at Richmond Gastro Immunology center, and it was not covered, and she had to pay for it. She shared several times in the conversation that no one has reciprocated with her at all since March, and she said when they did respond to he emails she was claiming in her own words that she was being brushed off and that we were buying time. I requested to know who she was speaking/emailing with. She shared it was Jen and Cari, and that was an immediate red flag for me, given the reputation that Jen and Cari have been upholding with the company. Therefore I requested that she send me the thread of emails she is referring to, to better understand what was reciprocated and to perhaps shed light on the appropriate or intended perception that was meant to be delivered OR where did the communication break down.
Now in a thread of emails, THAT PART re: having a 3D mammography, was addressed to her numerously by Jen and Cari, coaching her to NOT do the 3D, as it WOULD NOT be covered.
While I was still on the phone with Patricia, I did promise her that I would look over the chain of email, conference with my supervisor, and identify where all this broke down to call her back with solutions. 
Patricia was frustrated, making statement such as "looking elsewhere for coverage, b/c this is horrible" and "I have been on this RBP roller coaster since February" and "I don''t want to go through the colonoscopy screening like I went through with the Mammography screening".
Now beside the lack or reciprocation from the admin office to Patricia, according to the thread of emails, Patricia misread/misunderstood/misinterpreted/ignored, what was said to her in those emails by Jen and Cari. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 08:53:48', '2023-06-19 15:07:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120918016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '06.19.2023 Emily called to get transferred to Planstin. I gave her the number and then Direct transferred her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 08:48:01', '2023-06-19 08:48:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120919003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, 'I received email from Planstin that this members address had change and they wanted me to update in the file.  I will update in all systems', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-19 08:41:48', '2023-06-19 08:41:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120918008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100459012', 'Kelly Matthews', NULL, '06.9.2023 Kelly called to learn how to get covered for the colonoscopy screening through Zion.
I consulted with Jen and Cari to confirm what I know, due to the minimal exposure to dealing with Direct members.
I coached Kelly to open a medical need request under preventative. Fulfill or get as close to the $1000 IUA, submit the receipt for that and the invoice to the balance.
I transferred her to Zion, but Zion was closed for the day and she will call them the next day. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-19 08:35:26', '2023-06-19 08:37:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120879026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086715002', 'Nancy Krampetz', NULL, '6-16-2023:  Nancy called.  She''s waiting for a determination on some deep treatment on her nerve dmg ''med need'' &amp; wanted to see if there was anything on the pre-approval yet.  I gave her Zion''s ph # &amp; trans her to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-16 15:39:52', '2023-06-16 15:39:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120879021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '6-16-2023:  Sara called.  She rec''d a digital cc & is confused why we sent it.  I went over that it must be for a ''med need'' and came from Zion to pay outstanding bills.  She didn''t understand why she needs to pay them, so I did some educ - healthshare memb = ''cash-pay'' & this supports that scenario.  She wants to know why it has a deadline of 6/21/2023 on the digital card & I told her Zion would have to explain to that.  Made sure she has their ph # & trans her directly to them.
     - During the call did educ:  She kept saying she pd us the bal of her IUA.  So I tried to explain the diff entities:  MPB brought together the diff components.  Zion = the healthsharing component & who she would have pd the IUA bal to.  That we cannot see their med bills, etc, so that''s why I''m getting her to the comp that can see that info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-16 14:09:31', '2023-06-16 16:38:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120879016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110465010', 'Frederick Ashcraft', NULL, '6-16-2023:  Frederick''s wife called.  I don''t see a "Perm to Speak to..." form on file (She says, yeah, I''ve never filled one of those out.  I replied, that would require Frederick''s completiong, but we got side tracked & did not come back to this).  So, I spoke in general terms to the product, not Frederick specific.
     - She wanted info about a bill she rec''d.  It turns out Frederick''s doc''s off billed them & she was trying to make sure everything was submitted.  She thinks (totally unsure), it was ''prev care''.  We disc how limited the ACA MEC is & maybe what the bill is for  falls outside those covered items.  I gave her Planstin''s ph # so she can see if it was billed thru them.  
     - Did educ on diff comp: prev care, healthsharing, etc.  So, if it turns out not to be ''prev care'', but illness/accident/catastrophic it would move to the healthshare component = they are resp for 1k IUA & we can help them sub ''med need''.  She''s sure it wasn''t this...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-16 12:46:07', '2023-06-16 12:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120842039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085954002', 'Danielle Clayton', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 7/1 due to the fact that she now has employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-16 12:18:23', '2023-06-16 12:18:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120879008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083099001', 'julia avalon', NULL, '6-16-2023:  tt Julia:
     - Helped her see/use the disc lab site.  For the $10, she''ll prob put the lipid panel into the cart and go that route since Quest has been so difficult re: billing.
