  ('zcrm_1579374000120879003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105916002', 'Jeff Wulfman', NULL, 'Marjorie = Maggie''s e-mail:  maggie.christner@gmail.com

6-16-2023:  Melanie called.  She was trying to help their 18 yr old: Marjorie = Maggie signup for CirrusMD, but it wasn''t working.  I was able to send her an invitation & she was about to go into a chat w/CirrusMD when we got off the phone.  Melanie was also able to see their under age daughter listed, Charlotte, on her own CirrusMD.  I reminded her that if they are prescribed something we can help get best pricing & reminder her of the concierge hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-16 12:01:02', '2023-06-16 12:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120878003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, '06.16.2023 Carol called following up on getting reimbursed for the $50 RPB mischarge. I check Admin123 and confirmed she was reimbursed. She also asked about the new Planstin cards, and I did not have an answer for her given the different dates provided that they were supposed to get sent out, including information on how to now present to the providers.
