  ('zcrm_1579374000120810022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '6-15-23 Sara is enrolling her family now in SECURE $2500/$765. The ACA options were brutal with high ded and mop. We have to put her husband as primary since he''s self-employed.  We may have to change their membership if/when he ages out. They are enrolled successfully for July 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-15 15:55:31', '2023-06-15 16:12:57'),
