  ('zcrm_1579374000120795213', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108891001', 'Sarah Stokes', NULL, '6-15-2023:  Sarah called.  About 2 mos ago she walked into a door & the goose egg on her head hasn''t gone away.  Her PCP (also a pers friend) sugg she see a surgeon.  We looked up the doc in St Louis she was thinking of seeing: John Chi = HCBB lists him as highest overall quality, but also highest priced.  Using the term ''Otolaryngology'' that Dr Chi shows as his specialty, I gave her 3 other docs who are shown as fair priced.  She knows she can choose Dr Chi, yet seemed open to  at least looking at the others.
     - We went over how to present: no ''ins'', no ID card, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, etc...  Knows she''s resp for first 1k, deadline, & will let us know when she''s ready for guidance of sub her ''med need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-15 13:50:40', '2023-06-15 13:53:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120813037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110449010', 'HO CHUNG', NULL, '06.15.2023 Erin, Ho''s spouse, called to better understand how to open a medical need request, b/c the link is not opening the application. This may be due to zion''s new platform for the need request.
I explained that to Erin and direct transferred her to complete the new set up process. I requested that she call us back to open the medical need request, if still needed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-15 13:49:40', '2023-06-15 13:49:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120795208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120816002', 'Michael Lam', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-15 13:20:28', '2023-06-15 13:20:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120795200', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085362001', 'Laura Plummer', 'New Membership eff 7/1/23', 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-15 13:11:51', '2023-06-15 13:11:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120813024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, '06.15.2023 Wendy called to follow up on the already approved medical need request. Also she was unsure how to locate the need or the link that someone sent her.
I could not find anywhere in her emails, if someone from MPB sent her the instructions to submit bills to Zion, so I suggested that she check her email, if not there then the best thing to do is speak to them directly.
She is wanting to submit bills to Zion for her $6k costly dental surgery.  I direct transferred her to them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-15 13:09:23', '2023-06-15 13:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120795195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371027', 'Karen Faydenko', NULL, '6-15-2023:  Husb has had back issues forever &amp; would like to try dryneedling.  Had surgery in 2021 (=w/in the 24-mo look back prior to memb).  So, we disc anything toward this issue would be pre-x &amp; in the phase-in period.  Right now = waiting period.  Went over after 1/1/24 = 25k avail to share twds this issue, and following yr''s amts.  They will look at using their HSA for now.  Then after new year may look at getting prior approval if still need alternative type treatment.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-15 13:04:17', '2023-06-15 14:21:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120795190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770009', 'Matthew Woltman', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-15 13:04:14', '2023-06-15 13:04:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120795185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, 'Member''s spouse called in looking for a 1095A form to submit for Taxes.  I explained that they only have the Medical Cost Sharing and that it is not insurance.  He also asked about adding that on and I told his he would have to re-enroll if he wanted to do that.  Also asked about Dental and I told him that we would probably offer that in the future and that he would have to speak to his Advisor about that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-15 13:02:17', '2023-06-15 13:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120795180', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120772002', 'Sarah Byrnes', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-15 12:47:41', '2023-06-15 12:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120809039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120816002', 'Michael Lam', NULL, 'Samantha called today, had some additional questions. After answering her questions, she said they are ready to enroll in the Secure plan.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-15 11:37:25', '2023-06-15 11:37:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120815003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001757205', 'Mary Carter Eick', NULL, '06.15.23:  Mary called me. Said she thought the $50 fee she pays was compulsory to have LHS. She hasn''t used our MPB services and wants to know if she can have a refund on our fee she''s been paying. I explained since she never informed us she wants to cancel the MPB services, I doubted she''d be able to be refunded.  She argued that she didn''t realize she had to cancel anything because she thought it was part of the LHS plan. I reminded her it''s the member''s responsibility to inquire about their plan if they have questions.  She said she didn''t know what our services are, that she hasn''t received any information from us and thought we were still called My Academy of Excellence, etc.  I described our services she has access to. She asked me to send her more information about them.  She''ll take a look and see if she''d like to keep them at this time.  I emailed her a list of the services and links to my site and MPB site to review each service in more detail.  I suggested she schedule a Review call w/our Concierge.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-06-15 11:15:06', '2023-06-16 11:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120795175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '6-15-2023:  Emily called to get guidance on her ''prev care'' appt.  She lives in a super sm town, but her doc''s off is in ntwk.  Let her know that''s great, however we have more flexibility now w/no ntwk req''d.  
     - Mamm: She''s 41 & we looked at healthcare.gov together.  It''s as recommended by doc for high risk at her age.  We decided it might be worth having the doc call Planstin if they decide to do this ahead of time to make sure it''s billed corr & as prev.
     - Asked about her pap & it needing to be diff appt.  Let her know she has both Well Woman & general annual (usually ends up being your gyno & your PCP).
     - Labs:  She lives in NY, but we found a Quest location in VT that will work (about 1 hour away).  She will us her Planstin for the std lipid, then find out everything else the doc wants & will consider using the disc lab site for that.
     - I don''t see RX Quotes here in the notes, but it sounds like we sent her to our international shopper Reid & she''s been very happy w/that experience & pricing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-15 11:05:35', '2023-06-15 11:05:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120801131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119086002', 'Grayson Simmons', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-15 11:05:30', '2023-06-15 11:05:30'),
