  ('zcrm_1579374000120813016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153215', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, '06.15.2023 Luis called to confirm the process of taking his 4 month old daughter to the preventative appointment. I explained that all he would need is his RCI card and to keep the appointment preventative, as well as use THAT language with the office/doctor. I then direct transferred him to RCI for more questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-15 11:00:22', '2023-06-15 11:01:34'),
