  ('zcrm_1579374000120795003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, 'Per an email that I received from Sedera when I contacted them to remove dependent Tyler, he had been removed eff 12/31/22 when this member did the transition to the Select + platform.  Member did not notify MPB.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-15 07:02:39', '2023-06-15 07:02:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120771050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115142002', 'Howard Thomas', NULL, '6-14-2023:  Howard called:
     - ''Prev'' care appt 6/22/2023 - we found his normal doc in the PHCS search tool, so he will present his Planstin card.  I sent him the ''prev care'' temp w/healthcare.gov link so he can see what types of things are considered /prev.  He felt a bit overwhelmed, so he may call closer to his appt time to understand how to approach his hurt foot & the ''prev care'' appt in different manners.
     - CirrusMD:  He''s already registered, but we thought maybe this is a place to get initial guidance on his foot pain.  Knowing they may tell him he needs to see his doc, but he can try.
     - HSA Acct: Thinks his bank offers HSA accts for free.  He wondered about amt he can input, etc.  Let him know his acct, or maybe the bank can let him know how it works.  Conf for him his eff date in case that impacts how much he can put into the acct.  He will show his Planstin card if they need proof of the high deductible.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-14 18:28:10', '2023-06-14 18:28:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120769018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976010', 'George Elkins', NULL, 'Concierge sent this member over to me, enrolled with Tupac. Had some billing questions. I answered and helped him with what he needed. He had difficulty reaching concierge today. I transferred this to my name.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-14 15:52:47', '2023-06-14 15:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120730047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, '06.14.2023 Erin called to learn how to better search for an MRI facility. I guided her to the post welcome email that Jennifer sent, and to the HCBB link, where her and I searched for the MRI facilities in her area and learned briefly how to maneuver the site. Erin has not quite reached or gotten close to her IUA yet, for her daughter''s ankle injury, but if she does, she knows this is the number to call, 800-519-2969 to get help in opening a medical need request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-14 15:46:29', '2023-06-14 15:46:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120728061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077742031', 'Tyler Holt', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add newborn Emilia to the membership I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-14 14:45:54', '2023-06-14 14:46:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120728056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120745009', 'Diane Sadowski', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-14 14:42:19', '2023-06-14 14:42:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120730034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '06.14.2023 Asiye called to get a coupon for an RX request, I emailed her via CRM the form. 
**************************************************************************************

After lunch, Asiye called back suprised that we had not sent her a coupon yet. I explained that it usually takes 24 hours for a request, since we do an intensive research on 8 sites plus an international shopper if needed.
I said if it is an emergency, it is important that you let us know.
I was able to generate two coupons for her after searching 4 sites.
Included here.                              NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-14 14:37:58', '2023-06-14 15:25:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120728051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770001', 'Adele Haynes', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-14 14:32:51', '2023-06-14 14:32:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120728046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120756012', 'Ernest Stafford', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-14 14:30:11', '2023-06-14 14:30:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120771008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '6-14-2023: Mary called & wanted to confirm:
     - ...  [Got to end of call.  Cannot remember 1st thing we went over.]
     - Certified letter from MPowering?  They missed delivery and now they have to go pick it up.  I sugg she call the postal srvc & ask for redelivery since they only tried once.  Let her know I have no idea what it might be.  She will call back if questions once she finds out what it is.
     - Centura Health:  $848 not sufficient?  Discount amt not authorized?  Mamm & bone density?  Letter from Hosp saying pymt not sufficient.  We decided she will call hosp to conf what the charges are for.  Then, since it looks like Planstin may have been billed, she will call them to see if it was them that pd the $848.  At that point, we''ll figure out if it was out-of-ntwk, or why she''s being charged the balance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-14 14:23:30', '2023-06-14 14:45:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120728041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120762002', 'Jody Peterson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-14 14:22:49', '2023-06-14 14:22:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120728036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120746017', 'Guadalupe Escatel', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-14 11:26:42', '2023-06-14 11:26:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120728031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120746009', 'Jean Haghiri', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-14 11:22:47', '2023-06-14 11:22:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120732057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120770001', 'Adele Haynes', NULL, '6-14-23 Deli is enrolling now in CARE+. She wants wellness but did most of it recently. She''s in the process of setting up her business. She''s meeting with someone to help her next week. She is a psychotherapist and doesn''t need a license in CO for some reason. She''s not planning to get an EIN. I asked if she''s setting up an LLC, S-Corp or something along those lines. She doesn''t know yet. Once she gets it going, she wants to upgrade to SECURE. She might get proof via the State of CO business entity with her SS#.  For now choosing CARE+ $165/$1000 for July 1st. Enrollment complete and all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-14 11:22:12', '2023-06-14 11:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120713128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116988002', 'Christopher Cantwell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-14 11:03:36', '2023-06-14 11:03:36'),
