  ('zcrm_1579374000120713093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119626010', 'Alicia Koscinski', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-14 09:58:16', '2023-06-14 09:58:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120730024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108535010', 'James Robertson', NULL, '6/14/23 - James called because Cari/Patti were working on fixing his IUA with Zion (he went from $2500 to $1000). He had called Zion this AM who told him that they still have him in the system as $2500. James was nice but very frustrated that he is continuing to have issues with his IUA. I transferred him to Patti directly so that she could assist him. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-14 09:55:49', '2023-06-14 09:55:49'),
