  ('zcrm_1579374000120732003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '6-13-23 I talked with Callie also since I had an email and vm from her regarding Don''s upcoming colonoscopy. Don called Zion yesterday to get help with the process and they told him he does not have  wellness included. They do have wellness with the Planstin MEC. Jennifer gave them the low down of how to go through the process. Callie will make note of the correct MPB Concierge # to call in the future. They are totally relieved and he will proceed with his colonoscopy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-13 09:00:35', '2023-06-13 09:00:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120730003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007622345', 'B. Bradley Collier', NULL, 'Called for post cancellation. Spoke with Bradley who was very happy with all of our services! And Go Dawgs!  6/13/23', 'Angela Brocious', 'Angela Brocious', '2023-06-13 08:40:17', '2023-06-13 08:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120725028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120424002', 'Tory Erickson', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of July 1, 2023. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-06-13 08:40:03', '2023-06-13 08:40:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120713018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '6/13/23 - Don called in regarding his prev care colonoscopy coming up. I explained the process with Planstin and that as long as this stays prev then it will be covered 100%. I advised that if it does turn into a diagnostic test, then he would be responsible for his IUA and the rest would go to Zion for payment. Don did not elaborate, but stated that when his wife called in yesterday she received conflicting information and this scares him as he does not want to have a huge bill. I let Don know that I was unsure of who his wife spoke with, but it didn''t appear to be anyone from the MPB concierge team as there were no notes in their file and that we note when we speak with a member. Don and I were both confused but he was grateful for the clarification. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-13 08:23:32', '2023-06-13 08:23:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120720013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108730001', 'Elizabeth Dreher', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update form.  I will update. Reactivated previous pmt method', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-13 08:09:51', '2023-06-13 08:11:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120720008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714162', 'Christine Lair', NULL, 'Stuart Lubline requested a letter to give to dependent Logan''s new employer to prove that he had previous coverage.  MCS will not be eligible for previous coverage as it is not insurance.  Maybe he will qualify due to loosing coverage due to the fact that he turned 26.  Emailed letter to Stuart.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-13 08:08:32', '2023-06-13 08:08:32'),
