  ('zcrm_1579374000120720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111417002', 'Maria Shea', NULL, 'Member emailed me and wanted to confirm that since she added new bank info, that I deleted her previous HSA card.  I deleted it , however I advised member that for future reference that share amounts can not be paid with HSA funds only qualified Medical expenses.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-13 07:39:36', '2023-06-13 07:39:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120713013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '6/13/23 - Sara called in asking for Cari. I advised Sara that Cari would not be in until 12 PM EST so Sara asked if I could assist her in uploading a document to a need she has opened with Zion since May. Zion is now requiring members to sign up for their member portal so I attempted to warm transfer Sara to Zion for this information. Unfortunately Zion must be having issues with their phones because I could not get through. I advised Sara that I would send an email to their member services team asking that they reach out to her directly. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-13 07:34:06', '2023-06-13 07:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120713008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083478001', 'Kimberly McClure', NULL, '6/13/23 -Kimberly called because she has a document to upload for a need she started in May. Zion is now requiring members to sign up for a portal. I had an issue with Zion answering the phones this AM pertaining to another member, so I sent Zion 2 emails regarding both members needing to gain their member portal information. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-13 07:32:21', '2023-06-13 07:32:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120659111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098690002', 'Samantha Hernandez', NULL, '6-12-2023:  Samantha called.  She was scratching her back &amp; a tick came out.  She wanted med advice.  I let her know I couldn''t help her w/that, but suggested CirrusMD would be the place to start.  She says she''s used that before &amp; thinks she can get straight in.  I let her know I''m here another 25-minutes today &amp; to call me back right away if she needs help getting into CirrusMD.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-12 17:38:37', '2023-06-12 17:38:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120659106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109593019', 'Shannon Wallace', NULL, '6-12-2023:  James called re: his hosp stay.  They hosp has been unwilling to do a ''cash-pay'' disc & he feels like he''s exhasted that request.  He just rec''d the inv & since Zion just chg''d the way memb sub the ''med needs'' I send him the temp w/the new link & their ph # & eventually trans him to them.  He asked if he had to call the hosp to pay his $2500 IUA.  He sounded frustrated working w/them, so I sug: once you have your ''med need'' started w/Zion, you can call & pay them that $2500 directly.  He really seemed to like that option.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-12 17:12:06', '2023-06-12 17:12:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120656048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111619002', 'Lynne Diekmann', NULL, '06.12.2023 Sent email via CRM for instructions for submitting bills to Zion. I did inform her of the change of medical need request platform.
She opened the link and it naturally shared for her to open a member portal, and call the Zion number. (888) 920-9466 , to complete that process. I asked Lynne to give us a call back to continue with opening the medical need or let know if she''s taken care of. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 15:09:05', '2023-06-12 15:13:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120656038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108730001', 'Elizabeth Dreher', NULL, '06.12.2023 Elizabeth called concerned about an extra charge that is showing since she''s switched from checking to credit card. I learned today about the 3% charge, and relayed to her that that''s what she might be looking at. 
She confirmed that it is, and no longer needed to speak to billing.
She did mention that she received the email that was sent regarding the mishap with charging, and 
got refunded. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 14:59:36', '2023-06-12 14:59:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120689034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119666002', 'Brad York', 'Welcome Call', 'Completed 6/12/23 by JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-12 14:57:21', '2023-06-12 14:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120656033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '06.12.2023 Rachel called to learn if we have international medical treatment for when they go traveling outside of the US.
I pulled up the Zion guidelines, AO 06.12.2023, pressed the keys Ctrl F, searched for International in the search bar. Number 23, on page 25 in the PDF surfaced the following verbiage:
23. International Medical Treatment
Medical expenses for emergency and acute care incurred outside the United States will be
considered for sharing based on the Member Guidelines. Preventive or nonemergency
services are not shareable without prior written approval from Zion HealthShare.
I read that out loud to Rachel, and guided her to speak to zion to give them the heads up. I transferred her after our conversation was over. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 14:41:24', '2023-06-12 14:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120659086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132050', 'Elizabeth Longbotham', 'New membership eff 7/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-12 14:13:14', '2023-06-12 14:13:14'),
