  ('zcrm_1579374000120670048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120816002', 'Michael Lam', NULL, 'Samantha called me back, long conversation, she had lots of great questions. I emailed her all the details and pricing for the Secure plan. She will make a decision in the next couple of days.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-12 13:59:38', '2023-06-12 13:59:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120656028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081477002', 'Gina Casquarelli', NULL, '06.12.2023 Gina called concerned about nerve pain/sensation going down her arm and wants it checked out. Is considering an xray, but was not sure if she needs a referral. I double checked with Cari and Jen via teams, and Cari shared that we may not require the referral, however the X-ray provider might.  That would be their requirement.  She would then need to select & see a PCP.
Gina is also wanting to see an acupuncturist for this ailment, and I explained that alternative medicine, which is where acupuncture falls under, will need pre-approval with Zion. She asked will the sessions with the acupuncturist go towards the $1000? I told her it should, if Zion approves the treatment plan via pre-approval process. I believe Gina is going the xray first  route and reach out to the acupuncturist to read the reports and come up with a treatment plan to share with Zion.
I mentioned she might see a PCP to just get that xray referral and go from there with what she has in mind too.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 13:57:10', '2023-06-12 13:57:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120659073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120690002', 'Feyisara Adaramola', NULL, 'Member &amp; Children $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-12 13:49:42', '2023-06-12 13:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120659068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109093012', 'Yuwen Cen', NULL, '6-12-2023:  Yuwen called.  She has to have some diagnostic tests and biopsy(s) per her PCP.  She called the gyno sugg & they told her w/out ins, she cannot make an appt.  I told her that''s extremely unusual and she is a ''cash-pay'' pt, so if they will not accept ''cash'' pymt, she may need to select a diff provider.
     She thought she could use her Planstin, but my experience is the providers that req "ins", will be calling to get conf the treatment/biopsy, etc., are covered & she''d be back to sq one, so I kept to the above instead of thinking this is a good idea since it''s purely ''prev''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-12 13:42:16', '2023-06-12 13:42:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120659063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109791001', 'Sondra Sanfilippo', NULL, '6-12-2023:  Sondra''s husb called re: "thinks they were mischarged for their last mo cont."  Told him, since he''s not on the memb I cannot speak to her memb directly.  But, said:  We had an inadvertant duplicate charge to our MEC plans in trying to become compliant to the gvmt requirements, but the overcharges were ref 6/6/23.  He is looking at their May stmt &amp; will make sure the ref shows on their June stmt &amp; call if not.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-12 13:33:27', '2023-06-12 13:33:27'),
