  ('zcrm_1579374000120659042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '6-12-2023:  James called.  He wants to see the dr for a urologist that spec in ED.  I sent him a list of urologists w/in 24 miles of his zip = all highest qual &amp; fair priced.  He knows I cannot tell if the docs spec in ED.  He''ll call around &amp; let us know if other questions come up.  Talked about presenting as ''cash-pay'', deadline, RX quotes, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-12 12:51:50', '2023-06-12 13:12:24'),
