  ('zcrm_1579374000120656023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115996020', 'Cord Dorcey', NULL, '06.12.2023 Cord called so he can start his MAP process for therapy. I guided him through the member portal and updates page to the MAP link, but he could not see it there. I went ahead and emailed him via CRM the link. He opened and signed, and I went over the page briefly and guided him to the ways he can connect with them to start his sessions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 12:39:16', '2023-06-12 12:39:16'),
