  ('zcrm_1579374000120659034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112459002', 'Cathi Amaya-Sciacca', NULL, '6-12-2023:  Cathi called asking about dental.  I told her the MPB.Health pkg has some discount, but it sounds like she''s looking for true dental policy.  She has her advisor, Christine Corsini''s #, but I trans her to the one we have on file.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-12 12:08:08', '2023-06-12 12:08:08'),
