  ('zcrm_1579374000120624097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119157002', 'William Young', NULL, 'Angela''s e-mail:  angelabelieves@gmail.com

6-12-2023:  Angela called.  William goes by Greg for future ref.
     - She''s filling out her child''s camp registration & needed help.  She only has the MPB.Health ref card & didn''t see a ''policy #''.  We went over how to use that card, this is not ''trad ins'', so no ''policy #''.  Did a sm amt of educ, diff comp, they are on Direct, so waiting period, etc.  How to present for anything, waiting period, etc.  Made sure she has Zion''s ph # & trans her to them so they can get her the letter showing healthcare.
     - Sent her new ''Welcome Call'' invite.  She wants to get w/Greg so they can find a time to listen together. She will use William''s legal name so our staff can find them & know which plan they are under for the call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-12 10:59:18', '2023-06-12 10:59:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120645018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103620002', 'Courtney Buie', NULL, 'Member was sent over to me from concierge, member needs to cancel due to now receiving employer benefits. She was very pleased with our plan and service.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-12 10:44:26', '2023-06-12 10:44:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120640032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103620002', 'Courtney Buie', NULL, '06.12.2023 Courtney called  to cancel her membership. I double checked with Jeffrey on teams to see if he''s the right party to send her to, and he welcomed the call. 
I direct transferred her to Jeffrey Bursteen. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 10:40:11', '2023-06-12 10:40:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120640021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007057004', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, '06.12.2023 Joseph called to ask about the insurance ID number he could use on his application. After confirming his account, we learned that all of his contact information is out dated. 
I learned he has Liberty Mutual, so I referred him to them to ask his questions, per Cari and Jen''s previous coaching.
Then I guided him via member portals and updates page, to find the MPB member change form to update his: Email, Phone number and physical address. Lastly, I transferred him to Liberty Mutual. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 09:58:58', '2023-06-12 09:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120640016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929148', 'Ray Coleman', NULL, '06.12.2023 Crystal from Planstin called again regarding Michelle Coleman''s incorrect birthday year on their plan.
On their plan, Michelle''s birthday year is showing as 1960. HOWEVER THE CORRECT year is 1962.
Crystal is receiving calls from the member regarding this discrepancy, but we cannot change anything on our end at MPB, without a signed form from the member. I shared that with Crystal and told her that I emailed them the same day her and I spoke. 
TODAY, I called them at the number provided here in the plan (while Crystal was still on line with me), it went to straight to VM, I left them a VM sharing: My name, Company I work for, Reason for calling and our Concierge Consultant phone number to call us back so we can help them with this change. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 09:45:58', '2023-06-12 10:05:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120640011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117456002', 'Kelly Pieropan', NULL, '06.12.2023 Jennifer called to learn if her daughter Ashlee will be covered for the rest of the month, or will her college insurance end upon graduation? I told her with us, you pay for the month ahead, so you would be covered till the end of the month. 
She is going to call the university to double check with them. She is interested in adding Ashlee to their plan, but wasn''t sure when is the best time so she''d covered. I told her as long as it is done by the 20, earlier is preferred for it to bein in the next month.
Jennifer also wasn''t sure why her billing is different and looks like they are being overcharged. The billing looked more than it would be just the RPB pricing mishap, so I doubled checked with Jen and Cari via teams if Patti would be the best party to transfer them too or share this with, and Jen confirmed that it is. I messaged Patti via teams, but Pattie shared if there are members that have not been refunded or members that were refunded wrong that I need to give their names to John Kach.  He is the one that is taking care of this.
I told Patti that I will forward this information to Jen and Cari, and I did via teams. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-12 09:38:22', '2023-06-12 12:06:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120640003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114059001', 'Sanjai Dayal', NULL, '06.12.2023 Sanjai called to attain clarification on the following items due to a medical event of being diagnosed with testicular cancer:
1-the new platform, to complete Zion''s requests
2-why he''s not showing up in their system when he tries to open a medical need
3-Are treatments like; oncology Dietician treatment and sperm banking covered in the need
4-is his coverage hindered due to his plan changing
Sanjai was concerned about what he might be missing out on when he changed plans and/or IUA''s, given his learned diagnosis. He discovered this medical event in the middle of his changing from Secure to Care+ and from 5000 IUA to 1000 IUA. I suggested that he speak to Zion for the stated items listed above.
