  ('zcrm_1579374000120516051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '6-8-23 James is thrilled to have the out of network benefits now with moving back to SECURE. He will complete the Change Form and move forward. He needs a colonoscopy soon. He will try to go to Aspen Medical Hospital assuming they''ll accept the RBP. They want July 1st start date for access to SECURE and wellness.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-08 12:20:34', '2023-06-08 12:20:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120516034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131740002', 'Anzhelika Siloyan', NULL, '6-8-23 Anzhelika found me on the C4 site for brokers in Louisville. She is 43, Peter is 52 and Jonah is 12. They live in Louisville and moved here in 2020. Anz is taking a leave of absence and resigning at the end of June. So, they need benefits for July 1st. They are currently paying about $700 and the employer is paying the rest for a total cost around $1000. The full cost might be more than that. They are all healthy. Peter and Jonah are active cyclists. Husband is taking an occasional med for something that is minor. She didn''t reveal and couldn''t remember the name of the medication. She understands the pre-x clause and how to obtain meds at the best price. The want to keep Dr. Cheryl Cavanaugh and Coal Creek Family Practice Drs. They already have 2 HSA''s and want to combine them and happy to fund them. I sent her the samples of Anthem plans that start at $979.73 for cheapest bronze plan and go up from there. I described SECURE for $915/$1000 and she seemed happy with that and not interested in higher IUA''s. She didn''t want to reveal her income but it''s well above $100K, so likely won''t receive a subsidy of any kind, hence wanting to look at other options. Will want a July 1st start date. She will share with her husband and get back to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-08 12:06:22', '2023-06-08 12:06:22'),
