  ('zcrm_1579374000120516019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101203001', 'KERRY SAYLES', NULL, '06.08.2023 Kerry called to learn how to proceed after getting into an accident on Monday. She seems ok, and says she is lucky.
