  ('zcrm_1579374000120519014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114059001', 'Sanjai Dayal', NULL, '6-8-2023:  Katrina called.  Sanjai had a diagnosis May 20th of prostate cancer (= they were still on the orig Secure 1k IUA & req''d chg to Care+5k on 5/19/23 eff 6/1/23.).  His surgery was 6/8/23 as it''s a very aggresive prostate cancer.  She needed to conf how to handle things:
     ''Cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, will be resp for IUA*
     Was unsure if they have to leave hosp same day as surg - let her know that will be up to the doc.  This is not trad ins that will mandate it for them.  But, if their records from the doc say, "told pt to go home & they refused", the extra time may not be shareable.
     Asked about chemo: let her know "issue" spec & explained ongoing vs 12mos or >.  
     * W/the chg to their IUA & the fact that the dates may be wonky, I did not commit to which IUA they will be resp for = worst case scenario is 5k.
     - Katrina did not understand what they''d purch, so we talked about pkg, diff comp, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-08 11:31:04', '2023-06-08 11:54:36'),
