  ('zcrm_1579374000120519003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113215002', 'Morgan Vaive', NULL, '6-8-2023:  Morgan put in a tckt to find out how best to go about maint labs for her son''s tests. Note: Care+, newer memb, but high cholestrol is part of what they are monitoring & an exception in Zion''s guidelines.
