  ('zcrm_1579374000120473060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119080002', 'Drew Workman', NULL, '06.07.2023 Shelly called to learn the best way for her son to get a prescription filled for his cruise on Saturday. She specifically asked if CirrusMD can prescribe him the medication. I explained to her that they usually are able to prescribe medications as long as they are not controlled substances or some antibiotics.
