  ('zcrm_1579374000120473055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910125', 'Thomas Smith', NULL, '06.07.2023 Tom called to cancel his membership due to aging into Medicare. We spoke briefly and I explained that our policy is to send the members over to their advisors for cancellations. He requested an email that noted our conversation. I sent him the following:

