  ('zcrm_1579374000120463026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055626044', 'James Young', NULL, '6-7-23 I called Julie and she wants to include wellness again. James thinks they are paying $1400 a month. I checked their account and they are paying $780 and billing looks accurate. She was thrilled and is also thrilled for $915/$1000 for SECURE to add wellness back. She asked about going to Valley View for wellness and wanted to look up the network. I let her know she has in and out of network benefits now. So, there''s nothing to look up as long as they will bill to insurance. She''s happy! She will discuss it with James and call me later today or tomorrow to upgrade. They also do some of their appt here in Boulder. Their daughter will be going to CU next year as well, so she can choose drs. here.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-07 15:32:32', '2023-06-07 15:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120463018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '6-7-23 Reached Lynn and she figured out how to upload the bills herself to Zion. She got my broken vm from Monday and heeded to warning of the 6 month time limit. She was very appreciative of my calls and email to make sure she met the deadline. The first bill was via email to her in April and the next a paper one which is when she jumped on handling it. She''s all set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-07 15:18:10', '2023-06-07 15:18:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120463013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '6-6-23 Left her a vm to help her with a new ER visit that she''s just getting bills for. This is from Jan. I called and left her a vm today and on Monday to make sure she meets the deadline.  I also sent her an email yesterday. I''ll try again. I gave her MPB Concierge # too.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-07 15:14:04', '2023-06-07 15:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120433091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116124002', 'Ashley Pendrick', NULL, 'Member submitted change from to remove dependents from membership eff 7/1/23.  I will change billing &amp; notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-07 14:37:05', '2023-06-07 14:37:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120433081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083544002', 'Matthias Hilger', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 7/1/23.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-07 14:29:30', '2023-06-07 14:29:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120474018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118268012', 'Robert Thompson', NULL, '6-7-2023:  Patricia called.  She was confused & thought they will use their Planstin card when they go see the cardiologist.  We did some major education: ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev care only.  You''ll never present a card except for ''prev care''.   She''s extremely confused on what ''prev care'' is.
     Rbt went to the ER on 6/2/2023 & has a follow-up visit on 6/20/2023 w/a cardiologist.  [She thought that would be ''prev care''.]  I tried to explain the diff between ''prev'' & this follow-up visit = a part of the ''med need'' = all one ''issue'' = one IUA of $2500.  The ER didn''t want any pymt, but is giving them a disc for ''cash-pay'' & will send them the inv/bill.
     She''ll plan to present as ''cash-pay'' w/the cardiologist & at that point will call us to learn how to connect w/the healthshare comp to set up their memb portal w/then so she can sub the ''med need''.  We discussed the 6-mos deadline for sub.
     - RX:  They''ve put Rbt onto two medications.  One was ~$15 for the month.  The other is Eliquis & >$500/mo (taking 5mg, 1bid, = #60/mo).  The pharmacy gave her a coupon for the first month free.  We went into detail on connecting BEFORE their next fill because we will want to make sure we read the curr guidelines at the time to know how they can sub this super exp RX as part of the ''med need''.  Then I also let her know that down the road, we can approach our Int Shopper & gave her Dec 2022 pricing (Eliquis 5md, #168 = ~$220), but at that point we have to plan ahead because shipping can take up to 4 weeks.
        In all the discussion, we got sidetracked & did not finish talking about submitting the RX Quote req form.  Maybe we can do that next time.  She''s rec''d a lot of info from us today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-07 14:21:48', '2023-06-07 15:47:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120463008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667149', 'Tonya Cauduro', NULL, '6-7-23 Left vm for Tanya bc Patti said she got new employer benes. I will walk her through the cancellation process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-07 14:21:33', '2023-06-07 14:21:33'),
