  ('zcrm_1579374000120474013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '6-7-2023:  Asiye called to notify us of which doctor (counselor) she chose for her daughter.  I made sure she has Mazz &amp; Sull ph # &amp; trans her there.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-07 13:17:50', '2023-06-07 13:17:50'),
