  ('zcrm_1579374000120473027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118268012', 'Robert Thompson', NULL, '06.07.2023 Patricia called to know how to proceed with getting coverage for her husband, Robert''s, ER visit last Friday. I explained the process to present herself as a cash-pay patient, she said they did. I also recommended that they call them back and request the itemized billing, and if it is not available yet, to ask when will they be able to share it. I reminded her to fulfill the IUA $2500, or close to it, and call us back to begin a medical need request. 
Patricia also wanted to confirm how to proceed with preventative appointments in finding doctors and I explained that Planstin is moving away from the PHCS network into the RBP price model instead, where the doctor''s office will collaborate billing/pricing with Planstin in order to move forward with the coverage.
I suggested that Patricia add her husband''s email as well, for the telehealth portion of their plan, and while we were in the form (after I guided her through the member portal and updates page), she remember she needed to update their mailing address too, so she did that as well. She added her husband''s email and put it as the primary email, kept hers but requested it to be secondary. Patricia will call us back if she has more time to go over more elements about her plan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-07 12:52:54', '2023-06-07 12:52:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120474008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104128', 'Lindsay Tollefson', NULL, '6-7-2023:  Lindsay called.  She''s moving to GA &amp; she wanted to see if there''s anything special she needs to do.  While we were on the phone she was completing the chg of add form.   She''ll keep an eye on her e-mail for the new Planstin ID Card since we are moving to no ntwk req''d for the ''prev care'', which will be helpful when she''s estab new docs in GA.  She''ll call if she needs help with find good docs when she''s ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-07 12:28:59', '2023-06-07 12:28:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120473022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862130', 'Marion Steed', NULL, '06.07.2023 Marion called concerned about charges that exceed the usual $325. Supposedly, as explained in Planstin''s email, it should show a separation of charges NOT additional charges, which in this case is $50.
