  ('zcrm_1579374000120473008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010220053', 'Matthew Freije', NULL, '06.07.2023 Matthew called needing a refresher on how to proceed with seeing a doctor for the pain in his lower back. I am not familiar with this plan so I scrolled down to see what type of coverage he might have. Matthew is unsure of who to go see for this pain, and we thought he could go see a primary care to learn about his ailment, and go from there. However when I started talking about how to find the physician he usually goes for, for a preventative appointment, he quickly said that he cancelled it a few months ago, and the premium went down, so he believes it went through. I wanted to double check and see what Admin123 shares, but I could not pull him up there. 
I reached out to Jen and Cari via teams, Cari reiterated that THAT plan is catastrophic (Zion only) with the option to keep the preventative if they already had it, which Matthew did but then recently cancelled it.
I also reached out to Patti via teams, and she confirmed his cancellation and that I need to find him in the green side in Admin123 instead of the blue side. It turns out that I don''t have access to the toggle that 
