  ('zcrm_1579374000120379168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099358002', 'Katia Mazuera', NULL, '6-6-2023:  Katia''s husb called, so I went over general instructions on the following.  He signed her up for the plan, but understood about not being able to talk specifics until she sub the permission form (took him online to the form, he''ll have her draw her signature & complete the form when she gets home.  He''ll remind us next time he calls in that they submitted it so we can document receipt of the form then.)  Katie''s english isn''t as good as his & she would love if we get a spanish speaking teammember.  I let him know we''ve tried, but this can be a diff position.  He seemed to totally understand.
     - He doesn''t think they ever rec''d any card:  We went over only time you''ll ever need to present a card is for ''prev care''.  That in all other situations you present as: no ''ins'', no card to present'', ''cash-pay'' pt, ask about ''cash-pay'' disc, offer to pay up to the IUA (which I could not confirm since he doesn''t tech have an approval from yet for me to disc Katia''s details), then ask them to bill you for the bal so you can get the cash together.
     - Katia''s english is not very good, so that''s why she hasn''t been willing to do a ''Welcome Call''.  If we get a spanish speaker, then she''ll reconsider.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-06 14:48:18', '2023-06-07 15:54:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120420031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109171001', 'Amy Hindman', NULL, 'Amy called into the concierge line this afternoon needing some information regarding her plan. She was needing a "Member Number" to put down on a form she is filling out for a camp that she is going to be attending in case anything was to happen. I informed her that she would need to reach out to Zion Health to be given her member number on Zion''s behalf as MPB does not assign member numbers with our plans here. Secondly, Amy said she was told she is supposed to receive $200 a month on some sort of card every month from us. I needed to double check with Michele about this as I have never heard of any sort of card with us putting funds onto it to send out to members. I was informed that is something regarding an HMA account that involves the member''s employer group. I let Amy know to reach out to her Advisor Justin Garrett for him to explain to her in more detail. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-06-06 13:39:17', '2023-06-06 13:39:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, '6/6/2023:  Jimmy called my office # &amp; LM.  He has everything to sub to Zion for his shoulder.  
     - I called back &amp; ILM:  Zion just chg''d the sub process.  I sent him the new updated temp with some added instructions.  Let him know how to contact me.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-06 13:22:45', '2023-06-06 13:33:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098248002', 'Marcus Alig', NULL, '06.06.2023 Marcus called concerned about charges that exceed the usual $ amount that he pays. Supposedly, as explained in Planstin''s email, it should show a separation of charges NOT additional charges, which in this case is $50.
I added Marcus to the list of members that need to be reimbursed, and shared with Jennifer, my supervisor. Marcus was understanding and kind, and will check back with us next week, in case it did not get resolved (him being reimbursed). 
Marcus also asked how to proceed with maneuvering the preventative appointments via the new RBP model. I briefly explained, to the best of my knowledge due to the lack of guidance/education/training and preparation on this subject by saying that the members will need to make sure to set in place for the doctor''s office to collaborate billing and pricing with Planstin. Marcus asked what if they do not want to do that, and I told him bluntly that it sounds like the would want to members to move on to the next provider.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-06 13:08:58', '2023-06-06 13:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120370178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120386010', 'Timothy Hackett', NULL, 'Spoke to Timothy, nice guy, 39 years old, wife and two children, one is newly born in the last 2 weeks. Was paying $2,300 per month for ACA, with a $15k deductible. I discussed all the details of the Secure plan, he is self employed. He said let''s do it and I directed him to enrollment.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-06 12:55:34', '2023-06-06 12:55:34'),
