  ('zcrm_1579374000120379139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '6-6-23 Emily and Mike are in Europe on vacation and they just received another collections vm from the same preventative Dr. visit from the above. I gathered all of the notes and sent it to JT to talk with David Berg about.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-06 12:01:00', '2023-06-06 12:01:00'),
