  ('zcrm_1579374000120379131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106618002', 'Simon Dullingham', NULL, '6-6-2023:  Simon called.  His doc needs him to get a CT scan.  We walked thru how to present, no ins, ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, offer to pay 1k & ask them to bill bal, etc.   I let him know about the new Zion Memb Port req''d to sub a ''med need''.  He says he has another ''med need'' going for a torn achilies tendon (?), but it doesn''t look like we''ve been working with him.  I made sure he knows what happens with 3 x IUA, then if 4th >$500 IUA waived (my mentioning this seemed to annoy him).  Made sure he has Zion''s ph # & got him over to cust srvc to get help setting up his portal.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-06 11:24:52', '2023-06-06 11:38:17'),
