  ('zcrm_1579374000120352103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826196', 'Christopher Howe', NULL, '06.06.2023 Tina called to confirm how to proceed in submitting bills regarding her procedure tomorrow. I sent her a med need request link via CRM, but she did not receive it. I went ahead and sent it via Outlook and she was able to locate it in her spam folder.
I reminded Tina that Zion has changed their process and link to submitting a need request and now it is rendering the members to contact Zion first (we think it is a one time thing then the member is set), and get set up with them with their new system. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-06 10:36:18', '2023-06-06 10:50:24'),
