  ('zcrm_1579374000120352098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '06.06.2023 Peter responded to my coupon generated yesterday, per his request via email, and asked:
"Hello Nahla,

Can I use this $11.68 perscription at CVS as well as OSCO?  It’s says CVS too?  Let me know.  If not what would CVS on Islington St. in Portsmouth, NH 03801 charge and is there a coupon for that one?"

I responded with and included a coupon, per Peter''s convenience: "Good morning Peter, 
I wish it was that easy. Those pharmacies listed mean that the discount website, RXGO, has a contract with them (as long as you see the actual logo and not just plain black text). If you look at the fine print where they have their phone number listed, usually under the list of pharmacies, you will that the coupon is strictly clipped for that specific pharmacy.
Attached is the least expensive coupon I found for CVS."            NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-06 10:20:40', '2023-06-06 10:20:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120420016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110495002', 'Darin Zogopoulos', NULL, 'Darin called in regard to what and how going to an Urgent Care is to be paid. He was having a lot of difficulty speaking due to a constant cough he was dealing with, so it was extremely difficult to understand/hear anything he was saying when spelling his first and last name. I had to ask for the spelling of his last name to be repeated to pull up his account here. Darin''s wife repeated the spelling, but I couldn''t understand her either as she sounded very far away from the phone. I eventually got their account pulled up and was able to explain Darin needing to present himself as a self-paying patient and is responsible for the $1000 IUA he has and nothing more. There is no network, so he is free to go to any Urgent Care of his choice. That is all he needed to know/.KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-06-06 09:22:54', '2023-06-06 09:22:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120421028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102730014', 'Jennifer Weiffenbach', NULL, 'When this membership was split back in 11/22 only the Sedera portion was split.  This member  remained on RCI membership with her Ex spouse Jason where she still is.  I will reach out to ember to explain that I will be cancelling her from Jason''s membership &amp; re-enrolling her on her own eff 7/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-06 09:22:46', '2023-06-06 09:22:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120370098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120343002', 'Scott Aamodt', NULL, 'Left Scott another voicemail message to give me a call.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-06 09:18:38', '2023-06-06 09:18:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120421023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102730014', 'Jennifer Weiffenbach', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Partially Self Directed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-06 09:15:53', '2023-06-06 09:15:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120420011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, 'Melissa called in and said her daughter needs to go in and have an Eye exam to just have a regular check-up making sure everything is going well and no issues with her eyesight. Melissa wanted to know if there were any sort of discounts for this type of appointment. I let her know that eye exams or anything related to eye care appointments, are under their IUA of $2500. Melissa lastly asked to make sure that she can go to any doctor that they want, to which I told her she is correct that there is no network she needs to stay in and is free to go to any provider of their choice. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-06-06 09:09:06', '2023-06-06 09:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120421013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092335002', 'Sharon Kolodney', NULL, 'Member filled out cancellation as she will be aging into Medicare eff 7/23 I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-06 08:55:24', '2023-06-06 08:55:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120421008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048283052', 'Abbod Attallah', NULL, 'I have termed member w/Redirect &amp; member did not complete transition w/Sedera so membership will tern eff 6/30/23.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-06 08:50:13', '2023-06-06 08:50:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120421003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017950001', 'Robin Kemp', NULL, 'Robin submitted new banking info for her MCS plan &amp; also E&amp;O.  I emailed her and asked if she wanted commissions sent there as well.  Awaiting response.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-06 08:17:09', '2023-06-06 08:17:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111063013', 'Stephanie Hoffman', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Stephanie called us, but she''s direct with Zion from best I can tell.  So I made sure she has their phone # &amp; let her know they need to help her.  [Zion chg''d the ''med need'' process last Fri, 6/2/2023 anyway.  So either way, she''ll need to work w/them to set-up her portal.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 18:12:42', '2023-06-05 18:12:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Frances called.  She has a treatment plan she would like to submit to get prior approval.  Zion chg''d their sub process last Fri, 6/2.  So I sent her the updated temp &amp; walked her thru who to call &amp; what to do.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 16:58:58', '2023-06-05 18:05:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117926002', 'Karen Wedul', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Karen called.  
     - RX Quotes: She has an ear infection & the doc just called in 2 RXs she''s picking-up.  Here are the coupons I sent.  Because she''s in a hurry & on her way there, Pavilions (where the RXs were called in) was only slightly more exp then the other stores, so that''s what I sent her:
          - Amoxicillin-Clavulanate 875-125mg, #14 tabs = $10.55 on RXGo
          - Ofloxacin Otic 0.3%, 5ml = $11.07 on RXGo    [This comes in a 10ml, but you can buy 2 x 5ml for cheaper.  She doesn''t see a sz on the rx.]
     We also disc how to handle RX Quote req on the website for future needs.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 16:35:41', '2023-06-05 16:37:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118300002', 'Tammy Kindorf', NULL, '06.05.2023 Tammy called to get a better understanding of her plan. I spent 45 minutes with Tammy  trying to explain having three sections: Essentials, Preventative and Medical Cost Sharing. I went over Preventative (as confusing as it is right now), and CirrusMD (briefly), and I told her she needs to complete the call in order to learn more.
I messaged Jen to let her know that Tammy is trying to get a welcome call in this week, but scheduled it for the 13th on accident. She tried to reschedule it while on line with me (shoot me), but the system was too slow and would not take her there. I told her I''d leave Jen a note via teams to let her know.
She lives in a rural area and feels intimidated by this plan already.
I emailed Tammy another link to schedule her welcome call and another email with the MPB change form so she can add her husband''s email and change her mistyped address. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 16:10:03', '2023-06-05 16:10:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Mary called asking about labs:
     - We went over the extremely limited items covered by the ACA MEC.  She will conf w/doc the labs desired.  Then we went over the disc site &amp; she will go that route unless it''s basic lipid panel (STD, or sucrose = maybes, ck w/Planstin).
     - HSA: Went over inst on how/where/what needed to start.  She''ll conf w/her acct amt allowed, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 15:44:38', '2023-06-05 18:09:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', 'Rec''d Perm to Discuss w/husb: Chet Dykstra 6-5-2023', '(see Cognito Forms)

6-5-2023:  Chet called he''s trying to understand billing for Lauri''s plan.  However, it looks off to me:
     - I can see $425 was being pulled from ACH end in 8828 (= his cking according to Chet).  But, there haven''t been any payments since 1-3-2023.
     - It shows next pymt would be: $464.78 - BUT, I did not mention this amt to Chet.  He''s already panicked & I think this will need reapplication, rather than continuation?  This is an old Direct plan w/Sedera as healthshare comp & it does not look like the Sedera conversion was completed.  I suspect that may be why there are no further pymts.
     - Both Admin123 & the CRM show this as an active acct, but I think it may not be?  Because I am unsure, Chet is going to LM for Patti.  I sent her a chat as well with all of this info.  Maybe Wendy will need to get involved?  But, at this point I''m going have Patti dbl ck my findings first.  Chet knows Patti is gone for the day.
     - Chet has Lauri''s mamm receipt he wants to submit.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 15:33:07', '2023-06-05 18:11:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372147', 'Aimee Day', NULL, '6-5-23 Aimee is still enrolled even though Amber Rego, James Kreitman and Greg Dennis all cancelled with the group cancellation as of 5/31/23.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-05 15:19:23', '2023-06-05 15:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', 'SENT Perm. to Discuss MPB Plan Form to Discuss with Spouse 06.05.2023', '06.05.2023 Spouse called to check and see if Lauri''s plan was still active. I was able to confirm that, HOWEVER, I did share with him that I would like to speak more to the plan with him and cannot b/c he is not on it.
I asked him to let her know that I sent the MPB permission to discuss the plan form, and would like her to please complete it. It is very concise and will take no time in submitting. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 15:07:57', '2023-06-05 15:07:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '06.05.2023 Leah called to ask about chiro coverage for Michele. I told her it is covered via Sedera medical need, similar how Zion handles it with a treatment plan from the chiro presented via medical need to Sedera. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 14:59:12', '2023-06-05 16:19:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120407028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119464002', 'Sandra Chase', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-05 14:53:22', '2023-06-05 14:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '6-5-23 Anna is looking for the 1 cent in her bank account.  We had to call Sedera and spoke with Christine who told Anna the account # showing which turned out to be Anna''s phone # not her bank account. She updated her bank account information and used a temp pwd. She will look tomorrow and finish the process and then change her pwd one final time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-05 14:48:19', '2023-06-05 15:17:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120386002', 'Melissa Daigle', NULL, '6-5-23 Melissa came to me via Kristy Tripp. Melissa watched the video. They are a family of 4 living in Frenchtown, MT. Her husband is on VA already, so he''s all set. She''s 45 and kids are 18 and 15. She just joined a local DPC for her and the kids for $145 a month. So, DIRECT is best for her at $1000/$480. She''s thrilled at this option. She has hypothyroidism and takes meds to control it with no problems. Her daughter has acne and takes meds. She understands the pre-x clause in relation to those items. She and her husband own a construction company, so self-employed. The cost for a family are not good for ACA for them. She joined right away for a July 1st start date. She sees the value and benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-05 14:16:18', '2023-06-05 14:16:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120407023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119704002', 'Jonmi Brunette', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-05 14:08:00', '2023-06-05 14:08:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120407018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119607002', 'Carolyn Finnell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-05 14:07:41', '2023-06-05 14:07:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113604002', 'Charlotte Hudson', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Melissa called.  She''s trying to get letters that show she has coverage, as she''s being told w/out that she must have Cobra.  Gave her both Planstin &amp; Zion''s ph #s &amp; told her to start w/Planstin because they are sometimes doing pw for their sister comp Zion.  But, if Planstin can''t she''ll have the # &amp; can call Zion 2nd.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 13:39:06', '2023-06-05 13:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956089', 'C. Michaele Hogan', NULL, '06.05.2023 Michaele called dealing with a respiratory infection that rendered her unconscious and in the ER. 
She paid for her visit, and is calling us to get help to open a medical need. I sent her the instructions on how to submit bills to Zion via CRM, however it is my understanding that she will need to contact Zion to set up on their new system of in order to continue to with the process of opening a medical need. I went ahead and let her go ( I did not transfer her, b/c she was coughing a lot and thought she might want to get a breather first and call them herself). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 12:41:43', '2023-06-05 12:41:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099559002', 'Phonesavanh Phongsavan', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Phonesavanh & her sister called together.  They haven''t started the ''med need''s for her husb & son.  Last Friday the whole sub proc chg''d w/Zion, so I sent the new temp & guided them to call the 1-888# in the e-mail for help.  
     We did discuss 2 separate issues.  Sub husb''s as one.  Then sub a second ''med need'' for her son.  Tried to explain it''s best not to use claim, copay, & other ''ins words'' & why.
     They had questions I could not answer, but I assured them that Zion will walk them thru the process since it''s new.  They seemed fine with the guidance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 12:37:02', '2023-06-05 12:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Mitchell called wanting to tt his telehealth.  I reminded him how to access CirrusMD via comp, smart ph, &amp; app or online.  He seemed to recall using it before &amp; will let us know if he needs further help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 12:24:54', '2023-06-05 12:24:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '06.05.2023 Peter emailed an RX request for Famotidine, 40MG, 90 Tablets. I was able to generate two coupons for him and email him via outlook:
I was able to price your RX request in Portsmouth, NH area. The zip code that accompanied that search was 03801, so I went with that, and I hope it''s convenient for you.
I went ahead and included two coupons, one for a Hanna Pharm and the other is for Osco, just in case one pharmacy is better than the other.
Please let me know if you have any questions or need anything adjusted to these coupons. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 12:22:33', '2023-06-06 10:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196002', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '6-5-23 See other account for Brian to see all of my notes over time!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-05 12:12:55', '2023-06-05 12:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', NULL, '06.05.2023 Received an email from Anne-Marie regarding the MPB change form. She said it was asking her to change her spouse and that''s not what she was wanting to do. I was not very clear  with exactly the struggle she was having, so I called her and left her a VM to call us back regarding her email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 12:04:17', '2023-06-05 12:04:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598015', 'Steve Wilson', NULL, '06.05.2023 Steve called concerned about charges that exceed the usual $300. Supposedly, as explained in Planstin''s email, it should show a separation of charges NOT additional charges, which in this case is $25, two payments of $275 &amp; $50.
I added Steve to the list of members that need to be reimbursed, and shared with Jennifer, my supervisor. Steve was understanding and kind, and will check back with us around billing time 20th, in case it did not get resolved (him being reimbursed). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 11:57:45', '2023-06-05 12:01:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120376021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108610009', 'Paul Raby', NULL, 'Paul phoned in regarding getting information on dental and vision. He called in asking for Kelly. His advisor is Misty Berryman, he hasn''t been able to connect with her. I emailed him the info from Denali.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-05 11:54:01', '2023-06-05 11:54:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120379006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105287009', 'Christina Rampone', NULL, '6-5-2023:  Christina called.
     - MAP:  She wanted to know how to get the 1 counseling appt/mo.  We disc the pattern of 4, then waiting period, etc, to 12 appts pd per yr.  She had her MPB.Health card there, so she knows the ph # to call & was not at a comp for us to go to the site together.  She knows super sm ntwk, but high quality per reviews of people who have utilized srvcs.  Can pay during waiting periods, etc.
     - Prev Care:  Wants to make an appt for her annual visit, but had questions on ntwk.  We disc that new card on it''s way.  We agreed she''ll make her appt & let them know her new ins card is on its way, since this am it was conf the RBP cards are going out this week both via Planstin e-mail & hard copies.  She seemed fine w/that.  She''ll send doc''s off her ins card when she rec''s it, prior to her appt to get conf they will bill.
        We went into the healthcare.gov site so she could see what is & is not prev care.  Talked about keeping appt all ''prev care'' for med coding, what to expect w/labs, call us if she''s int in dis lab site, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-05 11:17:14', '2023-06-05 12:53:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120376008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120398001', 'Cole Rhodes', NULL, 'Spoke to Cole, he just turned 26, was bounced off his parents plan. He has his own business, qualifies for Secure. Went over details, pricing, and guidelines. Emailed him enrollment. He asked if he could be effective immediately, I spoke to John K, he told me if we get the enrollment today, we can adjust it it back to the first. I explained, no proration, and full amount would be due today. Cole is fine with that.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-05 10:46:42', '2023-06-05 10:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107285002', 'Rick Rife', NULL, '06.05.2023 Patricia called asking about the NEW RBP price model Planstin cards that she thought were going out last week. I confirmed her account, and she realized they may have sent the information to her husbands email. Patricia went to check her husband''s email and call us back. She has appointments that she would like to prepare for.
I consulted with Cari and Jen via teams to get more clarification on how to guide the members on this new process, and it turns out that what we originally were told in the last 10 AM Monday meeting (the week before last) was that they are sending information via the 2nd, but now they''re saying they are getting them out this week. I asked about the Vimeo with Steven from Planstin to see if there''s any coaching there that could be used towards guiding the members, but Jen and Cari said there really isn''t much there for that.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 10:45:19', '2023-06-05 10:45:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752088', 'Randall Simmering', NULL, '06.05.2023 Randy called thinking he called Zion, asking for his 1095 tax forms. I let him know that is more Planstin, and guided him to check his email for those directions that were sent over the spring time.
Randy did not find that email, so I gave him Planstin''s number and I forwarded him there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 09:21:02', '2023-06-05 09:21:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101128002', 'Christine Altamuro', NULL, '06.05.2023 Christine called wanting an educational way to choose a facility for a hip MRI. I referred her to the healthcare bluebook. She has not completed her welcome call, and I explained to her "the thing about completing the welcome call is at the end of it, the member receives an email with a plethora of resources that goes hand in hand with the plan they are in."
I ended up emailing her, first via CRM then via Outlook, the link to HCBB. Briefly went over how to use and learn from it. Christine was glad to use the link and felt more confident. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 09:12:47', '2023-06-05 09:24:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120358003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101717002', 'Eamon Quinlan', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation eff 7/1 due to the fact that he now has Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-05 08:42:08', '2023-06-05 08:42:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120354003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120343002', 'Scott Aamodt', NULL, 'I called Scott to welcome him and to find out if he''d spoken to any advisor or just enrolled on his own. Left message for a call back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-06-05 08:39:29', '2023-06-05 08:39:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120352003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005573382', 'Rick Patrick', NULL, '.06.05.2023 Rick called concerned about his bills not being covered at the orthopedic and MRI visit.
He initially went in to Urgent Care for knee pain.He usually goes to this urgent care and it works out fine. They took an x-ray and referred him to go to see an orthopedic surgeon. He found one and went and got checked out. They did an MRI. However both the orthodpedic and the MRI facility/visit would not take his insurance.
I consulted with Cari and Jen via teams, they confirmed we at MPB no longer field questions about Liberty anymore and that the members need to speak to Liberty directly.
Rick said that he had called them a couple of weeks ago, but has not heard back, so he will try them again. I offered to transfer him and gave him the number just in case. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-05 08:08:26', '2023-06-05 08:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120350016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092335002', 'Sharon Kolodney', NULL, 'Member called in to ask about her cancellation and that she had misplaced the previous email.  I resent and told her how to submit cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-05 07:51:35', '2023-06-05 07:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120348008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064530035', 'Karen Harris', NULL, '6/5/23 -Karen called in because she fell and fractured her wrist and may possibly have some ribs that are out of place. Karen went to the ER this weekend and the doc wants her to follow up with an orthopedic specialist along with her PCP. I advised Karen on how to open a Need with Zion and to get this opened ASAP. She also inquired about chiropractic care for the ribs that are out of place and I advised Karen to get a treatment plan from her doc/chiro and submit it along with this need as it is a part of the same injury. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-05 07:27:22', '2023-06-05 07:27:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120350003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081858001', 'Michael Dawson', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-05 07:26:29', '2023-06-05 07:26:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120326004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088965009', 'Melissa Rubinstein', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 3094 Question : I used your telehealth portal cirrus md and have a complaint about a provider.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-06-05 06:00:12', '2023-06-05 06:00:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120307003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3093 Question : Don''t know where to login to my MP Health account.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-06-04 15:09:34', '2023-06-04 15:09:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120273058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update email.  I will update in A123 &amp; FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-03 12:35:32', '2023-06-03 12:35:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120273048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update their address I will update across all systems.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-03 12:28:19', '2023-06-03 12:28:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120273043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120343002', 'Scott Aamodt', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-03 12:25:59', '2023-06-03 12:25:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120279013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, '6-2-23 Bill called to cancel bc he got moved to full time at his job and given good benefits now. His benefits started June 1st. He and his kids will get benes through his company.  I told him it''s too late to cancel for June 1st with MPB. He''s ok moving forward. He can''t change his company benes to start later.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-06-02 21:42:31', '2023-06-02 21:42:31');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000120320051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '6-2-2023:  Adam called.  He hasn''t seen the new Planstin RBP e-mail come in today.  I let him know I haven''t rec''d mine either (we both ck''d spam), but as of the mgr meeting this am, they were telling us they would start going out today.  He will call again Monday if still doesn''t have anything.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-02 15:55:09', '2023-06-02 15:55:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120320043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108598001', 'Charlene Olsen', NULL, '6-2-2023:  Charlene called back - she''s trying to sub the estimate for the office visit on her Zion plan (she has Direct &amp; 1x $250 visit fee only/yr).  But, the link Nahla sent isn''t working.  We went in together and it looks like just today Zion has changed their sub process.  We tried to do it together, but both Charlene &amp; I get an error code saying the submission page is missing.  I made sure she has Zion''s ph # &amp; trans her dir.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-02 15:44:33', '2023-06-02 18:14:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120322013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, '06.01.2023 Leah called yesterday asking for clarification on some guidelines regarding changing plans within the company. Would the member, in this case Michelle Manna, lose longevity if she moved from one plan to another under the same company? More specifically, how would the present conditions be filed as, if she changed plans? She developed conditions while on this plan, but now that she wants to change, would they be considered PreX conditions? I did not have the answer to that, so I needed for Cari to come back from lunch to address this. However, we got overloaded with members calling that Cari and I could not circle back to this. At the same time, and Cari reminded me of this, the chain of command regarding educating advisors has been set in place for quite some time, to direct them to Michelle Rebal.
