  ('zcrm_1579374000120265003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096344002', 'Mark Leubscher', NULL, '06.01.23:  After being notified by Jennifer on 5/30/23,  about Sabrina''s issues and confusion, I spoke w/Denny Watkins, Dr. Patterson''s OPD Advisor yesterday and asked  him to contact Sabrina re her issues and needs, then Julia, Dr. Patterson''s administrator re: the double lab fees.  He did so and responded to me.  See below:

