  ('zcrm_1579374000120259008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Frances called in and let me know that her back issue that has come up has now gotten worse and is going to be a life long issue that she is going to be dealing with. She had her MRI and has 2 options that she can go through with. One that is a non-evasive option that can cost up to $8500 or the other option that is more costly requiring surgery. She let me know that she is not yet at her $1000 IUA but is very close and collecting all her receipts. I told her I will send her an email that explains how to submit and start her need process through Zion Health. She is going to start reaching out to Zion Health now as I suggested for her to do as there will be someone that can help walk her through everything needed to be done. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-06-01 12:47:22', '2023-06-01 12:47:22'),
