  ('zcrm_1579374000120252036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082516001', 'Brian Stark', NULL, '06.01.2023 Brian called confused as he did his research to adhere to the PHCS list, found the physician on the multiPlan Link. HOWEVER, when he shared his preventative insurance information, they claimed they have not heard of this before. I generated the list that showed his doctor''s name as the first one on the list, and emailed it to him via Outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-01 12:37:01', '2023-06-01 13:27:52'),
