  ('zcrm_1579374000120244055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391116', 'David Barricklow', NULL, '6-1-2023:  David''s employer pays for his MPB.Health & they called the concierge line together.  David has heart issues.  The employer called upset because the ''claim'' had been declined.  "What are we paying for then?"
     - We all did a call over the speaker phone there:  I did education on the components in the ''pkg'' of healthcare he has and that this isn''t ''ins''.  
          - David gave the cardiologists his RCI card & that''s who declined the claim = at least as easy fix.  We talked about RCI = ''prev care'' only, only time you need to worry about a ntwk, & ''prev care'' = only time you present a card.  
          - Sedera = healthshare & this is the component that works with illness/catastrophic events & would be the company to help with the pacemaker issue.  I conf the e-mail add & sent the temp to show them the vimeo & inst for sub a ''need'' to Sedera.  Mentioned making sure he does the ''2nd Doc'' appt so Sedera shares fully.  He said "I''ve already seen 2 cardiologists", but I let him know this isn''t just a second opinion, it''s more of an educ piece req''d for best sharing of the expenses.  Showed them Sedera''s ph # in the temp & let them know if they have any issues submitting the info, or needing help, Sedera can help.  Also, I noticed he''s been w/Sedera for >4 yrs now = longevity clause = no pre-x worries.
          - Telehealth = thru CirrusMD.  Just mentioned in passing to show the diff components = all diff comp that are not linked.
     - His boss was extremely grateful.  It sounded like he was super happy to hear that they haven''t been paying for nothing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-01 12:03:16', '2023-06-01 16:17:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120244045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100874002', 'Troy Kreutzer', NULL, '6-1-2023:  Troy''s wife called.  They want to sched the ''Welcome Call'' for his "ins" plan (I didn''t correct her).  Sent the temp to his e-mail on file here in the CRM &amp; they know to use his name &amp; the ph # they want called in the scheduler.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-01 11:45:41', '2023-06-01 11:45:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120252026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117456002', 'Kelly Pieropan', NULL, '06.01.2023 Jennifer called to set up a welcome call to better understand how their plan works. I resent her the scheduling link and added her email. I asked her to possibly add her own email to plan as well for a variety of reasons including communication and telehealth. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-01 11:11:49', '2023-06-01 11:11:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120229105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119774001', 'Dessa Scheffer', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-01 10:59:17', '2023-06-01 10:59:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120252013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099559002', 'Phonesavanh Phongsavan', '06.01.2023 SENT Permission Form to Discuss MPB Plan w/ her sister', '06.01.2023 Noy (Phonesavanh) called to better understand the deadlines for submitting bills to Zion regarding her husband''s ER visit 05.28.2023, and the information for Zion to accept the bills/invoices/receipts. I explained they need to have the names and contact information on both the receipts and invoices. 
Her son is having breathing issues and needs ENT surgery, and she was confirming it would be covered by Zion. I tried opening the guidelines, but they would not come up, so I asked Cari and Jen via teams, and Jen said as long as the surgery is due to a medical issue, it will be shared. 
She did claim, on both situations, that the facilities won''t accept the $1000 up front as down payment, and want the entire bill paid up front. So I told her to gather the documents from both situations, and then call us back and we can apply together for the medical need on both.
I emailed her via CRM the instructions on how to submit the bills to Zion. I also sent her a link to the permission form to have her sister discuss her plan with us, due to a language barrier. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-06-01 10:57:56', '2023-06-01 11:01:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120229100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119765002', 'Janice Saar', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-01 10:56:34', '2023-06-01 10:56:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120244029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110465002', 'Josiah Payne', NULL, '6-1-2023:  Kaylie call & LM w/Back Office Betties, so I called her back.  It looks like Jennifer tt her yesterday & sent her the temp to sub a ''med need''.  
     - Had baby in Aug.  No cycle for long time.  Finally had cycle in April, then after a 5 day hiatus, she started w/a super heavy flow that just kept going.  
     - Went to see the doc.  Dr orig visit $180, ultrasound = $609, plus she can see the ultrasound expense has increased by another $400 = > her 1k IUA.
        The ultrasound showed a spot, so they now want to do surgery.  The surgical center will not allow her to sched her surgery until she make a down pymt.  She''s going to see if she can get the surg cntr to send her the 40% off (for cash pay) estimate & upload that in the ''Addl Doc'' section of Zion''s ''med need'' site.  Then, I sugg''d she call later today, 6pm eastern (=4pm Zion''s time) to kindly ask if someone can help her w/the timeline since they aren''t letting her sched the surgery until she pays (they''d like 85%, but will take less).
        [The surg cntr told her they would do all the billing w/her MCS, but could not then offer the 45% off.  The disc dropped to 15%.  We did educ on how to better present & the imp of doing out own work to keep the monthly contributions down.  Otherwise, will become priced, just like trad ''ins''.]
     She''ll call if she need further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-06-01 10:29:33', '2023-06-01 11:11:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120244021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111977017', 'Michelle Norman', NULL, '6/1/23 - I followed up with Michelle after she hung up on Cari. Michelle stated that she received the cancellation form from her advisor, but she feels that MPB Health''s processes need to be streamlined better. Her hopes are that our new CEO will make those changes ASAP. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-06-01 10:18:27', '2023-06-01 10:18:27'),
