  ('zcrm_1579374000120229069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119899002', 'Tammy Allen', NULL, 'Member''s Enrollment Fee declined.  Error msg was "No Acct" which means that there is a typo in the Acct.  I reached to member, however she was on vacation and told me she would call me back on 6/5 to get correct #.   6/5-member called in and gave me corrected Acct# I reran.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-06-01 09:49:58', '2023-06-05 09:28:28'),
