  ('zcrm_1579374000120208064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, '5-31-2023:  Rbt called.  His urologist''s off called while he was at his appt.  I let her know he is a ''cash-pay'' patient, asked her to provide any ''cash-pay'' disc, no ''ins'' or ''ins card'', but he will want a pymt rec &amp; detailed inv.  That if the problem became very expensive (&gt;5k) at that point he may have help financially, but nothing for a long while...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-31 17:36:33', '2023-06-01 17:18:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120189139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '5-31-23 Jennifer called bc her son has strep and she couldn''t reach the MPB Concierge Team. I called and reached Nahla no problem. I tried to connect Jennifer with Nahla but Jennifer didn''t answer. Nahla will call her as well. I left a vm with Jennifer. She also mentioned she was scheduled to have a surgery which she decided against doing the day before the surgery was scheduled. But, Zion hadn''t paid the fee yet to the doctor, so she''s not sure it would have even happened the next day without the payment. So, she''s getting nervous now that these two scenarios took place. Hopefully with my vm and Nahla''s efforts she will feel more comfortable again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-31 17:00:16', '2023-05-31 17:00:16'),
