  ('zcrm_1579374000120189131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991007', 'Stephen Gonzales', NULL, '5-31-23 Stephen is trying to complete the verification code and struggling.  He''s going to work on this on his computer later tonight and worst case tomorrow morning. I let him know today is the deadline to keep everything running without any troubles. He will work on it. He also wants a colonoscopy soon and I coached him a little since he''s been a member for years, so no waiting period. Let him know it must be coded as wellness not diagnostic. This will be his first time ever at the age of 60. He will talk with Andre MPitsos and Matt Ross for coaching on places to go.  I also talked him through what he will need to know for the upgrade process for each step.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-31 16:55:07', '2023-05-31 16:55:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120208037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107285002', 'Rick Rife', NULL, '5-31-2023:  Patricia called:
