    - Rick had his ''prev care'' appt last wk (?) & paid cash.  I went over how to have the doc''s office bill.  He saw a Larry Sobel, but I only see 2 other Dr Sobels (all at the same loc) listed in the PHCS Ntwk Search, but they are at the same location on Bell Rd:  Sobel, Jerry B, M.D., Physical Medicine and Rehabilitation  &  Sobel, Audrey J, B.S.     Physical Therapy     4550 E Bell Rd, Ste 110     Phoenix, AZ 85032     602-385-4160.  
        Patricia will call Dr Sobel''s office & ask if Larry Sobel is a part of the PHCS ntwk.  Let them know he forgot to present his ''prev care'' ID Card & can they bill & reimb him.  She knows, since Larry isn''t listed it could be an issue for this most recent visit.
    - Patricia has several doc appt next week: has both her PCP annual appt & Well Woman visits.  She asked about ntwk & we went over the new ''prev care'' no ntwk req is supposed to be eff tomorrow, w/the new Planstin ID cards going out via e-mail on Fri, 6/2/23.  If she doesn''t see anything by Monday, she''ll ck her spam folder & get back to us since she has 2 appts next wk.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-31 16:11:17', '2023-06-01 17:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120179023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101717002', 'Eamon Quinlan', NULL, '05.31.2023 Eamon called to cancel his membership starting July. I transferred him to his advisor, per the administration''s request, Jonathan Masters. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-31 15:43:25', '2023-05-31 15:43:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120173075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102036065', 'Kimberlee Kelso', NULL, 'Member called to ask about billing error.  She also said that she had never had a Welcome call and would like to schedule one.  I sent out the Welcome Call Scheduler template.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-31 14:57:03', '2023-05-31 14:57:03'),
