  ('zcrm_1579374000120201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111239002', 'Lois Hurst', NULL, '05.31.2023 Lois called to confirm that Colonoscopies covered, and I said yes. She proceeded to say she wants to go in for a pre-examination and was wondering if that too is covered. I was unsure as I have not heard of anyone yet to have that, so I consulted Jen and Cari via teams. Both recommended this question be directed to Planstin. I offered Lois some room to play should they say no, and suggested that she present herself as a cash pay patient for THAT pre screening visit only. I explained what would take place should they pull polyps and Lois shared her understanding and her willing to speak to Planstin about the prescreening visit. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-31 10:53:35', '2023-05-31 10:59:56'),
