  ('zcrm_1579374000120116008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120135002', 'Gregory Thomsen', NULL, 'Greg and I played a little phone tag today. Finally spoke with him, nice guy, is a self employed CPA. Looking for him and his wife. Detailed out the Secure plan, he likes the HSA compatibility. Sent him my enrollment page.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-30 15:27:10', '2023-05-30 15:27:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120115003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742027', 'Larry King', NULL, 'Out of chronological order.  Realized I didn''t get this documented, although it is complete.

3-13-2023:  RX Quotes
Hy-Vee seems to save you substantially over the listed prices for Walgreens, with a total savings of more than $97.  Online there is a Hy-Vee listed about 15-16 miles and approximately 20-minutes from you.
------------------------------------------------
Here are the details on the coupons I''ve attached.  Please let me know if we need to make adjustments.  My intention is to give you 90-days supply for each item.  However, I cannot necessarily tell what will be a 90-day supply will be with the information received:
     - Provastatin 80mg, #90 tabs = $13.47 at Hy-Vee on GoodRX
        Some statins are available on your preventative care Planstin component.  However, I was unable to get a definative answer.  If you would like to see if we can get a 30-day supply for free on your Planstin Minimal Essential Coverage, please call the Concierge Line and we will go over how to find out if this is one of the few items they cover.
        Statins tend to be inexpensive, so most of our members prefer paying the $13.47 in this instance, rather than make 3 trips to a qualified pharmacy.  
     - Quinapril 10mg, #90 tabs = $16.09 at Hy-Vee on GoodRX
     - Fluticasone Prop 50mcg, 16g x 1 = $9.43 at Hy-Vee on GoodRX
        I priced a single Nasal Spray of 16g.  This was the only item with a 50mcg strength.  You put ''custom'' for you quantity.  If you use more than a single bottle in 90-days, please let me know and we can adjust the quantity.
     - Azelastine 137mcg, 30ml x 1 = $14.24 at Hy-Vee on RXSaver
        I priced a single Nasal Spray of 30ml.  This is the item I see listed with a 137mcg strength.  You put ''custom'' for you quantity.  If you use more than a single bottle in 90-days, please let me know and we can adjust the quantity.
------------------------------------------------
In the future, if you need something right away, please call to let us know that information.  We''ll take time to run those rush items and do the balance later.  When there are multiple drugs, it takes time to run everything for you.  (Figure for every drug we quote for you, we''ve run it on a minimun of 7, and up to 15 sites, to find the best pricing for you.)     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-30 15:20:15', '2023-05-30 15:20:15'),
