  ('zcrm_1579374000120058043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096344002', 'Mark Leubscher', NULL, '5/30/23 - Sabrina called in with questions regarding why she was having to pay a bloodwork bill at her OPD office as well as paying QUEST labs for the same services. 
