  ('zcrm_1579374000120097003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, '5-30-2023:  John called to chg his pymt acct.  Walked him thru the pymt chg form.  He''s going from ACH to ACH.  Was filling out when we got off the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-30 11:54:47', '2023-05-30 11:54:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120067108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, '5-29-23 Stephanie called bc she broke her foot over the weekend and needs an appointment with the foot surgeon tomorrow. She called Redirect and they told her she doesn''t have coverage for that. So, she was about to panic and have a broker foot for life. I let her know that will get taken care of through Sedera. Her IUA in Admin123 shows $500 which is what she believes they have. Zoho shows $1500 which I just asked Patti to correct and double check. Stephanie will call the MPB Concierge Team for assistance to take the next steps.  She feels much better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-30 11:48:26', '2023-05-30 11:48:26'),
