  ('zcrm_1579374000120067088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610361', 'Jarod Carter', NULL, '5-29-23 Jarod Carter is cancelling bc his kids, who are not on his membership, will reach their MOP. They have genetic diseases and their costs are millions of dollars. So, he can join his wife''s ins plan and not have to pay more for his own needs since they''re paying the max either way.  He just completed the cancellation form. He was wanting dental cleanings which I let him know is separate. He wants dermatology skin checks which won''t cost him anything since they reached their MOP and he wants a vasectomy as well. I''m not sure if they''ll cover that or not. But, he''ll find out. He was very nice and Patti will send him a confirmation email today so he can give it to HR at his wife''s company to join her plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-30 10:55:55', '2023-05-30 10:55:55'),
