  ('zcrm_1579374000120058018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Tatiana is in Poland and was inquiring about deviated septum surgery while she is there. Because I do not have much experience with Sedera covering items not in the US, I advised Tatiana that she would have to speak with Sedera. I warm transferred her over. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-30 08:14:19', '2023-05-30 08:14:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000120058013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113141002', 'Scott Readence', NULL, '5/30/23 -Liz called because her son had a very severe injury to his finger that is requiring surgery ASAP to put pins in it to hold it together. The hospital told Liz that they do not participate with Medical cost sharing plans and she was unsure of what to do since her son requires this surgery. I reassured Liz that Zion will assist with making sure her son gets the treatment he needs, but that she would have to speak with Zion directly to see if they may be able to speak with the billing department regarding payment for the surgery. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-30 07:46:32', '2023-05-30 07:46:32'),
