  ('zcrm_1579374000119981008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '5-25-23 Linda just wanted to verify new billing will be like this ongoing. I let her know yes. She now wants to pay out of her business account. She will update her payment method and talk with her accountant about the ins as tax ded potentially.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-25 13:34:30', '2023-05-25 13:34:30'),
