  ('zcrm_1579374000119918003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, '5/25/2023:  Jimmy called.  He fell in Jan 2023 & hurt his rotator cuff.  4/10/2023 he saw his gen prac for his lab work & prescription fills - but they looked at his shoulder at that same appt & referred him to a specialist.
