     - He''s getting his det invs & pymt receipts together so I can walk him thru the sub process.  (I encouraged him to have an inv for his orig appt w/the PCP too.  Maybe they will put some of that towards his IUA?)', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-25 09:56:27', '2023-06-06 13:20:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119904008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967010', 'Jorie Armstrong', NULL, 'Jorie called to find out how long she had from the date of service to start a need with Zion. I advised Jorie that she has six months from the date of service. Jorie then called back and asked if the plan covers labs, to which I told her that as long as it is a part of her open need those should be included as well. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-25 07:29:06', '2023-05-25 07:29:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119905003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', NULL, 'Member submitted a Change form to change primary on the membership.  I contacted her and told her that I was unable to do this , that she would have to re-enroll.  She said to leave it as is right now and that they might end up going elsewhere.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-25 07:26:12', '2023-05-25 07:26:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119898017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467623', 'Christopher Bonelli', NULL, '5-24-2023:  Christopher called asking about the his Prev Care.  I did not see Patti''s notice of cancellation from 5/3/23 until we got off of the phone.  His wife, who lives in FL, is being billed re her mamm.  The prov is in ntwk, so he''s not sure why.  He''s cking w/his wife &amp; will let me/us know.
     -NOTE:  Christopher''s b-date is Sept 20th, 1968.  Since he''s cancelled it prob doesn''t matter at this point.  But, if he becomes a memb again, we need to update that info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-25 00:46:09', '2023-05-25 00:46:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119898003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111992001', 'Lars Ensign', NULL, '5-24-2023:  Lars was in an exercise class & hurt himself.  He needs an MRI for his shoulder (w/contrast) & he wondered if we have a way to look at options.  We walked thru how to utilize HCBB & what options it shows.  The hosp near him (he lives somewhat remotely) is 5k (?) & fair pr on HCBB is closer to $1500.  Sure enough, that hosp is red on pricing.  He may see if there''s anything not super far away to utilize w/a better price.  
     - The specialist he saw has great reviews, so at least that''s good.  First visit was ~$350.
     - NOTE: Lars is an ER doc, so he''s quite helpful & knowledgeable.
     - Because they haven''t been memb very long we did discuss pre-x, what that means, phase-in sharing, etc.  It sounds like this might be an issue.  So, I made sure he knows Feb 2024 he moves out of the waiting period, & would have 25k that first year for sharing.  
     - Went over alternative care if it''s not pre-x (or after waiting period) = treatment plan to Zion for pre-approval before 1st visit.
     - He will call us if he decides to submit these initial expenses for instructions on how to sub a med need.  [Knows if pre-x, they will decline, but it''s the only way to know for sure as it depends on what is in her doc records.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-24 15:54:09', '2023-05-25 00:29:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119897003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '05.24.2023 Chadd called to submit a medical need to Sedera towards chiropractic adjustments. I consulted with Cari via teams, but she was preoccupied with another member.
I wanted to learn if Sedera''s guidelines about chiropractic sessions are the same as Zion. I ask Chadd if he would like to wait or can I call him back. He was happy with a call back at (970) 445-0122. 
*******************************************************************************************
I called Chadd back after I heard back from Cari via teams. I as able to share what I learned from Cari "Redirect has an app.  You call Redirect & setup your account.  Give them the names of your doctors, chiropractor, etc.  Then, you use the app to let them know "I need a chiropractic appt."  They will then set it up/pay for it for you as long as it''s in their benefits."
Chadd was glad to follow those instructions. I gave him Redirect''s number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-24 15:42:34', '2023-05-24 16:07:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119865036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406017', 'Patricia Nard', 'SENT Perm. form to Discuss MPB Plan w/ Husband 5/24/2023', '05.24.2023 Patricia finally reached us and is asking about the shingles vaccines if it is covered. I told here I''m going to the Healthcare.gov to check, and I confirmed that it is. 
She started discussing concerns about fibroids and cysts and bone cancer, and how to prevent it all. I suggested she discuss it with her PCP, but request that he keep it preventative while in the preventative appointment.
I sent her a form to give her husband permission to discuss her plan on her behalf. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-24 14:27:23', '2023-05-24 14:27:23'),
