  ('zcrm_1579374000119865026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102421002', 'Christopher Rutt', NULL, '05.24.2023 Christopher contacted Michele re: a prescription, in turn contacted Jen and I called Christopher back. He wanted to get a prescription for sleeping aid filled, but could not. I suggested a plant by the name of Blue Skullcap, natural, in the vitamin section. He was glad to try it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-24 14:04:54', '2023-05-24 14:04:54'),
