  ('zcrm_1579374000119866003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '5-24-2023:  Corinne called.  Adrian fell & hurt his hand.  Went to the ER, then saw a specialist.  Corinne called to find out how to sub a ''med need'' for the bills.  She has detailed inv & knows she''ll need pymt receitps too.  Did a bit of educ on ''vocab'' so she doesn''t confuse prov w/"claim, ded, etc."  She seemed to understand.
