  ('zcrm_1579374000119862039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, '5-24-23 Chadd called bc he wants to use his chiro visits through Redirect. He was told by someone that he doesn''t have chiro anymore and he wants it. He does and he needs to download the newest Redirect app to get started. He knows he needs to get pre-approved. He has a chiro friend that will give him a 20% discount is he pays for 10 sessions up front. I told him I''m not sure how Redirect will handle that. But, start with MPB Concierge Team to get registered with the app as the best place to begin. He will do so now and was appreciative and happy he get to access chiro!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-24 12:37:04', '2023-05-24 12:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119843013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to "upgrade" his membership.  I sent him to Wendy and gave him her contact number.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-24 12:31:47', '2023-05-24 12:31:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119862034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050550098', 'Sarah Price', NULL, '5-23-24 and 5-24-23 She needs help with scheduling a wellness visit with Redirect Health. Sarah Price just tried calling the MPB Concierge Team 3x and waited the max 10 minutes each time for someone to answer and then got hung up on. So, she wasted 30 minutes trying to reach them.  The system kept telling her she was next in line, then bumping her back and then disconnecting once the 10 minute mark happened.  I called her right away and let her know we were all in training and a backup system should have answered her call which is clearly did not. She will try again in a little bit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-24 12:20:24', '2023-05-24 12:20:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119865003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115979002', 'Tony Hugar', NULL, '05.24.2023 Robin called to ask a question re: what is covered in the annual checkup preventative appt through Planstin. I sent her an email via CRM (unsure if it reached her, she did not receive it while we were on the phone), the healthcare.gov and the MPB change form. I ended up guiding her to the site manually, and to the form from the Member Portal and Updates page. I asked her to bookmark those pages for future reference and star the Post welcome Call email when they receive it. I urged her to add her email to be able to use the telehealth service flawlessly when needed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-24 12:17:41', '2023-05-24 12:44:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119862023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045750190', 'Hollie Romer', NULL, '5-24-23 Hollie is talking with me and moving forward on the upgrade process.  We completed the upgrade process. It took 45 more min. She wants to review some dental options next. I told her I''ll call her back this afternoon. She''s in AZ.  She will need to update her address since it shows WY not AZ.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-24 11:18:45', '2023-05-24 11:58:20'),
