  ('zcrm_1579374000119836003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, 'Ryan''s son was having some tooth pain when he woke up this AM and Ryan wanted to know if there was anything shareable when it comes to dental issues. We went over when dental would be shareable (when it is medically necessary or part of an injury). Ryan understood and just needed the clarification. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-24 07:13:22', '2023-05-24 07:13:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119823047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122013002', 'Donald Hubbard', NULL, '05.19.23:  Recvd. an email from Cindy.  She complimented me on how responsive and helpful I''ve been to her and her husband who is deciding what kind of health care he wants.  She said they will make the decision by next week.  I responded to her email and thanked her for her kind words.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-05-23 18:05:12', '2023-06-19 08:50:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119822016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196018', 'Amy Schecterson', NULL, '5-23-2023:  Amy sub RX Quote for 5 items.  Pref pharmacy is listed as CVS, but it''s $55+ more exp than the cheapest 2.  I e-mailed to see which pharmacy she''d like.  Here are the totals for the items at the following stores:
