  ('zcrm_1579374000119823032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256010', 'Martha Corona Torrez', NULL, '05.23.2023 Martha called re: the RBP priced model, claiming an extra $100 charge from the usual just $300 was taken out of her account.
Per Jen''s request, I let her know, I made a list of my own of who all I have come into contact with regarding this situation. Jen said they are planning on refunding the members, once they fix the situation. Premium went up. Two separate charges. One is for $150, the other is for $275. Usually $325.
I used Wendy''s message, given it''s Jane Kassel''s member, regarding Jane having a receptionist to help her with her clients when she''s unavailable. If it''s simply about the pricing error, the client should have an email now stating the issue that took place the the $ in error will be refunded right away. 
