  ('zcrm_1579374000119780133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119995002', 'Hunter Burns', NULL, 'Spoke with Hunter, her and her husband are a young couple, 2 children. Were on another healthshare, Christian based, they qualify for Secure. She wants to have an effective date of June 1, I asked John K, he said we can make it happen.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-23 14:38:41', '2023-05-23 14:38:41'),
