  ('zcrm_1579374000119823021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109791008', 'Kimberly Harney', NULL, '05.23.2023 Kimberly spoke with a doctor via CirrusMD, and received a lab request order, and wanted to know if it would be covered.
I explained through the lens of an actual PCP Preventative visit that if it is not the standard lipid panel, we usually ask the member to ask the doctor/the doctor''s office to separate that lab request from the preventative appointment, because all that we have seen covered so far is the standard lipid panel.
I then led her to JasonHealth.com to price out and pre-purchase her labs, HOWEVER, it turns out that NY DOES NOT participate in discounted lab sites at all. Kimberly''s only option is to negotiate pricing on her own through the voice of a cash pay patient. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-23 14:18:28', '2023-05-23 14:27:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119823016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111992001', 'Lars Ensign', NULL, '05.23.2023 Left Lars a message, as I was trying to reach him per Jennifer''s request via teams. Lars attempted to contact us while we were in training. The thought and  decisions made prior to training, was to inform our members via website and text and email that the Concierge Team/Line will not be available during the specific hours, and offer the temporary revamped available hours. It does not look like Lars received that message. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-23 14:12:22', '2023-05-23 14:12:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119815065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117963002', 'Julie Hunter', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-23 14:04:23', '2023-05-23 14:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119815052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112811002', 'Dan Vandre', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update in A123.  Member submitted same CC that was already in A123 no action needed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-23 13:51:51', '2023-05-23 13:57:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119823008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103228002', 'Tracy Herrin', NULL, '05.23.2023 Tracy called re: the RBP priced model, claiming an extra $100 charge from the usual just $300 was taken out of her account.
Per Jen''s request, I let her know, I made a list of my own of who all I have come into contact with regarding this situation. Jen said they are planning on refunding the members, once they fix the situation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-23 13:47:37', '2023-05-23 15:37:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119815039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007427003', 'Timothy Nichols', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-23 13:23:25', '2023-05-23 13:23:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119822008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282132', 'Amanda Hoskins', NULL, '5-23-2023:  Godivus (female) called from Piedmont Hosp to verify Amanda''s labor &amp; delivery benefits (again - see Jennifer''s note from yesterday).  Sedera generally works directly with the member, not direct w/the providers.  However, on the birth of a baby, that may be diff.  Therefore, I trans Godivus to Sedera, letting her know she may need to call us back if they cannot help her.  [Note: Prev notes show Amanda prev opened the maternity need w/Sedera.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-23 13:03:34', '2023-05-23 17:26:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119823003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077566026', 'MaiLan Boris', NULL, '05.23.2023 MaiLan called asking for pricing on other plans, but also says that she know Jane Kassel is not available (out of the office). I messaged Wendy via teams, and Jen and Cari (together chat) via teams, wondering if by any chance I could/should send her to discuss other plans with someone else.
Her initial conversation starter was re: the pricing breakage email that was sent out. I am not aware of it, BUT can only assume it is regarding the RBP price model effect in pricing.
MaiLan then asked if she had gotten her mamm done in august, does she have to wait exactly a year (this coming august) to have another mamm done? Or can she bump it to having it done NOW? Both Jen and Cari responded with it has to be a year exactly, even maybe go past those 12 months to be sure. 
MaiLan understood and she will wait for Jane''s availability to discuss other plans. 
***************************************************************************************
Wendy messaged back via teams saying that Jane has a receptionist to help her with her clients when she''s unavailable. If it''s simply about the pricing error, the client should have an email now stating the issue that took place the the $ in error will be refunded right away. 
I called MaiLan back and shared the information. MaiLan is planning to call Jane Kassel''s assistant. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-23 12:55:08', '2023-05-23 15:40:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119815034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103906002', 'Rodrigo Torres', NULL, 'Member emailed in and asked if I could cancel his membership.  I have just received his cancellation request.  I will process when we receive drop.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-23 12:35:12', '2023-05-23 12:35:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119815029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101019002', 'Lydia Krzyzak', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking a bout the 2 separate charges and also that she would be cancelling eff 6/1/23.  Member did not submit any cancellation so I directed her to her advisor to start the process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-23 12:30:55', '2023-05-23 12:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119822003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090935002', 'Tracy McKinney', NULL, '5-23-2023:  Tracy called.  We moved to the new RBP pricing & having Planstin show up separately on the invoice.  I notified Jennifer Thorin via Teams chat, so she can add Tracy to the list.  Tracy''s situation seems a bit off too:

[12:15 PM] Cari A.
Another member who was mis-charged.  Can you please add her to the list?  Tracy L McKinney  480-235-2829    Her charges are kind of odd too:  Normal mo cont = $625.  This mo they pulled Planstin as $190 + MBP at $560 for a total of $750.  It''s memb & spouse, so the Planstin amount seems really high?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-23 12:18:15', '2023-05-23 12:18:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119798012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111992001', 'Lars Ensign', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3073 Question : Hi, I am a health share member. I was trying to reach the MPB concierge service, but the 800 number doesn''t work', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-05-23 11:21:20', '2023-05-23 11:21:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045750190', 'Hollie Romer', NULL, '5-23-23 Helping Hollie update her email and address first and then help her complete the upgrade process now.  She wasn''t able to continue bc the verfication code for email wouldn''t work. Kristen with Sedera submitted a ticket and will call her back once it''s resolved. Hollie has decided to move to a $1000 IUA from $5000 for $485.15 from $423.65. I can''t tell if the $15 is already added in or not. So, $485.15 looks like the worst case for price. She didn''t understand the $5000 IUA before from Ryan Hoff.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-23 10:28:53', '2023-05-23 11:07:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '5-23-23 Anna and I almost completed her upgrade process. She got her bank acct pwd wrong so we had to do it the manual way. So, now she has to wait to see one cent in her account tomorrow to plug in the code to complete the process. She will do so tomorrow and let me know if it worked or not. She will also call the MPB Concierge Team for help accessing her benefits. She wants to schedule a mammogram in Denver at a Women''s Imaging Center soon and also wants chiro care benefits and possibly PT for something. She will get assistance from MPB Concierge Team to do those things. All set until tomorrow. She also got a full body scanning MRI through this company called Pre-Nouveau to screen for cancer or anything else bad and it will detect stuff super early. She knows it is her cost entirely and was really excited about it. She''s super healthy and no issues. We had Tina from Sedera help up get through the Upgrade process to the banking account section which is the last step.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-23 09:43:18', '2023-05-23 09:43:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119794010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3072 Question : Why was this month''s premium split?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-05-23 09:19:25', '2023-05-23 09:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119816008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, '5/23/23 - Wendy is having some periodontal work done due to bone loss in her jaw. She was wondering if this is something that is shareable. Since I did not know the exact answer to this question, I let Wendy know that I was going to warm transfer her to Zion. I spoke with Spencer to let him know the situation and he stated that since this may be considered medically necessary, it may be something that is shareable. Wendy wanted to hear that from Spencer, so I completed the transfer. As always, Spencer from Zion was extremely helpful! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-23 07:48:35', '2023-05-23 07:48:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119815019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119540002', 'Albert deHombre', '6/23 Decline', 'Member''s 6/23 Enrollment Fee Declined so 1st months Share Amount will decline as well 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 5/23  5/24- Member responded with updated Acct # I reran all pmts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-23 07:46:12', '2023-05-23 13:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119788058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104633001', 'Cathy Gibbons', NULL, '5-22-2023:  Cathy called.  She rec''d the e-mail letting her know of the accidental $50 draw (plus her normal mo cont pymt) that happened over the weekend.  I explained it was an accident and we are working to correct the situation.  She was not happy because she "did not authorize" this extra amt.  It didn''t seem like she could hear me.  Finally, she let me off the phone with a harsh, reiteration, scolding of "only authorized $325 from my acct each month".  I apologized again & it was not inteded to pull they way it had, and yes, the mo cont is all that sb pulling.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-22 18:02:58', '2023-05-22 18:02:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119788047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113604002', 'Charlotte Hudson', NULL, '5-22-2023:  Charlotte called.  I believe she said she tt CirrusMD (I was dealing with another caller at the same time, so I think that''s what she said) and they advised her to go to an urg care cntr.  She has something going on inside her mouth.  I gave her the example how I called around to various urg care cntrs cking prices and that went well, but it depends on how sick she is.  Told her to keep her receipts.  Depending on if it''s determined medical or dental could impact options.  Keep pymt receipts.  If it turns out to be ongoing, 6mos deadline to sub ''med need''.  She knows she''s resp for 1k IUA.
     If they prescribe something she knows to call and we''ll look for best RX pricing.  I went over our hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-22 16:23:34', '2023-05-22 17:27:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045750190', 'Hollie Romer', NULL, '5-22-23 Hollie Romer is Ryan''s Hoff''s client that I am now helping. I just left her a vm and didn''t realize it was his client so that she won''t know me. Ooops!  I will send her an email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-22 15:51:28', '2023-05-22 15:51:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826048', 'Trent Mullikin', NULL, '5-22-23 Trent needs to upgrade. I left him a vm and let him know we have to do this ASAP and to call me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-22 15:48:12', '2023-05-22 15:48:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119788042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, '5-22-2023:  Charlene called.  Her first mo cont was pulled over the weekend, but it included a separate &amp; addl chg for her MEC.  I let her know how sorry we are.  We just discovered a few hours ago it had pulled extra.  Sent her name &amp; # to Jennifer for our list.  Let her know we are working to correct this situation asap.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-22 15:47:31', '2023-05-22 17:29:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406061', 'Mark Ovind', NULL, '5-22-23 Man of few words. I have him down to call him tomorrow at 2:00 to help him. His schedule is tough because he''s planting corn, soy, etc. now. I let him know he will need to be in front of the computer to keep his membership active.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-22 15:45:00', '2023-05-22 15:45:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657058', 'Douglas Evans', NULL, '5-22-23 Doug will check his email and pass it on to his wife with help. One of them will call me and he will be happy to have assistance. He was appreciative of the call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-22 15:43:45', '2023-05-22 15:43:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919192', 'Tanya Bell', NULL, '5-22-23 Left vm for Tanya to help her upgrade her membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-22 15:34:33', '2023-05-22 15:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119746071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115993002', 'Paolo Gramcko-Tursi', NULL, '05.22.2023 Paolo called trying to get assistance for his wife to use the CirrusMD service. Her email presently is not added on the plan, so I sent him the form for her to add it. I consulted with Cari via team to confirm if a member''s email HAS TO BE on the plan in order to use CirrusMD, and Cari suggested to try to send the invitation, if it does not work then we will take it from there. I sent the invitation to angielorraine99@gmail.com, hopefully Angie receives it and can use it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-22 15:34:16', '2023-05-22 15:34:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119746058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290213', 'Amy Bloom', NULL, '05.22.2023 Mitch called to learn how to proceed to be seen by a dermatologist. I guided him through the HCBB. At first he could not log in, so I shared mine. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-22 15:11:50', '2023-05-22 15:34:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119791064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119589002', 'Zachary Vondeylen', '6/23 Decline', 'Member''s 6/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 5/22  Member called in and did not know why only on portion declined.  Share Amount is being paid by treasurer of church Member is pastor.  He will look into and get back with me.
5/23-member called in and gave me updated address on the CC I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-22 14:59:10', '2023-05-23 07:38:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119799013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311063', 'Goldy Wareing', NULL, '5/22/23 - Goldy called in frantic because she was told by Redirect that she has no benefits. Well, they meant catastrophic care, not preventative care. I was able to calm Goldy down and go through the benefits that she has. Goldy was thankful and will be sure to call the MPB concierge team when she has questions. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-22 14:20:52', '2023-05-22 14:20:52');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000119788037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069290213', 'Amy Bloom', NULL, '5-22-2023:  Mitchell called w/lots of questions:
     - His b-date was inaccurately keyed in.  I walked him how to submit a change for to correct it to: March (not May).  I think the day & yr were okay, but, he''ll complete the form & submit.
     - Had his ''prev care'' appt last wk.  No DPC - went over how to sub ''prev care need req'' & that only office visit itself cov up to the $250, once per yr.  
     - Colonoscopy:  Went over ''Direct'' plan instructions.  Showed how he can sub a ''prev req'' for this too w/an estimate.  If they pull polyps, depending on expense it might be worth submitting a reg ''med need'' & his resp = 1k if it goes that dir.  But, they do offer more flex on this plan twds what is a screening vs diagnostic.  1 every 10 yrs after age of 45.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-22 14:09:57', '2023-05-22 14:09:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119799008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112318002', 'Alex Pepper', NULL, '5/22/23 - Welcome call completed! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-22 13:44:10', '2023-05-22 13:44:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119746045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117844002', 'Lilian Pontillo', NULL, '05.22.2023 Lilian called trying to schedule her welcome call. She did not receive her initial invitation because of the email. She will change her yahoo to gmail email instead. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-22 13:19:28', '2023-05-22 15:35:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119788027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '5-22-2023:  Mary called to see if vision is part of their MPB plan.  We went over how Dental &amp; Vision are not a part of the plan.  That we do have a disc program that has some items, but not nec regular vision visits.  I encouraged her to call her advisor:  Wendy Scipione, as she may offer a stand alone dental &amp; vision option.  She''s going to do that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-22 13:13:02', '2023-05-22 13:13:02'),
