  ('zcrm_1579374000119796008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678021', 'Kirsten Casner', NULL, '5-22-23 I can''t leave her a vm bc it''s full. The email sent from Admin came only to me, not to  Kirsten. I''m going to send it myself now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-22 12:27:57', '2023-05-22 12:27:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119788022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '5-22-2023:  Sara called, had nuclear stress test (?) in March she paid for and wants to add to her ''med need''.  She paid for it &amp; it''s for this ER issue = $1400.  She asked how to handle bal of her IUA.  Once she has her ''med need'' sub, she''ll call to see if she can pay Zion the bal.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-22 12:27:15', '2023-05-22 12:27:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119796003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678021', 'Kirsten Casner', NULL, '5-22-23 JK sent out the notice for Reactivating clients w/ Sedera. Kirsten has been passed onto me per Ryan Hoff''s departure. I will contact her now regarding the upgrade process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-22 12:23:05', '2023-05-22 12:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119791026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115315002', 'tayler rodriguez', '6/23 Decline', 'Member''s 6/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - not set up - 5/22
2nd notice sent - 5/25 5/30-3rd notice sent 6/5-final notice sent 6/6-After 5 attempts member has been non responsive I will cancel for non payment', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-22 12:14:36', '2023-06-06 14:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119791013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116744001', 'David Young', '6/23 Decline', 'Member''s 6/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 5/22 I spoke to member and he had fraud on his acct.  he will update his pmt method.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-22 12:02:58', '2023-05-22 12:12:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119788011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, '5-22-2023:  James called.  He has the receipts he can find (some may be older than the 6mos deadline - he didn''t seem super worried about that).  I tried to get a feel for when this issue began & cannot tell if it''s pre-x or not.  We went over it & he doesn''t think it is.  His other hip was replaced about 7 years ago, but he doesn''t think this issue was around until he saw that surgeon for this hip ~ 2/21.  Either way, at least he''s in his 3rd yr = 50k & 8/1 = 4th yr = 125k.  
     - We walked thru sub a ''med need'', what to expect, etc.  He knows he''s resp for 1k IUA, needs to ask for his inv to show ''cash-pay'' & discounts for ''cash-pay''.  He''d really like for his surgery to be soon, but may push it 3-4 weeks to find out about approval first.  He''ll call if he needs further guidance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-22 12:00:44', '2023-05-22 12:21:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119746029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095960001', 'Doug Richter', NULL, '05.22.2023 Jennifer called feeling a little panicked after speaking to Planstin, and them telling her that her plan with them is being cancelled AO May 31, 2023. She was confused given that she signed herself and her family up July 2022.
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams. Jennifer reached out to JK right away and let them know that Planstin is telling MPB members that their plans are cancelled eff 5/31.
After Jennifer connected with JK to let him know about this issue, she was able to guide us with "Please let Jennifer and Doug know that we are working to correct this and thank her for bringing this to our attention. We have someone reaching out to Planstin administration right now to make sure they know that the members are not cancelled, they are just moving to the RBP model". I did that and called Planstin afterwards.
The thought behind this was PERHAPS it''s showing like that on their screen, b/c the RBP price model is supposed to start on the next day, 6/1/2023.
Jennifer was concerned this would no longer be a fit, but I did not have an answer for her on that. She asked me to personally contact Planstin.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-22 11:58:29', '2023-05-22 12:33:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119737168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Spoke to Ryan.  Was able to verify his children''s SSN for the new enrollment for the SECURE PLAN.  Noticed in Admin123 that he was cancelled in Jan 2023 but not cancelled in CRM.  Will do so now.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-05-22 11:38:22', '2023-05-22 11:38:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119791003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111949018', 'Jonathan Smoot', '6/23 Decline', 'Member''s 6/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 5/22
2nd notice sent - 5/25  5/27-Member sent in PU form I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-22 11:38:08', '2023-05-30 07:47:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119746024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107491002', 'Douglas Hollowell', NULL, '05.22.2023 Douglas reached out due to an extra charge of $51.50 on his bank statement. I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, while they were in a meeting, they both were surprised with how the charge was showing. Douglas was being charged his regular amount PLUS the state amount of $51.50.
