  ('zcrm_1579374000119736003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100830002', 'Michael Agugliaro', NULL, '05.22.2023 Michael called to find a podiatrist. I guided him to the email titled "Prev Care &amp; HCBB" to retrieve the HCBB link. I gave him the access code MPB, he logged in. We went to the multiplan link, and searched for podiatry there. He did not want me to download the list and send it to him. He was appeased with searching on the HCBB. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-22 08:28:38', '2023-05-22 08:31:41'),
