  ('zcrm_1579374000119723008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098564012', 'Michael Stephens', NULL, '5/22/23 - Michael called because his wife has a wellness visit coming up and he was told they can go anywhere they would like starting Jan. 1. I advised Michael that they new pricing model we are working on is coming out within the next few weeks, but that we currently have to stick within the PHCS network until they receive their new cards. Michael was a tad upset because he has been told by both Leo and Jeffrey that they can currently go anywhere they would like, no questions asked. THIS NEEDS TO BE STOPPED UNTIL THE NEW PRICING MODEL COMES OUT! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-22 07:26:40', '2023-05-22 07:26:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119723003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116003002', 'Robert Hanley', 'Ticket Answered from 5/22/23', '5/22/23 - Robert called in at 9:06 AM today while I was looking at his ticket in Zoho Desk. He stated that they do have cards, but he wasn''t sure which to provide to the provider when he goes in to have his back issue looked at today. I let Robert know that he is to present as a cash-paying patient, ask for the best cash discounted rate, and to be sure to collect all the bills and receipts so that if it does go above his IUA, he will have to open a Need with Zion. I also clarified why the Planstin cards state a $3000 deductible. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-22 07:14:31', '2023-05-22 07:14:31'),
