  ('zcrm_1579374000119676052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '5-19-2023:  Ryan called 22-minutes prior to the deadline for a June 1st eff date.  His advisor sent him a link and said to hurry to get it done, but did not offer to help him.  He had questions, but this is an application, not a concierge question.  I sugg, due to the short amount of time he has to get this done, that he call Analisa back & ask her to walk thru the app w/him to make sure he does it right since he''s so rushed.  He dediced that sounded like a good idea & hung-up quickly.  I did offer to conf we can see it''s come thru if he''s concerned prior to the deadline.     - CA
