  ('zcrm_1579374000119687016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391103', 'Diana Freeman', NULL, '05.18.23:  Recvd. call from Diana. Her husband had an HSA with his employer but employer is cancelling it.  Diana wants to know if she canuse the PlanstinMEC HSA eligibility to keep her HSA account.  I told her yes but she should call her bank and ask them if she needs to transfer this HSA to her Planstin MEC - if there is any paperwork she has to complete to use her HSA through her Planstin MEC. She said she would take care of that.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-05-19 12:17:00', '2023-05-19 12:17:00'),
