  ('zcrm_1579374000119687011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095345001', 'Lisa Negron', NULL, '05.19.23:  Called Lisa - l/m to c/b and let me know if they are ready to enroll in OPD Complete with Dr. Jakob for a June 1 start date.  Her health care is ended for her SECURE plan by May 31.  The deadline is being extended to Monday, the 22nd.  Asked her to call or text me and let me know.
