  ('zcrm_1579374000119687003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122013002', 'Donald Hubbard', NULL, '05.19.23:  Recvd. and email from Cindy. Said Donnie is worried about funds not being available for his medical needs. She asked if having the SECURE with the HSA would be a better plan due to this issue.
