  ('zcrm_1579374000119644016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119615002', 'Eric Madden', NULL, '5/19/23 - Eric''s employer called because he assisted Eric in signing up for the plan. Eric did not know his email address at the time of the enrollment, so his employer used his own. Now they are looking to change the email to Eric''s, so I sent a member change form link for this. I will request a new welcome packet for Eric once I see that the email has been changed. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-19 08:37:55', '2023-05-19 08:37:55'),
