  ('zcrm_1579374000119565229', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115996020', 'Cord Dorcey', NULL, '5-18-2023:  Cord called.  Jessica is going in for a bunch of lab tests for infertility.  She has a Quest near her, so we walked thru how to use JasonHealth &amp; he''s all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-18 17:43:01', '2023-05-18 17:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119552076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, '5-18-23 John is partners with Jill Bryant. They plan to combine their memberships after John completes a new Need he''s dealing with now. See notes in Jill''s account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-18 17:21:46', '2023-05-18 17:21:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119552071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '5-18-23 Jill called bc John Spalvins her partner of 9 years has a medical incident. In dealing with it they learned they can join their membership as domestic partners. I told her how she can do it and how it will affect their membership. They will save $25 per month and then only have 3 Needs per year to reach vs 3 each separately before the needs are shared without the IUA if/when above $500. She was super appreciative and will wait until they process his current need of melanoma (I think she said). Once it''s closed out she will call and combine the memberships into one. They also bought a property in Costa Rica. She''s a realtor and might like to come to my event on June 23rd since she has to travel a bunch for clients and would love to join.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-18 17:00:05', '2023-05-18 17:00:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119625047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, '05.18.2023 Ashley called to learn the best way to request 4 RX quotes for Anthony, husband/primary member. 
I guided her to the MPB change form on the Member Portals and Updates. She was thankful to have ample time to complete it accurately for Anthony. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-18 16:58:24', '2023-05-18 16:58:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119565218', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '5-18-2023:  Devon called.  She wants to sched her mamm for when they get back to Naples in Nov & was worried about in ntwk, etc.  We tried to look up both the cntr & the prov, but neither are showing in the PHCS search.  Just this last Mon, we were told the RBP program sb here soon.  I let her know:  Call PHCS directly (she has the #) to see if they can tell if the cntr & prov are in their ntwk.  But, that may not matter by Nov (we just cannot guarantee that yet).  She knows to watch for a Planstin e-mail, that has a new ID Card (without the PHCS Logo on it) to know we''ve moved to the new program.  
     Since she''s so far out, we agreed: when they get back to Naples, she will call to get up-to-date directions.
     - Her husb told her we could tell her how good a doc is.  I sent Devon their post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail so I could teach her how to use HCBB, because she doesn''t have access to her husb work e-mail.  Showed her examples of what''s there, how to use it, & she knows it''s hit & miss on mamm info. 
     - Her husb told her we''d make appts too.  I let her know that''s not one of our srvcs (they are on SECURE) & she seemed to understand that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-18 16:54:07', '2023-05-18 17:03:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119625042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, '05.18.2023 Heather called to confirm her daughter is presenting herself properly when she goes to see an orthopedic due to a foot injury.
I guided them to present as cash-pay patients and to save the receipts. Given that it''s an injury, most likely further services would be needed for Emma. Therefore when they get close to their IUA of $1000, to call us back so we open a medical need request. If they stumble across the interest in attending an alternative medicine approach to call us for the process as it takes time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-18 16:32:15', '2023-05-18 16:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119625037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099248002', 'Alex Killingsworth', NULL, '05.18.2023 Alyssa called to inform us that they had not received their Planstin or Zion cards yet. We confirmed her account, then I asked her to please check her email on the profile for anything from Planstin or Zion.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-18 16:06:05', '2023-05-18 16:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119625029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084172009', 'Aaron Brand', NULL, '05.18.2023 Jeanette called wondering why no one called her for her welcome call at 3:30. Jennifer had gone home/doctor''s office as an emergency call, but did share she took care of the welcome calls prior to leaving. I checked the Booking''s app and did not see Jeanette on Jen''s schedule either. But it turns out Jeanette had JUST missed Jennifer while she was reserving her spot, not knowing that Jennifer is not available.
I also helped Jeanette with the process of presenting herself/her husband Aaron at a preventative appointment but starting with the PHCS network. It turns out after speaking to CirrusMD, they were recommended to go see someone in person re: a callus under Aaron''s heel that is causing major problems. I then coached her/them on how to present as cash pay patients in situations that are not preventative and save the receipts in preparation for sharing them with Zion, if medical cost sharing is needed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-18 15:01:58', '2023-05-18 15:06:23'),
