  ('zcrm_1579374000119552061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119553023', 'Jen Roberts', NULL, '5-18-23 Jen is a Financial Advisor sent to me by Sarah Price. Jen is interested in sharing this with her clients to help them  free up money to then use to invest.  She''s all set for her health insurance. I gave her the rundown of how it works. She had a good grasp. I mentioned the Referral Fee of $100 and she is now allowed to accept that. But, she will be able to help her clients more with the freed up $, if they choose this path. She asked for information to share with her clients. I sent her the site and video to watch and will send the overview of SECURE next. She sounds lovely to partner with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-18 12:07:11', '2023-05-18 12:07:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119625008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109191001', 'Karl Lawfer', NULL, '05.18.2023 Lori called to understand more how to use the research she''s finding, and not finding in the MultiPlan link under the PHCS network. She finds the hospital but is unsure if the facility is in the network. She finds other doctors at the family practice firm, butnot the one she wants to go see for an annual exam. I consulted with Cari via teams to double check. Although it makes sense if most doctors in the firm show up in the list, then they all must be there, but it turns out it''s possibly not the case, and to call and speak to them directly is more effective and successful. I recommended that she do that on both searches; the family practice and the hospital for her mammogram. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-18 11:58:38', '2023-05-18 12:04:18'),
