  ('zcrm_1579374000119534061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043830088', 'Randal Warwick', NULL, 'I received a request from Sedera to help them try to contact this member to submit proof of payment for a need.  I left a VM for member on home phone &amp; cell and then reached out to Jeff to try and get in contact with member.  Within a half hour Jeff sent me an email that he received from member statement of payments made to Mercy Health.  I then sent this on to Mikey Nunez @ Sedera.  He later called me to tell me he received this and thanked me for our help in this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-18 07:52:45', '2023-05-18 07:52:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119534056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, 'Due to the fact that this member''s 5/1 share Amount declined I realized that she was one of the members that we were still billing her out of FTNI via CC.  Also that we were billing at old price.  I spoke to Wendy and we agreed that I would charge her for May today (5/18) and then push off her June billing until 5/26 so she will have enough money.  Then resume billing on the 20th of every month.  Member unable to make the switch to Zion due to recent need.  Member also requested help with clearing up her start date w/Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-18 07:10:30', '2023-05-18 07:10:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119551025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084951011', 'Paul Notartomaso', NULL, '5-17-2023:  Meghan called.  She''s at the pharmacy &amp; didn''t know how her pharmacy benefits work.  We went over our process &amp; it''s a discount system.  She wasn''t sure what the doc had called in, so she will fill out the form later and hopefully tomorrow we can get her the coupons.  She lives near a Walmart, Walgreens, or King Soopers.  Once she understood I think we were okay, it''s just very diff than she''s used to.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-17 18:09:16', '2023-05-17 18:09:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119551017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '5-17-2023:  Lisa called.  She needed to know how much of their monthly contribution goes twds the ''ACA MEC''.  Per Patti''s breakdown, I told her $105 / mo cont w/Planstin = Memb & Sp x #of months they were members (she found the form Planstin provided, it just doesn''t show the $ amount).  She had a ton of accounting questions & I kept referring her to her acct since the acct will be the one resp for how to file.  "Someone happened to have an acct in the room while talking with me & gave me answers."  I reiterated:  since you acct is the one preparing for you, I''d sugg talking w/them.  That''s the way to make sure you are properly filing your taxes.  She finally seemed to hear that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-17 16:01:39', '2023-05-17 16:05:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119565074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005185119', 'Susan Ronit Carter', NULL, '05.17.2023 Susan Called to confirm the cancellation and refund took place. I checked the CRM that shows she''s cancelled, and I could not find her in the Admin123, so I consulted with Cari via teams. She did a little digging and finally found her in Admin123: &nbsp;under Interactions:
