I shared that and the notes in the CRM and Susan was appeased and delighted. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-17 15:54:06', '2023-05-17 15:54:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119565069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080095009', 'Robert Martines', NULL, '05.17.2023 Sherry called to learn if there are options towards submitting a bill to Zion passed the deadline. I needed coaching on this item, so I waited for Cari to return, and told Sherry I''ll email her my findings. Sherry was going to search for the bill when she gets home (she''s traveling), and give us a call back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-17 15:10:38', '2023-05-17 15:10:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119552036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '5-17-23 Talked with Patti and we need to bill Elizabeth $508.59 tomorrow (up from $378 + cc fee) and again on May 26th to catch her up for May and then June with correct amount moving forward. Patti will also contact Redirect tomorrow to get her account straight showing she''s been a member since Jan. 2020 not June or July of 2022.  She prefers to use CC to track their bus expenses and not pay from bank account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-17 15:01:44', '2023-05-17 15:08:00'),
