  ('zcrm_1579374000119542104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '05.17.23:  Texted John Holland.  Told him, if he intends to enroll for a June 1 start date, he needs to do so by 5.19.23.  He responded he''s looking at alternatives that will address the highest risks and cost less.  I responded, with MPB, for any injury or illness that is not pre=x, once he pays his IUA, all his medical costs will be shared 100% with no cap.
John responded he found policies that will cover sports injuries (the only medical expenses he''s incurred in several decades) and auto injuries for a year at about the same cost as one month of the MPB plan. 
I responded if sports and auto  injuries are his only medical concerns and the plan he''s referring to can provide total protection for those particular needs while saving him that much money, it sounds like that would be the way to go. I said if he changes his mind to contact me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-05-17 14:42:19', '2023-05-19 11:57:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119542099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095345001', 'Lisa Negron', NULL, '05.17.23:  Texted Lisa. Told her if she intends to enroll in OPD Complete with Dr.Jakob,  she needs to do it by the enrollment deadline of 5/19 and to let me know when she would be available to do so.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-05-17 14:38:17', '2023-05-17 14:38:17'),
