  ('zcrm_1579374000119552031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '5-17-23 Thomas called to understand how to submit a Need.  His wife went into the hospital on April 9th into Methodist Hospital in TX for a blockage in her colon. It was so blocked that they couldn''t get past the colon. So, they put her on a liquid diet and gave her the liquid they use before a colonoscopy to clean her out. Now she needs a colorectol surgery which she goes in for on Monday, May 22nd. I gave him the MPB Concierge Team''s #. He will call them He knows of the 6 month deadline of submitting bills. He''s amazed at how slow their billing is. He''s been pressing them for a bill ever since the first visit. He completely understands how it works.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-17 14:16:44', '2023-05-17 14:16:44'),
