  ('zcrm_1579374000119552026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '5-17-23 I realized he needs to call C4 to make sure they update his account on his end as well. He''ll do that right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-17 14:09:34', '2023-05-17 14:09:34'),
