  ('zcrm_1579374000119552008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '5-17-23 Lester''s plan with Friday has been terminated according to the latest report. He has been to the drs. recently and it was supposedly covered without trouble. But, C4 is showing his plan was terminated back to 2/28/23.  He has no knowledge of that and his plan is on auto pay. He''ll look into it and see what''s happening. He was not contacted by Friday Health at all. He was very appreciative of my call. He''ll let me know as soon as I can look it over and find proof of payment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-17 11:13:02', '2023-05-17 11:13:02'),
