  ('zcrm_1579374000119534021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196002', 'Brian Gould', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-17 11:02:10', '2023-05-17 11:02:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119552003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014900054', 'Terry Talley', NULL, '5-17-23 Terry called bc he wanted to use his virtual healthcare. He thought is was through Teladoc and learned that''s not the case. But, he had no recollection of CirrusMD. Although, it was successfully set up already and he was going to give it a try. I suggested if he has trouble to call the Concierge Team since they know how to use it better than I do. He''s all set. He also asked about what to pressent when he goes to the drs. He will present himself as a self pay patient if it''s not an ACA compliant preventative visit. He''s good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-17 10:57:41', '2023-05-17 10:57:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119551003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, '5-17-2023:  Chiro, PT, Cold Laser, & now to orthopedic this week.  Bone-on-bone, requires hip replacement.  James saw his orthopedic surgeon this week.  He called asking for Jennifer, but she was in a meeting.  I went over the process with him.  His advisor is telling him we will call the doc''s office to work on pricing, I let him know that''s not quite how it works.  That once his healthsharing company is involved, they will work with him on the payments, etc.  He''s done a good job of telling them he''s ''cash-pay''.  
     James is going to get together all of the pymt receipts and detailed inv from everything he''s had done for this issue.  We disc that generally, alt care requires prior approval, but let''s go ahead and submit them to see if they will put them towards his IUA.  I was very clear - they may say no, but at least we tried.  He seemed to understand that.
     We went in depth on his IUA = his resp is 1k, before there is any help; issue specific; not annual, but if 12-mos of no activity they close it & you start over.
     James will call back soon so we can get the ''med need'' sub.  He''s hoping to get surgery soon.  
     After the call, Jennifer sent me Jane''s e-mail to her.  He did not bring up having another ''Welcome Call'' specifically with Jennifer or HCBB access.  He''s already selected his orthopedic surgeon, so we did not discuss the HCBB, Healthgrades, or else I would have worked with him on that as well.  NOTE:  re HCBB = he''s in the time period, where the members do NOT have access, so we cannot help him get into the system.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-17 10:54:58', '2023-05-17 12:21:08'),
