  ('zcrm_1579374000119487028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104976002', 'Kenneth Bailey', NULL, '5/17/23 - Rebecca called regarding how to present herself at a non-prev care appointment. We went over the cash-pay process and I explained that if she feels she will have to open a need, to give us a call on the concierge line and we will assist her. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-17 08:20:40', '2023-05-17 08:20:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119487023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117961010', 'Morgan Venham', NULL, '5/17/23 - Kelly called because she went to get her husbands Eloquis and it was priced at over $2k. Kelly called because she was never "told what to do" so I informed her about the prescription quote form along with how the pricing works on our end. Kelly demanded a price right at that moment, to which I told her that I would have to do some research to get her the best pricing. This member is in desperate need of a Welcome Call so I sent a scheduler. Lou, please follow up with your members when they are not understanding what they have purchased. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-17 08:19:21', '2023-05-17 08:19:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119490013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122612009', 'Annette Mosbarger', NULL, 'Attempted to follow up with Annette, to find out if she had any additional questions, and if she is ready to move forward with enrolling. I left her a voicemail, and sent her a text.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-17 08:07:10', '2023-05-17 08:07:10'),
