  ('zcrm_1579374000119427163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087122002', 'Robert Chupek', NULL, 'Karina informed me that Brigitte reached out indicating they want to add a new employee onto the plan. I reached out to Brigitte, and emailed her the enrollment link for Cali Electric to forward to her employee, and gave her my direct contact info.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-16 14:04:37', '2023-05-16 14:04:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119473028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '5/16/23 - These members are not a good fit for any plan with MPB. They have done welcome calls (2 that I know of that I conducted) and still have absolutely NO idea how to use their plan. Corinne did not present her Planstin at her mammo so I advised her to call Riverview Hospital (they are in-network) and have them resubmit the bill to Planstin. She also had several bills from wound care that may be past the 6-month date but she is going to attempt to submit them through Zion to get these paid. I feel that the member is more frustrated by having this plan than anything. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-16 14:03:58', '2023-05-16 14:03:58'),
