  ('zcrm_1579374000119470056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '5-16-2023:  When Ryan called on 5/9/23 he was in a hurry to re-enroll for MPB and I let him know that needs to be done thru his advisor Analisa.  As of today, I do not see the re-enrollment, so ILM for Ryan due to this Fri, 3pm eastern, being the deadline.  Ask him to call me if he''s having trouble connecting w/her or needs further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-16 13:01:18', '2023-05-16 13:01:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119474003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109501001', 'Sophia Guzman', NULL, '05.16.2023 Sophia called to learn how to attain a talk therapy set of sessions. From her phone, I was able to guide her through finding the MAP program via our Member Portals and Updates page. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-16 12:55:52', '2023-05-16 12:55:52'),
