  ('zcrm_1579374000119470038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179002', 'Corey Vincent', NULL, '5-16-2023:  Leslie from the provider''s off called to see if Christie needs prior approval for her stress test on her ''ins''.  We went over how she doesn''t have ''ins'', so they are ''cash-pay'' patients.  That should this issue go over 5k, they may have some financial help, but nothing before that, it''s out of their pocket.  She asked if they have already paid that 5k and I let her know that''s not something I can see.  Went over who we are &amp; that the memb may know that answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-16 11:47:46', '2023-05-16 11:47:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119473008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '5/16/23 - Charlie called because he had an ER visit this past weekend that may result in surgery. We went over the cash-pay process for his appointment tomorrow. Charlie is going to call back to let us know what is going on so we can proceed with him further. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-16 11:39:59', '2023-05-16 11:39:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119470030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088980002', 'Aaron Kline', NULL, '5-16-2023:  Aaron called.  He is getting a colonoscopy he thinks is actually diagnostic.  He went to the doc for an issue they now want to proceed to the colonoscopy.  He''s going to ck whether the doc is doing this as diag (=1k IUA) or screening (where if no polyps = his plan does not have ''prev care'').  If they are doing diagnostic, he knows how to present: no ''ins'', ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, pay his 1k IUA & ask to be billed for bal, then call us to get help sub ''med need''.  He was very nice & super grateful for the guidance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-16 11:33:16', '2023-05-16 11:38:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119470022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082328002', 'Eric Finley', NULL, '5-16-2023:  Eric called.  He wanted to chg his pymt type.  However, he''s curr on ACH and when he realized there is a 3% proc fee for cc, he decided to leave it as is.  I walked him thru the process in case he chgs his mind &amp; made sure he''s aware of the deadline = esp this mo, with Fri being the 19th, it must be done prior to 3pm Fri to change this month.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-16 11:13:11', '2023-05-16 11:13:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119472108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119444002', 'Charlene Conlin', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-16 11:07:33', '2023-05-16 11:07:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119427138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116982002', 'Lisa Agliano', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-16 11:06:05', '2023-05-16 11:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119472103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119412002', 'Andrew Everhart', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-16 11:05:44', '2023-05-16 11:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119470014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058875042', 'Denzel Rodriguez', NULL, '5-16-2023:  Denzel called.  He rec''d a $200 bill for his prev care.  Said the doc''s off told him his ins was expired (which I told him as long as he''s active, that would be incorrect), so he didn''t think they''d even billed it.  We ck''d, the docs: 	Silverstein, Scott A, D.O.  & Silverstein, Stephen M, D.O., Family Practice, 729 E Atlantic Blvd, Pompano Beach, FL 33060, 954-943-5044, are listed in the PHCS Search Tool.  As we proceeded, he found the bill and it looks like it was billed to Planstin, but still has a balance.  We went over how it may be items not part of the MEC coverage.  He''s going to call Planstin to find out & will call if he has questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-16 11:03:52', '2023-05-16 12:26:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119427133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116982002', 'Lisa Agliano', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-16 11:03:46', '2023-05-16 11:03:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119427123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117095002', 'Susan Brannon', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-16 10:58:11', '2023-05-16 10:58:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119470009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119412010', 'Carie Mueller', NULL, '5-16-2023:  Carie called.  She just signed up but didn''t see where she was supposed to select the "accident policy".  She also doesn''t understand why it''s the price it is, she was expecting considerably lower.  We realized, her advisor Christine Corsini was discussing the 5k IUA = $240/mo cont, not the 1k = $165.  I also explained that Christine is an ind adv & the "accident policy" is something she sells separate from the MPB prod.  We discussed how the 5k vs 1k IUA works.  The unknown was, say skin cancer cells, it''s a $2500 procedure, does the "accident policy" help w/that.  She has a call out to Christine, but if for some reason they cannot connect, she will call us back if she wants to change to the $2500 or 5k IUA instead, she know we have to have this done by Thurs due to the deadline.  [She did not see the toggle in the app to select the IUA.]
     - Either way, I encouraged her to go ahead and get her ''Welcome Call'' sched for sometime after her 6/1/2023 eff date.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-16 10:52:22', '2023-05-16 10:52:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119427113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117567010', 'Shane Dilley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-16 10:51:57', '2023-05-16 10:51:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119472098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119385002', 'Carla Wells', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-16 10:26:05', '2023-05-16 10:26:05'),
