  ('zcrm_1579374000119356003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014070', 'Mong-Tuyen Nguyen', NULL, '5-12-23 I moved Carrie Ballas'' email to secondary so she won''t get emails for her former employee Mong-Tuyen. I don''t have Mong''s email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-12 15:22:19', '2023-05-12 15:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119332038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084172001', 'Jacqueline Wolfe', NULL, '05.12.2023 Jackie called to better learn how to use the HCBB. I saw she did not complete her welcome call, and therefore does not have the post welcome call email.
I sent her the HCBB link WITH the schedule your welcome call email instructions.
Together we went over how to read HCBB.
I sent her another email with the instructions for submitting a need request to Zion. We filled it out together.
Jackie is scheduling her welcome call right after this phone call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-12 15:06:37', '2023-05-12 15:06:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119338008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '5-12-2023:  Valerie called looking for her tax document e-mail from Planstin.  She was able to locate the 2/24/2023 e-mail and register.  I let her know she cannot do everything (ie: change pymts) on their portal, however it will give her the tax form she''s looking for &amp; a copy of their ID Card.  She asked the amount of their mo contribution that goes twd this component &amp; I quoted her the amount Patti gave us: $135 per month = fam memb amt twds the MEC exp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-12 14:16:10', '2023-05-12 14:21:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119332023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '05.12.2023 Jennifer called to see if she can be reimbursed for a mammogram. I sent her the instructions to opening a need, prior to learning it was for a mamm.
After consulting with Jen and Cari via teams, it was recommended to make sure it was:
1-2D
2-the facility + all are in the PHCS network
3-to call Planstin and hopefully begin the conversation of getting reimbursed.
I guided Jennifer on how to present for a colonoscopy for her husband, and encouraged her to call us anytime she has an appointment to go to, in order to maneuver properly. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-12 13:45:40', '2023-05-12 13:45:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119338003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113835002', 'Terry Draper', NULL, '5-12-2023:  Shelly req''d RX Quotes.  They live rural w/not many conv places.  Priced all three pharmacies:  Walgreens, CVS, & Walmart.  Walgreens was cheapest on these items even compared to other places & her normal pharmacy, so it worked well.  CVS was only 9-cents more, where Walmart was $6.06 more.  So, all three are curr quite competitive.  Here''s what I sent:
     - Allopurinol 100mg, #90 tabs = $5.47 at Walgreens on RXGo  (1 daily)
     - Armour Thyroid BRAND 90mg, #90 tabs = $153.78 at Walgreens on RXGo (1 daily)
     - Armour Thyroid BRAND 15mg, #90 tabs = $76.71 at Walgreens on RXGo (1 daily)
     Armour Thyroid recently increased in price, but Reid''s prices were just as bad.  If they continue to rise in price, then re-visiting pricing w/Reid may be worthwhile?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-12 12:39:17', '2023-05-12 12:39:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119317008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036932155', 'Amy Betancourt', NULL, '5/12/23 - Amy called because she was told by Sedera/Redirect that her account is on hold. Since I am unable to see why her account is on hold and since Patti is on vacation, I transferred this member to Michele for assistance. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-12 09:53:19', '2023-05-12 09:53:19'),
