  ('zcrm_1579374000119200033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '5/11/23 - Michelle called regarding labs and being in-network. I found 1 Mount Carmel lab that she will call because Mount Carmel is her preferred facility. Michelle was frustrated because the bloodwork she is used to being covered by her insurance is not covered by her MPB.Health plan. I explained that it is something that the federal government dictates and that we do not have any control over who is in-network. Michelle and I spoke briefly about her frustration and I offered to assist her any way that I can. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-11 10:22:02', '2023-05-11 10:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119200028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366030', 'Veljko Ilic', NULL, '5/11/23 - Veljko called to verify that his wife was removed from his plan (confirmed she was removed 6/1/2022) and to change his email address plus his physical address. Veljko stated that he had put his new physical address on his payment update form, but I let him know that he would have to submit the actual member change form with the updated info to us. I sent him a welcome call scheduler and the member change form link via email. I will keep my eyes out to make sure his new address is on file before requesting a new welcome packet be sent to him. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-11 09:51:55', '2023-05-11 09:51:55'),
