  ('zcrm_1579374000119170018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, '5/10/23 - Sophia (she is the wife, not the child) called to find out about preventative care that is included with her plan. I explained to Sophia that with her specific plan, all preventative care would be out of pocket for her, including immunizations. Sophia understood and thanked me for the info. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-10 09:51:13', '2023-05-10 09:51:13'),
