  ('zcrm_1579374000119170013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086939009', 'Joseph Schrowang', NULL, '5/10/23 - Karen called regarding whether or not COVID tests were covered under Planstin. She needs to go purchase more tests due to her line of work and wanted to know if there was reimbursement for this, which currently there is not. Karen is such a delight to speak with every time she calls in. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-10 09:34:04', '2023-05-10 09:34:04'),
