  ('zcrm_1579374000119170008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095850002', 'Dave Chamberlin', NULL, '5/10/23 - Dave called because he hadn''t received the email yesterday from Nahla. I let Dave know that it shows in our system that it was delivered and opened, but that I would try to send it to him via my Outlook email. I resent the info Nahla had provided Dave and also tagged Nahla in the email. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-10 08:49:51', '2023-05-10 08:49:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119170003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093481010', 'Sanjay Bhattacharjee', NULL, '5/10/23 - member called because he said his wife received a bill from her lab work done during her prev care visit. I tried to explain to Sanjay that the only item covered is a basic lipid panel and he stated that Planstin did not pay for that either. I asked if she presented her Planstin card at the Labcorp she had her bloodwork done and Sanjay stated she did so at this point I had to warm transfer Sanjay to Planstin for further explanation surrounding this bill. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-10 08:28:52', '2023-05-10 08:28:52'),
