  ('zcrm_1579374000119145041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', NULL, '05.09.2023 Benjamin called to better understand what to do with getting coverage, if at all, with his wife''s ultrasound and future biopsy. I explained to be sure to present as cash-pay patients, and to start by opening a medical need with the receipts/invoices.
I sent them an email with the instructions for Zion bill submission, via CRM. We filled it out together over the phone. They submitted it while we were still together, and received a confirmation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-09 17:22:26', '2023-05-09 17:22:26'),
