Agent Info: Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555) 

Direct Vision | www.directvisioninsurance.com
844-833-8440', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-09 14:12:05', '2023-05-09 14:12:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119146019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '5-9-2023:  Martin called in to see if we''d processed his baby''s addition to their plan yet.  (The baby was born 4-29-2023.)  He just sent it today and I can see the Cognito form.  Patti''s out this week, so I let him know she will process it when she''s back & that''s within the 30-day deadline.  He asked if she will please send him a conf e-mail.  I''m not sure of her process, so I told him I will send her an e-mail (because I can sched that to send when she returns) & request that, but as a back-up he should plan to call us later next week to confirm as well.  That Patti''s really good at getting these taken care of & since I can see his form, this looks good.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-09 14:11:40', '2023-05-09 14:24:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119145021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108626001', 'Karen Schofield', NULL, '05.09.2023 Karen placed an RX request for: Risedronate Sodium for 90 days, 150MG per tablet. I sent her the following via outlook email:
