Risedronate Sodium: 150mg, 3 Tablets: Publix $55.13                                -- NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-09 13:24:53', '2023-05-09 13:24:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119146011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112304001', 'Lynn Ware', NULL, '5-9-2023:  Lynn called w/tons of questions:
     - Colonoscopy:  Luckily, it looks like the doc & facility she setup appt w/are in the PHCS Ntwk. 
 She will conf they still are & make sure the anesthesiologist is in ntwk too.  We went over what happens if they pull a polyp = 1k IUA, call us a few days after & we''ll guide her in chging the way billing is handled.  
     - Had her annual pap & there was a bill for that. (I didn''t even bring up the ntwk on this one since she already had the appt.)  She couldn''t find it while we were talking, but thought maybe it was the pathology bill.  She''s going to call the billing office w/her Planstin card info & ask they bill them directly.  
     This gal is super nice & really seems like she could be a great fit for this product.  She says she''s not good at the extra work, yet loves the philisophy behing MPB.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-09 13:06:03', '2023-05-09 13:14:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119145016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095850002', 'Dave Chamberlin', NULL, '05.09.2023 Dave called to receive guidance on behalf of his wife on how to present herself and maneuver her preventative appointments. I shared the process of making sure the providers/facilities are part of the PHCS network, present the information from the back of the Planstin card, be sure the office knows to keep the appointments preventative and to communicate with Dave and Kristin on how they would like to proceed with anything not considered preventative and must be practiced.
