He asked about dental, to have her wisdom teeth pulled out, but there is not coverage for dental or vision. I told him that and I shared that maybe his advisor might have a product companion that she might be able to shed light on. I emailed him Karen Torsoe''s information. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-08 14:13:21', '2023-05-08 14:13:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119070003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114224009', 'Hanan Fathallah', NULL, '5-8-2023:  Hanan called.  She knows there is a 6-mo waiting period for her colonoscopy on the Direct plan, but wanted to find out the procedure.  We walked thru how to find a quality facility/doc on HCBB.  She''s going to ck w/her DPC to see if they have anyone to sugg & she''ll see if that person is rated.
     We left it, she will start looking for where she will have the procedure, however will make her appt for about 7, 7-1/2 mos from her eff date of 3/1/2023.  Then right after she hits 6mos from her eff date, she''ll call for a ''cash-pay'' estimate.  Then will call us to get help sub a ''prev med care need'' to see if they can approve & send the pre-pd cc for pymt when she goes.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-08 13:41:12', '2023-05-08 13:41:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000119060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119081001', 'Gregory Curler', NULL, 'Laura called back, nice lady, 60 years old. She''s retiring in June, her husband, same age is already retired. She will be losing employer benefits, and did a search on health share plans. I spoke to her about Direct, took her online and went over plan details and pricing. she liked the plan and will probably move forward. Won''t need to be effective until July 1', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-08 12:55:59', '2023-05-08 12:55:59'),
