  ('zcrm_1579374000118971066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111523002', 'Laurie Gershgorn', NULL, '05.08.2023 Laurie called for not finding or haven received her MPB & Zion ID Card. We checked her email for Zion, and she did not see one. After her and I were finished, I direct transferred her to Zion, and I offered her their number.
