Laurie had questions about how and what and when to submit expenses on out of pocket appointments. I explained her plan is purely catastrophic with the essentials from MPB, therefore when it comes to filing expenses with Zion, her medical cost sharing company, it has to be NEED SPECIFIC and NOT ALL THE BILLS that she accumulates. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-08 07:52:55', '2023-05-08 07:58:55'),
