  ('zcrm_1579374000118964029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070067085', 'Kayla Boettcher', NULL, '05.05.2023 Kayla called wanting help in setting a preventative appointment in Portland, OR, since she will be there for 5 weeks in the summer. I guided her to the multiplan link to search for a PCP, we found over 400 on the list. She was concerned due to an experience she had with Multiplan link, where they come up on the list with ACCEPTING NEW PATIENTS, but when she calls to make an appointment, they share with her that they are not accepting new patients.
I consulted with Cari on this via teams, even though I know MPB does not have an actual solution for this, I was wondering how Cari maneuvered this or if she had any options. All we were able to relay to Kayla is that the nation is going through a huge shortage for PCP''s and one of the biggest reasons why we are moving towards the RBP system instead.
Kayla then asked if there are any discounts for Vision, and I shared that our plans do not include any dental or vision unless it cataract surgery for vision (per eye as medical cost sharing), and part of an already approved need for dental. I also shared that we at times find coupons/discounts on Whole Health Living Choices. I guided her there, she created an account, but we did not find any coupons/discounts in her present area, CA.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-05 16:50:03', '2023-05-05 16:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118964024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106045002', 'Lance Simonson', NULL, '05.05.2023 Amy called to be able to upload additional documents. She was having trouble logging into her member portal page. First I walked her through bookmarking the Member Updates and Portal page for future reference, and we clicked on submitting a need with Zion link. She said she could take it from there with the documents, then I shared with her the log in information for her member portal, but did tell her that all she would usually find there are payment information and receipts. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-05 15:46:40', '2023-05-05 15:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118964016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, '05.05.2023 Jane called back and ask to speak to Patti, to attain the 1095 tax form. RCI never generated those forms. Jane she spoke to a Becky, and Becky told her that RCI DOES NOT DO those forms, and referred her to MPB as our responsibility to provide them. I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, Jen suggested she be transferred to Patti. I direct transferred Jane. 
I also opened a ticket with the above information to document the ongoing problem with RCI and not having a useful response for our members. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-05 14:47:47', '2023-05-05 15:07:23'),
