  ('zcrm_1579374000118964008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, '05.05.2023 John called to learn more of what type of program we have towards prescriptions. I explained that we have the member fill out the RX Request form and submit it to us. We search around 6-7 sites, including an international shopper. He asked what would happen if you need something right away, and I said just call us after you fill out the form and we will get you squared away. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-05 14:40:00', '2023-05-05 14:44:04'),
