  ('zcrm_1579374000118996003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '5-5-2023:  Cynthia is due for her colonoscopy, so we disc how the in ntwk is tough in HI.  She said they''ve had a hard time find a doc at all.
     - No gastro anything comes up in ntwk.  We talked about IF they pull a polyp it would become diagnostic & healthshare w/1k IUA, but if they don''t it must stay in ntwk right now for the ''prev care'' w/Planstin to pay.  Told her to watch for an e-mail from Planstin w/a new ID card that no longer shows the PHCS logo.  We have no idea though  when that will be: 6wks, 6mos, 1yr, more?  She had a colonoscopy before & no polyps.  She''s going to see if she can get a PCP in HI first.
