    808-522-2624  comes up in the PHCS search tool.  This is who her husb is using, but in the past they told her they were not taking any other new patients.  I sugg she try to wiggle in:  Call & say, my husb is your patient.  I''m wondering if I can get on a waiting list, so we can have continuity by seeing the same doc.  She''s going to try that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-05 13:28:03', '2023-05-05 13:28:03'),
