  ('zcrm_1579374000118967003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636745', 'Scott Jansen', NULL, 'I opened a ticket for this member.  She expressed to me that she had cancelled her Liberty membership 1/22 and that she wanted all her monies back.  Per note below she had called in back in Feb of this year and I told her that I would refund the usual 2 mos, however that did not get done.  I have now refunded all monies from 2023 and have let the member know that John T will be getting back to her late next week.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-05 10:41:40', '2023-05-05 10:41:40'),
