  ('zcrm_1579374000118875008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, '05.04.2023 Jane called to get a form from Patti for the $81 as proof. I transferred Jane to RCI, 800-795-7772, to retrieve her 1095A. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-04 16:12:18', '2023-05-04 16:14:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118875003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109799008', 'Reginald Ashby', NULL, '05.04.2023 Reginal called to learn more about attaining a provider to go see. I told him that his plan is purely catastrophic and the essentials. I explained both and named a few essential services, including CirrusMD, Pharmacy...etc.
I told he may go see a doctor of his choosing, as a cash pay patient, request the cash pay discount and it could be that THAT appointment is all he needs or if the doctor wants to go further, and he reaches his IUA, then we open a medical need. I explained it might take a while to reach the 5K IUA, so be aware.
I sent him and Karen, spouse, a CirrusMD invitation link, it turns out he already has an account set up and just changed his passcode. He completed a change form to add Karen''s email so CirrusMD can recognize it and connect her account to them. I have him book mark the Member''s Portals and Updates page for future referencing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-04 14:53:04', '2023-05-04 14:53:04'),
