  ('zcrm_1579374000118868008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '5-4-2023:  A call came in from this #.  When I answered, it showed we had a good connection, but I could not hear anyone on the line.  I let them know I couldn''t hear them &amp; was trying them back.  When I did that, it rang &amp; almost seemed like it went to a VM?  However, again I couldn''t hear anything to know for sure.  Maybe they are in a bad cell zone &amp; can try us back.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-04 13:51:23', '2023-05-04 13:51:23'),
