  ('zcrm_1579374000118870003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '05.04.23:  Called John Holland, Janet''s husband to ask if he will be staying on the plan after Janet leaves and he said yes.  He asked me to send him the enrollment link so he could re-enroll. Called Patti to ask if Janet needs to do any paperwork and verify John needs to re-enroll.  John said Janet told him she hasn''t recvd. any notification from MPB about her aging out plan cancellation.  I told John I''d forward her my copy of the second notice.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-05-04 13:46:58', '2023-05-08 10:33:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118868003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372256', 'Daniel Biernat', NULL, 'Dorota Biernat is Daniel''s mom and she was wondering if he could change his plan since his dr. doesn''t accept his Cigna plan. Dr. accepts other Cigna plans, but not this one. I let her know that he can''t change until open enrollment next year. So, they will call me mid Nov. to make a new decision and make sure his dr. is on the network. The bill shows some portion of the bill paid and a separate bill that isn''t paid. She''s trying to understand it. Nice about it all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-04 13:46:42', '2023-05-04 13:46:42'),
