  ('zcrm_1579374000118787093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113410109', 'Jeremy Colbert', NULL, '5-4-23 Jeremy has a health concern that he wants to get checked out and was hoping he could possibly change his plan in case he needs surgery. But, he doesn''t have a life changing event. He''s already getting an APTC, so no tax time enrollment either. He''ll stick with his plan and schedule his dr. visit. If he''s able to wait until 2024, if he has to do something more significant, he''ll choose a more comprehensive plan for next year. He was hoping to review those plan options now, but I told him it''s not available until Nov. 1st to review for 2024. He was super nice and appreciative of my help and will stay the course. He now understands that the ACA doesn''t discriminate with pre-x issues. So, he''s fine on that front. 
Also he noted that he used his Delta Dental plan and it partially covered something that he didn''t expect to be covered. So, he''s happy with that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-04 11:11:09', '2023-05-04 11:11:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, '5-4-2023:  Nicholas sent an e-mail wondering why his monthly contribution went up last month.  I heard it being discussed & thought someone had gone over this with him, but he e-mailed again today, so I sent him the info in a "reply all".
     Nicholas went to a cc or debit card starting last month & the diff in pymt is the 3% processing fee.  I explained that & included the link to the pymt chg form in case he wants to go back to ACH with a note that needs to be done before 5/19 for it to change w/this month''s pymt processing.     - CA

Nicholas wrote back saying it was a great explanation & thanking me.  He will stay w/the cc or debit card for now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-04 10:51:45', '2023-05-04 11:12:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118825016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104976002', 'Kenneth Bailey', NULL, '05.04.2023 Kenneth called wanting help in finding a dermatologist. I told him that derm. is not covered under preventative, but it may be eligible for medical cost sharing, depending on the cost. I asked him to share more details regarding the derm. issue, and he said that he has a cyst on his cheek, and it might be infected - needs removal.
I consulted with Car and Jen via teams, and Jen confirmed it is a dermatological issue and can be submitted as a need request. I emailed Kenneth the directions to submitting bills to Zion, and guided him on how to proceed as a cash pay patient, request the cash pay discount and collect all the paperwork. That way he will have a lot more information to submit in the request, and will know how much it would cost. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-04 10:44:32', '2023-05-04 10:55:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118826002', 'Cathy Baker', NULL, '5-4-23 Cathy was born in Scotland. She has a subtle accent and is looking up her SS # since she hasn''t been here for too many years. Super sweet. She has 3 meds for hormones. Progesterone 200 mg,  Estradiol Transdermal System (0.0375 mg/d), Dutasteride (0.5 mg/1)  30 per mo, 1x daily. She''s enrolling in CARE+ for June 1st. We looked at reg ins on C4 and she''d get a small APTC of $132 and lowest cost Friday Health is $503.50 with $9100 Ded and MOP. Husband, Dave is on Medicare and born on 12/17/1955 and income about $100K since he was laid off this year. So, less than usual. I showed her the Welcome Call scheduler and she will go grab her calendar and set that up next for June 1st or shortly thereafter. She''s super nice and appreciative and feeling good about her decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-04 10:30:08', '2023-05-04 10:36:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118825011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117964015', 'Muhammad Asif', NULL, '05.04.2023 Muhammad called requesting assistance with billing and asking specifically for Patti, I asked him for a subject on the matter, and  direct transferred him to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-04 10:24:23', '2023-05-04 10:24:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058906061', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, '5-4-2023:  Patrick wanted to use CirrusMD, but was struglling.  We got him in w/a little work.
     - He''s aging into Medicare Dec 1st and had questions re: will this be pre-x then.  We disc &amp; he sb all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-04 10:19:12', '2023-05-04 10:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118825003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874007', 'David Traywick', NULL, '05.04.2023 David called to cancel his membership, I verified his account and direct transferred him to Michael Montes, his advisor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-04 10:16:31', '2023-05-04 10:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118758097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095345001', 'Lisa Negron', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she was under the impression that she had a membership that included the services of Total Family Health (OPD).  She will cancel this option and re-enroll in the OPD Membership', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-04 10:05:42', '2023-05-04 10:06:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111845002', 'Cindy Wolden', NULL, 'Jason called in to find out why he is being charged more than what the email he received from MPB stated. For this question, I transferred Jason to Patti. I answered why minors have to have parental consent for therapy through MAP as he found this ridiculous. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-04 09:46:40', '2023-05-04 09:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118748101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053149054', 'shawn warner', NULL, 'Attempted to reach Shawn again this morning, and got his voicemail again. I left him another message to contact me, I will also send him an email', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-04 09:08:05', '2023-05-04 09:08:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196002', 'Brian Gould', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 09:06:09', '2023-05-04 09:06:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196010', 'Robert Wadlington', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 09:03:44', '2023-05-04 09:03:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118748096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030826114', 'Dawn Marie Martin', NULL, 'Tried to follow up again, phone just rings. Sent an email yesterday, she opened it, I will wait to hear back from her', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-04 09:02:45', '2023-05-04 09:02:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118197011', 'Benjamin Edmonds', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 09:00:48', '2023-05-04 09:01:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118758082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 6/1/23.  I will process and notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-04 08:58:38', '2023-05-04 08:58:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118212001', 'Rustin Glass', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 08:57:21', '2023-05-04 08:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118219002', 'Mark Haynes', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 08:51:55', '2023-05-04 08:51:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118758069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105486012', 'Jorge Trejo', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 6/1/23 after speaking with Bern as she will now be eligible for Employer Benefits', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-04 08:51:01', '2023-05-04 08:51:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118748091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115365', 'Elizabeth Bennett', NULL, 'Spoke to Elizabeth this morning, nice lady. I explained that Sedera cancelled her out in February, and gave her the options as I was instructed to credit the 4 months of charges toward a new plan with Zion, or to get refunded. She chose to enroll in a new plan. I went over details of Secure, she''s happy with the plan, and will enroll today. We are also waiving the $100. enrollment fee.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-04 08:44:10', '2023-05-04 08:44:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117973002', 'Kristall Laursen', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 08:34:00', '2023-05-04 08:34:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118758064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004533005', 'Brian Mirsky', NULL, 'Member called in and asked a number of questions around adding &amp; removing family members.  One son will be getting own insurance in the late summer or fall timeframe and wife will be loosing coverage and wants to be on membership until aging into Medicare next year (2024).  I advised of Pre-Ex &amp; Deadlines.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-04 08:31:29', '2023-05-04 08:31:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109674008', 'Samantha Paul', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 08:03:16', '2023-05-04 08:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118821003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110554002', 'Dirk Anderson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Dirk. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-04 07:45:40', '2023-05-04 07:45:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118774036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '05.03.2023Kim called to check and see if we could come up with a less expensive coupon, or if we had a service for discounted items. I checked 4 discount pharmacy sites but it turned out her coupon that she found was best. In the future she knows to visit the member portal and updates page to fill out the rx request form. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-03 17:50:23', '2023-05-03 17:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118748081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095345001', 'Lisa Negron', NULL, '05.03.23:  Monica Rosa (P.P.) notified me Kevin called her and said Lisa and Jose gave them a Signa PPO insurance card and a Planstin card and think they are OPD members. He doesn''t know who to bill.  I called and spoke w/both Jose and Lisa.  They said they only gave them a Planstin card and Jose’s driver’s license and don’t own a Signa card. I explained the difference between the Secure plan they currently have and the OPD plan they thought they were buying from Leonardo when they originally enrolled last year.  We talked about the pricing and IUA levels.  Lisa told me her family always went to Total Family Healthcare and she wanted to retain Dr. Jakob as her provider. Dr. Jakob told her to call MPB to enroll in OPD.  Leonardo did not realize that was the plan Lisa wanted when she told him she wanted the top of the line plan.  Lisa wants to change plans. I told her she needs to cancel SECURE by the 20th of May for a June 1 start in OPD Complete.  I’m eImailing her the Cancel form link and she will, then, enroll in OPD with me.
Lisa said she had an introductory meeting with Dr. Jakob’s P.A. but no medical services were done.  It was just a conversation of about 10 – 15 min.  The P.A. wanted to schedule some labs for Lisa, then schedule a wellness visit in May but Lisa has now decided not to have  anything further done until June with her OPD plan.
I emailed Monica to apprise her of the situation.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-05-03 16:10:26', '2023-05-03 16:10:26');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000118748073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095345001', 'Lisa Negron', NULL, '04.28.23  Karina notified me Kevin Jakob emailed her to ask if Lisa and Jose were OPD members.  They were coming to the practice and he did''nt see them on the OPD list.  I told Karina I would look into it.  Checked their profile in CRM - found they are Scure members. Called Lisa - got a busy signal, couldn''t leave a message.  Emailed Kevin, apprised him of this info. Told him I would keep trying to contact them and asked him to apprise me of any info. he gets from them.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-05-03 15:48:49', '2023-05-03 15:49:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '5-3-23 To Melissa-
"Hi Melissa,

John Troutman and I spoke after our call with you just now. He is going to speak with the owner of Redirect Health again to see if he can encourage a refund of any kind from Redirect for all of your troubles. 

Best wishes,

Wendy Scipione"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-03 15:10:53', '2023-05-03 15:11:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '5-3-23 JT and I called with set meeting to let Melissa know that her $7K colonoscopy bill was paid for according to the owner of Redirect as of 2-3 days ago via a check in the mail. The call started off friendly and didn''t really end super well. She''s frustrated and wants money back in some form. She keeps forgetting that she changed her membership to exclude Redirect, so that she no longer ran into those challenges as of around fall of 2022. She lost trust in MPB and all of our services due to the year plus debacle for Redirect to pay for her colonoscopy. JT will call David Berg to let him know her frustration is ongoing and has spoken to an attorney and found new broker.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-03 14:45:52', '2023-05-03 14:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118767009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081146002', 'Lisa Doughty', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 3044 Question : unable to log in', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-05-03 14:28:02', '2023-05-03 14:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', 'New Membership eff 6/1 2023', 'Member &amp; Family $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 14:16:27', '2023-05-03 14:16:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to Change membership to the Secure and also change IUA to $2500 I will process and send member signature email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 14:15:16', '2023-05-03 14:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111535002', 'Michael Furi', NULL, '5-3-2023:  Michael  & Krista called.  He''s having a ton of bloodwork done thru the discount lab site & wondered if any of it would be covered.  They have the direct plan, so nothing is, & no ntwk for what ''prev care''/1x appt.  However, I told him to keep the breakdown & receipt in case the findings do lead to a ''med need''/issue.  He understood.
     - Krista is planning to have her annual gyno & pap, so we talked about sub the estimates for ''prev care'' approval to know what amount would be paid (the 1 visit & pap type pymt).  We went into quite a bit of detail & I thinks she''s going to try for estimates ahead of time.
     - HCBB:  They had questions on what it was saying, so we went over details & it seems like they really liked understanding and love the tool.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-03 14:04:25', '2023-05-03 14:35:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '5-3-2023:  Thelma called.  She has her ''prev care'' appt today, but cannot find her card.  She deleted her 2/23/23 e-mail w/portal info from Planstin.  So, I made sure she has their # &amp; trans her dir to them.  Let her know they can usually e-mail a copy point blank.  Planstin was having phone issues yesterday, so she''ll call back &amp; we can try together if necessary.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-03 14:02:32', '2023-05-03 14:35:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118776023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117877010', 'Jennifer Thais', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-03 13:44:09', '2023-05-03 13:44:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689015', 'Erica Hough', 'New Membership eff 6/1/23', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 13:39:50', '2023-05-03 13:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689015', 'Erica Hough', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form eff 6/1/23 to remove spouse Jeremy as he got a job w/benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 13:39:00', '2023-05-03 13:39:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', 'New Membership eff 6/1/23', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 13:26:02', '2023-05-03 13:26:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118774018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714174', 'Jatin Bhatia', NULL, '05.03.2023 Jatin called on behalf of his wife, Surbhi, re: a prev mamm screening result. The doctor called them and is recommending another screening, calling it diagnostic.
Jatin wanted to attain clarification on how it could/would be covered. After consulting with Cari and Jen via teams, both agreed that she should have the second mamm, find out results, then make a decision whether to open the medical need or not based on the results. I guided the Bhatia family to present as a cash pay patient for the 2nd one all services that pertains to it specifically. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-03 13:24:45', '2023-05-03 14:54:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, 'Per note below member needs to add her son as he has finished college.  I will process for a 6/1 start.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 13:20:20', '2023-05-03 13:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918002', 'Elizabeth Anderson', 'New membership eff 6/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 13:03:40', '2023-05-03 13:03:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 6/1 due to the fact that he obtained other coverage.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 12:52:39', '2023-05-03 12:52:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118748013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118784002', 'Sharma Atkinson-Staten', NULL, 'This member enrolled through the website sales platform. I reached out to the member and discovered she''d spoken with Leslie Jablonski. I welcomed the member, and I made the change to Leslie. I left Leslie a voicemail indicating the status. I updated both Zoho and Admin', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-03 12:36:43', '2023-05-03 12:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065985001', 'Denise Uhlig', NULL, '5-3-2023:  Denise called asking about her gyno annual appt.  I let her know her pap is included, but to stay 100% prev (she seemed to get it).  She did have questions about an ultrasound for fibroid breasts &amp; I let her know we are not seeing them cover those.  She''s going to call Planstin for better clarity there.  I let her know they were have ph issues yesterday, but I thought they''d resolved them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-03 12:32:08', '2023-05-03 12:33:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083535002', 'Christopher Carpenter', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 6/1/23  after speaking with Misty I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 12:24:00', '2023-05-03 12:24:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062467623', 'Christopher Bonelli', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request eff 6/1 after to speaking to advisor Steve Cox He called into me and told me he spoke to Steve 4/28 and that Steve submitted the cancellation for him.  I did not receive until 5/2.  I will cancel in A123 &amp; CRM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 12:15:32', '2023-05-03 12:15:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105486012', 'Jorge Trejo', NULL, 'Out-of-Order:  didn''t get this documented before Patti''s note (got called to another call first).

5-3-2023:  Yvette has been trying to get ahold of Bern for some time.  She says the VM is weird as it has Arnold Schwartenager''s voice on it, he hasn''t called her back, & she hasn''t been able to talk w/Bern at all.  There''s no ph # listed for Bern in the attachment above, so I sent him a chat w/her best ph #, showed him the # she''s been trying, and then forwarded her to Patti because:
     She has employer provided insurance that started on the 1st.  She''s been trying to get ahold of Bern because she wanted a refund of their May monthly contribution, but since she can''t get ahold of him I thought Patti should be aware of her desire for a refund.  Sadly, I did not have this not in the system for Patti to read.  I will send her a chat so she understands why I sent this member to her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-03 11:56:03', '2023-05-03 11:56:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118787003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, '5-3-2023:  William called.  He just got off the phone from Planstin for his dental & vision, but they told him we take care of those.  I let him know his MPB.Health does not include dental or vision, however, many of our advisors offer other products for those items.  Gave him the 1-800# I see listed for Michael for that.
     - Also took him to the MPB.Health pymt update form.  He''s looking to go from 1 cc to another cc, but we talked about the 3% processing fee & so he''s aware he could save that by going to ACH.  
       He thought he submitted the pymt chg yesterday, but I didn''t see a Cognito form & it sounds like an old MPowering Benefits site, so I''m not sure where/how those get processed.  If he submits the Cognito form, this will have come in AFTER the other site''s info, so that would be the most accurate new information (in case he now decides to go to an ACH especially).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-03 11:45:53', '2023-05-03 11:49:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118758054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115748002', 'Charles Chase', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Charles and Julie. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-03 11:15:21', '2023-05-03 11:15:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118776003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089065002', 'Susan Fontana', NULL, '5/3/23 - Susan called to verify that her husband has been removed from her plan, which he was effectively removed as of 5/1/23. She also asked to have her MPB member portal credentials sent to her which I did from admin123. I also advised Susan that she update her payment info via the MPB member portal. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-03 11:13:51', '2023-05-03 11:13:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118758036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110429010', 'Mark Strona', NULL, 'Spoke to member''s wife Taylor that is not on the plan. Will send Mark consent form to go over plan with his wife Taylor. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-03 11:00:31', '2023-05-03 11:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118774003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, '05.03.2023 Tessa called to better understand how pre-existing conditions work. I went over the timeline of beginning members the tiered shared per year. She shared that Zion deterred her medical need request for  being diagnosed with arthritis. I consulted with Cari and Jen via team, and they both educated me on how arthritis is considered in ion''s guidelines as pre-existing. They shared some language/verbiage and shared it with Tessa via email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-03 10:58:02', '2023-05-03 10:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105486012', 'Jorge Trejo', NULL, 'Member called in requesting cancellation.  I told her that she would have to speak to Bern.  I gave her his contact info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 10:46:03', '2023-05-03 10:46:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118759008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082256026', 'Doug Daniel', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation wan effective date of 4/30.  I reached out to Whitney to make sure he wanted that date since he does not age into Medicare until 7/1.  She got back to me after hours on 4/2 too late to get the cancellation in for 5/1.  I will process for 6/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-03 10:41:53', '2023-05-03 10:41:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118758018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118172010', 'David Slabaugh', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-05-03 10:31:15', '2023-05-03 10:31:15'),
