  ('zcrm_1579374000118706003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108430002', 'Mari Skalicky', NULL, '5/3/23 - Mari called because she received notice from her providers office that Planstin did not respond to a claim that was submitted by her optometrist. I explained to Mari that there is no dental or vision aspects included in the plans, but that I could put her in touch with one of the agents that sells separate plans. Mari was ok for now, but will reach out in the future if she needs a dental/vision plan. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-03 07:20:04', '2023-05-03 07:20:04'),
