  ('zcrm_1579374000118669039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108894001', 'Conde Johnson', NULL, '5-2-2023:  Conde called.  She tried calling Planstin because her annual appt from Feb 20, 2023 hasn''t been pd, but the phone was not going through.  I was able to conference her w/Planstin (but, it sounds like they''ve been having issues w/their ph system today.     - CA

