  ('zcrm_1579374000118668021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077957004', 'Amber Rego', NULL, '5-2-23 Amber and the group is cancelling for May 31st, 2023 going to an ICHRA. Sounds like it''s already in process. James Kreitman already cancelled recently.
