  ('zcrm_1579374000118667049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117738002', 'Douglas Weller', NULL, '05.02.2023 Per Jen''s request,  I called to confirm if Douglas received the rescheduling link. He said he did receive it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-02 15:25:33', '2023-05-02 15:25:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118667044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110363020', 'Javier Rodriguez', NULL, '05.02.2023 Per Jen''s request,  I called to confirm Javier received the rescheduling link. I left him a VM since no one picked up. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-02 15:24:56', '2023-05-02 15:24:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118669034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115632002', 'Tatiana Hamawi', NULL, '5-2-2023:  Tatiana called.  Her son is having pain & an orthopedist is being recommended.  She says he didn''t let her know of the issue until after they started in April, so we hope it''s not pre-x.  He definitely only recently brought it to her attention & so the initial visit is past their eff date.  The doc is $700 for the initial consultation alone (& that''s w/the ''cash-pay'' disc & free x-rays).  We went over how to handle if pre-x: 1 yr waiting period, phase-in, etc.  If not, 6mos deadline, $2500 IUA = their resp, but call us to learn how to sub ''med need'' w/in 6mos of 1st DOS (from doc recommending orthopedist?  or orthopedist visit), don''t have to be at $2500 yet, etc...     
     - We tried looking up the doc in HCBB, but nothing is listed and it was diff to find a ''fair price'' without that listing for the initial service.  She''s a physician & thinks maybe the price is so high because he''s world renound & a facility fee is in the $700.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-02 14:33:15', '2023-05-02 14:33:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118669029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108862002', 'Mark Witt', NULL, '5-2-2023:  Denise''s ''prev care'' doc''s off called to see if they are in ntwk (they do accept PHCS).  I tried looking on the PHCS site w/no luck, so I made sure they have PHCS'' ph # &amp; trans the gal there, letting her know they can look them up via tax id or NPI #, so will be better able to help her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-02 13:49:13', '2023-05-02 13:49:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118638226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098605011', 'Matthew Walker', NULL, 'Member requested cancellation eff 6/1 I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-02 13:48:42', '2023-05-02 13:48:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118638206', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109092002', 'Tara Bobesku', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request eff 6/1/23.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-02 12:38:06', '2023-05-02 12:38:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118669024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '5-2-2023:  Sara asked for me, but really just wanted confirmation.  Nahla had done a good job &amp; Sara was all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-02 12:34:32', '2023-05-02 12:34:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118667024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '05.02.2023 Sara called re: opening a medical need that she discussed with Cari. Cari guided her to request the itemized bill from ER to submit in the medical need. However the ER told Sara it would 5-10 business days before it reaches her. At first she said 30-45 days, and I thought that took too long. I consulted with Cari via teams to see if she has a different approach or a work around, so Sara is not playing with the deadline too closely.
Sara had to let me go because she got a call. But called us right back and clarified the 30-45 days was for them to label her bill as "self-pay". I guided her to ask them to actually label it "cash pay". Then she asked to speak to Cari. I warm transferred Sara to Cari. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-02 12:31:43', '2023-05-02 12:31:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118638188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030509001', 'Mark Murphy', NULL, 'Cancellation processed eff 6/1/23 aging into Medicare', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-05-02 12:25:35', '2023-05-02 12:25:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118667016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, '05.02.2023 Kim called wanting to better understand how to get coverage for her annual kidney services, as preventative. I reassured her it definitely is not preventative, and we got talking about medical cost sharing and pre-existing conditions. I shared the different tiers and she asked clarifying questions for the second year of pre-existing conditions.
*******************************************************************************************
Kim called back after a while asking how it would work if she''d want to take her son to an allergist. I told her this is also not preventative, and it would be more of a grey area because it is not large enough to be medical cost sharing. I explained how to present herself and at what point would it be worth considering opening a medical need request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-02 12:05:30', '2023-05-02 13:23:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118638154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118690002', 'Michael Patland', NULL, 'This lead was sent to me yesterday, by Jennifer in concierge. Reached Mike today, discussed the Secure Plan for him and his spouse Natalie. They are going to want to set this up currently just for them, down the road they want to possibly add employees and make it a group.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-05-02 12:05:16', '2023-05-02 12:05:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118669019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '5-2-2023:  Mary called looking for their ''tax doc''.  We went over Planstin sent out an email ~2/28, but she doesn''t have access to that e-mail acct, so I made sure she has their ph # & trans her dir to Planstin.
     We also went over $105/mo cont = twds her ACA MEC portion since they have a memb & sp membership.  For receipts on the full mo cont she can find payment receipts on her MPB portal (which she was already in).  I told her to tt her acct to understand what all she needs.
     It looks like Patti went over this w/her in April, but she''s still struggling.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-02 12:02:08', '2023-05-02 12:02:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118667011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420287', 'Payson McElveen', NULL, '05.02.2023 Payson called to double check if they provider (he called it clinic) that he''s going to see is in the PHCS network. I went on the MultiPlan link and searched with him on the phone ( I think his wife was on there too). I searched via, provider''s name, facility name, and 2 different zip codes but that specific provider or facility would not come up. Then I searched in two different zip codes for a general search on Family Practices, and 10 came that I generated and emailed via Outlook to them, with the MultiPlan Link to peruse more at their own leisure. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-02 11:58:46', '2023-05-02 13:31:50'),
