  ('zcrm_1579374000118668011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '5-2-23 Brian got a new job with new benefits. They benefits have already begun. He wanted to make sure those were in place before he cancelled MPB. I will send him the cancellation form now. He was super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-02 10:58:15', '2023-05-02 10:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118669003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104534011', 'Yu Deng', NULL, '5-2-2023:  Ruby called looking for her tax document.  We were able to locate the Feb 28th Planstin e-mail and we went over how to access her doc & that this portal will only be for this doc, not other srvcs.
