  ('zcrm_1579374000118667003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085042002', 'Alexa Fetta', NULL, '05.02.2023 Sandi called to follow up on the change of banking information that was completed  a while back. However the billing is still getting pulled out from the old account. They want to close the old account, but these transactions are stopping them from being able to do that. Sandi shared that she sent several messages to confirm this change, but has not heard back. I confirmed with Cari and Karina via teams on the next step on fixing billing errors for members, Karina shared that members go to Patti, and Karina solves and cares for the group billing issues. I direct transferred the member to Karina for this one, but will transfer to Patti next time. 
