  ('zcrm_1579374000118624028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '5/2/23 - Darrin called because he wanted to relay his frustration with our pricing for Dexlansoprazole 60 mg 30 pills. I did some more research for Darrin, but the cheapest I could find this prescription for during our call was $102.87 at CVS. Darrin told me that it was a ridiculous price and I assured Darrin that the concierge team does vast research for our members to make sure they are getting the best pricing available. Darrin is frustrated, but unfortunately we do not dictate prescription pricing. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-05-02 09:12:10', '2023-05-02 09:12:10'),
