  ('zcrm_1579374000118579033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650083', 'Meghan Van Vleet', NULL, '5-1-2023:  Meghan called in for several items:
     - RX Quote for her son''s medication.  Sent the following coupon:
               Methylphenidate 36mg, #30 tabs = $49.58 at Safeway on RXGo  [She thinks this is what the new RX will be written for.  If different, she''ll let me/us know so I/we can adjust the coupon.]
     - She wondered about ADHD on Sedera.  Their new guidelines are dated today, 5/1/23.  Here''s what I found in the Sedera Select+ guide:  "6.B.1. ADD, ADHD, Autism, and SPD Treatment = Maximum shareable amount of $3,000 per Member per Membership Year."  She already knows how to sub a ''med need'' to Sedera & we discussed deadlines, so she''ll get it started asap.  We discussed ongoing needs since it may take a while for them to reach their IUA ($1500 IUA shown - amt not actually discussed).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-01 18:19:24', '2023-05-01 18:19:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118566013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165413', 'Irene (Renee) Barbeau', NULL, '5-1-23 Renee moved to Sarasota FL from Louisville CO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-01 18:04:25', '2023-05-01 18:04:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118579017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115183002', 'Thomas Leach', NULL, '5-1-2023:  Thomas called.  He wants to have his annual ''prev care'' appt.  We trained on everything:
     - PHCS Seach Tool: was being finicky, so I sent him the Fam Prac list for his area, then he was able to get the Int Med list to come up.  Knows must curr stay in ntwk for all ''Prev Care'', Planstin = ''Prev Care'' only = only time you will ever present an ID Card (he had his in his hand as we spoke), went over how to handle labs, if he needs colonoscopy (somewhat, will call for proper details if needs this), healthcare.gov, etc.
       He was super disappointed in what the ACA MEC plan covers & had questions about ded on the card, but was fine when we discussed.
     - Went over quite a bit of education, using his post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail for guidance.  Talked a lot about the diff components, how sep they are, what does what, and to call us for guidance so we can help him understand best practices.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-05-01 16:37:53', '2023-05-01 16:47:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118549055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '05.01.2023 Brian called to cancel his membership. I transferred him to Wendy. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-01 15:59:51', '2023-05-01 15:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118566008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '5-1-23 Good morning Wendy:

As I communicated earlier this year, I believe the only course that remains for me will be to greatly lower my monthly out-of-pocket costs for health care coverage.

Having carefully considered my financial situation I have begrudgingly concluded that the only option at this time will be to switch to Medicaid.

Frankly, I have paid for 100% of my healthcare premiums and many costs on my own for the last 17 years with little or no support while having limited income.  The last 9 years I have been semi-retired without any form of income or the benefit of social security.  I have not filed a tax return since 2013.  

Making this decision was a difficult one and I have resisted going on the dole.  I hate the direction the country is going but have no other choice.

Previously, you indicated that you could assist me with this transition which I greatly appreciate.

Let me know sometime this week how we can get the ball rolling.

Sincere best regards,

Chuck Korb
chuck.korb@gmail.com
303-794-9368 (H)
303-601-3025 (M)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-05-01 15:19:42', '2023-05-01 15:19:42'),
