  ('zcrm_1579374000118470094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106317002', 'Kathryn Reishus', NULL, '05.01.2023 trying to better understand if her PT referral by her doctor is eligible for medical cost sharing. I pulled up the guidelines in Zion AO today, and it did state it is under alternative care/PT and is eligible.
