  ('zcrm_1579374000118544013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, '5-1-2023:  Tal called.  Went over $2500 IUA, 6mos deadline for sub the need per issue, no ntwk for healthsharing, HCBB for how to select a doc (his friend wasn''t rated very well), etc.
