  ('zcrm_1579374000118470023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107629002', 'Bryan McCay', NULL, '05.01.2023 Bryan called to ask a simple question whether he should open a medical need for a $300 bill or not.
I told him that it depends. If this is a one time incident and there FOR SURE will be no more follow ups or retesting or revisiting the incident, then NO. However, if it is an incident that seems to linger, requiring more testing or branching out to more specialists, then YES, let''s open a medical need and plug in all the receipts towards your IUA. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-05-01 09:39:29', '2023-05-01 09:39:29'),
