  ('zcrm_1579374000118487013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116613002', 'Timothy Foley', NULL, '04.28.2023 Has not had their Welcome Call yet.
Maryluz called to better understand their plan. I realized they had not had their welcome call, so I went ahead and SENT them an email to schedule it. I explained they will get a plethora of resources to empower them in using their plan confidently. 
She received an email from CirrusMD, and wanted to know what it is and how to set up. I explained it is telehealth, and each adult has to have their own email and separate CirrusMD account. When she set it up and was finished, the welcome page said "Welcome Timothy", b/c that was HER email as the primary email on the plan, so I SENT her an MPB change form, having her add Timothy''s email to be the primary, and change her to be secondary. Because she already registered her email on accident under her husband''s name, an email is sent out to CirrusMD to help make that correction.   
Timothy, husband, was out of town, experience severe dizziness and fainted and ended up taken to the ER. I guided Maryluz to contact the hospital back (billing), and present herself as a cash pay patient and request the cash pay discount. I SENT her the directions to submit bills to Zion. After she''s received the correct invoice and has fulfilled their IUA, I asked her to call us back so we can go through the form together and submit it. 
Maryluz was complaining about sever pain in her heel that she thinks could be fasciitis and would like to try to use CirrusMd first, so we are in process of sorting out their emails to better connect with CirrusMD. 
********************************************************************************************
Sent out an email to CirrusMD to help with the email sorting out, so Maryluz can use telehealth for her heel:
Our member, Maryluz Foley, under Timothy Foley (Primary), had her email as the primary''s email.
TODAY, she submitted a change form to add her husband''s email as the primary, and to change her email to become secondary.
Also today, she attempted to register for CirrusMD, and used HER email (which presently is still as the primary email), but would like to correct it to the following:
Maryluz''s email: lula_tim@msn.com > Make it secondary.
Timothy''s email (primary): Mach1llc@msn.com > Make it primary. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-28 12:26:05', '2023-04-28 15:30:56'),
