  ('zcrm_1579374000118398013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, '04.26.2023 Brian called to learn how to get coverage for the severe psoriasis. I double checked with Jen via teams, since I did not find anything about dermatology in the guidelines. Jen confirmed "...if it were to go above their IUA they could open a need with Zion." "...As long as the appointments and treatments will go above his IUA, he can definitely lean on Zuon for the rest." 
I sent Brian the instructions on how to submit bills to Zion via CRM, we filled it out together, minus the bills and receipts. Brian left that part to do on his own, so he can look and collect all of them, then hit submit. Briefly, I explained the process of receiving a confirmation email and hearing from Zion in a few days. If not by Monday, to give us a call back and we can talk to them together. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-26 16:13:55', '2023-04-26 16:39:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118319241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096042001', 'Jacqueline Schaible', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I checked in with Wendy and she advised that she would eb getting employer  benefits.  I will process &amp; refund 5/23 pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-26 14:38:37', '2023-04-26 14:38:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118384044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109491027', 'Allison McFee', NULL, '4-26-23 Patti reverted Allie''s payment back to the original cc since Allie removed the block on it. It should work next month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-26 14:26:56', '2023-04-26 14:26:56'),
