  ('zcrm_1579374000118384039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096042001', 'Jacqueline Schaible', NULL, '4-26-23 Jackie got a new job and we had spoken on the phone or via email. I had sent her the cancellation form, I just forgot I did. She was super nice and had a great experience. She did have an ACL tear but she never reached the $1000 IUA and may just leave it alone. So, there''s no Need to close out, nothing to be reimbursed for.  She knows she missed the 20th of the month deadline. But, Patti will likely still refund her for May since she has other new ins through her new company. She was super appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-26 14:24:49', '2023-04-26 14:24:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118319216', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116388002', 'Sophie Campbell', NULL, 'I received cancellation request from this member.  I will cancel in A123 &amp; refund 5/23 share amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-26 14:03:05', '2023-04-26 14:03:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118319211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', NULL, '4.26.23 - Lauren called to find out if CirrusMD has dermatologists. I advised Lauren that they do not, but they can see her for a rash if need be and if they cannot help they will let her know what her next steps should be. Lauren will call with any other questions. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-26 13:01:00', '2023-04-26 13:01:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118398008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115938061', 'Susan Lee', NULL, '04.26.2023 Susan returned our call back to learn more about the Pediatrics in the PHCS network, since we could not find her already doctor there. We generated a list together, I sent it via Outlook. However, later, she plugged in the office''s name instead and it came up, so she is going to double check with the office again, give that development.
She also has a mamm tomorrow and wanted to make sure she has the right Planstin card to present them. I called Planstin and had them send her one PDF version and hard copy. Crystal was so gracious to have it done while I was speaking to her on the phone. 
We talked more about how to present herself, and how to make sure ALL ENTITIES part of her screenings need to be in the PHCS network. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-26 12:08:27', '2023-04-26 12:08:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118319190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '4/26/23 - Quentin called because he wanted to know how to change his payment info. I sent him the payment update form. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-26 11:55:06', '2023-04-26 11:55:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118384034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109491027', 'Allison McFee', NULL, '4-26-23 Allie provided a different cc to use one time. Patti ran that card successfully. Allie has since corrected the card on file to work again which she wants to be used moving forward. So, no change form completed since no changes in the future. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-26 11:30:04', '2023-04-26 11:30:04'),
