  ('zcrm_1579374000118398003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103037010', 'Genelle Davis', NULL, '04.26.2023 Genelle called to attain a proof of benefits for her daughter''s extracurricular activities. I consulted with Jen via teams to confirm it is Planstin or Zion that offer that letter, Jen confirmed it was Zion. I direct transferred Genelle to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-26 10:44:53', '2023-04-26 10:44:53'),
