  ('zcrm_1579374000118385034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061161176', 'Lisa Ryerson', NULL, 'I took an incoming call from Lisa, she had questions regarding her Care+ plan. She wants preventative care as well, I went over all the plans, she is qualified for Secure. Went over pricing etc. She wants to change to Secure and change IUA to $5k. She has no contact with her advisor, and appreciated my assistance. I emailed her the change form, and informed her the Secure Plan will become effective on June 1, all good.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-26 09:40:58', '2023-04-26 09:40:58'),
