  ('zcrm_1579374000118394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069080024', 'Jennifer Vasquez', NULL, '04.25.23:  Recvd. notification from Mitesh Desai that Kevin Jacob emailed him to let  him know Kevin wants to cancel Jennifer''s plan but doesn''t know the process.  Said he tried to contact MPB but could only leave a voice mail.  Mitesh contacted me to advise.  I responded I would confirm the process w/Admin and get back to Mitesh.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-04-26 08:18:47', '2023-04-26 08:18:47'),
