  ('zcrm_1579374000118319091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571414', 'Donald Henig', NULL, '4/26/23 - Donald called because he had poison ivy last week that has turned into a major rash. We got him set up with CirrusMD and he was starting a chat with a doctor as we hung up. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-26 07:57:02', '2023-04-26 07:57:02'),
