  ('zcrm_1579374000118319073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118059009', 'Tambria Stinson', NULL, 'Per email request from Darius this member is requesting to push her start date from 5/1/23 to 6/1/23, due to winding up some medical treatment for something that would be considered Pre-Ex.  I will change in A123 and apply 1st months pmt to 6/1/ start.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-26 07:12:33', '2023-04-26 07:12:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118384029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '4-25-23 Thank you Wendy!  When the dust settles and I learn exactly what I will owe, I will definitely check these out!  Thank you for your help!

Best care in the world and I have no regrets going with Steadman Clinic and the rest of my providers.

L', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-25 16:28:49', '2023-04-25 16:28:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118385021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974125', 'Gerard McHugh', NULL, '04.24.2023 Gerard called helping his wife create a medical need to getting back surgery. Bianca woke up and was not able to move her head side to side or backwards and arm is getting numb from pain in mid back.
I sent him directions to submitting bills to Zion. We went over the sections to fill out. He did not have his bills/receipts on hand to upload. They are going to see the surgeon tomorrow to set a date for surgery, so I recommended that he submit it tomorrow when he has the surgery date available. I also guided him to up load his receipts by tonight, so he has less to do tomorrow when he''s ready to submit it.
Gerard was a pleasure to speak to, and wanted to further understand how the IUA works, and I explained as soon as the IUA is fulfilled, Zion will start kicking in the medical cost sharing, if the need is approved. 
Gerard will call us back if he has anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-25 15:57:31', '2023-04-25 16:11:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118384024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118473124', 'Gerad Castillo', NULL, '4-25-23 Gerad was born in ''95 and wife in ''97. They have two kids, 2 and 8. He''s an ASHI member! They do not have ins at the moment. His wife just started a new job and they have to wait for many weeks to even learn about the new benefits. He''s fine with a June 1st start date. They do not have any health issues other than normal kid sick visits. Only medication is birth control for wife. No tobacco. He started off saying he wanted a low co-pay. Once he understood he can use the virtual healthcare for no cost, he was much more excited to use it.  Otherwise, he prefers to go in person to their Ped. But, no cost was appealing to skip in person when possible. He used to have something similar to thing when he worked at a mine within a union.  Wife and kids do their annual wellness visits and shots for the kids. He likes the HSA as well. He''s self-employed as a home inspector. Looking at SECURE EF $1000/$690. He sounded pleased with the price compared to what he was expecting. We will talk on Monday next week to possibly enroll. I need to remember to use ASHI''s site to enroll and give him the $100 discount!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-25 14:43:20', '2023-04-25 14:43:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118319068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, '4/25/23 - Janalee called in because she was having issues uploading receipts to Zion for her need. The Zion website would not allow her to submit her receipts, so after some troubleshooting and no success I transferred her to Zion. Zion was in a meeting until 4:30 PM EST, so Janalee called me back with some questions regarding the surgery for her son. She is going to open the need today with Zion and when their team reaches out she will let them know that she is unable to upload her receipts to the site. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-25 14:28:27', '2023-04-25 14:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118342114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116388002', 'Sophie Campbell', NULL, 'Misty called in and let me know that this member wanted to cancel.  Misty said that she would send her out the cancellation.  Ok to cancel we I receive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-25 14:04:48', '2023-04-25 14:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118385008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '04.24.2023 Peter and Lisa put in RX requests today that Jennifer generated and sent to me via teams. I generated the email and sent them the following, in separate emails:
