  ('zcrm_1579374000118342104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755162', 'Scott Yarbrough', NULL, 'Scott called in and told me he realized that he had an account that he closed awhile back.  I advised him that we had been paid since 5/22.  He will be calling his bank and looking into this.  I will send him out the  Payment Update Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-25 13:06:47', '2023-04-25 13:06:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118319063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102931013', 'Jonathon Anderson', NULL, 'Kelli called to confirm her welcome call since she did not receive a confirmation email. She is all set to have her welcome call with me on April 27th @ 3:30 PM EST. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-25 13:06:28', '2023-04-25 13:06:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118381061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102931013', 'Jonathon Anderson', NULL, 'Kelli called and needed help with scheduling her welcome call as she said she just scheduled it online but never got the confirmation email. I sent her over to Jennifer and Jennifer was able to help her and confirmed her Welcome Call for tomorrow. All set! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-04-25 12:28:35', '2023-04-25 12:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118381056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, 'Jane reached out to me this morning on SalesIQ about needing help getting into her MAP Member Portal to start using her MSEAP Services. I sent her the MAP registration and info email over to her and directed her where to go and what to do. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-04-25 12:27:46', '2023-04-25 12:27:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118381051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583574', 'Carlos Guerrero', NULL, 'Frances called in to the concierge line and stated she know that we are going to be transitioning to the RBP instead of the PHCS Network and asked if an appointment she just had, that is preventative could be filed. I let her know that until she and other members get the new cards with the RBP info on them, she is to still go about using her preventative care like she has been through the PHCS Network. I transferred her over to Planstin so she can get with someone over there that can properly take care of her issue. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-04-25 12:26:33', '2023-04-25 12:26:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118381046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105428002', 'Steven Vertz', NULL, 'Steven reached out to me via SalesIQ about the bill him and his wife Catherine got in the mail for Catherine''s preventative screening she recently had. He was asking why he got the bill in the mail since this is something that should be 100% shared with their plan they have of SECURE. I let him know that he should have not been sent that as the facility should have sent everything directly to Planstin when Catherine showed her card. I directed him to reach out to Planstin and they will be able to take it from there to get everything figured out and taken care of. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-04-25 12:24:02', '2023-04-25 12:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118384008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063248011', 'Amanda Salzman', NULL, '4-25-23 Amanda called to find out the increase in price when adding her baby which is $1000/$420. She may move the baby to her partner''s ins in a few months for the other well visits. But, she was afraid that might get confusing to show ins sometimes and cash pay other times. I tend to agree in this case. So, she isn''t upgrading to SECURE. She''ll just move the baby later. She knows of the 30 day deadline. Baby was born on April 6th. She said she submitted the form today already. Patti didn''t have the form. I sent Amanda the form and called her to let her know it''s not complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-25 11:35:33', '2023-04-25 12:01:43'),
