Nichole is not very computer savvy, but is eager to learn and follow the guidelines to better understand her plan and how each part functions. Presently, she is seeking a dermatologist for daughter, as a cash pay patient. I coached her to ask for the cash pay discount. She was worried that they may not want to see her daughter without haven seen the PCP first, so I recommended that she call them for the appointment, and be open and candid and ask if they require her to see a PCP first. At that point she would have the Pediatricians list handy to research and choose from. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-24 10:10:03', '2023-04-24 10:24:21'),
