  ('zcrm_1579374000118308029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '04.24.2023 Jerry called trying to learn how he can negotiate intelligently with facilities, who he is interpreting are overcharging for Lori''s SPECIFIC RADIATION THERAPY.
I wanted to guide him to the post welcome call email, to find HCBB, but I could not find an email with the title Summary of Care....
I forwarded him the HCBB, guided him with signing in, we played around with the website and went over the color coded item, their messages and the fair pricing bar. Jerry was wondering if it works on details such as the name of the specific radiation Lori is getting.
Jerry is satisfied with Zion, tremendously, as they have been supported and covering his and Lori''s needs as of today. However, he is trying to provision Zion from over spending as it is a health SHARING, and based on a few conversations he''s had, he''s become aware that the present facility is overcharging (~$110k=~6 sessions). Jerry is going to do a little more research to compare other facilities that offer that same specific radiation therapy, the information he finds on HCBB and go back to the facility Lori''s presently attending, to try to negotiate. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-24 09:32:29', '2023-04-24 09:32:29'),
