  ('zcrm_1579374000118230122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116388002', 'Sophie Campbell', NULL, 'I received a phone call from this member who wanted to cancel her membership.  This was prompted by last nights billing.  She told me that she had young children and needed "more coverage" for them.  I asked if the membership was explained to her in detail by Misty and she said that she only exchanged "a couple of short emails" prior to her enrollment.  I sent her back to Misty to let her try to save the member.  Other issue is that there was no ticket made on 3/28/23 when this matter was originally brought to the attention of Cari.  This could have been rectified alot easier prior to billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-21 12:15:20', '2023-04-21 12:15:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118265018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '4-21-2023:  Robin sent Patti and e-mail 12:40pm eastern, asking to add her son: Finn Egan Rudy, birthdate 4/12/2000.  Patti responded, & cc''d me,  almost immed at 12:53pm eastern giving Robin the form and letting her know he cannot be added via e-mail, it requires the chg form & she included the link.  Robin responded by completing the chg form at 1:07pm eastern & submitting.
     In hopes of doing some membership education, I went ahead and responded at 2:02pm eastern, encouraging Robin to call the concierge line for guideance anytime she wants to make changes, or get instructions on how best to utilize her plan.  Gave her the concierge hours, ph #, etc.  Hopefully, next time she''ll think to give us a ring so we can skip to getting this done correctly point blank.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-21 12:09:02', '2023-04-21 12:10:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118230117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118196018', 'Amy Schecterson', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-21 11:53:08', '2023-04-21 11:53:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118270013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109659009', 'Massimo Didomenico', NULL, '04.21.2023 Frank, (Massimo) called concerned about viewing two payments of $169.95, one from the older account he had on file (checking), and another from the newer account (Visa). Frank did mention he changed his payment account with MPB to a Visa.
I doubled checked Admin123 but only saw one payment, 4/20 Visa $169.95.
I consulted with Cari and Jen via teams, and recommended that this goes straight to Patti, especially due to it being the weekend and him being charged twice. In hopes to get his money reimbursed to him ASAP. I direct transferred him to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-21 11:48:29', '2023-04-21 11:53:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118270008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115183002', 'Thomas Leach', NULL, '04.21.2023 Thomas called saying he was told to call the Concierge line to check on a Welcome Call. I said, I''ll go check who your host would be and I''ll come right back.
While he was on hold, I checked Bookings but I did not see him on Jen''s nor Vanessa''s schedule. I consulted with Cari and Jen via teams, and Bookings again till the next Friday, I did not see Thomas anywhere.
Jen reached out to Vanessa to see if she could squeeze him in, Vanessa shared that she could call him in one minute. I shared that with Thomas but then, as soon as I said V. can call him within 1 min, he asked "Oh how long do the calls usually take?" I said 30 minutes or less, depending on your questions. He then said, Oh I have to go to work.
I then sent him the schedule link email for him to schedule at his own convenience.
He seemed hesitant in letting go, and started asking "what about the telehealth...?" I said CirrusMD/Telehealth does not have a number to call, it''s usually via a', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-21 11:36:06', '2023-04-21 11:36:06'),
