  ('zcrm_1579374000118226028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '4/21/23 - Ryan called in because he is having a shoulder MRI done for a shoulder/elbow issue and he also wanted to discuss opening a Need for his knee injury. We walked through opening a need online and I sent Ryan information on the fair pricing for a shoulder MRI in his area. I advised Ryan to call us if he needs any further assistance with these matters. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-21 09:57:46', '2023-04-21 09:57:46'),
