  ('zcrm_1579374000118226013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, '4/21/23 - Danielle called in regarding the incident from the 4/5/23 note. She is ready to open a Need with Zion for this ER visit for her husband. I walked her through the needs process online, but I don''t believe she was at a computer. We realized that she needs her member number, but she was waiting to do a conference call at work so I gave her Zions number and advised Danielle to give us a call for any assistance with getting this need started. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-21 09:17:30', '2023-04-21 09:17:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118226008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084375002', 'Troy Axelson', NULL, '4.21.23 - Lisa called because the list that they received from the MAP program for therapists was a dud; all therapists stated that they did not participate with this program any longer. Since this seems like an urgent need, I emailed Sherry Myers from M&amp;S EAP directly. Hopefully we can get some assistance for Troy as he seems to be struggling right now. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-21 09:09:27', '2023-04-21 09:09:27'),
