  ('zcrm_1579374000118230003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093042002', 'Sarah Bailey', NULL, 'Member emailed in asking to cancel after hours on the 21st.  I directed her to be in contact with Darius to start the cancellation process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-21 07:33:16', '2023-04-21 07:33:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116046002', 'Mark Magnussen', NULL, '4.21.23 - Mark called in regarding speaking with a Christian counselor about anxiety. We spoke about the MAP program and Mark is going to call them when he gets a moment today. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-21 07:21:30', '2023-04-21 07:21:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118165122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '4-20-2023:  Thelma tt a doc today about seeing a diff type of dr: integrative doc.  Would this work for her prev care.  We disc ntwk req.  Resent her the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail so she has the PHCS search tool &amp; the healthcare.gov link.  She remembers those &amp; thinks she''s set.  She''ll call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 17:54:40', '2023-04-20 18:16:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118165114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, '4-20-2023:  Liz called.  She''s struggling with the PHCS network & when that matters.  
     - Her daughter needs her 2 yr ck up.  She''s in the car, so I sent her the pediatric providers listed in the PHCS tool near her.  We went over making sure all ''prev care'', which would incl immunizations if desired/proper timing, etc.  She has her Plasntin card = Prev Care & it seemed like she understood the ''prev care'' guidelines, like the prov must bill, etc.
     - Liz is having a symptom & thought she needed to stay in ntwk for seeing a gyno for this issue.  We did education on diag/treatment vs prev care and what the means (diff components, present differently, ntwk vs no ntwk req''d, etc.  
     We spent a good deal of time going over how to handle each situation.  Separately, hoping to make it as clear as possible.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 17:42:07', '2023-04-20 17:55:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118165103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291579', 'Darius Vasquez', NULL, '4-20-2023:  Darius called looking for his insurance cards.  We did a ton of education.   Everything from he has a catastrophic plan only (no prev care); how IUAs work 3/yr, etc; how to present if anything happens, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, offer to pay up to the 1k (IUA) & ask if they can bill for the balance; save pymt receipt & detailed inv, then call us for guidance; 6mos deadline to sub ''med need'' req.  We spent quite a bit of time going thru how it works if you do have an issue, not using ins vocab, no card to present, as well.  He seemed to be taking it all in & understanding.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 17:05:35', '2023-04-20 17:35:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118169048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578451', 'Wil Bowers', NULL, '04.20.2023 Wil called to have a Gastroenterologist PHCS Network List generated for the zip code 92057. At first the site was not working, I asked Cari to try, and it was still not working. However, we gave a few minutes, while we were talking, maybe trying to use a different zip code, and it finally generated the list for the first zip code. 
I saved it and sent it to Wil. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-20 16:59:50', '2023-04-20 16:59:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118165098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118172010', 'David Slabaugh', NULL, '4-20-2023:  David called.  They just signed up &amp; he was concerned that his acct still has his tax docs (1099).  I let him know uploading that in the next few days will be just fine.  He seems very attentive &amp; I expect he''ll get this done soon.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 16:35:51', '2023-04-20 16:35:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118169040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, '04.20.2023 Jaqueline called on behalf of her husband''s shoulder and how to maneuver the process with a primary coverage outside of MPB.
I explained when members have another insurance with MCS, Medical Cost Sharing becomes secondary, and here is how the need kicks in:
1-1st insurance will pay its portion
2-Member fulfills the IUA, and we open a medical need
3-MCS kicks in for the rest, after opening the need
I encouraged her to save all her receipts, payments, invoices, EOB and anything else, pertaining the procedure.
Jacqueline understood the above steps and will reconnect when she''s ready to open a medical need. I went ahead and sent her directions to submitting bills to Zion, via CRM.
Jacqueline then asked me about a skin condition that causes cancer that she''s experiencing and requires a blue light (that is pricey) to be applied. I told Jacqueline I told her that it does sound like it would fit the medical need guidelines, but a good conversation to have with Zion to confirm.
Jacqueline had another meeting to attend and had to get off the phone. But I told her that I would double check with my trainer, and call her back if she says something different. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-20 16:33:07', '2023-04-20 16:34:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118151103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118212001', 'Rustin Glass', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-20 14:50:02', '2023-04-20 14:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118169030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072394001', 'Susan Hoffman-Pletter', NULL, '04.20.2023 Susan is aware she cancelled due to aging out by 5/1. However, she got bit by a tick and has a large red mark, and wants to connect with a physician via CirrusMD. I sent her an invitation to set up an account, but apparently it recognized her as a previous patient, ONCE she reset her passcode with them.
It already says "Cancelled" for her membership, but she has until 5/1/2023. I''m glad she was able to still talk to someone to receive a prescription for the Lyme/tick borne virus that may have entered her body. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-20 14:48:09', '2023-04-20 14:48:09'),
