  ('zcrm_1579374000118169016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084286002', 'Jacob Cranman', NULL, '04.20.2023Jacob called to check to see why he cannot log in. He shares that this is the 3rd time he''s had to call re: the change of his email address. I checked his notes, and saw there was a process set in place and completed to get his email address changed.
Then I asked him to tell me where is exactly trying to sign into, his MPB portal? Or any of his other elements in his plan? It turned out he was on the wrong website (Empowering Benefits of some sort), so I redirected him to search for MPB.Health instead > Member Portals & Updates > Member Portal Sign in. 
He attempted his log-in information, but it still did not work. I asked him what his NEW email we should have in file and he shared cobycomputer@gmail.com. Then I asked him which one is the OLD email, and he shared cic@bavsound.com.
I told him, it looks like they changed his email in the system for communication purposes, but NOT his log-in purposes. He also had a DIFFERENT PASSCODE, I gave him what I see on his profile as LOG-IN information: Username: cic@bavsound.com & PSSCD: 9Qyhza3ywa.
He wasn''t sure how that passcode came about, as he has something else written down.
Everything was working fine at this point, but Jacob was extremely frustrated, due to two things: that he keeps having to call MPB to get this email changed once and for all (3X times calling) & that this is one of 40 accounts out of around 350 accounts, that he''s needed to change the email account on and that is giving him a hard time.
Despite his frustration, Jacob was patient, respectful and kind. He does request to have this fixed as TODAY IS THE LAST DAY for that old account, then he can no longer access it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-20 12:53:12', '2023-04-20 13:05:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118165074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115751002', 'Rocio Borzage', NULL, '4-20-2023:  tt Whitney &amp; offered for us to price all of Rocio''s RXs to make sure he is finding the best place to get his RXs.  She will get the info (he''s been in the hosp &amp; she''s helping him) and get it to us to price if she can.  I have one of the items, but she didn''t have the strength (mcg) for his RX.  She may ask for me since we started this, but knows anyone can help her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 12:44:01', '2023-04-20 12:44:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118165066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110974002', 'Heather Juby', NULL, 'Patti brought this member to my attention, after the cancellation form was sent to the member and submitted back by the member. I reached out to Heather to speak with her, got her voicemail, left her a message to call me back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-20 11:43:51', '2023-04-20 11:43:51'),
