  ('zcrm_1579374000118169008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821744', 'Scott Wingfield', NULL, '04.20.2023 Heidi called to cancel their membership. I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams to confirm the new process of cancellations from Advisors, to Jeffrey and now to Michel.
So I direct transferred her to Michele. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-20 11:24:32', '2023-04-20 11:24:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118195003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117525128', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '4-20-23 Brian watched the 9-minute video and said it was super informative. He''s enrolling in CARE+ since he''s employed as W2 employee and no other side income of any kind. His employer will reimburse him for his monthly membership fee.  CARE+ $240/$1000 for May 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-20 11:23:50', '2023-04-20 11:23:50'),
