  ('zcrm_1579374000118165048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '4-20-2023:  Michelle called.  She''s super frustrated.  She has a mammogram sched for tomorrow at the Ohio State University Wexner Medical Center.  Although, they are telling her they do accept PHCS, they didn''t know what MultiPlan was so she got nervous & called us.  I looked up radiology center near her & do not see them listed.  We tried a 3-way call to PHCS and could not get past their automated service to see if an NPI# was registered with them.  However, when I let her know I was going to disconnect & try again, it left her on the line & she was told by PHCS, OSU is NOT in ntwk. 
     - Michelle & I went back to the PHCS ''Spec Srvcs'' search tool (she''d prev been told to use ''Prev Only'' in the search tool - no idea if this matters, but did make sure she moved to the correct ''Spec Srvcs'').  She sees & likes:
     ProScan Imaging Gahanna Radiology
     Services: Breast Cancer/ Screening / Mammograms
          5593 N Hamilton Rd, Columbus, OH 43230     614-855-8740
She''s now going to try to cancel her appt tomorrow & call ProScan to get an appt.  Went thru being redundant:  make sure imaging center & the people reading the images are in ntwk & repeat that when making appt, at arrival, once they say they are sending the images to be read, etc.
     - She''s also trying to work to find a PCP & that appt is taking so long, she''s hoping it won''t be an issue w/them delivering her mamm results 2 mos prior to her PCP initial visit!     - CA

Michelle called back.  The top 4 results on the PHCS list are worthless.  ProScan no longer does mamm, one is no longer a PHCS provider, one of the ph #s is disconnected, etc.  She super frustrated.  We finally agreed she would try this one (even though she does not like that part of town & it''s not close to her:  JamesCare Comprehensive Breast Center Mammography
     Services: Breast Cancer/ Screening / Mammograms
     1145 Olentangy River Rd
     Columbus, OH 43212
     614-293-5066     - CA

Michelle called back again.  OMGosh, the above JamesCare is the same appointment system as the place she just cancelled her appt for (Ohio State University Wexner Medical Center)!  We talked though, and it sounds like JamesCare is a diff location.  I let her know that location can be specific to one site & not another.  She''s going to try that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 10:58:21', '2023-04-20 12:57:26'),
