  ('zcrm_1579374000118169003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366030', 'Veljko Ilic', NULL, '04.20.2023 Veljko called last night at one minute till closing time. He said he had questions about his plan, I said I''d love to answer all your questions, but unsure how much I could answer in one minute, till the end of my shift.
He said well most importantly, I''d like to change my banking information before the deadline. I said perfect, I''ll send you the form to fill out TONIGHT, so they get to it tomorrow first thing. It looks like he did just that, based on Patti''s note above.
I told him to call us back tomorrow or whenever he''s free again to go over his other questions, and we''d be glad to help him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-20 10:23:20', '2023-04-20 10:23:20'),
