  ('zcrm_1579374000118151003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964297', 'Brooke Bangart', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address &amp; Phone number.  I will update across all platforms.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-20 09:59:55', '2023-04-20 09:59:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118137003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116033002', 'Laura Boyd', NULL, 'Laura reached out to me on SalesIQ asking about the MSEAP MAP program included in her plan and how to get that set up to see a therapist. There is a list of names that Laura already has for her wanting to look into as well. I let her know that I sent her the email template about the MAP program with instructions on where to login to the MAP Member Portal, along with what she needs to do after doing so. I instructed her to call the number on the home page of MSEAP after logging in and MSEAP will be able to get her started with her 12 Free Counseling sessions per year after looking up the Therapist''s names Laura wants to have searched. She thanked me and got everything ready to set up. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-04-20 09:49:29', '2023-04-20 09:49:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118075098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to remove dependents Logan &amp; Anthony from her membership eff 5/1/23.  I will process prior to billing for 5/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-20 09:43:58', '2023-04-20 09:43:58'),
