  ('zcrm_1579374000118075058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104871002', 'Hannah Wilson', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy this member decided to cancel eff 4/30.  I will process ahead of billing later today', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-20 09:19:25', '2023-04-20 09:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118128003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118133001', 'Stephen Hultquist', NULL, '4-20-23 Steve is enrolling in SECURE for May 1st. I made sure they are 100% understanding the pre-x clause. He said they only pay $1400 a year for Terry''s appointments and anything related. It''s not something that is concerning to them.  Their concern was what happens if the funds run out. I explained the multiple back up plans in place. He''s choosing $915/$1000 for SECURE.  Used Safari twice and it wouldn''t accept the Captcha on an iPad. He switched to Firefox and it worked. He hates the Captcha tools bc they always break. He''s all set after completing the form 3x!  Also, Stephen Hultquist, Inc. (EIN#26-1183857).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-20 09:12:44', '2023-04-20 09:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118109021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '4.20.23 Bryan called because he wants to have something on his foot taken care of. We went over the self-pay process and how to submit a need to Zion. He will call with any other questions. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-20 09:01:01', '2023-04-20 09:01:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118109008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110974002', 'Heather Juby', NULL, 'Heather called to cancel her plan. I had a lapse in memory and forgot to send Heather to Michele for this cancelation. I sent Heather the cancelation link via email since today is the last day to make any changes to her membership. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-20 08:44:40', '2023-04-20 08:47:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118075043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091168010', 'Richard Clow', NULL, 'This member submitted a cancellation request due to going on spouses employer coverage.  Member has been unable to connect with advisor.  Will cancel ahead of billing later today.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-20 08:35:18', '2023-04-20 08:35:18'),
