  ('zcrm_1579374000118075008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041185005', 'James Roberts', NULL, 'I received notification from Sedera that this member was approved for Medicare and wants to cancel his membership eff 4/30 I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-20 08:12:57', '2023-04-20 08:12:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118075003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114324012', 'Brindra Lekhraj', NULL, 'Member left VM after hours re: getting receipts for reimbursement.  I resent him his receipt from A123 and als advised him he should be getting a receipt from FTNI and to look in his spam.  I also let him know that he can print receipts out of the Member Portal under Payment History.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-20 08:05:44', '2023-04-20 08:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118064011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, '4-12-2023:  Ilan called.  He''s quite upset.  Zion declined his ''med need'' saying once you''ve cancelled you cannot get help with needs even when you were active & in good standing.
     When we read the guideline regarding this, I see they talk about not paying for ''med needs'' once you have been withdrawn for not paying your mo cont & there will be no healthsharing until you are reinstated.  This gentleman was in good standing & it had nothing to do with that, so Jennifer & I colaborated on a ticket to get guidance.  [Sedera has a different system for sub ''med needs'' after you have voluntarily cancelled your memb, but the DOS is during the time you had sharing.]  So we want to cofirm this handled properly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 03:28:39', '2023-04-20 12:05:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118064003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098248002', 'Marcus Alig', NULL, '4/19/2023:  I found a VM on my office phone I hadn''t seen before.  His acct was telling him "healthsharing" didn''t qualify him for an HSA.  Taxes were due yesterday.  Since I found this late tonight, I sent him an e-mail letting him know it may be a verbiage issue.  That it''s the ''ACA MEC'' high ded prev care ins component that qualifies him for the HSA. 
     - Also gave him the Concierge Line hours, #, &amp; he can ask for me so there''s no lapse in time.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-20 01:11:55', '2023-04-20 01:11:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118038066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '4-18-2023:  At the end of the day, I found a ticket created super early this am (6:36am).  It says he has a dental appt at 8:45am &amp; wants to know about his dental benefits.  It is unassigned.  I''m brand new to the tckt system and cannot tell who opened this, why it''s unassigned, etc.  Since it''s past the 2 hour window he gave us prior to his appt, I''m going to ask for help tomorrow regarding how to read, see, and help w/tckts like this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-19 18:24:49', '2023-04-19 18:24:49'),
