  ('zcrm_1579374000118060052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117525128', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '4-19-23 Talked with Brian and gave him a run down of CARE+ since he''s been denied re-activation of his Friday Health membership. He''s well aware that he''s responsible to pay for his insulin and any medications. He got it for $3 last time at King Sooper''s. He has no idea why it was so cheap. But, he''ll try again next time and leave well enough alone. He''s also been to his endocrinologist already and doesn''t plan to do any wellness visit in 2023. He''ll wait to do all of it once he can get back on ACA for Jan. 1st start date. He also knows that diabetes is one of the few exemptions to the pre-x clause if well managed. He''ll watch the video tonight and we''ll enroll him tomorrow into CARE+ / $1000 / $240. His company will continue to reimburse him for his plan.  He''s clear it''s not insurance and he will ask for cash pay and utilize Concierge Team for meds, imaging, labs, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-19 16:19:02', '2023-04-19 16:19:02'),
