  ('zcrm_1579374000117989118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, '04.19.2023 Nicholas called and asked to speak to Patti to update her on the situation with Zion and Planstin. He was kind enough to give a little update in knowing that the process is moving forward for him and his family. I went ahead and direct forwarded him to Patti Boran. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-19 15:02:37', '2023-04-19 15:02:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087509002', 'Mark Carman', NULL, '04.19.2023  Janalee called asking for Jennifer. However, Jennifer was already assisting another valued member. I asked Janalee if she is ok if I can help her, she said it it''s ok to have Jennifer call her back at (801) 891-2267. I said no problem, I''ll relay the message to Jennifer. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-19 14:56:25', '2023-04-19 14:56:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111986010', 'Gerald Roper', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update ahead of billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-19 14:25:40', '2023-04-19 14:25:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118133001', 'Stephen Hultquist', NULL, '4-19-23 Steve 62 and wife Terry, 62 and son Gabe 21. They came to be by Mike and Christie Dee who are long time friends of about 30 years! Steve has known of MCS options for years and he just watched the 9-minute video. He got laid off last Friday and he''s going to be doing some consulting work already and he has a business entity already. Nobody uses tobacco. Terry has Parkinson''s disease and he is in FULL understanding of the pre-x clause. She sees a Dr. 2x per year and her meds cost $30 per month. They are completely fine and understand that they will need to pay for that on their own and anything related to Parkinsons. They do use a Functional Medicine Dr. in Longmont and also understand that anything alternative Must be pre-approved. They are super healthy otherwise and rarely need to see a doctor. Terry is a home-maker and has a side jewelry business.  They are looking at SECURE $1000/$915. I forgot to mention the $125 Admin fee and $25 annual renewal fee!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-19 14:24:34', '2023-04-20 09:37:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118038055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810668', 'Rosalie Chilcoat', NULL, '4-19-2023:  Access was denied so I sent an e-mail w/the 2 orthopedic surgeons in her area that are listed on HCBB as highest quality, fair priced.  I also let her know that although these are the two we can see, she should check with her Medicare provider for doctors allowed since she''s aging out into Medicare on 5/1/2023.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-19 14:03:49', '2023-04-19 22:59:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111697002', 'Prasad Salunkhe', NULL, '04.19.2023 Prasad and Haritha called to learn more about their plan. I referred to their Post Welcome Call email, but I did not see one in the emails below, even though it did show that the welcome call was completed. I ended up sending one to refer to for their resources, because reading the CRM it says "welcome call competed" with a date next it, and above "2 attempts", which led me to understand that the welcome call was completed and it took 2 attempts.
It turns out, I read/interpreted the CRM wrong, and that they attempted twice to reach them and complete the call, but it was not completed YET. Therefore the email was not sent.
The Salunkhe parents, Prasad and Haritha, asked a number of questions, which I did my best to answer through referencing the Post Welcome Call Email AND the Member Portal & Updates page.
Some of what they asked and I went into extensive explanations with are:
1-What is covered in preventative
2-What is CirrusMD - after I said you could use your telehealth service if your son gets sick, cause it would not be preventative. I proceeded to send them both an invitation link. Prasad received his, and Hathira was not receiving her, and kept asking to resend it vs. give it time to have it sent.
3-What are the elements in our plan? I gave them three examples
The whole time I understood that they''ve had their welcome call, and just needed reiteration. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-19 14:01:39', '2023-04-19 15:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118038044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108592002', 'Michele Jewett', NULL, '4-19-2023:  Michele called re: colorectal screening vs colonoscopy.  She decided she wants to use Planstin for her cologuard type screening & will call Planstin to get details on how to get that test.  Her family memb have had polyps, so her assumption is she''ll have polyps if she has to do a colonoscopy afterwards = healthsharing will help pay for.  She is very clear: IF she chooses this route, she will not have help w/the colonoscopy this year if it''s decided she needs to do that.
     - She has a DPC doc, so she does not want to go see another doc.  We talked about the only reason it would be necessary, is if she wants her ''prev care'' to be billed & cov by Planstin.  Her DPC does not bill ins.  An out-of-ntwk doc can order labs, (& I assume the cologuard type test) but whereever she goes for the test must be part of the ntwk & willing to bill for her.  No reimb.     - CA

Michele called back.  She tt Planstin (sounds like the person was new) and did not really make much process.  BUT, she kept telling me how she was explaining MCS to them - so we did more education.  Planstin is NOT the MCS.  Totally separate & that verbiage may be why the Planstin emplyee was so confused & unable to help her.  I coached her & she''s going to call them back, hoping to catch someone else.  She just wants to see how to order the cologuard & have it pd for by Planstin.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-19 13:13:07', '2023-04-19 15:39:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118038025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, 'jenlfisher@ymail.com = Jen''s e-mail:
4-19-2023:  ''Jen''nifer called.  She needed to start a ''med need''  for hormone imbalance that started after their memb (from what she''s saying).  But, we went over in detail everything: 6mos deadline, 1k resp/issue, etc.  The labs alone though are 2k!  So, she went ahead and got things going.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-19 12:36:45', '2023-04-19 12:53:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116266002', 'Edee Yuen', NULL, '04.19.2023 Edee called not feeling well, claiming chest congestion and prefers to be seen in person for the doctor to listen to her chest in person.
I explained to her to present herself as a cash pay patient and request the cash pay discount. I told it''ll come out of pocket, because it is not preventative and not large enough to go through medical cost sharing, UNLESS she has an HSA account she can dip into. She said she does not have an HSA set up yet. I told her I can check with my trainer to see what we can offer for information on that, but she needed to go to the doctor right away. 
She asked about prescriptions and was worried that the doctors might call it into one pharmacy but I found it much less expensive at another pharmacy, and that neither the doctors nor the pharmacies would be quick enough to transfer the prescription for her to pick up. 
She repeated the process of how to present herself at the doctor''s office. Other that being able to pick up her prescription on time, Edee seemed confident in the process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-19 12:23:11', '2023-04-19 12:28:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118041001', 'Simon Buchard', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-19 12:00:02', '2023-04-19 12:00:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094775002', 'Jamie Johnson', NULL, '04.19.2023 Suzanne from Jane Kassel''s organization called sharing a situation revolving around Remie Johnson called to speak to someone HERE at MPB. Whoever caught the call, is being considered the concierge line according to Remie, said to her that they cannot talk to her b/c she''s not on the plan.
Because there is no documentation of the call, who answered and the other side of the story, our guess is that they may have called some other line.  So I let Suzanne know we have NO record of a call and cannot speak to that story.  Suzanne shared that she is not surprised, and said she will have Remie confirm the # called is after all ours, and not accidentally called a different #, as it happens every so often. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-19 11:59:31', '2023-04-19 12:02:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118039012', 'Nathan Ellsworth', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-19 11:56:57', '2023-04-19 11:56:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118034011', 'Megan Knight', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA OPD Complete', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-19 11:54:14', '2023-04-19 11:54:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118022018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091168010', 'Richard Clow', NULL, 'Rich got transferred to me, Mike Montes with HSA for America is his advisor. Rich told me he hasn''t spoken with Mike Montes, knows his billing is tomorrow and wants to cancel due to going on his wife''s insurance through her employment. He didn''t want to wait for Mike Montes and asked if I could email him the form. I did send the CXL form and asked the member to try to get in touch with Mike Montes.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-19 11:52:02', '2023-04-19 11:52:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118038008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104973012', 'Lynne Howard', NULL, '4-19-2023:  Adam (& Lynne) called.  Adam''s knee started bothering him in Feb.  He went to see his ortho doc & wanted to know if/when he should start a med need.  I went over everything, incl 6mos deadline, etc.  Sent them the temp for sub a ''med need'' & went over in detail how to sub, what to expect, etc.  We went into IUAs in detail: 3x/yr, 4th & bey, & pre-x.  Talked a little about the timing on this knee''s symptoms (his other was replaced before their memb) & per him, it wasn''t until Feb 2023.  
     - He had basic questions re: diff between Planstin (=''Prev'' care), Zion, PHCS, etc.  We did some education on the diff entities & that their calling us is the perfect way to start when they have something they want to do - we can direct them.
     - PHCS: Went over it''s the curr req''d ntwk for ''prev care''.  Mentioned that eventually we will trans to no ntwk req''d & to watch their e-mail for a new pdf Planstin card that no longer has the PHCS logo on it.  That''ll be the cue that we''ve transitioned, but no timeline on how soon that will be.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-19 11:48:26', '2023-04-19 12:04:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117989048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091168010', 'Richard Clow', NULL, '04.19.2023 Rich called asking for Jennifer, re: cancellation. It doesn''t look like he was able to connect with his advisor. Since Jennifer was out on her lunch break, I direct transferred him to Jeffrey. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-19 11:40:21', '2023-04-19 11:41:24'),
