  ('zcrm_1579374000117989028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967010', 'Jorie Armstrong', NULL, 'I received a cancellation from this member after her conversations with Jennifer &amp; Jeffrey.  Bottom line member''s email was incorrect so she did not receive any correspondence from us.  However she interacted with me when her pmt declined and updated her Payment method.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-19 10:49:03', '2023-04-19 10:49:03'),
