  ('zcrm_1579374000117989018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 5/23 after speaking with Diane.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-19 10:05:20', '2023-04-19 10:05:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000118022008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967010', 'Jorie Armstrong', NULL, 'I spoke to this lady, after she spoke to Jennifer. This lady was totally rude to both Jennifer and myself. She claimed we are fraudulently charging her, that she has received no mail, and she has not submitted any claims. I went through her documentation, and all notes. She said she doesn''t remember anything, yet she has been a member since June 2022. She was demanding we stop charging her and wanted to be refunded. She was very adamant. She didn''t want to provide any information, she didn''t want to verify her email address, or any info. Finally I calmed her down, and found out the email address she provided was incorrect. I finally got her to provide a new email address, which I updated in the system. I emailed her the CXL form and told her to submit it today to avoid any further billing.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-19 09:47:43', '2023-04-19 09:47:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117983013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091168010', 'Richard Clow', NULL, 'Rich called in to cancel. I direct transferred him to his advisor but also let Rich know that if he doesn''t hear back from Mike by this afternoon to call me back and we will get this taken care of for him since tomorrow is the deadline. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-19 09:43:10', '2023-04-19 09:43:10'),
