  ('zcrm_1579374000117983008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095967010', 'Jorie Armstrong', NULL, 'Jorie called and would not verify her information in order for me to assist her. She states that we are stealing money from her, but she has authorized this payment by updating her CC that she had on file. After several attempts to have Jorie verify her information so that I could assist her, and she refused every time, I had to let Jorie know that unless she verified her DOB I could not assist her. Jorie hung up and later called back to ask how to cancel. I directed Jorie to the MPB.Health website to submit a cancelation. I spoke with Jeffrey via Teams call where he directed me to send Jorie his way if she were to call back. Jorie did call back so I transferred her to Jeffrey. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-19 08:23:33', '2023-04-19 13:13:53'),
