  ('zcrm_1579374000117971038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107280002', 'Bibi Frederick', NULL, '04.18.2023 Bibi called to confirm if the labwork requested with getting her daughter an IUD inserted is covered. I told her, and later confirmed with Cari via teams, that it is probably not, but an option would be to go to: www.jasonhealth.com and prepay for the labwork, print out the purchase and visit the chosen location to complete the labwork.
I emailed her the Jason Health website to peruse the labwork she needs to purchase.
She asked how to proceed to get kidney stones taken out, I emailed her the instruction to submit bills to Zion via CRM, and offered her to go through together, but she preferred to look at it on her own. I encouraged her to call us with any questions or in need of any clarification.   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-18 15:09:38', '2023-08-14 15:56:41'),
