  ('zcrm_1579374000117956114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117961010', 'Morgan Venham', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-18 13:32:14', '2023-04-18 13:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117971013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '04.18.2023 Christopher called to confirm the process to proceed with making and maintaining the preventative appt for an annual check-up. He had already generated a PCP list in the multiplan site. For good measures, I encouraged him to double check with the doctors office, when calling for the first time to make an appt. I reiterated how important it is for the appt to stay preventative and share that with the office and they''ll understand how to proceed. I also coached him to share he is with Planstin and to give the information from the back of the card.
I brought to his attention should they want to prescribe anything, to ask them how they would like to proceed with that to keep it preventative.
He asked what about colonoscopies. I said you will do the same thing you did with PCP, and search for Gastroenterologist, but the only thing with screenings like that is that you MUST make sure that all entities that are performing on your screening are in network as well. Should they find anything, it automatically transfers over to medical cost sharing with Zion, and we will talk more on that should the time come. 
******************************************************************************************
Christopher called back asking specific questions re: bloodwork. I told him that the only blood work we have seen get covered is the lipid panel. Should there be other blood work involved/requested, to make sure it is separated from the preventative appt elements. Be sure to ask them to keep the appt prev and separate the rest, present himself as a cash-pay patient for the separated items. He can then go wherever they requested him to go, or get on jasonhealth.com and choose the lab work and location he needs. 
******************************************************************************************
Cari and collaborated via teams and decided it''s best to reach back out to Christopher to confirm the appropriate process I shared, or the one he wants to go with, will keep him covered under Planstin.
Along the lines of  getting extra bloodwork done, Cari confirmed that not only is it JUST the lipid panel that is being covered, but also the BASIC lipid panel one. She told him it won''t do any harm to go ahead with JasonHealth.com to prepay for any extra bloodwork, have it handy for the prev appt, ask the doctor how would they like to proceed with this to maintain the appt as prev. 
B/C of where Christopher lives is extremely remote and far away from everything, and Cari remembering that he does some extensive traveling, she recommended that he get his extra labvwork in an area that he is visiting, that way he is not traveling 90 miles to get them done. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-18 13:04:48', '2023-04-18 17:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117969029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839147', 'Ashleigh Bechtel', NULL, '4-18-2023:  Ashleigh called.  She wants to get her mammogram/colonoscopy done.  We went over everything.  I even resent her the prev care e-mail with links for healthcare.gov &amp; PHCS search tool.  NOTE: she''s an old RCI memb.  She will call RCI to get guidance on her dense breast &amp; CAT Scan.  She knows we haven''t seen this be part of the gvmt''s allowed ''prev care'', but knows RCI can guide her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-18 12:55:16', '2023-04-18 12:55:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117969018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '4-18-2023:  David called.  His daughter is having issues w/dyxlesia & (ADD?) and they''ve spent > their 5k IUA.  He talked w/Wendy and she let him know he can try, however, this will probably not be something Zion will share in.  I let him know that with kids they sometimes have more wiggle room, but in reality, I have not seen them help with these expenses.  Reminded him of 6mos deadline - his wife has all those receipts, etc., so he''ll call later if he wants to get help sub these to see if they get help.
     - MAP:  Took him to Mazz & Sull site, showed him how to get asst, went over counseling pattern in CO = 12 visits per fam memb per yr, & that I do not know if occupational therapists are available, because it must stay in their small network.  However, I''ve seen nominations of you curr doc work for this program.  They are in Boulder though and it could be challenging due to cost of living.  He seemed to understand that.  He asked if they could use it as a discount program, where they pay the diff & I told him he could try, but I think that may be prohibited in the contract, as I haven''t seen that go well.  Went over how to use the site as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-18 12:46:52', '2023-04-18 12:52:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117969013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113500001', 'Diana Albrecht', NULL, '4-18-2023:  Larry called.  He''s having his ''prev care'' appt next week.  We went over everything, ntwk req''d, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-18 12:45:43', '2023-04-18 12:57:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117956103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117967012', 'Susan Baker', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-18 12:42:03', '2023-04-18 12:42:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117971008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072425023', 'Lior Moshe', NULL, '04.18.2023 Adria called to get clarification on how reimbursement process works with Zion, in re: # of needs per rolling year, needs unopened but maybe she needs to, when does medical cost sharing kick in, issue need specific. When she contacted Zion, what they shared with her was not explained parallel with how it was explained by her advisor. She thought she needed to speak to Patti. She thought Patti was her advisor.
She chatted with Zion, and became extra confused re: fulfilled needs, issue specific for each need and the 6 month timeframe per open need.
Via teams chat and me being on the phone with Adria, clarifying with the team and relaying the confirmed information with Adria, I WAS STILL unable to truly get her to fully understand how medical need reimbursements work. She continued to revert back to what Zion shared with her, which was not parallel to what we share with our calling members, nor what we are trained on.
She eventually had to go to a meeting that started in 1 minute, so we hung up the call. She attended her meeting, and I further consulted with Jen and Cari via teams. They recommended, at this point, to bring in the advisor to see if they can retract/clarify anything they said that may have confused her, or debunk or better understand what Zion told her. 
I went ahead and messaged Joan Phelps via teams with: ".......(above explanation)....Wondering if you could make a difference with her, since she''s your member and you might like to explain in a way you''d want her to maneuver the plan and services."   - NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-18 11:25:05', '2023-04-18 13:12:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117971003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, '04.18.2023 Nicholas emailed Cari and I on 04.17.2023 re: the same situation of his son not getting coverage for his prev appt (note above on 04.03/11.2023). Today he called to check on that same situation, and bring to our attention, another situation (of possible same reason), possible in need of new cards, since the same thing happened to Nicholas at his annual checkup today "Planstin" card shares that his plan is not active.
After consulting with Jen and Cari via teams, I was coached to go ahead and transfer him to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-18 11:09:49', '2023-04-18 13:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117953058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126948009', 'Audrey Byram', NULL, 'Audrey called me back, nice lady, she is a small business owner, the plan would be just for her. Answered all he questions, and sent email with all details. She will let me know what she decides.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-18 11:08:53', '2023-04-18 11:08:53'),
