  ('zcrm_1579374000117956093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105478001', 'Sean Little', 'Address Change', 'I received an email from Planstin that this member contacted them to submit an address change.  I will update across all platforms.  No change form was submitted.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-18 10:34:44', '2023-04-18 10:34:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115996020', 'Cord Dorcey', NULL, '4-18-2023:  Cord called.  He spained or broke his ankle per a conv w/CirrusMD doc &amp; wondered where to go.  We looked up the Urg Care cntrs near him with no luck on rating, reviews, etc.  He''ll present as ''cash-pay'', knows he is resp for 1k IUA, &amp; will call us once he''s settled so we can help him sub a ''med need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-18 10:31:55', '2023-04-18 10:31:55'),
