  ('zcrm_1579374000117936036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040874041', 'Robert McCord', NULL, '4/18/23 - Rob called to get a Proof of Benefits letter for his sons college. I advised Rob to ask RCI for this letter, they will usually email it right to the member. I warm transferred Rob over to RCI. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-18 09:00:11', '2023-04-18 09:00:11'),
