  ('zcrm_1579374000117958028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111536002', 'Chester Yang', NULL, '4-17-2023:  Chester called.  His wife has as ear infection.  HI is super hard to get into doctors, so we went over Fam Prac or can go to an ENT (talked about price diff w/fam prac vs specialist), but w/a $2500 IUA, they will prob be mostly out-of-pocket (or HSA, which he had no idea what it was, so we discussed this too.  I suggested he call Christine Corsini, because she''s part of Wiley''s gr & HSA of America & could work w/them directly?).  If it looks like this may be ongoing he knows there''s a 6-mo deadline for including fees in the IUA & ''med need''.  He will call if they get to that point.
     - He was able to access & walk thru HCBB & healthgrades with me.  He''s going to dig in & see if he can make an appt somewhere.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-17 16:03:20', '2023-04-17 16:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117959008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104871002', 'Hannah Wilson', NULL, '4-17-23 Hannah wants to cancel. But, once I explained that she can''t enroll in reg ins outside of open enrollment, then she got cold feet. She wouldn''t reveal why she wanted to cancel. I suggested if it was for financial reason, she might qualify for a subsidy depending on her situation. She hasn''t used her membership yet, so no complaints on that front. After I showed her how to cancel, she decided she wants to think it over for another way or two. I let her know to decide before the 20th or early on the 20th if she plans to cancel. She understood.  She''s very sweet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-17 15:51:37', '2023-04-17 15:51:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117958023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084375002', 'Troy Axelson', NULL, '4-17-2023:  Lisa called.  She had her mamm &amp; it''s all been declined.  We talked about being in ntwk &amp; she said last time the office was.  I sent her a list from PHCS so she can look for the facility, their address, etc.  Whether she finds them or not, she''s going to call Planstin to find out why the bill was declined.  If she has questions after that, she''ll call us again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-17 15:32:55', '2023-04-17 15:32:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117953043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110880002', 'Alexander Crowe', NULL, 'Spoke to Alex, explained the RBP has just started rolling out. He did take his child to a dr in the network, but the child was seen by another dr in the same group. I told Alex to get the facility to provide him with an itemized bill and an EOB in case we need to have him submit that to us.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-17 14:16:55', '2023-04-17 14:16:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117958018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '4-17-2023:  RX Quote request:
     - Sildenafil Citrate 100mg, #30 tabs - Sent Safeway coupon for $17.03 on RXGo which = cheapest Safeway coupon
        tt Tim, he will call further ahead next time in case Cost+ is cheapest again (= $10.40 w/s&amp;h today).  He also prefers Safeway this time even though KS is $12.19.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-17 14:05:57', '2023-04-17 14:05:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117953038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110880002', 'Alexander Crowe', NULL, 'Michelle forwarded this to me. I reached out to Alex, got his voicemail, left a message for a return call.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-17 13:55:30', '2023-04-17 13:55:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117953033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118268030', 'Matthew Garcia', NULL, 'Kayla, Matthew''s wife called me back. I went over the Direct Plan with her. It would just be for Matthew and the 3 kids. I emailed her all the information, and the enrollment. She will decide by tonight.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-17 12:31:45', '2023-04-17 12:31:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117958013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, '4-17-2023:  Ashley called.  Our PHCS system was not working last week.  They did call PHCS, but almost all the providers are NPs & he''d like a reg doc.  They are trying to find a doctor for Anthony to see, but it will revolve around his recent emerg.  PHCS was still not working today, so we talked prev vs diag/treatment & she was okay looking at HCBB.  We went there together & I showed her how to look up the docs, find fair price, etc.  She loved having that source. 
     - Then we started a med need w/Zion for his emergency hosp care Monday, 4/3/23.  She knows they are resp for the first $2500 IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-17 12:13:30', '2023-04-17 12:13:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117939088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117961002', 'Ryan Banuelos', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-17 12:08:52', '2023-04-17 12:08:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117939083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109285002', 'Michael Danze', NULL, 'Member reached to me letting me know that his 5/23 payment would decline and that most likely he would be able to make payment on 4/28 due to him having money at that time.  I advised that letters would still go out and that he should be in touch with me when I should run the payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-17 11:43:38', '2023-04-17 11:43:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117956071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111949018', 'Jonathan Smoot', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-17 11:26:52', '2023-04-17 11:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117956056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111982002', 'Steven Tracy', NULL, 'Mailbox full. Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-17 11:19:35', '2023-04-17 11:19:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117959003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '4-17-23 I called Direct Vision and relayed this to Estefania to use her benefits.

The Reference # below is your Member ID # 300058428.
that you must use for them to find you in their system.  They mailed you an ID card with this information as well.
Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan A
