If you want a digital ID card, you can go to VSP.com and create your online account using the last 4 digits of the Member ID # listed above. If all of that fails, you can also call the Claims Dept. at 1-800-877-7195.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-17 11:14:23', '2023-04-17 11:14:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117956048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113480010', 'Bruce Gibson', NULL, 'Mailbox full. Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-17 10:57:07', '2023-04-17 10:57:16');
