  ('zcrm_1579374000117958003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904449', 'Hein Brutsaert', NULL, '4-17-2023:  Hein called looking for his tax document.  This CRM file says no ''MEC'', so I suggested he try Redirect.  I let him know I did not know for sure, but they would be the only ones I can think might be able to help.  He was sent our way by Sedera, where Christine told him he had APEX.  Not sure where she got that info.  I made sure he has Redirect''s ph # &amp; transferred him to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-17 10:38:10', '2023-04-17 10:38:10'),
