  ('zcrm_1579374000117939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, 'Member emailed in requesting cancellation.  I responded to her and directed her to speak with Diane to start the cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-17 07:53:50', '2023-04-17 07:53:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117936013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109506013', 'Denise Korab', NULL, '4.17.23 - Denise called to update her payment info and to inquire about how to do prescriptions. I explained prescriptions to Denise and sent her both the script quote form and payment update form via email. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-17 07:38:07', '2023-04-17 07:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117849064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116830026', 'Rob Roth', NULL, '4-13-23 "Hi, Wendy - 

Stuart Lubline and I worked on this together and both came to the same conclusion - Rob should still be able to qualify for Medicaid. He doesn’t make enough to afford a marketplace plan. I gave him a few numbers to call. I think they erroneously denied him.  He is able to have them redetermine his eligibility. 

I told him to let me know if anything changes. I think they try to kick off as many people as possible and unless you challenge them and fight for yourself, you will get kicked off. 

Thanks,
Traci"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-14 22:18:20', '2023-04-14 22:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117878058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '04.14.2023 Kallie called to learn of radiology centers in her area, due to a jammed finger. I narrated the steps I was taking to get that list, by telling her that I''ll be using healthcare bluebook site to bring up a few facilities. She said she was familiar with the site, I generated radiology in her zip code, copied and pasted what was on the screen. I shared both the list of radiology facilities, the URL to the site HCBB, via email on CRM. I also encouraged her to call her PCP directly to ask if she needs a referral to get an X-Ray, and to peruse the HCBB site for more facilities, their ratings and quality of work. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-14 15:56:31', '2023-04-14 16:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117878053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, '04.14.2023 Anthony called to attain a PCP list in the PHCS network.
I tried generating a list a few times, but the site was not functioning for me. I consulted with Cari via teams, to see if she can pull on up for us, but she too could not get it to generate.
She recommended that Anthony go ahead and speak to PHCS MultiPlan Specific Services directly, (and that he''ll need to know that full name of the network because they will ask) for help: 866-981-7427.
I shared that with Anthony and he was ready to speak to them, so I directly transferred him to them. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-14 15:55:49', '2023-04-14 15:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117878032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004367112', 'Noah Spencer', NULL, '04.14.2023 Noah called to get help with opening a medical need request. I''m not familiar with the CareZ plan, so I scrolled down to learn more about it. 
I consulted with Cari via teams. She confirmed it is Zion and, she shared that all he would need to provide are: &nbsp;payment receipts, detailed invoices (super bill just means it includes medical coding &amp; that''s ideal, but best to get whatever turned in). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-14 15:01:25', '2023-04-14 15:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839316', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117870002', 'David Ward', 'Member & Fam $1000 IUA Secure', NULL, 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 14:32:31', '2023-04-14 14:32:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839311', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117870002', 'David Ward', 'Additional Dependent', 'Linda Ward  SS# 025-41-0491 DOB 5/20/2013', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 14:32:02', '2023-04-14 14:32:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839301', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106720002', 'Jessica Chariton', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will process in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 14:20:18', '2023-04-14 14:20:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117866137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106720002', 'Jessica Chariton', NULL, '4-14-2023:  Jessica called for 2 items:
     - We walked thru changing her pymt form.  She completed the form to a new cking acct while we were on the phone.  
     - Her husb is going to quit his job, needing healthcare in July, so we discissed adding him & the form.  It looks like an addl $180/mo cont to go to Memb & Fam from Memb & Children, so she will submit this between June 1 - 19th, for a July 1st eff date.  (I did warn her, the concierge line does not do pricing, but that is my estimate.  Both she & her husb are early 40s & this is the Direct plan.)  She''s aware of the 6-mos waiting period for prev when he comes onto the plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-14 13:58:48', '2023-04-14 13:58:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839286', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094942002', 'Tim Ottmann', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove dependent Karli eff 5/1/23 since she now has her own coverage.  I will remove her from membership &amp; update Plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 13:50:15', '2023-04-14 13:50:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117878024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104790012', 'Jessica Perez', NULL, '04.14.2023 Jessica called checking in on where Zion is at with her medical need request (maternity). She submitted a request on the 4th.
I consulted with Cari via teams to confirm the best action to take, given the ball is in Zion''s court. She shared some options that I shared with Jessica. I told Jessica that b/c pregnancies last 9-mos, it takes them time to assign the cases.  I asked her if she''s responded & signed the HIPPA form if they''ve requested it, and to check her spam folder, in case it didn''t show up. Jessica checked and not HIPPA form there, a good reason to contact Zion to better understand where they are in the process. So I offered her to either:
     1)  Call Zion (give them her ph # & use #5 on the menu = need dept) to make sure they can see it & they can tell her what to expect.
OR
     2) Give them until the middle of next week, then do the above.
Jessica decided to talk to them today. I encouraged her to contact them to learn why they haven''t sent the HIPPA form at least and if she''s missing something. 
After we were done, I directly transferred her to Zion, and gave her their phone number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-14 13:40:19', '2023-04-14 14:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839276', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117863002', 'Jonathan Chin', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation because it has been determined that he enrolled in the wrong plan.  I will cancel his Essentials enrollment &amp; refund him the $25.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 13:36:07', '2023-04-14 13:36:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839261', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844140', 'Kevin Pfaff', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 13:29:17', '2023-04-14 13:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839246', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100863002', 'Nathaniel Lowrie', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form to change Payment method.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 13:24:29', '2023-04-14 13:24:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839236', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073951054', 'Jerry Handley', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation  eff 5/23 due to getting Employer Coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-14 13:19:16', '2023-04-14 13:19:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117849059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004367112', 'Noah Spencer', NULL, '4-14-23 Noah called to ask how to submit a Need with Zion. He''s on their site and about ready to submit it for dermatology visits and MOHS surgery and biopsy. It''s exceeded $1000. I let him know of the 6 month time limit and to ask for a Super Bill and to submit receipts. He''ll do that and call the MPB Concierge Team for help. He also needs to request a new MPB.health card. He doesn''t have one for some reason. He''s all set for now and appreciative as always.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-14 13:14:55', '2023-04-14 13:14:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117866132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060844140', 'Kevin Pfaff', NULL, '4-14-2023:  Laura called to update their pymt info.  I walked her thru the pymt chg form &amp; she was completing it while we were on the phone.  sb submitted shortly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-14 12:44:02', '2023-04-14 12:44:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839231', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100863002', 'Nathaniel Lowrie', NULL, 'Nathaniel called in this morning, indicating he had done his welcome call, and was asking about dental and vision. He also has a change of address. I sent him the change form, and info on Denali for dental and vision.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-14 11:56:44', '2023-04-14 11:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117878019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094942002', 'Tim Ottmann', NULL, '04.14.2023 Angela called back to confirm if there''s anything else they need to do to complete the process of removing their daughter, Karli, from the plan.
She specifically asked about the Value Benefits of America, wondering if she needs to do anything with them too. I told her that sounds like an companion product from Analisa, her advisor, and she might need to speak to her.
I messaged Cari via teams and she confirmed that is correct for Angela to do, contact Analisa to make that specific change. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-14 11:43:38', '2023-04-14 11:43:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117866127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100863002', 'Nathaniel Lowrie', NULL, '4-14-2023:  Nathaniel called.  We walked thru chg''ing his cking info on the pymt update form (staying w/ACH).  He sb all set and was working on it as we were on the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-14 11:39:51', '2023-04-14 11:39:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117866116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094942002', 'Tim Ottmann', NULL, '4-14-2023:  Angela called.
     - Next week getting all her ''prev care'' annual appt & mamm.  She seems to have a handle on how to present & we went over ''everything must stay in ntwk'' (ie: labs, entity that reads the mamm, etc.)  Sally Jobe for her mamm in Parker, CO is not in the PHCS search tool, but at Sky Ridge it is, so she''s going to look into that.  
     - Karli, their daughter now has employer prov health ins.  We discussed how to fill out the ''chg form'' so their memb goes to Memb & Spouse, rather than Memb & Fam eff 5/1/2023.  I estimated the savings at ~$190/mo cont.  Going from $690/mo cont to $500/mo cont.  But, told her we don''t do pricing here on the concierge line, so that''s my guess.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-14 11:02:40', '2023-04-14 11:18:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117875071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114217012', 'Kelli Greene', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code card. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-14 11:02:31', '2023-04-14 11:17:40'),
