  ('zcrm_1579374000117798102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874007', 'David Traywick', NULL, '4-13-2023:  David called upset he''s still be charged each month, when Sedera''s e-mail told him he would automatically be cancelled at the end of Jan.  I tried to explain, they may have cancelled him, but it doesn''t look like we were aware of it.  I offered to have someone from billing call him & he had a very difficult time understanding it wasn''t me, the MPB Concierge Line team member that could help him, it was someone in MPB billing.  Finally, I think he understood.
     - I created ticket # 2599 asking for someone to call him re: his CE''d memb, no further charges, and a refund for the mo contributions since his cancellation.
        He will call us back in a few days if he hasn''t heard anything yet as follow-up.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-13 13:05:51', '2023-04-13 13:06:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117849029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115246001', 'Kristi Anderson', NULL, 'Vanessa called me after her welcome with this member.  It came up that the member had requested a Change of IUA prior to her start date.  Michele had gone in and changed it on 3/8/23, but did not update in CRM.  I verified w/Planstin that plan was correct IUA.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-13 13:01:16', '2023-04-13 13:01:16'),
