  ('zcrm_1579374000117839103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117863002', 'Jonathan Chin', NULL, 'Jonathan was chatting with Kelly through Sales IQ to find out if his enrollment went through. He asked about the benefits on the plan, and was informed it had no catastrophic or preventative. He was advised to call me, which he did. I spoke to him about Direct Plan and gave him pricing. However, he came to us through his mom who is friendly with Karen Torsoe. I referred him to Karen to make any plan changes if that''s what he wants to do.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-13 11:36:03', '2023-04-13 11:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117864058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155119', 'Timothy Cook', NULL, 'I received notification that this member never submitted dependent Gabriel''s SS# after he was added in 2019.  I reached out to the member and left VM. I heard back from Tim with Gabriel''s SS#.  I uploaded it into the RCI Portal.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-13 11:31:16', '2023-04-14 08:58:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117798086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '04.13.2023 Jennifer called to learn why her sons annual visits back in december, were not covered completely by  Planstin.
I asked Jennifer what exactly was performed at the visit, but all I understood from her was that one of her sons received an HPV vax, which I shared with her it is covered under the ACA guidelines, according the healthcare.gov.
Jennifer also injured her meniscus, so we got talking about medical cost sharing, and how to present herself, and how she already received documentation from entities that will be involved with the surgery that her doctor is recommending that she needs. I emailed her the directions on how to submit a need request to Zion. She asked how long do they usually take, I consulted with Cari and Jen via teams on this, and they said she should receive an acknowledgement immediately, after she submits her request.  Then depending on how complete her request is, they usually get back to her within about 5 business days to get her to sign the HIPPA form.
Towards the end of the call Jennifer shared that she will fill out the request on her own. I urged her to be ready and scan all her documents and have her member ID ready to submit. 
Jennifer''s demeanor was a little stressful, as she doesn''t allow a lot of space to respond and complete the guidance process. Also there was an uncomfortable echo the whole time, I was talking with her. She does seem confident and receptive, however and perhaps a little impatient in the process that could lead to possible need to ''clean-up'' later.   NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-13 11:06:07', '2023-04-13 16:51:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117866103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115246001', 'Kristi Anderson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-13 11:05:20', '2023-04-13 11:05:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117864053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459064', 'Lisa DeGan', NULL, 'I was notified by RCI that they never received a SS# for Liam.  I reached out to Lisa to get that to me.  I left VM 4/14- herd from Lisa and she gave me Liam''s SS# I uploaded into RCI Portal', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-13 10:58:38', '2023-04-14 08:57:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117864048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819507', 'Brian Teske', NULL, 'Was notified by RCI that they do not have a SS for dependent Reagan.  I spoke with Member who directed me to email his wife for that info.  email sent to Christina', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-13 10:45:59', '2023-04-13 10:45:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117798068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, '04.13.2023 Racuch has not really used the plan, cause he''s been feeling healthy.
These days, he''s been feeling like he needs to give his health closer attention. He asked for clarification on presenting for his preventative appointments, as well as the medical cost sharing.
I offered the steps for preventative:
-Follow the PHCS network (he had already done that)
-Make it know it''s preventive only and imperative to maintain that
-Offer the information from the back of Planstin card so they can collaborate pricing and billing.

He was searching for orthopedics in PHCS, and I told him, for his plan orthopedic will not be considered preventative. It would be under medical cost sharing, and he can go see any licensed medical doctor.
I asked him to call us back to open a medical need with Sedera, he asked if I can go ahead and send it now so he can peruse the instructions. I emailed him, via CRM, instructions on how to submit bills to Sedera and an email with Healthcare.gov link in it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-13 10:41:37', '2023-04-13 10:59:39'),
