  ('zcrm_1579374000117798063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117863002', 'Jonathan Chin', NULL, 'Johnathan reached out to me via SalesIQ stating that he just this morning enrolled into Healthcare Essentials with us and asked what comes next. What does he need to do now? I told him that we will be emailing him several different things, along with mailing out to his physical address, of what comes next and everything about the plan he is enrolled in. I also let him know that I would get with Jeffrey who is head of our Sales Dept, and have Jeffrey call Johnathan. He said that was perfect, to which Jeffrey called and left a message to reach back out. Johnathan just responded to me saying he is class right now and will call back at lunch time. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-04-13 08:38:34', '2023-04-13 08:38:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117864013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740011', 'Kathleen VanGoethem', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation due to aging into Medicare I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-13 08:38:28', '2023-04-13 08:38:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117864003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810668', 'Rosalie Chilcoat', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as she will be aging into Medicare eff 5/1.  I will process &amp; let Sedera know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-13 08:14:13', '2023-04-13 08:14:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117839063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109481002', 'Lucy Pirner', NULL, 'Lucy called to find out how to use her prev care services. We verified that her doc, Clemma Nash, is in the network along with the RAYUS imaging center for her mammo. Lucy is all set and understand that everything needs to be coded as prev care for this visit. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-13 07:24:47', '2023-04-13 07:24:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117828109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094737002', 'Faviola Meschi', NULL, '04.12.2023 I had not heard back from Mia re: her Zoloft (Gen) RX request. Via teams Cari suggested we send her what we understood from her request and have her call us, should there need to be any adjustments.
I generated a couple of coupons for options and sent them via Outlook email:
Below are the prices as of Wednesday 04.12.2023
RITE AID:
SERTRALINE HCL (Generic for ZOLOFT) QTY 60 • 20 MG/ML • ORAL CONC = $14.92
COSTCO (Preferred):
SERTRALINE HCL (Generic for ZOLOFT) QTY 60 • 20 MG/ML • ORAL CONC = $20.99
Disclaimer: We had a hard time interpreting your request, so please contact us to make the appropriate adjustments needed.  
************************************************************************************
Mia responded almost immediately with: "...This appears to be just what we need."  -     NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-12 17:37:26', '2023-04-12 17:56:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117849019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117297011', 'Piyush Kansara', NULL, '4-12-23 His wife is suddenly thinking she wants to keep Cobra at $2200 a month! If they keep the Cigna plan with the APTC they will save $13K over the course of the rest of the year. So, it''s pretty insane for her to choose that path. Piyush will let me know very soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-12 16:31:35', '2023-04-12 16:31:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117828101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '04.12.2023 Emily returned my call in hopes to get some updates. I let her know that the situation is still in the works with Jen, John Troutman, Cari and I. It will be one of many issues that will be discussed re: REDIRECT members, during our Concierge Meeting tomorrow. Emily will be looking forward to hearing back from us tomorrow after that meeting. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-12 16:00:39', '2023-04-12 16:08:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117849011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063248011', 'Amanda Salzman', NULL, '4-12-23 Amanda just had a baby boy!!! She had a 30 hour labor. Ugh!  She and her partner are deciding if they want to add him to her membership or his insurance. I let her know she will want to upgrade to SECURE for all of the well baby visits which she definitely wants.  With the upgrade to SECURE her EC will be $1000/$525. If she adds her partner it''s $715/$1000 in case that makes sense for them. She''s on CARE+ at the moment at $240/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-12 13:53:49', '2023-04-12 13:54:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117849003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061561019', 'Lamm Inthavong', NULL, '4-12-23 I called Lamm and he said he paid $800+ for March and April. He will call tomorrow to set up his auto-pay with Cigna. He also confirmed that he saw the initial charge on his cc account on Jan. 29th or so. He should be up to date with his payments.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-12 13:41:14', '2023-04-12 13:43:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117809040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114514002', 'Kevin Bayerlein', NULL, '4-12-2023:  Talitha called.  She''s struggling to get CirrusMD set-up for the entire family.  She set-up Kevin using her e-mail address &amp; was able to add their 15 yr old to his acct.  I was able to send her an invite - she didn''t seem to want to corr the e-mail addresses (thru a supp tckt) &amp; just used his e-mail for her acct.  An invite was sent.  She says she will write down they''re using each other''s e-mail addresses so they remember.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-12 13:38:09', '2023-04-12 13:38:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117809032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103641001', 'Peter Reimer', NULL, '4-12-2023:  Shannon called.  While they were members she had her kids immunized &amp; wondered if she could get reim.  I explained they were eff: 10/1/2022 - 10/31/2022, but had a catastrophic/illness Care+ option, which has zero ''prev care''.  She was nice about it, but very bummed, because it''s a $1200 bill.  I coached her to go back, let them know she doesn''t have ''ins'' for this &amp; will be ''cash-pay'' to see if they can bring that down for her.  She''ll try that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-12 13:28:37', '2023-04-12 13:39:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117828081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108862002', 'Mark Witt', NULL, '04.12.2023 Denise called to learn what their next steps are. They received a bill from spectrum health. Re: Mark''s visit 01.27.2023 & 03.24.2023, dermatologist, found spots they needed to freeze. It looks like they had a spot they did a biopsy on, not cancerous result.
