Can you please help us get access for Rosalie.

Thank you!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-12 12:52:53', '2023-04-12 16:01:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117809006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132196', 'Laura Lee Pier', NULL, '4-10-2023:  Laura Lee called.  She doesn''t like that ''prev care'' must be billed by the doctor''s office.  I sent a tckt #2588 thru to let the main off know, she would like a ''prev care'' option that allows her to submit invoices for directed reimb per her req.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-12 12:34:50', '2023-04-12 12:51:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117828050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094606012', 'Zack Asatani', 'SENT: Perm. form to Discuss MPB plan w/ Jayne Asatani 4.12.2023', '04.12.2023 Zack''s mom, Jayne, called to ask about X-Rays for his nose. He got elbowed in the nose and started bleeding. He called to better understand what he can do. I told Jayne she is not on his plan to speak to it, but that I will email him the link to the form that will provide her access for this sort of situation, and I did via CRM (from Zack''s account). 
