Should her results come back with more testing and services to be done, then we will start a medical need.
Jayne will call us back, assuming the permission form has been filled out, to discuss if further services need to be performed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-12 12:29:43', '2023-04-14 11:05:45'),
