  ('zcrm_1579374000117828008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111535002', 'Michael Furi', NULL, '04.12.2023 Michael called and wants to get his "FREE" ($250 for annual check-up is what he was referring to for this) annual check-up with a HOLISTIC physician.
I''m not well versed with the Direct plan as much as the other plans, so I consulted heavily with Cari and Jen via teams on this one.
Some of the items offered and I shared with Michael are; he can utilize his $250 towards a license med doc. but it doesn''t cover anything but the office visit fee. It is UP TO $250 and NOT the whole amount. He will need to get Zion''s approval for the $250 pre-appointment.  Zion will determine if the doctor is acceptable. I encouraged him to call the doctor he wants to see & get a written visit fee invoice.  Submit that with the request.  It should show the doctor & their credentials on the receipt.  The doctor will have to be a licensed medical doctor.
I guided him towards the HCBB to do research on the physicians, facilities and other in mind. Michael will call us if he has anymore questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-12 10:51:37', '2023-04-12 12:59:15'),
