  ('zcrm_1579374000117733036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098841002', 'Janice Saar', NULL, 'After reaching out to member on 4/11 and letting her know that the payment that was ran on 4/5 declined again and that I would have to cancel her membership, I did not hear anything from member.  I will have to cancel her for non payment. (msg sent via Outlook)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-12 07:43:15', '2023-04-12 07:46:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117733031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '4-11-23 Suzanne finally changed her address from a very old Lyon''s address to her current Thornton address. Her cost went from $75 to $139.80.  She was wondering why. I called and let her know the plans and costs are adjusted according to zip code. But, also it might be because the calculations change each year. We didn''t update her income this year since it was accurate at $24K. Also, it might just be the newest calculations for 2023 that changed. She will leave well enough alone.  She also let me know that she might get a contract for a painting job for about $70K and possibly paid 1/3 up front. If/when that happens we cna change her income from that point moving forward with her new income source.  She will likely lose much of her APTC at that time. She was bummed about the address change and increased pay. But, I don''t believe there''s anything we can do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-11 17:24:39', '2023-04-11 17:24:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117735029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '4-11-2023:  Last Friday, 4/7/23 went to Urg Care because she thought she was have a heart issue.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-11 17:17:55', '2023-04-19 18:27:04'),
