  ('zcrm_1579374000117733026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '4-11-23 Maurine is excited to join the HMA and she wants to fund an HSA for the tax benefits. She will review the information I just sent. My other HMA email got lost. She was ready to enroll but she''s driving right now. So, she''ll review what I sent and get back to me if she needs help. I told her I can help with the HMA but not setting up the HSA. However, I sent her the instructions. She''s excited and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-11 16:54:16', '2023-04-11 16:54:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117735016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, '4-11-2023:  Ilan got sick in the last 2 weeks = 12/6/2022.  He used the new Aetna which is/was primary during the one month overlap...  He just rec''d the EOB from Aetna, &amp; owes $3500.  So, since it is less than 6 mos since his DOS, we went thru how to sub a ''med need''.  He is aware of all the limitations around his cancel date, that only expenses from that month (nothing past 12/31/2022) can be included.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-11 16:52:00', '2023-04-12 10:06:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117733008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117738002', 'Douglas Weller', NULL, '4-11-23 Doug came to me via Andrew Goldman. He watched the 9-minute video. He''s 60, no tobacco, no pre-x, moderate alcohol, no meds, 3/4 of his hair left...hahaha! He''s self-employed. Married a few times and has 3 kids. His current wife works for BVSD and gets benefits through the school system. But, his cost would be $800+. So he''s thrilled about this and got a good recommendation from Andrew. It was a very easy decision for Doug to enroll into SECURE $1000/$325. He seems to really get it and it feels very simple and clear to him!  He already scheduled his Welcome Call for May 2nd. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-11 16:25:09', '2023-04-11 16:35:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117735011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117661001', 'Elizabeth Geronime', NULL, '4/11/2023:  Walked Liz thru getting into her MPB.Health memb portal to upload her 1099.  Sb done.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-11 16:24:18', '2023-04-11 16:24:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117712079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '04.11.2023 I called Emily and left her a VM to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-11 16:16:02', '2023-04-11 16:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117712074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '04.10.2023 Emily, spouse, called on behalf of Michael re: a bill from 1 year and 2 months ago. Michael went to the doctor 12/2021 - did not receive a bill, hear from the doctor''s office NOR Redirect, till 01/2023. Emily is not on THIS plan, cause they transferred Michael onto her plan (Emily Kloser). Emily went to where Michael was to confirm his account and allow her to speak to us, to his plan.
His appointment was supposed to be preventative. However, he did receive additional lab-work done aside from the Lipid Panel. Emily claims that Redirect verified that they would pay for the extra lab-work, but Redirect did not pay for any of it after all, as they''ve started to receive a bill since 01/2023.
Michael also had a shingles shot. I do not have the Redirect guidelines or coverage verbiage to confirm if it is part of preventative. 
I asked Emily if she''s ok with me checking w/my supervisor Jen tomorrow.  She was getting Redirect help for some of our members.  Can we plan to talk in the next few days?  I asked her if she doesn''t hear from me, as a back up plan, would she call & ask for Nahla Thurs or Friday. 
