  ('zcrm_1579374000117712049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098475010', 'Oscar Granados', NULL, '04.11.2023 Krystal needed a welcome call schedule link. I resent her the one Cari sent out, but accidentally sent it to Oscar''s email instead, so I resent a regular one, cause it was just faster.
