  ('zcrm_1579374000117615003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177182', 'Anna Thexton', NULL, 'Anna requested a list of providers in her area that are in-network via email. I sent her a list of family practice providers in 80027. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-11 08:21:59', '2023-04-11 08:21:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117539136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117525128', 'Brian Gould', NULL, '4-10-23 I submitted an escalation for Brian''s account that he had been paying on.  His current exchange ID 4000794573.

Hi Wendy,

Thanks for your help with this issue. 

I cannot access my account on Friday anymore, so what I have would be some recent records from my bank account. 

From what I was told today, a refund was issued for a payment that I tried to make around Thanksgiving of last year, this payment was to cover December 2022. I was unaware of this initially, and continued to make monthly payments at the start of this year. On 1/12/23 I had made a payment of $529.21 (double my monthly premium) for what I had assumed was for January and February ’23. 

I also made a payment of $270.54 on 3/7/23 while speaking with a Friday representative over the phone. At this point he informed me that monthly premium had gone up, and was informed at the end of the call that my account was "up to date and in good standing”

When trying to make a payment today, I was informed that my account had been terminated on February 1, 2023 due to an “outstanding balance from December 2022”. It was explained to me that I have had this balance since then, with any additional payments being made for the current month and not applied to the outstanding balance.

I am now no longer enrolled in Friday Health Plans, even though I had made a payment on March 7th 2023. 

Thanks again, let me know if you need anything else from me.

Regards,

Brian Gould
c. 703.220.8158', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-10 22:00:58', '2023-04-10 22:02:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117528147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, '4-10-2023:  Ashley called to let me know how Anthony is doing.  We worked together on his hospital visit &amp; she knows to call so I can walk her thru sub their ''med need''.  We discussed what to include &amp; I think that helped her because she forgot it''s ''issue'' specific.  She''ll call the hosp to get a ''cash-pay'' detailed invoice by Friday &amp; knows they are resp for the first $2500.  She was shocked that they let them come &amp; go w/no pymt so far.  We joked, they know how to find her...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-10 18:08:29', '2023-04-10 18:08:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117528142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '4/10/2023:  Kyle e-mailed asking for a ton of information re: who to contact, info she got on the website chat sounds inaccurate but maybe I don''t know the whole story, how to sub a ''med need'', ''prev care'' &amp; her naturopathy doc, etc.  Sent very detailed e-mail answering her questions.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-10 17:33:53', '2023-04-10 17:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117526190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061178', 'Michael Kloser', NULL, '04.10.2023 Emily, spouse, called on behalf of Michael re: a bill from 1 year and 2 months ago. Michael went to the doctor 12/2021 - did not receive a bill, hear from the doctor''s office NOR Redirect, till 01/2023. Emily is not on THIS plan, cause they transferred Michael onto her plan (Emily Kloser). Emily went to where Michael was to confirm his account and allow her to speak to us, to his plan.
His appointment was supposed to be preventative. However, he did receive additional lab-work done aside from the Lipid Panel. Emily claims that Redirect verified that they would pay for the extra lab-work, but Redirect did not pay for any of it after all, as they''ve started to receive a bill since 01/2023.
Michael also had a shingles shot. I do not have the Redirect guidelines or coverage verbiage to confirm if it is part of preventative. 
I asked Emily if she''s ok with me checking w/my supervisor Jen tomorrow.  She was getting Redirect help for some of our members.  Can we plan to talk in the next few days?  I asked her if she doesn''t hear from me, as a back up plan, would she call & ask for Nahla Thurs or Friday. 
