  ('zcrm_1579374000117526033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107483002', 'Mario Perkins', NULL, '04.10.2023 Mario called to confirm how to present at his first preventative check-up. I confirmed that he made sure to check that the provider is in the PHCS network, and maintain the appt as a preventative appt. Should the office want to prescribe anything, have them separate it. He said that they renewed his prescription separate from the appt prior to the appt. I also shared that the only bloodwork that seems to be covered these days are the lipid panels. Anything else, just have them separate it as well, and negotiate that price under a cash-pay patient pricing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-10 09:15:37', '2023-04-10 09:23:15'),
