  ('zcrm_1579374000117389013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, '04.06.2023 Ron called in to learn more on how to submit an RX request. I explained it can be done over the phone if it''s an immediate need (i.e. on your way to the pharmacy...), OR I can send you the link to the form to fill out, which will give me a lot more time to research the 7-8 discount sites, including an international shopper. The international shopper might take extra time, so be prepared for that as well.
