  ('zcrm_1579374000117351018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104757002', 'Mary Johnson', NULL, 'Mary called in today because she needs a new list of PHCS PCP''s and assistance with the verbage for schedule her appointments for prev care. We went over the verbage and I am sending her a list of in-network providers. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-06 09:59:08', '2023-04-06 09:59:08'),
