  ('zcrm_1579374000117351003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, 'Ashley called to follow up on our conversation from 4/4/23. Her husband is still recovering in the hospital from a bleeding ulcer and she was shocked that the hospital financial team called her. I assured Ashley that she can confidently tell the hospital financial team that the cost of this incident is being taken care of by her medical cost sharing company. I also advised Ashley to give them my name and phone number on the concierge line if the financial team keeps hassling her. Ashley was grateful. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-06 08:46:24', '2023-04-06 08:46:24'),
