  ('zcrm_1579374000117332014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '04.06.23:  Brooke texted she listened to Dr. Alice Lee''s podcasts and loved them.  I texted her back to remind her to do a commentary if she is interested.  Brooke asked for Dr. Lee''s YouTube link and I texted it to her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-04-06 07:38:14', '2023-04-06 08:03:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117332003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '04.05.23:  Brooke called me, had texted me yesterday but I didn''t see it.  Wanted my opinion re: her idea to write an in-depth article about why members should try a "wellness spa" vacation instead of a vacation where they drink, eat too much, etc. and feel worse when they return from it.  And did I think Zion would offer to wave or discount her IUA in any way if she does this "documentary" about it. My response: rather unlikely that Zion would do this - but if she wanted to try it, instead of just going to them and saying she has a great idea to help our members, she could do the video documenting her experience and we would post in in our MPB newsletter along with her written article.  She would then have something legitimate to offer Zion.  She liked the idea and will think about it.  I suggested she listen to Dr. Alice Lee''s podcasts in our Feb. and Mar newsletters and make a video commentary about what Dr. Lee discusses.  She said she would do that.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-04-06 07:34:51', '2023-04-06 07:37:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117296041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '04.05.2023 Cameron called to make sure she opened a medical need with Zion, after reading the above notes, I was able to confirm with her that she did with Jen.
Then she wanted to know whether it was approved or not AND that she could not attain a treatment plan from the doctor. I told her those are items to be discussed specifically with Zion, as the ball is in their court when it comes to approvals and processes of the needs. 
