  ('zcrm_1579374000117296012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117297011', 'Piyush Kansara', NULL, '3/30/22 Piyush got laid off and he could choose Cobra for $2200! Without a job his household income will be about $35-$40K at most. He had a heart attack 5 years ago and had stints put in, so not a good candidate for MCS.  They are a family of 4. His wife used to work for Wells Fargo as a teller. They don''t provide severance at the level. His 22 yr old son, Parth files separately, so he needs his own ins. However, his son is offered affordable healthcare at his work through Apple, so he won''t qualify for a subsidy. Earns $25K. He''ll leave son''s alone for now.  Piyush currently goes to Dr. Rubright. He''s open to changing if need be. He did the Dr. search on his own and says Dr. Rubright is in the network for Friday. So, I didn''t look as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-05 15:33:16', '2023-04-05 15:43:13'),
