  ('zcrm_1579374000117276024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000263191', 'Daniel Zaborowski', NULL, '04.05.2023 Daniel  called frantic re: his wife''s account getting billed again and throwing them in the negative. He initially wanted to speak to Patti, but I tried to resolve the issue without having to transfer him.
