  ('zcrm_1579374000117232078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117233102', 'Dennis Hartin', NULL, 'This is a contact of John''s that works mainly with Lrg Groups.  He has may Small groups that are in need of our Services and he is willing to let us work them.  Plan will be to possibly set him up as an Influencer.  Conversations to follow.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-05 11:53:24', '2023-04-05 11:53:24'),
