  ('zcrm_1579374000117276019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086852002', 'Brandon Ciullo', NULL, '04.05.2023 Brandon called to attain his 1095 tax form, per his accountant''s request.
I explained to him that under his Secure plan, his preventative is through Planstin. Planstin send out an email at the beginning of march, with the instructions to attain the form he is requesting.
