  ('zcrm_1579374000117207014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '4-4-2023:  Can finally create & sub tickets.  There is an older ticket #2536 assigned to JK, but because Ryan has now called 3/28, 3/31, and 4/4/2023, I created a ticket & assigned it to Patti.  Referenced the partner tckt #s in both, so John K & Patti are aware 2 people are seeing this issue.  A refund seems like it''s in Patti''s wheelhouse & Ryan''s patience is exhausted.  He really needs the money refunded (wants it put back into his account, which I do not know if we can even do) & does not want us pulling anything further.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-05 02:49:26', '2023-04-05 02:49:26'),
