  ('zcrm_1579374000117195019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101118002', 'David Cavazos', NULL, '04.04.2023 David called to get guidance on opening a medical need for kidney stones (no surgery was implemented). He''s cognizant of the different terminology used outside of the traditional insurance realm, and is trying to use it.
