  ('zcrm_1579374000117200003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '4-4-23 Kristen received permission from Planstin/Steve to go in as a self-pay patient for her wellness visit and they will reimburse her the RBP pricing. I let her know in greater detail that if her provider charges her significantly more than 150% of Medicare reimbursement rate that she will have to pay the difference.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-04 16:49:49', '2023-04-04 16:49:49'),
