  ('zcrm_1579374000117154031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076197064', 'Mary Ballard', NULL, '4-4-2023:  Mary & her husband called today to cancel because she''s aging into Medicare.  I let her know I can see they have notes showing they will be cancelling this membership per the cancellation form they sent in (on 3/7/2023:  my notes show I told them to wait to submit the form until after 4/1/23 & they still submitted it in March.  Maybe even before they called on the 7th from Patti''s).
