  ('zcrm_1579374000117071169', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295146', 'Keith Marshall', NULL, '4-4-2023:  Keith called to see if Dr Alberto Guerrero near him is in the PHCS Spec Srvcs ntwk.  My search tool would not work even after closing &amp; bringing it up, refreshing, etc.  Gave him PHCS''s ph #, then trans him to them letting him know they should be able to answer that question for him.  He will call us if he needs further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-04 12:12:53', '2023-04-04 12:12:53'),
