  ('zcrm_1579374000117118015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578232', 'Mark Stelter', NULL, '04.04.2023 Mark called in search of his payment history with us. He was transferred from Planstin, as what they sent him was not what he was looking for. I attempted to get him into his portal, but he cannot access it from his end, even though I was able to from my end, twice.
I attempted to play around his portal to download a list of the payments vs individual monthly ones, but could not figure it out. I played around in his portal and in Admin123. 
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, but they were pre-occupied with other members. I asked Mark if we could reconnect later with more information, and if he does not hear back from me by the end of the day to call me back. 
*****************************************************************************************
Mark called back to figure out how to sign into his portal to view his payment history, and it turned out it was signing into CirrusMD not the MPB member portal. We had a laugh and he was squared away.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-04 11:52:21', '2023-04-04 15:57:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109279002', 'Monica Violante', NULL, '4-4-2023:  Monica called.  She hasn''t seen any reimb yet &amp; wanted to find out why (for the ER/hosp visit).  She''s sub the bills as they''ve come in, has already paid her 1k IUA, and has signed the HIPPA form.  I let her know we cannot see them, so Zion would be the people who can help.  Made sure she has their ph #, then trans her dir w/inst to use menu #5 = ''Med Need'' dept.  She''ll call back if we need to get involved to find out why there''s an issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-04 11:49:44', '2023-04-04 11:49:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100495017', 'Brian Klemz', NULL, '4-4-2023:  Brian called.  He wants to get his labwork at a disc.  I showed him how to use JasonHealth.com.  His PCP is not in the PHCS ntwk, but I let him know:
     1- if immunizations, may possible be covered thru a participating pharmacy (although, they might pay for immun thru a non-ntwk doc''s office too?) 
     2- we are in trans & will eventually NOT req a ntwk doc.  He''ll watch his e-mail in case the new pdf Planstin card w/no PHCS logo arrives between now & when he has his appt.  But, knows, even if it''s past his appt, that will be the cue that the ntwk restriction has chg''d.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-04 11:43:18', '2023-04-04 12:14:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117111086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-04 11:11:46', '2023-04-04 11:11:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117118010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090978002', 'Michael McKenny', NULL, '04.04.2023 Julie called to  see how to get her lab-work covered, since it was drawn for her annual wellness check-up.
Their plan has been cancelled, since her husband (Michael) aged out.
There was a miscommunication, she is under the impression that all MPB did was say Happy Bday and cancel the membership. I shared that Patti DID try to get in touch with her, and even recommended that her advisor would be her best bet to get re-enrolled, however Julie shares that she did not receive an email from MPB.
Past that, re: lab-work coverage, her PCP did not stick to the Preventative Only guidelines and had her test for various other panels outside the lipid panel. I tried to get around to getting her covered by separating the bill and billing Planstin for the Lipid Panel solely, and the rest could be submitted as a medical need rqst, since she said it was around $2000. 
Later, after I sent her an email for submitting a rqst to Zion via CRM, I was explaining her fulfilling the IUA, and THEN the cost sharing will kick in, if approved. Then she shed light on that there were adjustments made so her portions is only a bit over $500.
I was a little confused at what adjustments, and GLAD that it''s less than her IUA and less than $2000.
Julie was kind, respectful and patient, but seemed down and disappointed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-04 11:10:59', '2023-04-04 11:10:59'),
