  ('zcrm_1579374000117111033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116046002', 'Mark Magnussen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-04 09:23:25', '2023-04-04 09:23:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117111023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114725002', 'Louis Young', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Julie. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-04 08:38:36', '2023-04-04 08:38:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535099', 'Shirley Ospina', NULL, 'Shirley called in because she has a follow-up ultrasound on her breasts from her recent mammo. I advised Shirley that unless the ultrasound goes above her $2500 IUA, she will not be reimbursed for this cost as it is not considered preventative care. I will be searching HCBB for the zips of 33156 and 33143 for the best cash price and facilities in her area. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-04 08:23:35', '2023-04-04 08:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117111018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-04 08:06:22', '2023-04-04 08:06:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117111008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116606002', 'Louis Mitri', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-04 07:56:17', '2023-04-04 07:56:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082516001', 'Brian Stark', NULL, 'Brian called and in January 2023 he had ER appendix surgery that also resulted in the removal of precancerous cells. Brian and I went through how to open a need with Zion and that IF he has to have some hernia repair in the same area as his ER surgery, that it will be a part of the same need. Brian will call if he needs any further assistance and he absolutely LOVES the MPB concierge team. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-04-04 07:54:26', '2023-04-04 07:54:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, 'Member submitted a ticket for her 2022 "Tax Statement".  I responded to her re:Portal invite from Planstin on 2/24/23 and directed her to create login &amp; password in order to access 1095C.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-04 07:24:21', '2023-04-04 07:24:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '04.03.2023 Darrin called to receive a better price for his prescription that was already called into the Safeway pharmacy:
Dexlansoprazole
Generic - 60mg - 30 caps - 80027
I found the best price to be at Walgreens. He inquired about how to get the RX transferred. I was not entirely sure on the details, outside from having the pharmacies communicate to get it transferred, so I consulted with Cari via teams. Cari shared where they would like to pick it up from, will take care of the RX to get transferred. 
I sent Darrin a generic email with just the coupon, and will follow it with a more detailed email later. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 16:57:24', '2023-04-03 16:58:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117075048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012657055', 'Michelle Kinkead', NULL, '4-3-23 I called Michelle bc Cigna sent a late payment notice. She had to call them multiple times already to get her payment squared away. It''s all set now. The timing of her auto pay and their notifications crossed paths. So, she is back in track and they confirmed with her that she''s all set. Her payment amount is $77.11.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-03 16:06:26', '2023-04-03 16:07:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117075043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061561019', 'Lamm Inthavong', NULL, '4-3-23 I tried calling but the phone # is no longer good, so I sent an email to let him know his payment is late, $444.59.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-03 16:00:01', '2023-04-03 16:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117075038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012051083', 'Nancy Gentry', NULL, '4-3-23 Nancy called bc her Drs. office doesn''t know how to bill to Planstin. I suggested they call the # on the card. She was worried Dr. Hillary Brown was no longer in the network. I looked it up and see her showing still. Also, it shouldn''t matter soon. She has 2 cards one with the PHCS network logo and one without. Not sure which one to use. I suggested she try the card with the PHCS network so they can bill that way since they are in Boulder. She will continue to refer new clients to me and I just signed one up today, Nicole Murad. I told her to expect payment by early June, if not to let me know. She referred Delli Hanes and another couple to me but I haven''t heard from them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-03 15:51:33', '2023-04-03 15:51:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115748002', 'Charles Chase', NULL, '04.03.2023 Charles called as a concern for not seeing his wife''s name on the card, I told him there''s usually just the primary name on there.
He said that''s not ok, bcz he just finished talking to Planstin and they could not find her in the system either. He later shared that Planstin said they will contact MPB directly to get information on Julie to add her on his plan. She is not currently on the plan in their system apparently.
I''m unsure who Planstin contacts directly at MPB for situations like adding members onto THEIR system, so I check with Cari. 
However, Jen is out sick today, unfortunately, so Cari does not any of the connection''s contact information. We will have to try again once Jen is back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 15:22:07', '2023-04-03 16:05:28'),
