  ('zcrm_1579374000117074026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117973002', 'Kristall Laursen', NULL, 'Kristall called me back. She recently lost her job and benefits. She has done some research on medical cost sharing. I went over the Care+ and Direct Plan with her while online. She will go over the numbers and make a decision in a day or two.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-03 14:54:48', '2023-04-03 14:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117074021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115042002', 'ommehoni motarefi-borden', NULL, 'I spoke in detail with this lady today. She had questions, and wasn''t sure if her welcome call was today. I spoke with Cari A. and we rescheduled her for Wed, April 5, 2023 @3:30 pm EST. I also sent her details on the Direct Plan.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-04-03 14:52:25', '2023-04-03 14:52:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, '04.03.2023 Melinda wants to make an OBGYN prev. appt, she would like to have her IUD removed, and have another TYPE of birth control put in use.
She wanted to make sure the removal is covered. I asked Cari via teams, who confirmed that it is usually covered. However, Melinda and I had already hung-up, so I was not able to provide her with that information.
Melinda called Planstin to confirm the prev appt process, but whoever she spoke to cause her to feel unease due to the lack of knowledge, so she called us back. She wanted to speak to Cari, bcz she believes Cari is knowledgeable and wanted reassurance. Cari was busy with another member, and I asked Melinda what exactly does she need from Cari. And she said she was mainly concern being covered for removing the IUD. 
THen I was able to share the previous information, and Melinda felt better. She still wishes to speak to Cari, and I shared that with Cari, if she can. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 14:33:40', '2023-04-03 15:39:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115200014', 'Michael Ebeling', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Michael was sched for his ''Welcome Call'' today at 3:00pm eastern.  Jennifer threw-out her back though and is out of the office.  I didn''t think about her calls until the middle of Michael''s sched time, but I ck''d in w/Jennifer &amp; she says she let the members she was sched w/know this morning that she was unable to make their calls today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 14:08:59', '2023-04-03 14:08:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117075030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000117101001', 'Nicole Murad', NULL, '4-3-23 Nicole is in the process of getting divorced by May 1st. She wants a May 1st start date. She owns a small business with her brother and has an EIN. She''s 53, healthy, no meds, no tobacco. She currently has health ins through Kaiser through her soon to be ex husband''s employer. She wants more freedom of doctors. Nancy Gentry has spoken highly of MPB for many years, so she wanted to learn. Lives in Avon where everything is super expensive. She tries to do her annual wellness visit and used to have an HSA. She understands the value of the HSA for tax purposes and to pay for the small stuff. She had a colonoscopy about 2 years ago, so many years before that''s necessary again. She chose to join SECURE $325/$1000 during our first call. She''s enrolled for May 1st. She''ll check her record and make sure nothing weird is showing up on it. She doesn''t have anything to her knowledge.   She also asked about using this for her employees. They have about 6 employees. She''s bringing this to her brother and asking him what he thinks about for their company down the road.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-04-03 13:57:31', '2023-04-03 15:47:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116266002', 'Edee Yuen', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Edee is sched for her ''Welcome Call'' today w/Jennifer at 4:30pm Eastern.  However, Jennifer threw out her back &amp; is home sick.  We didn''t realize the calls hadn''t been resched, so I finally was able to notify Edee at 3:43pm via e-mail (see below).  Sent her the link so she can reschedule as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 13:45:27', '2023-04-03 13:45:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114514002', 'Kevin Bayerlein', NULL, '04.03.2023 Talitha called back following up on the previous conversation. We were expecting Jen to be able to look into this matter today, unfortunately, Jen was out on sick leave. I let Talitha know that and that the situation is set in motion and they are working on it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 13:44:33', '2023-04-03 13:44:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '04.03.2023 I was reviewing Jerry''s notes, when I saw Kelly''s note regarding emailing him some pricing info. I''m not sure why Jerry would expect an email from me, since I did not promise that to him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 13:33:35', '2023-04-03 13:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115042002', 'ommehoni motarefi-borden', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Jeffrey Bursteen called: Ommehoni has a ''Welcome Call'' today at 3:30pm, but Jennifer threw her back out &amp; cannot work.  I sent Ommehoni the ''Welcome Call'' template &amp; Jeffrey is going to work w/her to get her rescheduled, letting her know that link is in the e-mail I sent.     -  CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 13:25:37', '2023-04-03 13:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117028124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083478001', 'Kimberly McClure', 'New Plan eff 5/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-03 13:07:39', '2023-04-03 13:07:39'),
