  ('zcrm_1579374000117071054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Carol needed quite a bit of help.  We went over:
     - She couldn''t find in ntwk gen prac in her area for ''prev care''.  I helped her get into the accurate PHCS search tool site & we found Fam Prac docs in her area.  I also let her know at some point we will be trans to no ntwk req''d, but no time line on that.  Plez watch for new pdf Planstin card = no PHCS logo as cue to the chg.
     - Went over HCBB & how to use, healthgrades.com too.
     - Tried to get her into her MPB.Health Memb Portal, but even though I could get in, she never could.  We moved from Safari to Google as the browser & that didn''t help.
     - She took the pymt amts for Jan - Dec 2022 from me & was ok w/that.  She know for Planstin''s port = $60/mo.  She tried to find Planstin''s e-mail w/the link to her 1095, but could not find it, so is contacting them via ph to ask them to resend.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 12:26:01', '2023-04-03 13:03:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072471089', 'Anita Fisher', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Anita called to chg her pymt info.  We went online &amp; I showed her how to complete the form.  She should be able to submit shortly after we are off the ph.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 12:17:00', '2023-04-03 13:04:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Amy called looking for her 1095C.  She was able to find the e-mail from Planstin, clicked on the link, and I went over the only items she''ll use this part portal for is copy of her ID card &amp; her tax form.  She''ll call back if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 12:02:01', '2023-04-03 12:02:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Abigail called.  She had a questions on counseling and the MAP Program.  We got her signed into Mazz & Sull website and I went over using the Asst #, finding a counselor (virt & in person, sm ntwk), etc.  She had questions she''s going to ask when to tt Mazz & Sull (like how to present to these ntwk docs).  We walked thru everything on the site as well, incl Impact Suite.  She will let us know if she has issues, but was thrilled w/12 visits (also went over the pattern) here in CO.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 11:53:28', '2023-04-03 12:09:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117053033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116033002', 'Laura Boyd', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-03 11:08:07', '2023-04-03 11:08:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034221050', 'Lily Williams', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Lily called.  She''s going overseas for a trip & wanted to know how to handle an emerg medical event.  She took out trip ins too, so I let her know that will be her primary ins.  She will take our # so we can advise if nec.  Sedera is her healthsharing comp, so we can get her to them if nec.
     - While we were on the phone, she mentioned in 2020 (?) she was hospitalized for COVID & they also diagnosed her with diabetes.  She now has to go in every 6-mos for diabetes cks & her advisor told her those would be part of the same ''med need''.  I told her she can certainly submit the expenses to Sedera, however, it will depend on deadlines, the issue, etc.  That sometimes maint items are not handled as part of a ''need'' after a certain amount of time.  Her accent can be pretty strong, but I think we decided she''s going to submit the expenses & let Sedera know they go with the orig need.  She knows they are the only ones that can determine how it is handled.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 11:07:37', '2023-04-03 11:11:45'),
