  ('zcrm_1579374000117071012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108036002', 'Julia Starr', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Julia called.  She had her Cologuard test done & has rec''d a $700 bill for it from the company that sent it.  She presented her Planstin card when she went, so she''s going to call the company that billed her to see why the doc''s off didn''t give them her ''prev care ins'' for billing.  If they refer her to the doc''s office, she knows that may happen & will tt their billing.  If she needs help further, she will call.
