  ('zcrm_1579374000117074003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '03.30.23:  Jim called me to report that for his cataract Sx,  Planstin paid the negotiated price and used Jim''s $6000 MEC deductible to pay against this diagnostic care.  Jim called Zion to verify this was ok and Zion said they approved it because it was less than the retail rate.   I asked JK about this and he said that is what Zion/Planstin do.  On 4.3.23 I texted Jim to let him know I looked into this and it seems to be the approved process for Zion/Planstin.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-04-03 10:29:12', '2023-04-03 10:30:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117028056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, 'Member chose to change plans to the Secure eff 5/1 due to aging into the 50 age band.  I will process change and send out email to sign and submit Proof of Eligibility.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-03 10:14:44', '2023-04-03 10:14:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117071003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108407034', 'Bih Shya Gau', NULL, '4-3-2023:  Bih Shya called.  She''s having foot pain &amp; going to see a specialist.  PCP could not see her, so she''s going to see a specialist.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-04-03 10:14:00', '2023-04-05 02:16:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117053023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114650002', 'Briana FAHERTY', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-03 10:04:06', '2023-04-03 10:04:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109192002', 'Justin Young', NULL, '04.03.2023 Kelly called to confirm WHO MPowering Benefits is, cause she saw a charge on her bank account. I explained that she called the broker for her medical cost sharing company, called MPowering Benefits.
I confirmed their account, but the email they have on file is misspelled, so I sent her to HER EMAIL via outlook, an MPB change form to update the present email and add her email, kellysyoung2@gmail.com

NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 10:01:59', '2023-04-03 10:01:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '04.03.2023 Aimee called to learn how the best practice to when visiting the ER, and how to submit medical need to Zion.
She shared that she told the ER that she is self-pay, I requested that she present herself as a Cash-pay patient and request the cash-pay discount, which she was on her way to do, while we were on the phone (they were still in the hospital).
I asked her to call us back to set up a medical need request to Zion, have her receipt from paying as close as possible to her IUA $1000, invoice from remaining balance and her Zion Member ID. *****************************************************************************************
Aimee called back to confirm how she presented herself at the ER, was indeed correct, bcz the hospital was confused and questioned her NOT HAVING coverage. I reassured her of the process, so when she is ready we will use the documents she will collect from them, and we will open a medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 09:50:30', '2023-04-03 16:12:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111977017', 'Michelle Norman', NULL, '04.03.2023 Michelle called EXTREMELY FRUSTRATED with a number of items. He initial attempt that started her journey on this matter, was attempting to use CirrusMD Issue the night before.
Michelle is not having an emergency, BUT is extremely uncomfortable and would like to access her plan that she pays for, without needing to dish out the "cash-pay" discount, to see someone in person.
Michelle called a few numbers before reaching us. Somehow she was told to call the Concierge Line in order to access CirrusMD. 
PRESENTLY, she is not receiving reciprocation from CirrusMD. I sent her an invitation to the email on file and it has not reached her. PRIOR, she attempted to set up on her own, but the system kicked back and said they cannot find her in the system.
We are having to call her back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 09:45:43', '2023-04-03 10:12:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117053013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115040002', 'Randolph Hatten', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-03 09:40:22', '2023-04-03 09:40:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117059001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111977017', 'Michelle Norman', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 2976 Question : I attempted to register on the app. No record of my account was the response.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-04-03 09:26:43', '2023-04-03 09:26:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004648009', 'Julia Fisher', NULL, '04.03.2023 Julia called to get guidance on possibly opening a medical need for her husband.
He''s going in for an ultrasound THIS THURSDAY, for a possible hernia surgery. 
I sent Julia an email for directions on how to submit to Zion, a medical need.
I coached her through the process:
1-cash-py patient, and discount presentation
2-pay as close as possible to the IUA
3-collect receipts
4-call us back for guidance in filling out the need
5-have the Zion member ID handy

NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 09:18:42', '2023-04-03 10:16:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663707', 'Olga Chwascinska', NULL, '04.03.2023 Olga called wanting to connect with our MAP program. I guided her onto our collaborative page, asked her to bookmark it as well as the member portal and updates page. I pointed out their number, their app and the plethora of hyperlinked resources, as well as their hours. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 09:15:56', '2023-04-03 09:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117053003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115064002', 'Samantha Everhart', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-03 09:04:30', '2023-04-03 09:04:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115888002', 'Dustin Henke', NULL, '04.03.2023 Maggie call in need to attain a proof of insurance for her work.
She called Planstin and they said they cannot do that for her, and sent her over to us.
Their Planstin card only shows Dustin''s name, Maggie needs something (she called it a certificate) to show proof of insurance for her job.
Due to previous member requests in the past, wanting/needing proof of insurance for their kids'' university, I thought I learned that Planstin was the place to go to , to get that.
I consulted with Cari via teams, however, they were still in a meeting, and Cari was pre-occupied. 
I asked Maggie to call her back. She offered to call us back instead, due to the remote area that she will be traveling to. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 08:58:10', '2023-04-03 09:01:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117029003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085687002', 'Danielle Howley', NULL, '04.03.2023 Martin called to get help in accessing the "Portal" Planstin has requested for the members to do, in order to attain their tax documents.
Martin followed the instruction in the email with the link they offered the members, but got stuck at the part where he had to choose what type of member: Member, Agent or Group.
However, only the tabs; Agent and Group, were hyperlinked for him to choose from. Therefore, he called us to move forward from there.
Unfortunately, neither Cari nor I have had the pleasure to see what it looks like to set that portal up in order for the members to access their docs (haven consulted briefly with Cari, via teams). So we educationally guessed and guided Martin to choose Group, since WE are a group. However,  that led Martin down a path that looked like setting up a new account, so he stopped and decided he wanted to speak with Planstin. So I direct transferred him there.
I told him I''m not familiar with what it looks like, and eager to know how to be able to assist other members. He said he''d be glad to give us a call back to let us know. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-04-03 08:45:58', '2023-04-03 09:02:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000117005008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115246009', 'Andrea Mills', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-04-03 08:03:02', '2023-04-03 08:03:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116939024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2972 Question : Hello,', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-04-02 12:21:10', '2023-04-02 12:21:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116986003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116462002', 'Nina Finley', NULL, 'Received Cancellation Request from this enrollee.  Wants to cancel prior to enrollment.  I will refund the $125.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-04-02 11:26:54', '2023-04-02 11:26:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116985022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '3-31-23 Maureen called to refresh her memory about the Health Matching Account. She sees a podiatrist every quarter and needs to see an endocrinologist soon and went to the ER last year. So, she''s starting to see the value. She''s also 62 and knows more stuff is likely to come up as she gets older. But, she prefers mostly naturopathic, holistic care and is bummed acupuncture can''t be paid for with the HMA.  She also had a huge debacle last year with her annual wellness visit. For some reason in her area of CA the network is terrible. She finally found one PCP locally and had to wait 6 months to get in. She checked 3x to make sure they accepted the PHCS network and was told yes. Once she finally was in for her appointment they told her they don''t offer preventative care! What? Who doesn''t offer preventative care services? She still kept her appointment and paid cash and discovered he was a terrible doctor. He was trying to prescribe stuff to her that wasn''t needed or relevant. She will never go back. She''s thrilled to learn that the network is getting removed and will open up her world for her annual well check that isn''t due until about Aug.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-31 16:59:59', '2023-03-31 16:59:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116919149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100495009', 'Jace Perry', NULL, '3-31-2023:  Jace''s daughter broke her foot.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-31 16:47:48', '2023-03-31 16:47:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116985017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '3-31-23 She used Redirect''s virtual healthcare for sickness. She then needed in person care at PCP which was approved by Redirect. She got a $1600 bill that she submitted through the new Redirect Health app. She knows Spruce app is older and won''t bother with that. Also the MPB.Health CirrusMD keeps having problems when she tries to register and login. She will reach out to the MPB Concierge Team for help with that. But, she wants to be extra proactive with the $1600 bill bc her last experiences with Redirect haven''t been great. They sometimes pay and sometimes don''t when she did her mammogram. The bills are split in two with the actual visit at $200 and the radiology bill which is $200 also and billed after the fact. Sometimes they pay the initial bill and not the radiology part. She''s trying to figure out how to avoid that moving forward and just wants to talk with someone at Redirect. She tried their main # without success.  She will hold tight for now. The $1600 bill was dated 3/12/23, so she thinks she has a little time. Her nephew just passed away, so she''s going back to PA for that and will check on this while there or when she gets home. If it gets past her comfort zone with the time frame she will send me all of the documentation to get is paid right away. Her mammogram visit for $200 was threatening going to collections so she just paid that one. She doesn''t want that to happen with this large bill. She''ll keep me posted if she needs help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-31 16:26:15', '2023-03-31 16:26:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116985003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '3-31-23  I called Willa bc there seems to be some confusion relating to her upgrade and her question simply wanting to understand if baby well checks are covered on the day of birth for whatever the hospital might be doing immediately. I let her know as long as she submits her request to add her baby within 30 days of birth, the baby''s membership will begin at the date of birth. I let her know well checks will follow the ACA Guidelines and doctors most code it as well baby screening/well check. She feels good about it all and understands we are getting training on the removal of the network limitations in 2 weeks and we''ll be better able to help her with that part when it comes time.  She is self-employed as well and submitted her EIN upon application.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-31 15:03:39', '2023-03-31 15:09:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116980060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089149002', 'Daniel Connelly', NULL, '03.31.2023 Cynthia called to better learn how alt med zion request, spec. for Chiropractic work, process works to get approved.
I sent her an email via CRM for submitting needs to Zion.
Guided her to change the toggle menu to Alt. As we were going through the form, Cynthia realized she needed to gather more documents to upload the request: Zion member ID, the actual treatment plan from the Dr. 
Cynthia mentioned she needs to send in a rqst for her daughters'' toe as well. I explained how the IUA is issue specific, and that will be another $2500 IUA fulfillment. She said she is aware of that. I reminded her to change the "type of request" for this type of issue.
Cynthia said she feels like she can do this from here, so she''ll collect what she needs and call us back if she has questions. 
I decided to send Cynthia some language from Zion''s RECENT guidelines AO 3/2023 re: Alt. Med. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-31 14:40:29', '2023-03-31 14:56:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116919144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112728002', 'Way Walters', NULL, '3-31-2023:  Way called asking about why his son is not listed on his Planstin card.  He''s divorced & wondered what instructions to give his ex-wife.  We went over prob 2 scenarios:
     - ''Prev Care'' thru Planstin = only time he/she will ever need to present a card & the Planstin card only lists the Primary Memb (& spouse when aplicable, not in this situation), but not depend child.  However, they are on the plan & it shouldn''t be an issue.  Went over to watch for new card = no ntwk req''d at some point.  The e-mail from Planstin w/that card that no longer has a PHCS logo will cue him to call for new instructions when they want to use the ''prev care''.  But, to know all appts re: ''prev care'' must stay within the ''prev care'' to get paid & med coded properly.  He''ll call when they get to a back-to-school appt or something.
     - Illness/Catasrophic:  Unless urgent, he could start w/CirrusMD thru him to get an idea of PCP, Urg Care, or ER - he''s worried she will jump to the ER immed, so he wants her to know to start by cking w/him.  I let him know, worst case scenario, she jumps to the ER:  if it is a qualied item (ie: broken leg), how she should present & he''s be resp for the 1k IUA.  To call us & we will show him how to sub as a ''med need''.  
        He seemed to understand the healthshare ''cash-pay'' idea, so I didn''t go in too deep.
     - I let him know that if he wants us to be able to talk specifics w/his ex-wife (did not sound like he does), he''d need to fill out a prem to discuss form.  Otherwise, if she calls, we can only talk general terms about how our plans work, not his plan specifically.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-31 14:35:30', '2023-03-31 14:35:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116919139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109790001', 'Justin Askins', NULL, '3-30-2023;  Just sub RX Quote req.  Here''s what was sent:
     - Lisinopril 20mg, #90 tabs = $10.25 at Tom Thumb pharmacy on RXGo
              This item is cheapest at HEB Groc at $9.60, yet available at a bunch of pharmacies for &gt; a dollar more.  Since it was only a .65-cent diff between HEB &amp; Tom Thumb, I sent him the cheapest coupon for Tom Thumb, although let him know other options are avilable on this &amp; the cheapest rate at HEB.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-31 14:14:28', '2023-03-31 14:14:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116980047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102931013', 'Jonathon Anderson', NULL, '03.31.2023 Kelli got around to calling re: welcome call. I went ahead and emailed her, via CRM, the welcome call invitation scheduling.
Kelli asked how it would work to have a doctor (for a well woman visit) who is not in ANY network be her provider. I shared it would have to be cash pay. I briefly shared about the RPB potential existence. Kelli received her email while we were still talking. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-31 13:12:16', '2023-03-31 13:12:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116919134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115994002', 'Scott Nonnemaker', NULL, '3-31-2023:  Nicole & Scott called panicked because they rec''d a Zion card (yes a Zion card), but it only shows Scott''s name.  They called Zion & I think they said they could not "fix" the card to show both names, we''d have to do that.  Yet again, Zion gave extremely inaccurate info.  They want to conf Nicole is on the memb eff tomorrow 4/1/2023.  Went thru a ton of education:
     - Zion card - surp you rec''d this card, people using like ''trad ins'' card which screws things up, so they''d quit sending these out.  This is purely for reference.  You will NEVER present this card for anything.
     - To see Nicole is on the memb I took them to the MPB.Health Memb Port & helped them get in (don''t chg pw).  There they can see Nicole & eff date & felt better.
     - While in their portal, I mentioned this is where they will upload Scott''s proof of self-emp.  Scott has worked for someone until recently & won''t have a 1099 until next yr.  Nicole has a 1099, but is not Primary, even though she is the older of the 2 members.  I sent a cut & paste of the orig e-mail requesting proof of self-emp & we went over other options since Scott''s listed as prim.  He found one of the documents he can upload and they will get that done.  They are both real estate agents.
     - They will have their ''Welcome Call'' after 4/1/2023 & it sounds like they''ll do it together.
     - Re: Planstin ID Card, they haven''t rec''d yet.  I let them know we are trans to a new ''no ntwk'' on this, so the card may be delayed slightly.  This is the only ID Card they will ever present & ONLY for ''prev care''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-31 12:39:50', '2023-03-31 12:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116919126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '3-31-2023:  Jerry called in to rem his son.  We walked thru the chg form and he was completing as we got off of the phone.  He''s had questions on this for a bit here, so he''s hoping the removal can be eff: 4/1/2023.  I let him know those changes usually have to happen before the 20th of the month so we have time to notify the companies, so it could get pushed to 5/1/2023.  His son already has other coverage, so he''s hoping he won''t be paying for something he doesn''t need.  I told him he can try for 4/1/2023, but I did not know exactly what they''d be able to do.  He was nice about it, although a bit bummed I think.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-31 12:01:41', '2023-03-31 12:01:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116919115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330216', 'Nelson Oldham', NULL, '3-31-2023:  Nelson called upset that his ''prev care'' appt came back saying he owes $200.  We discussed details an the doc prescribed his ''restless leg syndrome'' medication during the appt.  I went over how this chgs the ''med billing code'' from ''prev care'' to ''treatment'' and that''s why so much was declined.  We disc my doc''s solution w/the sign in the room & how difficult this is for everyone.  He was very nice about it and decided this year he''ll just pay it & go over the ''prev'' vs ''treatment'' w/the doc next year to find out how to handle & not screw up his med coding/pymt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-31 11:35:06', '2023-03-31 11:41:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116980030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742027', 'Larry King', NULL, '03.31.2023 Larry called to learn about the process of getting covered, after visiting the ER at United Hospital.
Larry did present himself as a cash-pay patient. I guided him to the rest of the process:
1-Request the cash-pay discount
2-Pay as close as possible, if not all of the $1000 IUA (he asked me what is an IUA)
3-Request the balance to be invoiced to you, and collect the receipt to your payment
4-Call us back with both items, and we will guide you in opening a medical need rqst with Zion.
Larry was receptive, and a great listener. He asked what does he say when they ask if he has insurance, I coached him to say ''No''. He said then I am lying to them, and I said "Well technically you are not lying, bcz you have insurance for PREVENTATIVE ONLY. NOT catastrophe situation".
Larry comprehended his plan a little better and is looking forward to speaking with us again to get that MNR out to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-31 11:31:03', '2023-03-31 11:41:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116980016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115651002', 'Scott Groza', NULL, '03.31.2023 Scott called to speak to JB, I messaged Jeffrey via teams, and direct transferred Scott to him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-31 10:57:04', '2023-03-31 10:57:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116980011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111986002', 'Lynette Couls', NULL, '03.31.2023 Lynette called to get an INSTANT RX request coupon, due to an infection. She does not have a lot of pharmacy options, she went ahead and had them send the prescription to CVS. I offered to search other pharmacies if there are cheaper coupons, but she needed this right away.
I then searched two of our major sites for her: GoodRX & RXGO. She was elated to hear the amount is less than $20, was expecting it to be in the 100''s. So with the zip code she provided, 85390, I generated a generic email for a coupon of $15.52 from RXGO at CVS, and sent it to her. 
She received my email while we were still talking. She is very new with us, so she saved both my email and Cari''s in her contacts. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-31 10:54:14', '2023-03-31 11:08:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116975071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114323002', 'Kelly Minear', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-31 10:53:40', '2023-03-31 10:53:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116919110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '3-31-2023:  Ryan called asking about a refund.  I tried to sent a chat to Patti, but before I got Ryan''s even typed up to her, Michele let me know Patti is out today &amp; I need to sub a ticket.  Let Michele know the reason we asked for helped the other day on sub tickets, is neither Nahla or I can do that yet.  Sent a note to Jennifer that we have a lot of things to go over when she''s back on Monday &amp; put Ryan''s refund on the list.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-31 10:51:33', '2023-03-31 12:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116975066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106618002', 'Simon Dullingham', NULL, 'Sent email to member to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-31 10:50:00', '2023-03-31 10:50:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116975051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104790012', 'Jessica Perez', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated  address. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-31 10:17:21', '2023-03-31 10:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116980003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '03.31.2023 Willa is calling to confirm her newborn in June would have coverage in the first 2 days he is born.
She initially called asking to be transferred to Patti (Vanessa recommended so), then she called us. I asked her for the message I could leave for Patti, as it is possible she may not be in on Friday. 
She shared that she is giving birth in June, wants to know when she can add the baby, and if the baby will have instant coverage upon birth. They recommended to her that she see a pediatrician within 2 days of giving birth. 
I told her the parents/primary member has 30 days from birth to add the new baby. It''s ok if they don''t have a SSN right away, they can share it afterwards.
Re: having coverage RIGHT AWAY, I consulted with Cari via teams, but Cari was pre-occupied with another member at the time. I offered to give Willa a call back to answer that question.
****************************************************************************************
Cari shared that she shared the above with Patti for quick attention. Patti forwarded it to Michele. Michele requested that we generate a ticket. Neither Cari nor I have access to creating a ticket.
I then called Willa back, left her a VM, to let her know that the people who need to care for this matter are actually out for the weekend, and will be able to connect with her possibly on Monday. I offered for MPB to connect with her, HWVR, should she not have heard back from us by the 10th, to please give us a call back at 800-519-2969. That way this does not fall through the cracks.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-31 10:07:15', '2023-03-31 13:15:48'),
