  ('zcrm_1579374000116919024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098378002', 'Allyson Eaton', NULL, '3-30-2023:  Allyson called.  She''s very confused & had a bunch of questions.  She''s using all ''ins'' terms, so I did some education on how that can throw things off & she was open to learning the new terminolody for healthsharing.
