     - Because they are planning the pregnancy, we disc the advantages of possibly changing to the 1k IUA BEFORE they get pregnant.  I let her know about the waiting period, so it''s imp to do asap.  For their age group (until they turn 30), it would add $100/mo to their mo cont = $1200 more /yr,  but sharing will start $1500 sooner.  When we disc the 3 IUAs per year she seemed to understand how this is an adv w/even 1 ''med need''.  Also, sharing would be available on more items because the 1k level is hit far more often than the $2500 level & you are resp for everything until you hit the IUA on any issue.
     - She needed to change their address.  We walked thru the form together.  She also needs new MPB.Health cards w/the QR Codes - because she''s sub the chg form, we tried requesting the new cards to her new address in the Sect 5 comment section so the cards go to the correct address.  If she doesn''t see them in about 3 weeks, she''ll know to call back & re-request the MPB.Health cards again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-30 14:09:46', '2023-03-30 14:19:20'),
