  ('zcrm_1579374000116639053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '3-27-23 My text note to Merryl after also leaving her a vm. Hi Merryl! Sorry for my delay. Your account looks accurate with no changes in Connect for Health CO showing your monthly payment amount at $516.34. Did you miss one month''s pay? If not, this is a Cigna Billing problem or communication problem between Cigna and C4. I''d suggest calling C4 and asking them to update their communication with Cigna, since Cigna was no help to you!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-27 13:59:32', '2023-03-27 13:59:32'),
