  ('zcrm_1579374000116623036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103379002', 'Brian Robinson', NULL, 'Member''s 4/23 Payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM-3/27 2nd notice sent 3/30  3rd notice sent 4/4.  4/6-after not response from this member I reached to Sally and she has not heard from him either after sending him an email.  I advised that I would have to cancel him later today 4/6 if I did not hear from her.  Sally got a response from the member he is unable to pay at this time and needs to cancel.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-27 13:50:44', '2023-04-07 06:31:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116639033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001107434', 'Lauren Peterson', NULL, '3-27-23  Spirit Dental Enrollment Information - Call 844-833-8440 or go to https://spiritdental.com

Dear Lauren Peterson,

Your application has been Approved. Please SAVE this important membership information. Congratulations, you have just made a great investment in your smile and overall health. Please do not respond to this confirmation email. 

