  ('zcrm_1579374000116570038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992038', 'Willa Bonzi', NULL, '3-24-23 Willa called and left vm wanting to upgrade to SECURE to add wellness and HSA compliance to membership. I left her  a vm and let her know I can help her do that no problem. I just need to make sure they are self-employed first. She also needs to update their mailing address.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-24 15:45:45', '2023-03-24 15:45:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116594048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '3-24-2023:  Jayne called to see if she could add vision to her plan.  I let her know her advisor, Kirk Bennett, may offer something, so I made sure she had the e-mail &amp; ph# we have on file for him, then trans her to him.
     - Before we got off the phone, she had a lot of questions about the IUAs.  She was thinking they used to only have two per year, but I let her know it''s been three for as long as I''ve been around.  Then we went into details, issue specific, 3 per rolling yr, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-24 15:42:15', '2023-03-24 15:42:15'),
