  ('zcrm_1579374000116594016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '3-24-2023:  Heidi called, she''s struggled w/the care centers & their unwillingness to give her the ''cash-pay'' price ("if she''s on MCS"), so she''s paid for everything upfront to get the discounts!  She''s at 20k+ w/the emerg hand surgery they did.  She''s in Carbondale & feels lucky to have the world renouned docs in Basalt, but both those docs & the UT docs (where she got hurt) really gave her grief about ''cash-pay''.
