  ('zcrm_1579374000116566009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109080001', 'Debbie Boyd', 'Transcript of ticket that was opened 3/23', 'I spoke to member re: Declined CC and in the conversation found out that she had been misinformed on the following issues:
