  ('zcrm_1579374000116465006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110364001', 'Clyde Clyde Nelsen', NULL, 'Please be aware that this member feels he did not need his welcome call at all. When I called Clyde to do his Welcome Call, he answered with "15 minutes!", not realizing if Clyde was speaking to me when he said that, I introduced myself and asked if he still had some time for me today. He demanded that he only had 15 minutes to do the call and that he was not interested in anything but knowing how to change the number of employees on his list bill. I answered him by stating that I could get him to someone after our call who can assist him with this and he stated that I should know how to do this so he didn''t have to waste time. I advised Clyde that we suggest members do these calls to know how the plans works; Clyde told me it was a waste of time for him but to go ahead and go on with my call. I let him know that I was taking time out of my day to do this call and if he didn''t have the time currently, I could send him a new scheduler. Clyde replied with "I am the customer, when I say I want something done it should get done because I am right". Unfortunately at one point our call dropped so I had to call Clyde back several times before it would connect to him. I finally was able to connect with Clyde, do his call, and answer some questions. I don''t feel like Clyde actually heard me, but at least I tried. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-23 13:29:09', '2023-03-23 14:04:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116478003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078638002', 'Claudia Nanino', NULL, '3-23-2023:  Claudia called for three items:
