  ('zcrm_1579374000116378013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111954002', 'Daniel Soto', NULL, '3-22-2023:  Daniel called in saying the pharmacy was having trouble processing his "pharmacy" benefits.  I let him know he does not have actual pharmacy benefits as he''s thinking for his generic Adderal XR, but that we offer to search for the best local price.  Here are details on what I sent & why - kind of an unusual situation:
     Per Daniel, even though he''s living in FL, there is a shortage of Adderall in FL, so he''ll need to pickup the RX in GA (zip: 30324).  We looked at the most convenient place near that zip & it''s Kroger.
     - Generic Adderall XR 30mg, #40 caps = $31.61 at Kroger on RXGo [=  more convenient per Daniel than the cheapest coupon at Publix (which was location specific) ''As Low As'' $31.20 on WellRX.]  Sent him the Kroger coupon.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-22 18:08:22', '2023-03-22 18:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116381026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522170', 'Jonathan Carroll', NULL, '03.22.2023 Lauren called to understand why she''s received a pre-collection letter from Cleveland Clinic, for her Preventative Wellness Visit.
