  ('zcrm_1579374000116378003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, '3-22-2023:  Kelly is trying to get her gen Novaring.  The price has doubled since Sept.  Here''s what we are looking into:
     - I ran this as a quote & a 90-day supply is now at least $134+.  = why we are looking for other options.  Because the price has gone up so much, she doesn''t want coupons yet.
     - Kelly has tried Planned Parenthood, etc., trying to find a cheaper route, but is not having luck.
   *- gen bcs are often cov by the MEC.  When I called Planstin, they were absolutely no help and said they only way to find out was to process it thru the OptumRX.  Jennifer Thorin was able to provide the OptumRX info and I gave that to Kelly.  Kelly called back today, because that''s feeling overwhelming.  IF she has issues with the pharmacy, she will have the pharmacy call & talk to either me or Jennifer for guidance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-22 15:29:33', '2023-03-22 15:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116369003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, '03.22.2023 Marth called stating Zion called her back, denying her need request application. She told me she filled the need from the link Jen sent her.
