  ('zcrm_1579374000116313027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299149', 'Grant Hudson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update his address.  I will update in CRM, A123 Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-22 08:27:17', '2023-03-22 08:27:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116316008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366121', 'Brian Trebus', NULL, 'Brian reached out to me via SalesIQ explaining that he had a Dermatology check-up for his annual skin check screening looking for anything that could be life threatening or cancer of some kind. Just a "Preventative" measure appointment. His provider suggested her get Blue Light Therapy for his face as a good treatment for skin damage over the years. Brian stated the one bill was $3000 that he got, along with one other bill he is waiting for that he knows will be $1200. I explained to Bill that anything Dermatology or any sort of injury/illness, he is to present as a cash paying patient to get the best cash discount, and he is responsible out of pocket only up to the IUA of $2500 he choose upon enrolling. Everything thereafter will be shared with Zion Health. I let him know I sent an email explaining how to submit bills to Zion Health, etc. I lastly highly suggested to Brian that the calls Zion and they can walk him through the process. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-03-22 08:23:35', '2023-03-22 08:23:35'),
