I shared that with Grant and offered him to call us tomorrow, if he would like us to do a three way. RCI''s hours are from 7:30-4:30 MTN time.
Grant needs to change his address. I emailed him, via CRM, the link to the change form. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-21 16:46:41', '2023-03-21 17:06:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116243036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097826002', 'Sharon McCormick', NULL, '3-21-2023:  Sharon called.  She says we are charging her for a dental plan & she doesn''t need dental.  Let her know her MPB Secure plan does not incl dental or vision.  I thought she might be seeing the dental advertisement on the back of her Planstin card, but she said she''s being billed separately for dental.  I let her know that''s possibly coming from something setup w/her advisor Jane Kassel?  Made sure she has Jane''s # & trans her to her off directly.  She''ll LM if she doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-21 16:41:25', '2023-03-21 16:41:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116243028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, '3/21/2023:  Lewis called.  He wants to go get his Shigles shot &amp; wondered his options.  We checked OptumRX part pharmacies search &amp; the Harmons pharmacy on Holladay Blvd is listed.  He was willing to take the Bin # &amp; other Optum RX info to provide w/his Planstin card so they can run it (without having to call Planstin, although that is also an option).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-21 16:24:18', '2023-03-21 16:31:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116243023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116266002', 'Edee Yuen', NULL, '3-21-2023:  Edee called.  Wanted to know if her plan includes her doctor.  She went to the Zion page & it says no network, so her doc''s fine right?  I let her know there are different components to her healthcare & the Zion portion, her catastrophic type care, she''s right, no network.  That curr the ''prev care'' however is diff.  Since her plan is not eff until 5/1/2023, I told her she really needed to discuss this w/her advisor: Jeffrey Bursteen.  She says she has his dir ph #, so we conf his normal hours so she can call him tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-21 16:20:20', '2023-03-21 16:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116243018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116117002', 'Michael Griggs', NULL, '3-21-2023:  Michael called.  He''s trying to upload his proof of self empl &amp; wondered if a K1 form would work.  Told him the items I know work and he says most of the info is on the K1.  Let him know this is for confirmation if our records are audited (since it qualifies you for the gvmt HSA tax advantaged program).  He is going to try to upload the item(s) we discussed &amp; may call to conf what he''s uploaded will work if he ends-up going w/the K1.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-21 16:19:10', '2023-03-21 16:19:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116244030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097895017', 'Gregory Desme', NULL, '03.21.2023 Gregory called and asked for billing. I direct transferred him to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-21 15:40:50', '2023-03-21 15:40:50'),
