  ('zcrm_1579374000116245008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, 'Michael''s wife, Patty, called in today regarding opening a need for his recent dermatology visit/surgery. I walked Patty through opening a need with Zion via the website and also sent the instructions via email. Patty will call if she needs further assistance. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-21 13:49:35', '2023-03-21 13:49:35'),
