  ('zcrm_1579374000116243003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100611001', 'Justin Laubach', NULL, '3-21-2023:  Justin called & had 2 issues:
     - Prev Care:  He went to the doctor & had his bloodwork done:  STD panel, etc.  From best I can tell it was ''prev care'', but he wasn''t very clear.  I let him know his current plan does not include ''prev care''.  That possibly, next time, call us ahead of the blood tests & maybe one of our discount labs could help bring down the price.  I told him it sounds like this portion is prob out-of-pocket if it is ''prev care''.
     - Skiing Accident:  Torn ACL?  We went over how to present to the doctors for a catastrophic event like this: no ''ins'', ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, save pymt rec & detailed inv, pay up to 1k IUA, then ask if they can bill him for balance.  Then he will call us so we can help him sub a ''med need'' & know what to expect, who to call & when, etc.
     - HCBB: Sent him a list of the 4 ortho surg in his area.  They are all high quality, fair priced, but showed him the 3rd one only has a 2.5 star rating on healthgrades, so he''ll prob look into the other 3.  Told him, once he''s had his ''Welcome Call'' this is a resource we can teach him how to utilize.  He liked that, but seemed okay in waiting until he''s finished his call.
     - Welcome Call:  He was open to me sending him another invite.  I let him know that will help him build his understanding of his healthcare option.  Noted in the invite to make sure he uses his full name & the ph # he wants called (not a Teams chat) call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-21 13:34:39', '2023-03-21 16:44:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116235029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081302002', 'David Pearson', NULL, '3-21-2023:  Lisa called.  David wanted to talk to ''Teledoc''.  He called CirrusMD &amp; they would not do PCP type stuff.  He''s a physician &amp; is hesitant to see a local doc since they all refer each other.  Lisa thought they had both available.  I let her know the only telehealth we offer at this point is CirrusMD.  She seemed to understand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-21 12:54:00', '2023-03-21 12:59:52'),
