  ('zcrm_1579374000116235003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115999002', 'Keith Bakos', NULL, '3-20-2023:  Mary called.  She realized she started their plan eff 4/1/2023, but after talking w/their curr plan, they have to give 30-day notice of cancellation, so they are going to push our eff date to 5/1/2023.  Took her to the plan chg form &amp; she sub.  [It was late in the day though, so her monthly cont may have already pulled.  We did not discuss this...]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-21 11:25:31', '2023-03-21 17:03:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116234003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '03.21.2023 Samantha contacted us via.... to learn how to connect with a therapist through her plan with MPB. Jen forwarded her request to me via Outlook.
