Please note the variety of resources on the Mazzitti and Sullivan EAP Services, outside from connecting with a therapist.
... NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-21 11:24:53', '2023-03-21 11:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116231003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, '03.13.23:  Jessica texted, letting me know her sons now have health insurance with their companies and wants to know how she changes her membership status to MO.  I texted her the change form link to fill out and explained how to do this.  Told her if she does it before the 20th, she can start her new status as MO as of 4/1/23.  Her rate would go from $525 to $300.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-03-21 11:14:43', '2023-04-24 14:13:26'),
