  ('zcrm_1579374000116223018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103167002', 'Teresa Broaddus', NULL, '03.21.2023 Teresa called to attain access to her member portal. She sounded like she was also having an issue receiving emails, so I guided her to the Member Update forms on our site. She wanted to be able to view her payments via her profile/account with MPB, from the Member Portal sign in page, I offered her the log-in information, and she was able to access it and view her payments. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-21 10:59:28', '2023-03-21 11:08:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116169107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111778002', 'Lin Qian', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-21 10:58:27', '2023-03-21 10:58:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116224013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '3-21-23 JP chose to switch to SECURE since they''re long past the pre-x clause and don''t have any open needs or anything to worry about. Their membership will still date back to their original start date of Nov. 1st, 2020. They will save a little money at the $915/$1000 fee now for May 1st, 2023 (April 20th billing).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-21 10:53:16', '2023-03-21 10:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116223013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084641002', 'Rebecca Shelton', NULL, '03.21.2023 Rebecca called to learn how to use her plan. Specifically for preventative.
I shared with her:
1-Her plan is made up of three pillars: Preventative with Planstin, and I asked if she received their card. She has. Zion for medical cost sharing, and the essentials (with examples).
2-Sent her the MulitPlan link via CRM (She has not had her welcome call yet), and we searched together for a mammogram facility. 
3-The proper way to present herself for a preventative appt. I re-iterated the importance of making sure she shares that she is with Planstin, and for the appt to remain Preventative. 
  ----------She wondered what if the doctor request labwork other than the lipid panel. I guided her to request that they bill her separately from the preventative care requirements and request the cash-pay patient for those.
4-Because she has not had her welcome call, I resent her the link to schedule one, to have the resources in the POST WELCOME CALL email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-21 10:52:50', '2023-03-21 10:52:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116224008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '3-21-23 I sent emails again yesterday to Redirect to Christian and Mike. I left Mike Bechtol a vm just now as well. I also sent a note to the CSA Team to help with Chuck''s problems. He''s getting impatient, needless to say. I''m hoping one of these paths will return positive results.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-21 10:38:43', '2023-03-21 10:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116224003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '3-21-23 Jennifer let me know Sally is having troubles with getting reimbursed for her wellness visit. She submitted the bills via the app and Redirect is saying they don''t have the bills. I called Sally and left her a vm to send everything to me in writing and I''ll forward it to my contacts at Redirect. I also left a vm for Mike Bechtol to please reach out to her to help her and avoid yet another cancellation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-21 10:36:39', '2023-03-21 10:36:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116169092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089150002', 'Joseph Taylor', NULL, 'Members 4/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 3/21 3/23-Member submitted PU form I will update &amp; Rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-21 10:34:24', '2023-03-23 07:35:01'),
