  ('zcrm_1579374000116167003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111982009', 'Dean Mello', NULL, 'Dean called inquiring about submitting his prescription receipts towards his IUA. I explained that unless it is part of an open need, medications do not count towards an IUA.  Dean understood. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-21 07:56:53', '2023-03-21 07:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116163001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2932 Question : where do I find my member 1d', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-03-21 07:48:32', '2023-03-21 07:48:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116153018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107602002', 'Stephanie Neider', NULL, 'Spent several minutes on the phone with Nathaniel regarding several portions of their plan. They have it pretty much figured out, but he just needed some clarifications. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-21 07:33:57', '2023-03-21 07:33:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116153008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109361008', 'Laura Roessler', NULL, 'I attempted to call Laura to do her scheduled welcome call but unfortunately I was having technical difficulties on my end with my headset. My first attempt to call Laura I was unable to leave a message and asked the other concierge team members to let Laura know that she may need to reschedule her call if she calls back. Nahla did inform Laura and I also sent Laura 2 emails; 1st on 3/20/23 letting her know I was having technical difficulties and the other on 3/21/23 asking if she''d like to reschedule for sometime this week. Hopefully we will get to do Laura''s call this week. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-21 07:13:15', '2023-03-21 07:13:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116108016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, '3-20-2023:  Taylor called w/questions about what is & is not a part of her new baby''s care.  She got Theodore added and I can see that in the CRM.  I let her know their curr plan Care+ is catastrophic w/out ''prev care''.  But, she''s thinking her Zion Maternity Needs Processor said there is care for the baby for the first year.  I''m struggling to find anything in the Maternity needs guidlines, so Taylor is going to tt her Maternity Needs process for details.  I trans her to Zion so she can get the corr answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-20 15:39:06', '2023-03-20 15:50:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116045077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107844010', 'Sheri Auten', NULL, '03.20.2023 Sheri called trying to get her preventative appts all set up, to stay under the PHCS network. I looked up a specific gaster. doctor for her, but ended up not being on the list. I sent her what was generated with the multiplan link. She was able to access the list and the link.
She proceeded to learn more about the preventative services: getting a mamm, wellness visit, woman wellness visit, colon....etc. 
I sent her the Healthcare.gov link to refer to the ACA/MEC guidelines. NT
It does not look like she''s had her welcome call. I could not find the POST WELCOME CALL EMAIL to refer her to. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-20 15:20:20', '2023-03-20 15:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116078171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116120018', 'David Cole', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 14:45:27', '2023-03-20 14:45:27'),
