  ('zcrm_1579374000116078161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081135010', 'Quentyn Luna', 'New Plan eff 4/1/23', 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 14:29:03', '2023-03-20 14:29:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116078151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079922001', 'Pamela Luna', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to remove dependent Brayden, however put spouse Bryan as one to be removed.  this will be effective 4/1.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 14:17:11', '2023-03-20 14:17:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116045064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509019', 'Sameera Reddy', 'SENT: Perm. to Disc. MPB Plan w/ Narendar Reddy 3.20.''23', '03.20.2023 Mr. Reddy called concerned about expenses if they go to the ER. I explained the process in detail, several times. He''s not on the plan, so I sent her the permission form link.
Mr. Reddy continued to be worried about the ER not treating them if they learn they dont have insurance. I continued to reassure him, but he kept asking the same question again.
Consulted Cari and Jen via teams to see if they have a way around people who are not familiar with medical cost sharing and are worried. They recommended I share with Sameera and Mr. Reddy that they connect with CirrusMD first.
Mr. Reddy was sure even if they had done that, they knew the doctors would recommend to be seen in person. 
I offered the CIrrusMD option - sent her an invitation link.
Discussed pharm progr. Thinks they have Optum RX. THEIR plan does not have Planstin. Possible further education on the plan may be needed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-20 13:53:21', '2023-03-20 17:58:48'),
