  ('zcrm_1579374000116078108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002075005', 'Jared Martin', NULL, 'Member sent me na email and then called me re: cancellation of her membership.  I then reached out to Diane after I determined that it was her member.  She will be in contact with her.  I will process the cancellation to avoid billing the member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 13:18:30', '2023-03-20 13:18:30'),
