  ('zcrm_1579374000116045043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111068002', 'Patrick Burns', NULL, '03.20.2023 Cathy called to learn how to access the telehealth for their son, Matthew.
I proceeded to inquire about setting up their CirrusMD accounts, explained that all three of them need their own separate accounts.
Cathy believes they already have accounts, but do not know how to access them.
I consulted with Cari via teams, and she suggested to send out invitation links anyways, and the system will either move forward with the next step to set up a new account or inform us they already exist in the system.
It turns out that Patrick and Matthew already, most likely according to Cathy, have their CirrusMD account set up. I sent her an invitation link to cath.burns@principledstrategies.com.
She attempted to set up her account, but was cumbersome while at work. Cathy will call us back later to help her set up her CirrusMD account. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-20 12:20:02', '2023-03-20 12:38:38'),
