  ('zcrm_1579374000116091041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535099', 'Shirley Ospina', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form as her CC was hacked.  I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 10:42:18', '2023-03-20 10:42:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617001', 'William Murdy', NULL, '3-20-2023:  William called.  He rec''d an e-mail saying his HES has been cancelled.  I don''t see any notes re: the cancellation here or in Admin123.  He says the e-mail came from accounting, so I trans him to Karina.     -CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-20 10:38:11', '2023-03-20 10:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116091036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060779355', 'Sandy Randolph', NULL, 'I did not hear from member in response to my email &amp; VM.  We will be billing tonight for 4/1.  I will cancel this member for non Payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 10:37:40', '2023-03-20 10:37:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116106008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480314', 'Sean Murtha', NULL, 'Sean''s mother called because he injured his shoulder. I explained the cash-pay process and opening a need with Zion. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-20 10:16:07', '2023-03-20 10:16:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116091023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976002', 'James Stinson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-20 10:14:33', '2023-03-20 10:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116091013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540138', 'Leslie Frazier', NULL, 'Member returned my call and told me that she wanted to cancel because she wanted to have Planstin &amp; a DPC and was able to do that via Zion direct.  I will cancel membership', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 09:41:05', '2023-03-20 09:41:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116045026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114129002', 'Stephanie McCarter', NULL, '03.20.2023 Stephanie called concerned about finding an Renal-Imaging center near her. Her doctor recommended it, to check for kidney stones. She lives a very rural area, so she will be most close to centers in Dallas OR Greenville.
I attempted to use HCBB, but imaging was not coming up for kidneys. I consulted Jen and Cari, Jen helped me find the right title to search on HCBB, Retroperitoneal Ultrasound.
I emailed Stephanie, via CRM, the HCBB link.
Stephanie tried just ultrasound, because she does not believe THAT one would cover the renal area for her bladder and kidneys. Stephanie seemed she needed to get off the phone, so I requested that she call us, if she has any questions about using HCBB.
I guided Stephanie to: find the right center for her, call and verify they practice that procedure, present herself as a cash-pay patient, request the cash-pay discount. I requested that she call us back to help set up her medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-20 09:05:58', '2023-03-20 09:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116091008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085042002', 'Alexa Fetta', NULL, 'Per Sales IQ chat below member wants to cancel her plan.  I sent out Cancellation link.  I will cancel ahead of billing. 3/21- Member submitted cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-20 08:59:19', '2023-03-21 11:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116078003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116046002', 'Mark Magnussen', NULL, 'Spoke to Mark this morning, discussed the Secure Plan. I sent him an email with all the plan details and pricing, I just noticed, he just enrolled.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-20 08:53:22', '2023-03-20 08:53:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116076003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105831009', 'Dariusz Szteborowski', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life Code card. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-20 08:52:58', '2023-03-20 10:20:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116045008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, '03.20.2023 Julie called needing to get bloodwork on hormone replacement, ...... etc on Monday. First time using our services. 
I explained to her the gist of her plan, and told her that her plan preventative portion will not cover that type of bloodwork as preventative. Her options are to attain pre-purchased lab-work on line through a discounted labwork site. I consulted with Jen and Cari, via teams, Jen forwarded three sites to share with Julie. 
I emailed Julie the three sites that she can shop on then go to that site in her area. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-20 08:42:34', '2023-03-20 09:17:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000116045003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059611038', 'Heidi McGuire', NULL, '03.20.2023 Heidi called concerned about presenting herself to be covered for hand surgery. Heidi had an accident this past weekend (Saturday, treated and came home).
