2-OR if it''s not an urgent matter, but needs attention, she can connect with CirrusMD for a  telehealth visit. They will guide her to the next needed steps. 
She was not set up on CIrrusMD, so I sent her an invitation and explained to her that each adult on the plan needs to have their own account and the under age children/offsprings, would be added to both parents'' accounts. I requested that she call us back if they don''t receive their link invitation to CirrusMD.
