  ('zcrm_1579374000115901069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '3-16-23 Suzy forwarded an invoice she downloaded from her account with Sedera and it''s incredibly confusing. She needs the payment amount to show for an upcoming divorce. Her full membership fee is $732.28 but Sedera''s invoice shows $757.10 balance or deposits of $361.97. It''s very strange. I told her to call MPB Concierge Team for the full membership fee invoice for her lawyer. She''ll let me know if she needs more help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-16 13:13:33', '2023-03-16 13:13:33'),
