  ('zcrm_1579374000115901064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089959012', 'Matthew Wyckoff', NULL, '3-16-23 My note to Patti, "Go ahead and cancel. He looks like he has a bad attitude judging from the cancellation form. He hasn''t called me back."  He has ins now that include screenings. He might be getting a tax credit possibly. Not sure what the rules are in OH since we''re outside of open enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-16 12:21:36', '2023-03-16 12:21:36'),
