  ('zcrm_1579374000115885032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070161001', 'Douglas Brenteson', NULL, '03.16.2023 Doug called to attain a list of family doctors in his area. He wanted to do it on his own, but was not sure where to get the link from. I checked his email history to guide him to the Post Welcome call email, but I did not see one in the CRM emails.
