  ('zcrm_1579374000115910063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784550', 'Thomas Bukacek', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation due to fact that he will now be offering his employees trad insurance.  Sedera &amp; RCI notified. I will cancel in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-16 10:27:07', '2023-03-16 10:27:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115885008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '03.16.2023 Kelly called back to learn how to submit a treatment plan towards a medical need request. She submitted previously attended acupuncturist receipts, knowing (from previous conversation) she should have a treatment plan prior. She is inquiring if she needs to still submit a separate medical need request with the treatment plan she JUST attained from the acupuncturist, and a detailed note from the referring doctor.
I am not familiar with that specific medical need request form, so I consulted with Cari and Jen via teams. Cari requested to be brought in to help.
Cari: recommended to not go about it that way, since there''s already a medical need open. Asked if HSA has been opened. Recommended that we speak to Zion to clarify how to proceed from this point with the complete documents. Cari shared the number we are calling, and the option to get her to the right dept. (#5). 
We reached Zion and spoke to JoAnna. Cari asked how to submit the alt. paperwork, since a medical is already open.  JoAnna instantly suggested to send a general overview, email to the NEEDS department at needs@zionhealth.org, place same general information from the MNR application, in that email.
JoAnna said the DA dept has her need request to possibly be labeled as alternative medicine, and so they are already facing that direction. Kelly asked "how long does it take to process it?" - Cari said a week or so, and to reach out to them within a week or next week to connect with Zion and ask them about her submissions. She recommended to transfer Kelly over and reminded her to choose option #5. I dropped out of the call, and Cari completed the transfer with Kelly. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-16 10:23:54', '2023-03-16 11:01:34'),
