  ('zcrm_1579374000115847093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090781017', 'Dawn Chiero', NULL, '3-15-2023:  Nahla brought me in to the conv above.  In cking Admin123 it looks like in 2022, orig Theod was the primary and they had a memb + sp memb:  May, June, July, Aug, Sept [per Patti = $105/mo for the MEC.  Then Oct, Nov, Dec of 2022 = memb only w/Dawn = $60/mo for the MEC.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-16 10:11:16', '2023-03-16 10:11:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115910053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462355', 'Karen Martorana', NULL, 'I received a call from member''s spouse Wayne.  He told me that his wife had a stroke.  Seems an ongoing issue.  He had been in contact w/Sedera and they told him that she had a $5K IUA as opposed to a $500.  I looked in A123 and her plan had not been changed and we had been charging her for $500.  I spoke to Sedera who wanted proof that she had been paying for the $500 IUA.  I sent screen shot of the 3 pmts to Member services.  Awaiting answer.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-16 10:09:10', '2023-03-16 10:09:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115910048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067540138', 'Leslie Frazier', NULL, 'I received an email from Planstin who had been in contact with Zion who said that member wanted to make a change in her plan.  I reached out to member who told me that she was thinking about going with a DPC provider.   I told her that if she went that route she would be looking to change to the Direct plan.  I adviser her of the deadline for making any changes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-16 10:00:28', '2023-03-16 10:00:28'),
