  ('zcrm_1579374000115839036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '3-15-2023:  Elsa called.  They found a counselor for her son thru the MAP program  (Win Winsor, Aurora, CO).  Selected a counselor they sugg, but now that office is asking for their ''ins'' card.  She is going to let Mazz & Sull know the situation, since Mazz & Sull said they were sending over the forms for the counseling.  I let her know if nothing else, maybe they can connect with counselor''s office to make sure they realize they are part of the Mazz & Sull ntwk & ck to see if they rec''d the doc.  She will call us back if this continues to be an issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-15 16:44:53', '2023-03-16 00:22:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115889054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079409010', 'Julie Macki', NULL, '03.15.2023 Julie is looking to see a psychiatrist. I reminded her of the service she has in her plan already with the MAP, and walked her through the process of finding it on our Member and Portal Update page ( had her bookmark this page for future 1st landing visits).
She is in need of RX drugs so def a psych. is a must. I inquired with Cari via team to see if we can share those expenses, she said no mental wellness is shared. UNLESS (one exception in the guidelines).
Cari was able to find the language in the guidelines AO 03.15.2023 that reflect that no mental wellness or anything connected to it is shareable, UNLESS it is related to suicide or attempted suicide with adolescents, up to the age 18. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-15 16:42:51', '2023-03-15 16:56:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '3-15-23 She requested a copy of her "Sedera Policy." I sent her the sharing guidelines, Life Care brochure, Redirect Brochure and Quick Reference Guide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 16:04:52', '2023-03-15 16:04:52'),
