  ('zcrm_1579374000115901046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115984002', 'Colleen Patrice', NULL, '3-15-23 Colleen wants the $5K IUA and I explained all the reasons why I don''t like it but she will likely choose that since she''s always had catastrophic ins and can pay the $5K if something bad happens. She is also interested in exploring the HMA to help pay for all the stuff that she has to pay for on her own like thermogram, dermatalogy skin check, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 15:23:04', '2023-03-15 15:23:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '3-15-23 All set! Patti cancelled the refund. David membership is active through the end of March and then he''ll switch to SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 15:01:58', '2023-03-15 15:01:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '3-15-23 MPB and Sedera are working together to reinstate all Sedera members who didn''t complete the upgrade but did NOT choose to cancel and have been billed. Patti is going to try to reverse the refund she just tried to put through. She''ll let me know. I won''t alarm David yet. Either way he''ll be active for all months and starting new with SECURE for April 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 14:59:59', '2023-03-15 14:59:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784550', 'Thomas Bukacek', NULL, '3-15-23 Thomas has been billed successfully and MPB and Sedera are working together to reinstate him and other members who failed to complete the upgrade process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 14:57:50', '2023-03-15 14:57:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115889040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114514002', 'Kevin Bayerlein', NULL, '03.15.2023 Talitha called to attain a 3rd MPB card to register her child. She said she received the two cards, but needs a 3rd one to complete the family.
I consulted with Jen via teams why she was sent to us and not Kelly, who is responsible for the fulfillment packages that include the MPB card.
Jen reassured me to relay to Talitha that one the members don''t need the cards other than for the QR Code for catastrophe situations. Jen also shared that the cards don''t require registration.
Apparently SOMEONE gave her Jeffrey Bursteen''s number to attain this 3rd card, and that person also told her that she did need a 3rd card (she doesn''t remember who that was). Then Jeffrey sent her to the concierge consulting. In the middle there somewhere, she attempted Leslie Jablonski and did not get a hold of her. She is very new, starts 4/1, and is looking forward to scheduling her welcome call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-15 14:45:15', '2023-03-15 15:01:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115847068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114514002', 'Kevin Bayerlein', NULL, 'Member Talitha Bayerlein, was forwarded to me. Member told me she has made several attempts to reach her advisor Leslie Jablonski, and has not received a response. Member told me, shews forwarded to me by a gentleman she''d spoken with. I looked her up in the system, and I gave her concierge''s number to assist her with resolving her issue.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-15 14:41:14', '2023-03-15 14:41:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115896048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-15 14:38:07', '2023-03-15 14:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645404', 'James (JP) Boylan', NULL, '3-15-23 I talked with JP and he might convert to SECURE to save a little money per month. His monthly membership fee is going from $731.50 to $931.50.   We discussed ACA too and how brutal they are right now.  He has a little time to decide. He had sticker shock at the huge price increase but after talking through it and discussing ACA options, he willing to remain. By moving to SECURE it will be $915/$1000 and save him $16.50 per month. He''ll let me know before April 20th since his B-Day is in May.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 14:37:08', '2023-03-15 14:37:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '3-15-23 Patti just re-informed me that David was cancelled by Sedera since he didn''t complete the conversion but MPB has been billing him. She refunded his past 2 months and ended his membership as of end of Feb. 1st 2023. I don''t know how to rectify this since he was under the assumption he was active all along.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 14:34:06', '2023-03-15 14:34:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '3-15-23 David was having a terrible time getting his annual wellness bill paid. After Jennifer went to bat for him, Redirect actually called David and told him they had the wrong address for the provider which is why they weren''t getting paid.  I think Jennifer said it was a $900 visit that should be all set now. When I talked with David he was calm and nice. He''s had a good experience with Redirect up until this time. He was willing to stay put. But, after realizing he has no pre-x and has only used the membership for wellness visits that he can easily switch to SECURE and save about $200 per month and lower his IUA. He enrolled in SECURE $1000/$325 for April 1st, 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 14:32:19', '2023-03-15 14:32:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115901008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089959012', 'Matthew Wyckoff', NULL, '3-15-23 Called and left vm for Matthew to find out what he''s really needing and/or why he''s cancelling. His cancellation form simply says he got other ins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-15 14:26:16', '2023-03-15 14:26:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115839019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, '3-15-2023:  Deanna called regarding 2 ''needs''.  When she discusses them it''s very confusing because she uses such generic terms ("the Dec appt" - both were in Dec...  "I sent it over" - but she doesn''t specify where: Redirect, Sedera?).  So, I''ll detail my understanding of the 2 issues below.  However, I did a warm transfer to Sedera & let Lori  at Sedera know to be aware of the 2 items & the communication has been confusing.  Hopefully, that will help her know there are two issues, not one.
     - Duane had a colonoscopy clear back in Dec 2021.  According to Deanna, they got it pre-approved thru Redirect and thought everything was all set until, she just rec''d a bill from the anesthesiologist saying they''ve billed Redirect every mo since the procedure & have yet to rec pymt.  Deanna says she sent it over to both Redirect & Sedera & says she had a 1pm appt w/Sedera "billing" dept today, but they did not call her (we were talking just before 2pm).
     - Deanna had issues w/a mammogram clear back in Dec 2020.  All of those bills have been paid for, but when she sub this Dec''s bill as part of her ongoing ''need'' thru Sedera, they haven''t pd yet.  In hindsight, I don''t think Deanna remembers the pymt from Sedera will come to her to pay once Sedera sends her the money.  In her mind, Sedera will be paying the doc''s office?  We didn''t talk about that part, but this is the second item she''s worried about.  Becasue of her old issue, they have her go in every 6 mos & her last appt was Dec 2022, and it should still be the same ''need''.
     Hopefully, Lori at Sedera can sort thru these items w/Deanna.  Deanna will call if she needs further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-15 14:16:09', '2023-03-15 15:37:23'),
