  ('zcrm_1579374000115889022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090781017', 'Dawn Chiero', 'SENT: Perm To Discuss MPB Pln w/Theodore 3.15.2023', '03.15.2023 Theodore called trying to attain the tax deductible form 1095A. I consulted with Cari via teams to confirm who to send to attain that. He''s already received the 1095C from Planstin.
