After speaking to Cari Theodore was in a better understanding of how to move forward from here, and for next time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-15 12:44:12', '2023-03-15 12:50:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115896023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104964002', 'Sandra Erickson', 'Cancellation of Membership eff 4/1/23', 'Due to all the notes below this member should have been enrolled in the Secure option if she qualified.  Due to the fact that she lived in CA that would have been the only option that was compliant.  Member is cancelling because she now has no trust  in us a a company.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-15 12:36:43', '2023-03-15 12:36:43'),
