  ('zcrm_1579374000115838028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, 'David called in regards to the note below from Cari. David has not heard from Redirect and when he called them the member services person told him that they could not see the bill so they cannot tell him if it has been paid or not. David was going to wait for Cari to call him when she came on shift, but I did not feel that waiting was something David needed today. I called Redirect myself and spoke with Hailey; she told me that Redirect is now requiring members who submit preventative care bills to complete a one hour call with the claims team. I advised Hailey that I thought that this was ridiculous since David''s bills have been submitted since August 2022. Hailey told me that there was nothing more she could do and that David will have to wait to complete his call with the claims team. How frustrating that our members have to wait this long to have bills paid by Redirect. David is now in collections and this is not good because he is trying to get a loan. David is going to go pay the bill in full so that it doesn''t affect his credit and hopes that Redirect will reimburse him (even though I told him that this is not guaranteed). David is frustrated and ready to quit. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-15 09:31:24', '2023-03-15 12:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115838023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108509002', 'Ariel Rudland', NULL, 'Ariel called because she was trying to schedule her daughter''s 4-year appointment and was told that she had to use a PHCS in-network provider. She called in upset because her advisor told her that starting at the beginning of 2023 she would not have to worry about being in-network. I tried to explain to Ariel that this is something that has not been put into place as of yet and I apologized that she was given inaccurate information but we are looking to implement this soon. Ariel was upset and is calling Leo. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-15 09:25:13', '2023-03-15 09:25:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115838018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742027', 'Larry King', NULL, 'Larry called because he wasn''t sure how to transfer his prescriptions from one pharm to another. I explained that he just needs to call the pharmacy his scripts are currently at and ask the staff to transfer them to the new pharm. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-15 09:01:02', '2023-03-15 09:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115838013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064227232', 'Levi Bowen', NULL, 'Levi called to check the status of a need, I warm transferred him to Zion. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-15 09:00:04', '2023-03-15 09:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115838008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100143002', 'Larkin Saalfrank', NULL, 'Larkin called regarding an elective vasectomy he wants to have. I let Larkin know that elective sterilization is not shareable. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-15 08:59:38', '2023-03-15 08:59:38'),
