  ('zcrm_1579374000115824032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077918048', 'Bryan Schiff', NULL, '3/14/2023:  Bryan & Susan called re: needing a commercial pharmacy plan declination of their super expensive RA med.  We discussed the following:
     - No comm RX benefit w/their plan.  They had tried OptumRX, I explained that''s only for a few sm items & so it won''t decline = why it said no benefits.
     - ''Med Need'':  Bryan is going to get together all of their receipts & pymts.  It sounds like we are near the 6mos deadline & he knows to hurry & get back to me so we can start a ''med need'' on this new RA diag.
     - I''m going to see if I can find a stand alone RX Benefit policy for them.  Susan (a doc) liked that idea.  They don''t even want this to be a covered item, they just want the ''declined'' notice.  Then they get 3-years free from the mfg.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-14 18:16:32', '2023-03-23 23:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115819053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '3-14-23 FINALLY - Good Evening Wendy

