  ('zcrm_1579374000115814011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093638002', 'Jill Nagle', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2920 Question : I am looking for a copy of my plan that includes my partner David Levine''s name', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-03-14 16:44:23', '2023-03-14 16:44:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115822023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083233002', 'Heidi Holliday', NULL, '03.14.2023 Heidi called after she had JUST spoken with Zion regarding her recently new pregnancy development. She opened a medical need request with them, which was approved, and they recommended she call us too to update us.
Aside from documenting this new development, and since she is GTG on the medical cost sharing end, I was not sure if there''s anything other ends that need to be tied for a clean process on our end. Therefore I consulted with Cari via teams.
Before I let Heidi go, I told her if I learn about any other steps that will be needed for this matter, I will call her back. After connecting with Cari, I learned there is nothing else we can offer, but to encourage her to start with us NEXT TIME.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-14 15:28:08', '2023-03-14 16:11:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115819040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762009', 'Lori Keller', NULL, '3-14-23 Lori called me by accident unknowingly. I called her back and she revealed that she''s not super excited about her current indemnity plan. She was open to learning about any new options I had. She was concerned bc with LHS she waited 2 years to be reimbursed. She doesn''t seem to remember be on SECURE for a short period last LHS. She joining SECURE now bc she does like to do her wellness visits and knows benefits of HSA''s.  I did a quick review of the membership with her. I sent her the overview just now. She was now most concerned about not having a cap on her medical needs in case of accident, injury, illness, etc. I let her know there''s no cap for anything not pre-x.  I waived the $100 enrollment fee since she''s been a client in the past. She has no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She chooses alternative healthcare doctors but understands she''ll have to go to MD for wellness visit as long as they bill to ins. She''s ok with that. She will have an April 1st start date and cancel her UHC indemnity plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-14 14:33:41', '2023-03-14 14:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115824024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '3-14-2023:  Maria called to go over a few items:
     - She had knee issues &amp; had a need going.  Her PT is over, but they are sugg she go thru an exercise routine at a special therapy place.  She wondered if that would be shared.  I let her know to go ahead &amp; submit it for prior approval.  But, I wasn''t sure how they handle that type of item.
     -      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-14 14:22:54', '2023-03-24 10:05:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115824019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082307002', 'Massimo Giammarco', NULL, '3-14-2023:  Massimo called.  He wants to get a colonoscopy.  Because he''s on Care+ we went over a lot:
     - No ''prev care'' on his Care+.  IF gets the colonoscopy & it''s considered a ''screening'' = his responsibility.  We looked at fair price in his area so he''d know what that looks like financially.  He''s going to call & assume he''s resp so will let them no, no ''ins''.
     - IF they pull a polyp = moves to diagnostic.  Now, resp for 1k IUA & call us so we can help sub a ''med need''.  We went over all details: 6 mos deadline, 1k IUA, if further treatments how that works, etc.
     - HCBB:  showed him how to get in & utilize the tool.  His last doc = "Lower than avg quality of care", so according to him, he''ll be trying someone new.
     - Medicare:  Ages into Medicare Jan 2024.  He lives on the border of 2 states & wondered if he could cont on this plan.  Let him know, no, you become inelig the mo you turn 65.  He will find someone in his area that specializes in Medicare to see what that will look like.     
     - He was very apologetic that he might need to call back, because there''s a lot.  I encouraged him to call, that''s what we are here for.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-14 14:19:56', '2023-03-14 14:19:56'),
