  ('zcrm_1579374000115824014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742027', 'Larry King', NULL, '3-13-2023:  Larry RX Quotes:  Larry sent in a req for 6 drug quotes, but provided challenging information (ex:  qty = "custom").  When I would ask Larry for info his resp were very short, so I just finally sent the best I could offering to adj anything on the backside.  2 items were things he needed right away, but didn''t let us know that, so he said he no longer needed those later the same day he sub the req as he''d already picked them up.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-14 12:54:22', '2023-03-14 18:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115822018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '03.14.2023 Kelly called back for a follow up question regarding the medical need request she opened yesterday. She received another bill for the same incident, and wanted to know if she should wait for Zion to approve/or get the medical need going FIRST, or can she go ahead and submit the bill in? I recommended that she go ahead and submit it the bill, and Zion will connect the papers based on her initial contact and member ID information. Together we walked through the process by changing the toggle menu option to "additional document submission". NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-14 12:49:28', '2023-03-14 12:49:28'),
