  ('zcrm_1579374000115822013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113604002', 'Charlotte Hudson', NULL, '03.14.2023 Melissa called me back. I shared the Pharmacies that could be in her area. She was drawn to Vons and to Rite Aid, and possible using CostPlus Drugs site and pay a bit more.
Melissa was getting an idea on the RX pricing for this drug, and was not actually needing to use it ASAP. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-14 11:41:53', '2023-03-14 11:41:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115822008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '03.14.2023 Cynthia called  with a possible ear infection, while she is out of town. She asked how to be seen by a doctor, present herself there and overall steps. I recommended that she present herself as a cash-pay patient and request the cash-pay discount, save the receipt in preparation to open a medical need request to Zion, if it leads to that. 
After hanging up with Cynthia, I realized she could try using CirrusMD and save a bit of money. So I called her back, but I ended up leaving a message instead. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-14 11:39:50', '2023-03-14 11:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115824003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104534011', 'Yu Deng', NULL, '3-14-2023:  Ruby called.  She''s totally confused about the ID cards, thinking she should get new cards each year.  I let her know the card she has will work for everyone in the family.  She thinks her mamm next week is w/a PHCS ntwk facility, but she''s going to call to verify.  They were orig the only in ntwk spot.  IF they are no longer in ntwk, she will call us back immed so we can ask John K to push thru the approval for the RBP?  Or else, she can postpone.  She knows to watch for her new pdf Planstin card w/out the PHCS logo as well.
     - She asked about presenting her Zion card, so we did full education on the only card you will ever present is your ''prev care'' card from Planstin & how w/catastrophic care you do not present a card, no ''ins'', ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, your 1k IUA resp, etc.  Did full education, incl 6-mo deadline to sub initial expenses to go towards IUA.
     - Ruby''s super sweet.  I''m never 100% sure the comprehension is complete though due to her strong accent & some of the follow-up questions at times.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-14 11:35:36', '2023-03-14 11:49:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115819030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '3-14-23 I left another vm for Mike Bechtol just now. Christian is away. I also submitted an email to the CSA Team to see if that will resolve anything.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-14 11:34:24', '2023-03-14 11:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115819022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115821001', 'Nichole Baker', NULL, '3-14-23 Single income household with Payson McElveen. Nichole is going back to school. However, Nichole and Payson are engaged but not yet married. No set date yet. She''s 37 and wanting preventative care and if major problem.  Family history of breast cancer so wants to be able to do mammograms. No pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Rides for a bike company.  Used to work for hospital in Oct and left country. So she lost her chance to get Cobra. Now leaving country again soon for Uganda. She leaves on Tuesday. Payson will get her mail for her. She can do the Welcome Call while she''s in Uganda or before Tuesday if allowed. Choosing SECURE for wellness and HSA. $300/$1000 for April 1st start date.  She gets some income from a bike company and also some from Payson''s company. Uses her SS#.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-14 11:22:55', '2023-03-14 11:30:59'),
