  ('zcrm_1579374000115724048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115748002', 'Charles Chase', NULL, '3-13-2023:  Charles called.  They just signed up for SECURE (eff 4/1/2023) &amp; he rec''d the req for proof of self-emp.  But he''s not self-emp curr.  He''s retiring &amp; will be working a sm # of hours for his curr employer.  He might be able to get them to pay him on a 1099, but he''s not sure if they will do that, or how soon.  I put him into Patti''s VM as I''m not sure how quickly that needs to be done (immediately was my thought) and Patti would be able to give him a firm answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-13 17:01:43', '2023-03-13 17:01:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115697241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111417', 'Dimitri Soris', NULL, '03.13.2023 Dimitri called to attain a PCP provider list in his area for his annual physical. He also has a cold, so I recommended he contact CirrusMD, but he wanted it included in his physical. I am not very familiar with the older plans (RCI here), so I consulted with Cari via teams. I learned and delivered that he needs to make sure to keep it Preventative ONLY, and have them bill him separately for any extra bloodwork or other lab requests outside of the lipid panel, which is the only one covered.
I sent him and email via outlook with the PHCS provider search list I generated and the HCBB link. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-13 16:59:35', '2023-03-13 16:59:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115724030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088967001', 'Kristen Victor', NULL, '3-13-2023:  Kristen called - Planstin told her to start a ''med need'' because the mamm ultrasound will be for greater than her 1k IUA.  I told Kisten I was surprised as I hadn''t seen these be that expensive.  Her appt isn''t until July, so:  She''s going to call the provider she has the appt(s) with. Let them know she is a ''cash-pay'' pt, does not have ''ins'' for this, ask for a ''cash-pay'' disc, & a written estimate.  Then she will call us so we can show her how to sub a ''med need''.  Since we have 4 months, we have time to get this together.  [I ck''d on HCBB after we got off & it shows a unilateral breast ultrasound as ~ $183 in her area.  Maybe w/a mammogram as well?  Or I''m not looking up the corr procedure?]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-13 15:39:21', '2023-03-13 15:46:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115738023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038883009', 'Melissa Bajza', NULL, '3-13-23 Called Mike Becthol yet again with no response. I emailed CSA Team and Christian as well. Nothing yet. Melissa is freaking out, needless to say and ready to bring it to DORA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-13 15:38:00', '2023-03-13 15:38:00'),
