Where Karen is living right now, Safeway &amp; CVS are w/in walking distance.  Rite Aid was cheapest, but for the small price diff she chose Safeway instead of Rite Aid.  Sent both coupons above.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-13 10:51:36', '2023-03-13 10:54:27'),
