  ('zcrm_1579374000115697034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '03.13.2023 Kelly called to confirm how to proceed with an obgyn procedure visit.
I guided her to make sure that the provider and facility for all procedures are in the PHCS network. We both checked the PHCS for her doctor, Jeanne Falk, and she is on there. I did not see the location she stated, but as an actual participant of the network, she is on there.
Zion papers for medical need. Asked about alternative medicine treatment referred by doctor and coverage by Zion, and the difference in the dates in the medical form: first column question ''When did you first start showing symptoms or require treatment?'' & ''Initial Doctor''s visit'' 2nd column; wondering which question affects the 6 month deadline.
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams on both subjects to confirm my understand prior to delivering information. I learned and guided with the 2nd column question is what we go by to adhere to the 6 month deadline AND that the alternative treatments referred by docs need to be done PRIOR to filling out a medical need request that include the referral from the initial doctor AND the complete treatment plan from the practitioner or doctor of chiropractic. 
Kelly will submit everything at once, as she had ONE acupuncture visit already, and follow up with Zion in a day. 
I referred them to the WHLC link from our member portal and updates page for coupons.
I recommended that they bookmark the member portals and updates page as well as star the POST WELCOME call email they received from Kelly, a while back.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-13 09:09:53', '2023-03-13 09:59:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115697023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115434012', 'Shawn Vadeboncoeur', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-13 08:55:18', '2023-03-13 08:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115697018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115651002', 'Scott Groza', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-13 08:50:38', '2023-03-13 08:50:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115697013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103906002', 'Rodrigo Torres', NULL, '03.13.2023 Rodrigo called to learn the process on how to set up his annual check up to get covered by Planstin. He is well versed with the MultiPlan link, and searching for a doctor there. Was not sure what to choose for a PCP under the drop down menu, so I recommended he choose either Family practice OR Internal Medicine. I coached him to:
-Present as part of the Planstin insurance for coverage, ask if they are part of the PHCS network.
-Be firm on the appt being PREVENTATIVE ONLY. Should they request outside labwork, request back that they separate the', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-13 08:43:21', '2023-03-13 09:04:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115691008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077623046', 'Nicholas Onken', NULL, 'Nicholas called because he is having a nose bleed. CirrusMD told him to just relax with his head back to get his nose to stop bleeding but Nicholas wanted to know what to do in case he has to go to the ER. I explained the process to Nicholas, to which he seemed surprised that he has to meet a $2500 IUA. He was quite upset that this was his responsibility and hopes that he does not have to go to the ER. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-13 07:51:00', '2023-03-13 07:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115697003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001837009', 'Andrea Hinman', 'Payment Update', 'Andres submitted new Payment Info.  Updated in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-13 07:43:56', '2023-03-13 07:43:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115691003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032070', 'Danielle Hatch', NULL, 'Danielle had a miscarriage and the Zion Health Needs team told her that someone would be reaching out to her from the extended care team to open this new need. Danielle hadn''t heard from anyone yet and requested to speak with Zion. I transferred her over and gave her my best wishes with this situation. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-13 07:18:28', '2023-03-13 07:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2905 Question : I’m a MPB member looking for how to contact MPB telehealth', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-03-11 16:28:53', '2023-03-11 16:28:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115654003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2904 Question : I’m a MPB member and I’m looking for the MPB telehealth number', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-03-11 16:24:40', '2023-03-11 16:24:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115613069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105392002', 'Craig Larson', NULL, '03.10.2023 Craig Larson called to get his Zion member ID number to complete filling out the medical need request. I guided him to check his email for a softcopy in a welcome email from them.
I found what he needed, and started asking how to access the same medical need request to upload more documents. I explained that he can use the same link, but change the option in the toggle drop down menu to "Addition Document...", and Zion would match your name with the file they have on you.
Craig felt confident in completing the request on his own. I encouraged him to call us if he had any questions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-10 16:25:09', '2023-03-10 16:25:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115613064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111982009', 'Dean Mello', NULL, '03.10.2023 Dean filled out an RX Request via cognito forms for: 24 HR Bupropion Hydrochloride/Bupropion XL - 100MG - 90 Day, Pantoprazole - 20MG - 30 Day Supply, 
Albuterol HFA & Humalog SC SOLN - 100 Unit/ML.
Here''s what I sent him via Outlook:
CostPlus website: https://costplusdrugs.com/medications/ (3 items had the BEST prices)
RX Request Prices On CostPlus:
24 HR Bupropion Hydrochloride/Bupropion XL - 100MG - 90 Day Supply 1/day = $13.40 
Pantoprazole - 20MG - 30 Day Supply = $9.20
Albuterol HFA - 6.75 - 2 Inhalers = $32.60
For the Humalog request, the research does not pull up the prefixes you have in your RX Request form, SC SOLN.  However, the strength and units are a match. Here''s what we found. Double check before you purchase that this form works with your pump. 
Below are the prices as of Thursday 02.09.2023
The average price for Humalog  SC SOLN - 100 Unit/ML in your area is $150.92
Humalog  SC SOLN - 100 Unit/ML - 6 Vials: CVS $257.22
Humalog  SC SOLN - 100 Unit/ML - 6 Vials: Walgreens $214.70    ---------------------------- NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-10 16:07:57', '2023-03-10 16:31:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115626039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, '3-10-2023:  Since the weekend is coming &amp; I haven''t heard back from Lafi, ILM ck''ing to make sure he was able to work everything out w/CirrusMD.  Asked him to let me know if he''s still having issues &amp; gave him our hours of opperation here on the concierge line.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-10 15:35:43', '2023-03-10 15:35:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115626031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081602002', 'Kristi Carr', NULL, '3-10-2023:  Kristi called.  Her teenage daugher''s school is asking about ''ins'' for mental health counseling.  I went over our option: MAP.  She was trying to register, so I showed her how to get in using the access code instead.  We went in depth on how the plan works, pattern, sm ntwk, option to pay during waiting periods, etc.  She knows sm ntwk can prove challenging, but once w/a counselor, I hear really good things.  Also, showed her their site, its depth, & mentioned the Impact Suite items.  Maybe, if she needs positive interaction daily, the Lift might be a good option.  Set up similar to gaming w/reinforcement.  She''ll look at that to see what she thinks.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-10 15:32:00', '2023-03-10 15:32:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115613050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113604002', 'Charlotte Hudson', NULL, '03.10.2023 Charlotte called to schedule her welcome call. I sent her the welcome call scheduling email via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-10 15:29:36', '2023-03-10 15:29:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115613040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '03.10.2023 Aimee called to attain a discounted rx coupon. It is her first time using the service. She had already had them send the prescription to CVS. She asked me how does the Pharm. Program work. I explained briefly what we do, when member fill out the form online. She proceeded to say, "Oh I already had them send it to the pharm. is that ok?" I responded with, yes, It''s just that I can give you a coupon for that pharmacy only, even though it might not be the lease expensive. She was appeased, so I generated a coupon on one discount site, and forwarded it to her immediately, since she''s already at the pharmacy waiting.
I sent Aimee the generated coupon and the link to the RX Request Form to, aimeehove35@gmail.com:

I was glad I was able to price your immediate RX request that I took over the phone from you for Eric, Mupirocin - 15g 2% - for zip code 94070 - CVS, since that is where they sent the prescription.

Below are the prices as of today, 03.10.2023.
Mupirocin - 15g 2% - 1 Tube supply: CVS $14.47         ------------------------------ NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-10 15:27:43', '2023-03-10 15:43:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115612056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, '3-10-23 Patti asked Amy and Kenneth to call me about Essentials. I called them and explained what is included and how to make the change if they wish to do so. Kenneth is the only one on the membership. Amy is not a member. They will decide and complete either the cancellation form or the change form by March 20th. All set for now. Although, it sounds like Kenneth has some major health issues he''s dealing with right now with Sedera. He mentioned they''ve paid $35K already and have many more expenses to come!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-10 14:45:48', '2023-03-10 14:45:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115612051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115828002', 'Kathleen Totherow', NULL, 'Kathleen returned my call while I was conducting an interview. She left me a voicemail indicating interest in our plans. I tried her back, and missed her again.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-10 14:36:30', '2023-03-10 14:36:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115626026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082489118', 'Darrin Levy', NULL, '3-10-2023:  A gentleman call from 303-870-0001 & it pulls up this acct.  He rec''d a bill for the labwork from his ''prev care'' appt & didn''t know why Planstin would not have paid for those items.  I conf, he had more than just his lipid panel done, so I let him know that''s really the only consistent ''prev care'' lab test the gvmt considers as ''prev care''.  It might also have been an out-of-ntwk lab, which may be the issue.  We agreed Planstin could give him more definitive answers, so I made sure he has their # & trans him there.  He''ll call back if he still has questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-10 14:30:27', '2023-03-10 14:30:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115626015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, '3-10-2023:  Snatam called to confirm her monthly contribution.  Per Admin123, she''s being chg''d $681.50 (& has been for quite some time).  She said that''s the amt she expected.  
     - Planstin:  she said that the only card she has - I conf ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative Care only & is the only time she''ll ever need to present a card.  We discussed how everything else is ''cash-pay''.  She seemed to understand that.  Did let her know we will eventually be trans to RBP w/new pdf Planstin cards coming via e-mail, so to watch for that card down the road.  At that point, feel free to call us w/questions because we will eventually move away for the PHCS ntwk, just don''t know when.     
     [It seemed like I heard a man in the background guiding her.  Not sure though.  Could have been an older son?  Maybe they are evaluating her healthcare?]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-10 14:04:23', '2023-03-10 14:06:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115585203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115632002', 'Tatiana Hamawi', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-10 13:58:32', '2023-03-10 13:58:32');
