  ('zcrm_1579374000115587052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005666920', 'Rachel Brandon', NULL, 'Rachel called regarding dental/vision. I sent her the instructions on how to register for WHLC. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-10 13:50:56', '2023-03-10 13:50:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115585193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083256002', 'William Coble', 'Member aging into the 50 Age Band eff 5/1/23', '1st notice sent to member &amp; Advisor - 3/10 (Outlook)
2nd notice sent to member &amp; Advisor - 4/3', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-10 13:44:57', '2023-04-03 09:30:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115612036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115984002', 'Colleen Patrice', NULL, '3-10-23 Colleen came to me via Andre Simoneau and is working with Five Rings a bit. Totally like minded. She''s an athlete, no meds, no tobacco, no health issues. Prefers alternative care. Does her pap screening, no mammo, prefers ultrasound or thermography, no colonoscopy, does colonics, yes to annual dermatology check up but isn''t covered by ACA. So, she''s leaning towards CARE+ since the price is better too. Not sure if she''ll fund an HSA. Will sleep on it all and we are meeting next week. She''s also super excited about our Referral Program. She will be thrilled to refer new people to me and get paid $100 each membership who signs up!  He best friend Chelsea Ariew is also a member and talked about this!  She''s excited. She''s paying about $100 now for supplemental plans. But, she believes she needs to protect herself better. She was quoted $600+ from a broker for trad ins and said "Hell no."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-10 13:43:20', '2023-03-10 13:43:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115587044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113141002', 'Scott Readence', NULL, 'Left detailed vm, sent email earlier to confirm call but did not hear back from the member(I emailed Elizabeth since she is the one who scheduled the call), and sent a new scheduling link. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-10 13:02:51', '2023-03-10 13:03:21'),
