  ('zcrm_1579374000115613035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111773002', 'Heather DelDuca', NULL, '03.10.2023 Heather called to get set up on CirrusMD. I confirmed her profile, and sent her an CirrusMD invitation link to set up. She received the email while we were on the phone. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-10 12:42:55', '2023-03-10 12:42:55'),
