  ('zcrm_1579374000115585125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075714162', 'Christine Lair', 'Dependent turning 26 5/23', 'Dependent Logan will be turning 26 5/23 1st notices sent to member &amp; advisor - 3/10
2nd notice sent 3/30', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-10 12:32:56', '2023-03-30 12:00:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115585112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109669001', 'Kelli Thrasher', 'Dependent Aging out of plan 5/31/23', 'Hailey will be turning 26 in month of 5/23 I will send 1st notice to member &amp; advisor - 3/10', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-10 12:28:19', '2023-03-10 12:31:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115613027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, '03.10.2023 Karen called, returning Cari''s call, looking for information Cari had found for her. I tried Cari on teams but was dedicated with another member. I told Karen that, and that I wish I had the information in front of me for her, but I don''t.
She was ok, and had some questions for me while on the phone. Karen asked if she wanted search for a PCP, how does she go about doing that to have her physical? I guided her to star/bookmark the MPB Member Portal and Updates page on our site, and then I guided her to her Post Welcome Call Email from Vanessa, then to the multiPlan link. The link was not included in the email, which I had her star as well, so I send her a generic email via CRM with the MultiPlan link in it. I initially searched internal medicine for her, but she wanted to search it herself to learn, so I never sent her the list.
She asked what else does she do for her physical, I coached her on the cues and how to present herself with Planstin, billing, the PHCS network confirmation, the reiterating it is PREVENTATIVE only, and what to do with extra lab work outside of lipid work.
By the time her and I were getting through it all, I learned that Cari became available, so I transferred her over. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-10 12:07:50', '2023-03-10 12:19:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115626003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114129002', 'Stephanie McCarter', NULL, '3-10-2023:  Stephanie called back.  
     - Zion told her she needed to call us.  They did send her a Zion card, but did not go over you do not present this card with her!  We talked about that''s why they don''t sent out these cards - you''ll never need it & did more education on this.
     - RX:  She wanted to know how we handle RXs.  Zion told her if she gets drugs while she''s in the hospital those aren''t covered because she doesn''t have thier RX plan.  I went over how if she''s admitted into the hosp, the drugs they give her while she''s there are generally a part of the hospital ''med need''.  But, if the drug is now a maintenance item, she notifies the concierge of the drugs she''ll need & we''ll find the best price near her.  We disc this w/quite a few details.  However, she was just worried because Zion told her she doesn'' t have their RX plan.  Gave her recent comparisons & mentioned there are times we need to go to our int shopper & on a rare occasion, it''s a challenge, but more often that not we can really help w/RX discounts.
     - WHLC:  We got her registered & walked thru how to use the site.  She has a chiro about 100-miles from her she''d like to use.  I showed her the ''Nominate a Provider'' at the bottom of the screen if she doesn''t see her chiro.  There were so many pages we quit looking together at the chiro w/in 100 miles of her on page 9.
     - PCP:  She''s going to be doing a temp job in Charleston (kind of to see if she wants to move there full time).  She asked if she needs to wait to get a PCP until she gets home to TX.  Went over that''s up to her.  She can choose someone in Charleston to have her needs met while she''s there, then just choose a new doc when she gets home.  Not like trad ''ins'' where you can only be served in your perm area.  She seemed to like she had options.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-10 11:58:55', '2023-03-10 14:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115585107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109495010', 'William Moomaw', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to update email I will change in CRM, A123 &amp; FTNI.  Change will go over in file to Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-10 11:54:12', '2023-03-10 11:54:12'),
