  ('zcrm_1579374000115494031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102421002', 'Christopher Rutt', NULL, 'Outside agent John Jarman called me to explain his member, Christopher Rutt was confused about his coverage and which card to use. I went through the CRM and Admin, member never did his welcome call. The advisor, John Jarman stated he wasn''t aware of the process of a welcome call. I told the member I''d have someone from the concierge team send him a scheduler to do the long overdue welcome call.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-09 14:08:22', '2023-03-09 14:08:22'),
