  ('zcrm_1579374000115494008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115515002', 'Osha Waters', NULL, '3-9-23 Ossha had many questions and was waivering about choosing SECURE for wellness until we realized she''s not ready to show proof of her self-employment. She''s not eager to do colonoscopy or mammogram and had never heard of thermogram. She''s choosing CARE+ $1000/$520. Her DOB is March 19th and is turning 50. She knows she will be charged at the higher rate.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-09 13:11:18', '2023-03-09 13:11:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115489003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082754', 'Ricardo Trespalacios', 'Tckt Sub: No Contact for Sedera Conv', 'Jennifer submitted to Michele.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-09 12:22:05', '2023-03-09 12:22:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115465011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, '3-9-23 Drew was upset about how he will be billed on March 20th for his April membership since he''s changing age brackets in April. After a few emails, I called and explained better over the phone. He now understands. He''s bummed, but understands. Then I asked if he''s been using his membership in case a switch would be helpful. He said his knees have been bothering him. He''s been getting help from Redirect to schedule the appointments.  He went to his doctor and they wanted to take x-rays. He said he wanted to get them on his own or provide the ones he already had from a year ago. Then they said x-rays won''t help! He will need an MRI. They wouldn''t look at his x-rays. Then the Dr. gave him a shot (assuming cortisone) to help one knee feel better but not the other one. Dr. said it would relieve the pain in 3 days. It didn''t help. He called back and asked for the MRI prescription for both knees and the Dr. won''t do it bc supposedly insurance will typically reject it. He pressed on saying it won''t be an issue since he''s self-pay. He has still yet to succeed in getting the script for both knees. Once he does, he will contact Redirect or MPB Concierge Team to find  the best and cheapest place locally to get his MRI''s. It''s totally insane the games the doctor is playing with him. Side note - he''s well aware of what''s happening in the world and has done everything in his power to stay away from doctors. He''s learning that the behavior can be described as myopia. He''s also getting engaged soon!  He was much better educated about his membership once we finished the call. I''ll send him the Quick Reference Guide today too.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-09 12:14:26', '2023-03-09 12:14:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115465006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118543002', 'Kelcey Nichols', NULL, 'Kelcey called me back, we discussed the Secure Plan for her and her husband. Went over details of the plan, and pricing. she is interested, will discuss with her husband and get back with me.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-09 12:05:36', '2023-03-09 12:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115385013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '3-9-2023:  Elizabeth called.  She''s having issues when she tries to get Redirect pymt/& to sched appts.  They are telling her, her acct has gaps in cov.  I called Redirect & spoke with Jamie W (female), she can see Eliz memb has been non-stop, no gaps, & is curr active.  She''s reaching out to Memb Srvcs to figure out why there are issues.  Took both Eliz ph #, both e-mails, my name & # & will have Memb Srvcs contact Eliz & us to follow-up.
     - I let Jamie at Redirect know, Eliz''s been trying to sched a chiro appt, so it is time sensitive since her appt is at 3:45pm mtn time today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-09 11:41:15', '2023-03-09 11:46:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115450089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', 'Aging into Medicare eff 4/23', '1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor - 2/10 2nd notice sent - 3/9 Plan cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-09 11:39:32', '2023-03-09 11:39:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115401085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '3-9-2023:  Ben called.  They just found out the are 5-weeks pregnant.  We started a maternity need &amp; he already had the pymt pkg to upload, so he has a handle on this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-09 11:38:52', '2023-03-09 11:38:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115426229', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '3-9-23 Emily is joining SECURE and has moved to Upstate NY. She was ready to go back to LHS bc she got confused about how to access wellness with ins and won''t accumulate towards IUA since it should be no cost. She also didn''t really understand or like IUA vs AUA. She knows LHS is going through some changes but felt comfortable with them. Once I re-explained how SECURE works, she feels much better. She knows to be her own advocate at her annual wellness visit and to ask for only labs that will be coded as wellness/screening. Anything else she''ll reach out the MPB Concierge Team to access labs at the best price. This is what they use the membership for the most. She likes to get her vitamin D levels tested, etc. Basic stuff. No pre-x. Enrolling in SECURE MS $1000/$625. I gave them the $100 discount since they''ve been clients with me long ago. Kids are all set through NY State program.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-09 11:24:32', '2023-03-09 11:38:50'),
