  ('zcrm_1579374000115426219', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113409012', 'Cynthia Denson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-09 11:13:42', '2023-03-09 11:13:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115459008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070161001', 'Douglas Brenteson', NULL, '03.09.2023 Doug is looking for his 1095C form. I guided him to check his emails from Planstin regarding his tax documents. 
He found it, and Planstin has members creating a  portal NOW with them, so he was confused and wanted to use the MPB log-in information. I was confused as well, and actually offered him his MPB log in info, to quickly learn afterwards, it was a Planstin administration page. 
Doug did share that he has not done this before, and has not used IT. I will assume IT = 1095 form.
After extensive explanation on his membership, what company/service is involved and for what reasons, I then shared that his  next step in that email is going to be with Planstin. After him and I were done, I gave him Planstin''s number and transferred him over. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-09 11:12:50', '2023-03-09 12:59:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115459003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082754', 'Ricardo Trespalacios', NULL, '03.09.2023 PLEASE SEE NOTES ABOVE 2.22.2023, 1.31.2023, 03.02.2023 & 03.09.2023 Cari''s Note that is directly aligned with THIS NOTE.
Ricardo called frustrated about his membership still not attended to, due to the Sedera Conversion.  He wanted to understand what he needs to and salvage his membership that has not be resolved, even though he has spoken to a few people from MPB. He sounded very confused, where his frustration seemed to stem from mainly. 
I immediately reached out to my team via teams, and right away they both (Jen & Cari) started dissecting the matter and going back in the timeline to address any loop holes. I was coached to contact the advisor, so I called Michael Montes instantly and left an extensive message with the notion of it being time sensitive/pressing matter.
Cari immediately got on the call with Sedera and spoke with Ashley again, who she spoke with in the past regarding this matter. Via teams, I was receiving guidance on who in MPB should receive this matter TODAY, Jen put in a ticket IMMEDIATELY, and I relayed the information and tried to gain more insight on any efforts taken place in the past, between Ricardo and MPB.
Ricardo stated that he was promised a call back from the last couple of times he contacted us, but has not received a call from us, including Michael Montes. Given the nature of our company, Michele became involved regarding the ticket on this issue that Jen generated. I could not warm transfer him to her, as she was pre-occupied with another dedicated member. I left her a text message via teams instead.
Also, give the nature of the situation status of Ricardo''s membership with us, is it possible that now ONLY Patti can salvage the situation or at least revive it in a different manner?? NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-09 11:09:37', '2023-03-09 11:44:34'),
