  ('zcrm_1579374000115401066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082754', 'Ricardo Trespalacios', NULL, '3-9-2023:  Realized I never heard back from Ashley (female) at Sedera (see 2/22/2023 note).  tt Ashley again today.  She says a Sedera advisor talked with Ricardo earlier in Jan.  He wanted to confirm the price w/MPB though, so he decided to get that confirmation before completing the conversion.  According to Ashley, their notes show that advisor reminded him that he''d still need to complete the conversion after he confirms the price to keep his memb going.
