  ('zcrm_1579374000115418040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869433', 'Alayn Williams', NULL, '3-8-2023:  Alayn called.  She had 2 questions:
     - Does this ''ins'' cover wisdom tooth extraction?  We started w/a reminder this isn''t trad ins, & using those terms can conf doc''s off (she laughed & was nice about the reminder).  Then I went to Zion''s curr Memb Guidelines & read the inelig "Dental" paragraph that says no, this is not a shareable item.  She seemed to understand.
     - She hasn''t rec''d her Planstin cards yet and is looking at ''prev care'' coming up in June.  We went over the curr trans to RBP & that may be why they haven''t sent them.  We decided she will make her appts for later in June, then call us late May if she still hasn''t rec''d the new Planstin pdf version of the new card (she ck''d & didn''t receive the old one).  I told her what to look for so she can recognize the new card if they arrive.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-08 20:49:56', '2023-03-08 20:52:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115388050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '03.08.2023 Robin called to attain a 1095A information, based on a question in the taxes she''s completing. I consulted with Cari via teams to confirm if Patti also deals with the 1095A, as the 1095C. She said not and explained the difference, and coached me to remind Robin to check her emails from Planstin for that tax form. Robin was happy to do that, and found what she was looking for. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-08 18:00:57', '2023-03-08 18:00:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115426054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '3-8-23 Kimber with Zion called me re Darryl''s case. Her # is 888-399-0017 ext. 274. Emily Bland called me back from Steadman''s clinic. I left another vm asking her to let me know when she submitted the letter showing it''s an acute, new health issue, not pre-x. I will call them both again tomorrow morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-08 17:29:16', '2023-03-08 17:29:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115426049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132226', 'Maria Borden', NULL, '3-8-23 Maria called to remove her son who recently got a new job with benefits. I walked her through the online form and she submitted her removal request for her son. All set and she was super appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-08 17:27:33', '2023-03-08 17:27:33'),
