  ('zcrm_1579374000115426019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104964002', 'Sandra Erickson', NULL, 'I reached out to Sandra, she was very upset and didn''t want to speak. I''m sending her an email for her to call me directly when she is up to it, hopefully I can help her out.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-08 14:37:27', '2023-03-08 14:37:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115418032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '3-8-2023:  Etta called.  Ian is having a single procedure, but part will be ''prev care'' & part isn''t.  She wasn''t sure how to handle.  Since it''s Redirect, I let her know at times, they actually will coordinate your entire healthcare & work w/Sedera for the portion that is not ''prev''.  However, that seems to chg as we are all growing, so to call Redirect.  IF she needs help w/the Sedera portion we can guide her, but she said it she has to do that she knows how to.  I left it that if she runs into issues, to please let us know and we''ll do what we can to help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-08 14:32:02', '2023-03-08 14:32:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115418021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109658034', 'Dawn Dines', NULL, '3-8-2023:  Dawn called & I had Nahla bring me into the call.  She''s very resistant and just wants to tell you what to do.  I encouraged her to call us for assistance to make sure she''s following the guidelines, utilizing the componenets accurately...  Honestly, she''s the type that will have issues because she refused our assistance & then is mad because she did something inaccurately.  It was a challenging conversation.  She didn''t want to follow my instructions, she wanted to tell me how it was going to be & she''s inaccurate on her understandings.  [ie: the portal has everything she needs.  That the $ she''s spent will go towards a total (like a ded).  She wanted to know about ''claims'', etc...]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-08 13:55:08', '2023-03-08 13:58:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115388029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109658034', 'Dawn Dines', NULL, '03.08.2023 Dawn called trying to get her profile and providers all set up. She wanted a memory refresh on how to access the RX Request form. I guided her to the MPB.Health>Member Portals & Updates Page. She shared she is confident to take it from there. NT

*******************************************************************************************

Dawn called back and I picked up, regarding how to access her Member Portal. I was in the process of offering her the log-in information, but then she asked me for the MPB Member ID# that is not anywhere on the member''s profile. I told her usually it only asks for the username that is the email and the passcode, which I''d be happy to give you as well. However I needed to consult with Cari regarding the member ID#, and Cari requested to be brought into the call, to further explain the use of the Member Portal, how everything the member needs is 99% here on the member portal & updates page, and that the only reason to log-in to the actual member portal is to attain receipts and/or check the Secure plan. 
Please note further details on the call below from Cari. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-08 13:30:43', '2023-03-09 13:30:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115401058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115315002', 'tayler rodriguez', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-08 13:29:04', '2023-03-08 13:29:04'),
