  ('zcrm_1579374000115426003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096562002', 'Gordon Matthews', NULL, '3-8-23 Gordon left his job. It wasn''t the right direction for him. He''s interested in rejoining SECURE. However, in a networking meeting he met a health ins agent who wants to give him a quote. So, he''s currently working on his own bus. He might go into the negative, so he might qualify for Medicaid. He might also earn $60K as best guess with including his wife income of $15K and his $45K. However, if all goes really well, he''ll earn $100K when all said and done. He might qualify for Medicaid while he builds his biz and then if he gets the contracts he wants, he''s move to SECURE at that time. He''s also interested in the HMA for other expenses. This could be great for his family for dental and other medical needs. They don''t have any immediate needs but might have to deal with braces in the future. His daughter just moved to Boulder to work for Trader Joes for 3 months, then she''s off to AK. She''s been to 15 countries since about 2017 I think he said. She''s super adventurous. He knows Medicaid and ins ins''t ideal for her traveling. So, he''ll take it all into consideration and will keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-08 13:05:58', '2023-03-08 13:41:46'),
