  ('zcrm_1579374000115418003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112836002', 'Andre Savoie', NULL, '3-8-2023:  Lillian called.  Their membship started on 3/1/2023 & that morning she tore ligaments, dislocated her shoulder, & after seeing the doc today, they are planning on surgery Friday!  Sent her the temp for sub a ''surgical need'' to Zion.  She has a lot to do to submit this though:
     - They cancelled their BCBS, but don''t know what date it ends.  We talked about BCBS is primary if they still have that & their healthsharing comp Zion will be secondary.  She''s going to call & get an answer right after our call.
     - She was doing yoga when this happened.  [Somewhat concerned:  she''s a yoga instructor & that''s when it happened.  Will that cross into the prof athlete issue?  I suggested she tell them:  ''I was doing yoga that morning & that''s how it happened".  Did not go into why (I left out the instructor part).  She''s very concerned they screwed up by going to this plan.  I hope it''s a non issue.
     - She doesn''t think she''s pd anything yet:  ER, MRI, Dr''s, etc.  I sugg she may just want to pay Zion her 1k IUA then, that might be easiest once they''ve received her ''med need''.
     Lillian will call us for further instructions.  She still in a lot of pain & it sounds like thoughts aren''t 100% clear.  I encouraged her to call us so we can help.     - CA

Lillian called back.  Their BCBS has cancelled so that''s no longer a concern.  She rec''d the estimates for ''cash-pay'' patients from all of the providers & the doc (?) is requiring 1k upfront.  She''s already pd $700 towards the MRI, so we discussed options.  The hardest part is how quickly this is happening.  Worst case scenario, I told her to see if all other entities will bill her.  Even if she had the $1700 out-of-pkt, once the ''med need'' is approved (assuming it is) they would reimb her.  From what she''s saying, it''s not like she has any other option.  This emerg surgery must be done.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-08 12:29:08', '2023-03-08 17:10:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115388013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108590009', 'Loni Oliver', NULL, '03.08.2023 Loni called initially wondering if she will be receiving hard copy cards from Planstin and Zion. I shared that they are only sending PDF version right now.
