  ('zcrm_1579374000115385003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112463002', 'Alec Campbell', NULL, 'I spoke with Alec regarding this situation. Nice guy, I listened to this conversation between him and Leo. Alec was misinformed, and after I did the research on this, he decided to cancel. I spoke to John Kach about this yesterday, and John said if he cancels, we will give him back his money. I opened a ticket for the refund.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-08 10:04:06', '2023-03-08 10:04:06'),
