  ('zcrm_1579374000115332023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755162', 'Scott Yarbrough', NULL, 'Scott called regarding bills he is now receiving after his rotator cuff surgery. He was told by Zion that they were going to pay everything and gave him a CC# for the payments. The hospital is now coming back stating that Zion did not pay everything and now they are sending Scott exponential bills. I transferred Scott to Zion so he could speak to the needs department directly. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-08 09:43:53', '2023-03-08 09:43:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115380003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '3-8-23 Darryl called a bit panicked. Zion has not yet lifted the $50K cap on his Need for back surgery. He''s in pain and needs this done quickly. The bill payor Vince says it''s capped at $50K. Tamra with HCBB has been great at helping with the negotiations and such. Emily Bland at Steadman''s has been super helpful and sent the letter early last week from Dr. stating this is acute and brand new health issue, not chronic. I''m waiting to hear back from her as to the exact date she sent the letter. Darryl thinks it was Feb. 27th-Mar 1st. The cost for the entire surgery will be over $50K with the Dr., anesthesiologist and surgical center.  He''s freaking out a bit this morning since bill payor hasn''t received word that the cap is lifted yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-08 09:43:52', '2023-03-08 09:43:52'),
