  ('zcrm_1579374000115332018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575167', 'Peggy Neises', NULL, 'Gastro of the Rockies called to verify Peggy''s insurance information. I explained to Jennifer from Gastro of the Rockies that Peggy should have given her Planstin card information for this colonoscopy. Jennifer is going to call Peggy to get that info. Jennifer did verify with me while she was on the phone that they do accept the PHCS/Planstin card. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-08 08:46:19', '2023-03-08 08:46:19'),
