  ('zcrm_1579374000115257070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, '3-7-2023:  Lafi called.  He wanted to tt CirrusMD for his daughter: Saeda.  We finally got him into CirrusMD (he''s prev reg''d), but then it wouldn''t allow him to add his minor children.  He was going to try to talk with the doctor & explain the system was keeping her out (we dbl ck''d spelling, b-dates, etc, & neither child would add to his memb).  I''ll send a support ticket asking them to add both children to his acct if he needs me to.  We don''t know his wife''s e-mail, so we''ll have to do her separately.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-07 16:47:04', '2023-03-10 15:34:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115300059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092232002', 'Lon Kumpula', NULL, '03.07.2023 Jocelyn called to learn how to attain the discounts on pharmacy services/prescriptions. I explained that usually the members fill out a form and submit it to us, when we receive it we search discount sites and check in with out international shopper. 
