  ('zcrm_1579374000115300048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038985042', 'Sandra Byrne', NULL, '03.07.2023 Sandra called from the hospital, where she was recommended to go due to closeness. She mistakenly gave the hospital her RCI card, and naturally the hospital rejected it referring to it as "Sandra''s insurance", according to Sandra. 
