Via Outlook, I sent her an email  with the new email (sandle.ires@gmail.com), a change form to change her email address, so we can communicate via CRM''s templates. After we hung up, I sent her another email via outlook, the "Submitting your medical bills to Sedera" template.
I look forward to speaking with Sandra again to guide her to open the medical need with Sedera. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-07 15:39:07', '2023-03-07 15:46:13'),
