  ('zcrm_1579374000115257060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092232002', 'Lon Kumpula', NULL, '3-7-2023:  Jocelyn called.  Callie needs her thyroid pills & she thought they could do that with their ''prev care'' annual appt.  We disc that''s not considered ''prev care'', so she''ll need to find a doc.  She''s always gone to a pediatrician, but has now turned 18, so they want to find another doc for her.  
