  ('zcrm_1579374000115272053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, 'Allison called because she is pregnant and needed some guidance on how to present at her OB. We went through the cash-pay process and opening a maternity need, but it appears the office is giving Allison  a hard time and wants to speak with Zion. I attempted to to a warm transfer to Zion with Allison so we could see if they could give us any advice on how to handle this situation but they were in a company wide meeting at 3:55 PM EST. Allison is going to call on her own to find out if Zion can give any recommendations. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-07 13:56:34', '2023-03-07 13:56:34'),
