  ('zcrm_1579374000115257041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112463002', 'Alec Campbell', NULL, '3-7-2023:  Alec called.  Feels like he was sold the product w/a ton of misinformation.  Complaints starting w/eff should have been 2/1/23 per his understanding, then it was 3/1/2023 instead.  Pre-x conditions were not gone over properly &amp; now after tt Zion he has major concerns.  Trans him to Leo''s mgr: Jeffrey Bursteen since he would be the best person to discuss this with.  He knows he can call us anytime, but Jeffrey''s a good place to start.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-07 12:27:00', '2023-03-07 12:29:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115282008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115982002', 'Timothy Cornely', NULL, 'Spoke to Timothy and Tracy, nice people. They have been researching medical cost sharing. I went over both the Direct plan, and Care Plus. She has Lupus, I explained there would be no coverage for that. She understands and is ok with just having catastrophic for the both of them. We will speak again.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-07 12:03:20', '2023-03-07 12:03:20'),
