After consulting with Cari via teams to confirm the process, and learned that the insurance POSSIBLY may not have been shared. I gave Martha the choice to contact the doctor''s office or speak with Planstin. One way or the other, Martha needed to connect the two parties to exchange information and get the bill settled. I did warm transfer her to Planstin, after unpleasantly conversing with Celeste to give her a preface of the situation. 
