  ('zcrm_1579374000115300013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Raissa Wilkes', NULL, '03.07.2023 Raissa called to learn how to submit her initial papers towards opening a medical need. Her PCP Preventative visit, turned into diagnostic with lab work.
