  ('zcrm_1579374000115298003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114056002', 'David Mell', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-07 10:40:32', '2023-03-07 10:40:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115272043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109781008', 'Lauren Guida', NULL, 'Lauren called in the AM frustrated and upset because she is feeling overwhelmed with her healthcare. Lauren and I spoke for roughly 30 minutes discussing how the concierge team can assist her when she''s feeling overwhelmed like she is today. We verified that the OBGYN she wants to see for her preventative care is in the PHCS network and we discussed present as cash pay for her Endo appointment. I advised Lauren that we can take this one step at a time so that she doesn''t feel so overwhelmed. Lauren will call when her Endo gives her the labs she wants done so that we can assist her with pricing. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-07 09:48:37', '2023-03-07 09:48:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115281029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438206', 'Brandon Pearce', NULL, 'Re: note below I replied to Allison and copied Jane on the email.  I will send the Cancellation out to Brandon and copy Jane on this as well.  Hopefully she will reach out to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-07 09:27:28', '2023-03-07 09:27:28'),
