  ('zcrm_1579374000115272028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'Snatam called in regarding her daughter''s mental health. We discussed the MAP program and I had to repeatedly tell Snatam that she does not have to give a member number and to let the MAP that she is an MPB member. I sent the info for MAP via email. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-07 08:21:01', '2023-03-07 08:21:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115272023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082319002', 'Steven Smith', NULL, 'I spoke with Steven regarding his ticket that Misty Berryman submitted on his behalf. Steven had originally spoken to Rosana Bowman, who I believe misinformed Steven regarding opening a Need for this surgery. Steven stated he did open a Need with Zion, so I warm transferred Steven to Zion so that they may discuss prepayment for this surgery. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-07 08:07:28', '2023-03-07 08:07:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115272018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112455002', 'Logan Waechtler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-07 08:07:28', '2023-03-07 08:07:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115282003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'I spoke to this woman briefly this morning at the request of Michelle, Yesterday, I spoke with her husband Mike for almost an hour. They are both very abusive verbally, and argumentative. They do not believe they should be considered pre-existing. Dena has no spleen and is having to take antibiotics regularly. This was an issue before, and last time, when Cirrus told her they would not prescribe her anymore antibiotics, and told her she needed to go to a doctor, she got angry and cancelled. Now they want to re-enroll. I told them they could, but that Dena would not be covered on anything related to the spleen for the first year. She said Zion is telling her differently, and said she only wants to speak with Michelle. I explained this Michelle, and Dena called her. These people keep changing their story.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-07 07:50:20', '2023-03-07 07:50:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115281008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080304002', 'Marcell Hetenyi', NULL, 'I returned a VM from Ainsley questioning her being listed twice on the 1095.  I advised her that we did not have  her listed twice and that she would have to contact Planstin to correct in their system.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-07 07:49:29', '2023-03-07 07:49:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115281003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093918002', 'Jennifer McMullen', NULL, 'I received VM form this ember re; 1095C.  I directed her to her email from Planstin.  Advised her of the 1095 protocol.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-07 07:44:15', '2023-03-07 07:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115272013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called because her 21 year-old daughter is seeking mental health counseling services. I sent Heather the info via email and put the MAP program phone number in there for her. I did advise Heather that the MAP members services may not speak with Heather directly regarding her daughter due to her daughter''s age. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-07 07:32:32', '2023-03-07 07:32:32'),
