  ('zcrm_1579374000115272003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091330', 'Krista Rogers', NULL, 'Received an email from Krista regarding a cyst that Michael''s periodontist found and would like it to be removed. Krista wanted me to decide whether or not this would be something that is shareable, but I let Krista know that this is not something that is determined by the MPB.Health team, but rather by Zion Health. I advised Krista to open a need ASAP for this instance and to upload any supporting documents she has so that this can be considered for sharing by Zion. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-07 07:13:28', '2023-03-07 07:13:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115239065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095783002', 'Gregory Lilien', NULL, '3-6-2023:  A call from the ph # linked to this acct called.  I''m making the assumption it was Gregory.  The call was hectic because he was at the Walgreen''s window picking up Amox for his child w/strep.  It was only $12 total, so we really just talked about how to handle it in the future.  I''d have priced it for him, however, he didn''t know the strength or qty, so not practical & for the price we agreed to try it in the future.  Let him know there''s a form on our website he can fill out at his conv, preferrably 5-7 days before they need to pick it up & we''ll comp 6-8 disc sites.  IF the drug is super exp, we can approach our int shopper, but that takes longer to arrive & only works on super exp items.  I''m sure he''ll have to call in again since he was doing all of this while also talking w/the pharmacy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-06 17:10:50', '2023-03-06 17:10:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115241081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114056002', 'David Mell', NULL, '03.06.2023 David called ISO podiatrist. His welcome call is tomorrow, but he was curious on how to maneuver in finding a podiatrist, if it is preventative or medical cost sharing, and how to get reimbursed.
I sent him an email via CRM with the HCBB link attached, and we briefly perused it by looking up a specific podiatrist.
I explained the different services we offer through his Secure plan: Preventive/Planstin, Medical Cost Sharing/Zion, and Essential Services (CirrusMD...etc). I shared that what him and I are talking about today, falls under the medical cost sharing umbrella. We walked through what his process might look like, should the podiatrist consider surgery or any other high costing procedures.
I explained the difference between the three stated branches of services, how the IUA works (I consulted with Cari via teams to remind me of the maximum # of IUA''s per year), and reminded him that he will be getting an extensive walk through his plan tomorrow during his welcome call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-06 17:07:40', '2023-03-06 17:41:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115241067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092232002', 'Lon Kumpula', NULL, '03.06.2023 Has not received any material since sign up. No MPB, No Planstin, No Zion.
