  ('zcrm_1579374000115251027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115245002', 'Derek Brandt', NULL, '5TH QR LIFE CODE FOR DERK JR.: H0YMB. Due to Derke Jr. not being 18+. The required age to have one of these cards is 18 or older, per HIPPA Medical Legal guidelines. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-03-06 13:58:37', '2023-03-06 13:58:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115239049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109568001', 'Donald Whitfield', NULL, '3-6-2023:  Patty from Advanced Construction called.  Donald says he''s having trouble getting his surgery approval.  We disc who MPB.Health is, & his healthsharing component would take care of his ''med need'', we don''t see those private med records & are not a part of the approval process.
     I told her he might want to see if there are any new e-mails that could have details.  Also, gave her Zion''s ph # (& use menu #5 =''med needs'' dept).  They are generally helpful.  However, if he''s getting conflicting reports like he says he''s getting (one person says they rec''d the paperwork...  another says they are still waiting), to communicate he''s having trouble because he''s getting mixed messages and can someone please confirm the situation.
     IF he continues to have issue I told her he can call & we''ll call over with him.  Just to know that due to privacy sometimes we have to step out of the call if it becomes an issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-06 13:57:46', '2023-03-06 14:02:41'),
