  ('zcrm_1579374000115239037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595001', 'Robert Moore', NULL, '3-6-2023:  Robert called.  He wanted to make sure he still get a ''prev care'' annual appt.  We didn''t see his old doc listed in the PHCS search tool, so he''s going to call that office to see if there''s a new doc in chg that is in ntwk.
