     - Colonoscopies, this one he thought he might wait for the new RBP pricing.  He''s had polyps pulled in the past, so we talked about it could move from ''prev'' & free, to diagnostic & 1k IUA.  He seems to understand that process.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-06 13:15:16', '2023-03-06 13:50:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115239029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100830002', 'Michael Agugliaro', NULL, '3-6-2023:  Katelyn called looking for help setting up an appt &amp; finding a dermatologist.  I let her know we don''t help make the appts, derm is generally not included in her healthcare unless there is a ''medical'' issue and the expense is &gt; $2500 IUA, then sent her the derms w/in 15 miles of her zip code: 08902.  They were fair priced, but no ratings on care, so I suggested reading reveiws on Google.com, or she could see if there''s anything on healthgrades.com as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-06 13:11:43', '2023-03-06 13:12:35'),
