  ('zcrm_1579374000115241008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089441002', 'Jason Roberg', 'RSCV''d Perm to Disc MPB Plan wCindy 03.06.2023', '03.06.2023 Cindy, Jason''s spouse, called to confirm what time their welcome call was today. I contacted Jen and Cari via teams and Jen responded in 2 minutes, Vanessa will call them. So we hung up instantly, to wait for the call. 
