  ('zcrm_1579374000115239013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '3-6-2023:  Darryl is having surgery.  March 15 there is a cancellation & he could get in for that if he can get us to approve it.  I let him know that needs to go thru his MCS comp Zion.  Made sure he has their #, directly trans him, & told him to use menu #5 = ''med needs'' dept.
     - He mentioned they got a much better quote thru some negotiating company w/Zion.  It was not a name I recognized & I just hope they''ve used quality providers.  [Did not voice this concern to the member.]  
     - He''s planning to have the surgery thru the Vail Surgical Center.  I tried to look them up in HCBB & there''s no rating.  I do not know who they doc is, so could not ck that.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-06 10:38:11', '2023-03-06 11:27:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115222031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092232002', 'Lon Kumpula', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Jocelyn. Added secondary email. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code cards. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-06 10:37:40', '2023-03-06 10:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115241003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, '03.06.2023 Tessa called today to follow up on her medical need submission. I guided her to check her emails from Zion to see if they confirmed her medical need request submission. She said yes. Then I asked to see if she received another email from them, assigning her a processor. She said no. I then said, ok then I will need to transfer you to Zion and request to understand the next steps thus far.
She then asked to learn how to research for a good surgeon for cervical spine. I guided her to HCBB, and the link from the Post Welcome Call resources. TOGETHER we signed into HCBB, and did a search. I explained the different icons relations and meanings, types of search and how to read the site. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-06 10:31:47', '2023-03-06 10:31:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115239008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109279002', 'Monica Violante', NULL, '3-6-2023:  Monica called us upset we had not sent her the HIPPA form we said we were going to send.  I let her know that comes from her MCS comp Zion, made sure she has their #, &amp; trans her directly w/inst to use menu #5 = ''med needs'' dept.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-06 10:30:49', '2023-03-06 10:30:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115239003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '3-6-2023:  Tara from Mortenson Dental in UT called to find out what dental (ck''d, it''s not', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-06 10:22:53', '2023-03-06 10:22:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115222023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725092', 'Mark Garcia', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated secondary email  and address as well. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-06 10:11:02', '2023-03-06 10:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115222018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '03.06.23:  Jenni called me.  Asked who provides the 1095A form they need for HSA.   I had told her to call Patti but we both researched it further and she called me back to let me know she found out the same information I did about it. We found out the 1095A comes from the federal or state marketplace.  Since she doesn''t have a marketplace plan, she doesn''t need a 1095A.
Looked up pmts. for this membership:  Pd. $685 1/1/22 - 9/1/22.  Increased to $715 - 10/1/22.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-03-06 09:59:22', '2023-03-06 11:32:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115218019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271219', 'Jacklyn (Jackie) Gartman', NULL, 'Member called in as she did not realize that she needed to cancel us as well as Liberty.  I will refund her the Marc pmt.  She will be submitting Cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-06 09:54:37', '2023-03-06 09:54:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115222013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111982009', 'Dean Mello', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Dean and Kelly. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-06 09:33:16', '2023-03-06 09:33:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115222008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112552002', 'Robert Gilliam', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-06 09:25:31', '2023-03-06 09:25:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115218014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment update form.  I processed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-03-06 09:04:10', '2023-03-06 09:04:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115229018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502073', 'Bruce Wildman', NULL, 'Bruce called because he was nervous about using his MSEAP services. We walked through how Bruce can access speaking with an MSEAP therapist and he thanked me for being the calming voice on the end of the phone when he''s panicking about using his services. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-06 09:01:54', '2023-03-06 09:01:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115229013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088723009', 'Daniela Papi', NULL, 'Daniela called because her son fell this weekend ice skating and she needed to know what to do when she takes him to the Chiro. I advised Daniela that if the Chiro suggests that her son needs treatment, to get a detailed treatment plan from the chiro to submit to Zion. Daniela will call with any other questions. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-06 09:00:04', '2023-03-06 09:00:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115229008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109886002', 'James Evans lll', NULL, 'Thomas (advisor) called in to find out how this member is supposed to present a card for their preventative care appointment when the never received one. I went over the fact that this member does not have preventative care services and that they will strictly present as cash pay. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-06 08:48:56', '2023-03-06 08:48:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115229003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014679123', 'John McBride', NULL, 'John called about uploading additional documents for his Need request. We walked through this together on the Zionhealth.org website. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-06 08:46:05', '2023-03-06 08:46:05'),
