  ('zcrm_1579374000115204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107486002', 'Julia Mickelson', NULL, '3-4-23 Julia''s monthly fee alone would be $270 and adding the boys is $210 to equal their monthly membership fee of $480.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-04 16:43:19', '2023-03-04 16:43:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115165029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Documentation = out-of-chronological order...
3-3-2023:   Diane called before I went to lunch (& before Nahla''s doc above).  I walked her line-by-line through how to fill out the various forms she/they need to use on the MPB.Health website, then went to lunch so I''d be back before Jennifer had to leave & planning to doc when I got back.  In the meantime, while I was at lunch, Diane called & basically let Jennifer know she has no idea how to do these things (we think she may have been thinking we''d just do it for her?).  Shortly after I returned, Diane called a third time & tt Nahla.  Documentation is above.  Here are the forms I showed & went over w/her:
     - Chg of pymt
     - Her daughter needs to chg her address.  I showed Diane the doc her daughter (since she''s on her own membership) needs to complete & sign.
     - While showing her the form for her daughter''s chg of address, I showed her how this is the form she will comp to add her son (he''s 23 yrs old ).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-03 17:35:40', '2023-03-03 17:39:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115165021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, '3-3-2023:  Juan called asking about PCP for both he & his wife''s ''prev care''.  We opened the PHCS search tool together, found hundreds of fam prac docs near them in ntwk.  Then we discussed that IF they receive a new Planstin e-mail w/a new ID card (without the PHCS logo on the back), we should talk because we will need to conf the doc''s off will still work w/us.  He''s hoping to get them in within the next week or two, but I warned him that can be tough.  Disc keeping everything ''prev care'' & also brought up healthcare.gov together.  There may be a slight lang barrier, but I went slow when he struggled & I think he understood.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-03 17:18:14', '2023-03-03 17:20:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115165013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106616001', 'Janet Banks', NULL, '3-3-2023:  Janet called re: Participating Pharmacies for immunization(s) - shingles.  We looked at the participating pharmacies & she liked this one:  
     RITE AID PHARMACY 05634 0
     1201 South Coast Highway
     Oceanside , CA 92054
     San Diego County     0.6 mi.
          Phone: 760-433-4013
               In-network
               NPI: 1487763843
               License: PHY43951

I walked thru presenting her Planstin card as her insurance & that the pharmacy can call if they need further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-03 15:41:45', '2023-03-03 16:19:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115165008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, '3-3-2023:  Steven', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-03 15:26:42', '2023-03-03 15:26:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115191008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, '03.03.2023 Diane called to remember how to access the change form on the Member Portal page, in order to add her son. She thought he would have insurance, but it turns out, he wont. Therefore, wants to add him.
I guided her again to the list of change forms from the Member Portal &amp; Update page. Once she saw the form, she shared she''s confident to take it from here. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-03 15:20:37', '2023-03-03 15:20:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115173003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756008', 'Paul Sippil', NULL, 'Assigned a new QR Life Code and sent out the new card with a New MPB.Health Card Letter in the mail to Paul. Per Nahla''s request that Paul called needing a new one. All set and to be picked up and mailed out tomorrow Saturday 3/4/23 to arrive between 3-5 days. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-03-03 14:05:41', '2023-03-03 14:05:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115165003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '3-3-2023:  Alexa called.  She''s at the derm off for skin care &amp; wondered what her cov is.  We went over generally derm not cov, but if it''s a health item &amp; &gt; their 1k IUA, she could try submitting to see if it can be shared.  Also, mentioned they may have an HSA setup &amp; they could ck the HSA guidelines to see if those funds could be used.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-03 13:59:17', '2023-03-03 13:59:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115131023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, 'Left detailed vm and sent a new scheduling link JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-03 13:33:33', '2023-03-03 13:33:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115128013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115142002', 'Howard Thomas', NULL, 'Howard sent me an email indicating he was ready to enroll. I called him  and walked him through the enrollment, Secure plan, mem only, $2,500 IUA', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-03 13:25:52', '2023-03-03 13:25:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115131018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756008', 'Paul Sippil', NULL, '03.03.2023 Paul Wore out his keychain with the QR Code, and was wanting to attain another one. I learned via teams from Jen that we no longer supply the keychains, and I''m not sure why. I shared that with Paul, however, I can request a new MPB. Health card with that on there. He was glad to do that, but DOES want to know why no more keychains.
I messaged Kelly with the above. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-03 13:14:11', '2023-03-03 13:14:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115131013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112455002', 'Logan Waechtler', NULL, 'LVM and sent a new scheduler JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-03 13:12:14', '2023-03-03 13:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115132003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110261002', 'Lance Casey', NULL, '3-3-2023:  Lance called.  He is looking for a PCP.  We discussed the diff between PCP &amp; a DPC (which his Direct Plan is designed to link with).  He decided he''d like to look at a DPC.  I found 4 true DPCs &amp; 1 hybrid in his area.  He took the name, ph #, website, &amp; some prices were listed.  I let him know what to look for &amp; that the ''membership fee'' for the DPC is separate, but he said this was a great starting point.  If he has questions, he''ll call us back.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-03 12:50:37', '2023-03-03 12:50:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115131008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '03.03.2023 Nathan emailed in response to my email of the 2 links yesterday: PHCS Search &amp; Healthcare.gov. He asked how else to search for participating pharmacies, cause the PHCS link is not offering any? He was confirming that I shared both him and his wife, given their age, CAN get the HPV vaccine.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-03 12:39:55', '2023-03-03 12:39:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115128008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Diane called me back. I went over the plan with her, discussed IUA, monthly contribution, etc. She''s clear now. She will contact Jennifer in concierge with updated info for new payment info and the address change for daughter Britney, for new card.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-03 12:36:26', '2023-03-03 12:36:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115131003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107281002', 'Devorrah Moss', NULL, '03.03.2023 Devorrah called to learn what pharmacy to have her doctor send her prescription, and how to present herself at a diagnostic appointment (colonoscopy).
I explained the pharmacy discount program with us, and what the process is. She was receptive, and I emailed her or rx request form/link via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-03 12:36:21', '2023-03-03 12:36:21');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000115128003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'I spoke to Diane, she sounds confused about her plan and who''s supposed to be on it. I went in to admin and found several accounts. I narrowed it down to hers, and I went over it with Jennifer who took her call before it was transferred to me. She wants to change her payment info, and find out who''s on her plan, and who''s not, IE: kids. I tried reaching her back after researching this more, I got her voicemail and left her a message for call back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-03 12:14:10', '2023-03-03 12:14:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115113003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114145002', 'Mary Soborowicz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-03 10:40:34', '2023-03-03 10:40:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115108003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105117002', 'David Nowag', NULL, '3-3-2023:  David called.  His empl is req he prove he has an "HSA plan".  I told him I think showing his Planstin ''prev care'' ID card (which shows the high ded) might work.  He''s going to look for that card &amp; call Planstin for a pdf version if he can''t find it.  If that doesn''t suffice he may call back to brainstorm.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-03 10:19:51', '2023-03-03 10:19:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115069023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113970002', 'Tracy Murphy', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Also member is on calendar for 4:30pm EST today. Jennifer will try to reach out to her as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-03 10:04:38', '2023-03-03 10:04:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Diane called in to request cards for her family membership. Upon looking into the accounts, it appears that her husband Todd was the original primary member but when he aged into Medicare, the other family members were supposed to start their own plans. Brittany and Diane do have their own plans, but Curtis never submitted his application. I advised Diane that she will need to speak with her advisor, but I did not think Ron was still an active advisor so I transferred her to Jeffrey for this. I did advise Jeffrey that I hadn''t realized Ron was still active with MPB. Diane also requested a new MPB card be sent her daughter Brittany, but we verified that her address is incorrect. As soon as Brittany''s address is corrected in our system I will order her card as well. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-03 09:32:09', '2023-03-03 09:32:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115069018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113788002', 'David Joyce', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-03 09:29:39', '2023-03-03 09:29:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115069013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114129002', 'Stephanie McCarter', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-03 09:03:29', '2023-03-03 09:03:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115069008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113950002', 'Jan Gibson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-03 08:05:15', '2023-03-03 08:05:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000115069003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114059001', 'Sanjai Dayal', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-03-03 07:46:14', '2023-03-03 07:46:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114973166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', 'NOTE:  Wife Jill Bryant has own membership.', '2-27-2023  They know they need to complete the ''Perm to Disc'' forms, but haven''t yet done so.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-02 18:47:35', '2023-03-02 18:47:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114973161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', 'NOTE:  Husb John Spalvins has own membership.', '2-27-2023  They know they need to complete the ''Perm to Disc'' forms, but haven''t yet done so.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-02 18:46:23', '2023-03-02 18:46:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114973147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '3-2-2023:  Nathan called to inquire about the mental health.  Took him to the Mazz &amp; Sull site &amp; showed him the diff features, etc.  Went over basics of how the counseling works, pattern, sm ntwk, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-02 17:24:55', '2023-03-02 17:24:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114977044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '03.02.2023 Nathan called to learn if HPV is covered under ACA. Cari via teams confirmed it is, via healthcare.gov. Nathan also asked about the site to search in network providers, and I shared the multiplan site with the healthcare.gov site via email from CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-02 16:53:46', '2023-03-02 16:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114973142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104971002', 'Judith Rudin', NULL, '3-1-2023:  Judith called.  She had an ultrasound, MRI, & now they want to do a DNC.  Currently, she''s pd ~1k & is going to get together her pymt receipts & detailed inv.  Knows we have a deadline to beat, so will call in the next wk-1/2 to work on submitting together.  [In tt Judith, she doesn''t think this will be pre-x, but from what she''s saying we went over both scenarios:  pre-x = 1 yr waiting period, all out-of-pocket until 2nd yr & then will have 25k available for sharing 11/1/2023.  Not = 1k IUA, & they will look at approving for sharing.]  They think the DNC will be in April, so hopefully we can get approval prior to then so they can help share the exp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-02 16:37:33', '2023-03-02 16:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114977039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113215002', 'Morgan Vaive', NULL, '03.02.2023 Morgan called to attain her MPB Member Portal Log in information.. After I confirmed her account, I had her log in while I was on the phone and she wrote her passcode down. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-02 14:37:40', '2023-03-02 14:37:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114973134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '3/2/2023:  Josh & I talked about his ''prev care'' options.  He''s usually super easy going, yet was a bit short today (Jennifer said he was from the second she answered until she trans him to me).  His doc retired, so he''s looking for someone new to see in April.  We found the doc he''s interested in on the PHCS search stie:  	Habib, Taimur, M.D.	Int Med, Geriatric Med.
     - I wanted to let Josh know we are in trans to the RBP, so to watch for the Planstin e-mail w/the new card & call me right away if he hasn''t had his appt yet so we can go over the new process.
     - Josh & Ashley have not had a ''Welcome Call'' since they changed from their old plan.   When I mentioned it would be helpful he was completely unwilling.  They are new parents, so maybe they are feeling overwhelmed.  He asked if I could just send him the post ''Welcome Call'' info.  I let him know I couldn''t do that & did the PHCS Search, HCBB Search for him instead.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-02 14:22:23', '2023-03-02 18:21:09'),
