  ('zcrm_1579374000115007008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093929002', 'Aaron Clemons', NULL, '3-1-2023:  Aaron called.  He had questions on the eight drugs they are prescribing for his daughter who is still in the hosp.  One is a compounded item & I let him know, we don''t have a good source for that anyway.  Dorothy is still in the hospital.  Aaron is going to try to have the drugs administered/dispensed as part of her visit & include it in the hosp bill.  I let him know I didn''t know if they can do that, but that seems like a good plan.
     - Took him to the Concierge RX Quote req form & went over how to fill it out.  Let him know that w/8 drugs, it will take us a bit, but we''ll do it as fast as possible.  Plus, w/Leukemia drugs, we may need to approach our intl shopper if they are super expensive, which can take about 4 weeks for delivery.
     For everything they must be going thru, he really seems to have a handle on how to handle this w/their healthsharing and us for RXs not administered in the hosp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-03-01 13:24:03', '2023-03-01 16:59:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114998008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089149002', 'Daniel Connelly', NULL, '03.01.2023 Cynthia called to learn best how to maneuver her plan, specifically the difference between her preventative and medical cost sharing. After briefly going over the elements of preventative with Planstin, including lab tests to be covered, I consulted with Cari and she shared the one item we are currently seeing covered is the basic LIPID panel. If a member would like other types of labs done, we can visit our discounted website, like Jason''s Health, and generate a form of pre-paid service.
I recommended that Cynthia schedule another welcome call to learn anything new going on with her plan and the services we offer, so I sent her the scheduling link via CRM. 
Cari came onto our call to delve into more details around that, and to demonstrate/guide Cynthia on how to utilize the website herself. She proceeded to explain about medical cost sharing for Cynthia''s daughter, Gabriella, who is a college student away from home with her traditional insurance. Due to Gabriella having trad ''ins'' through her school, the MCS will be considered a secondary healthcare should the ''med need'' arise. Regarding the diagnosed, scoliosis. Cari went over how a medical need would be fitting for such INCIDENT, how the IUA would apply, and the fact that they still have ample time to open a medical need.
 Cynthia was confused since she previously had Liberty.  & did not understand the diff between their AUA and Zion''s IUA = why Cari went over the diff.  Then Cari went into deep education on how the Zion IUAs work. Due to Cari''s deep insight as an advisor, she offered Cynthia that insight regarding reaching her $2500 present IUA vs. a $1000 IUA. Cynthia requested more details sent her way via email regarding that subject, Cari referred her to their advisor for more action and information on it. 
Overall, Cynthia seemed appeased with all the details Cari had shared and will not need to schedule another welcome call for more education. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-01 13:23:08', '2023-03-01 15:24:33'),
