  ('zcrm_1579374000114997016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '3-1-23 Ryan really likes the HMA concept for dental and vision as well as medical. I''ll email him the overview and levels to choose from. He likes the $140 level possibly. He just turned 40 last year and wants to do a wellness visit. I coached him how to do it and currently remain in the PHCS network. He knows that limitation might be removed any day now. But, he''ll find a Dr. and call the MPB Concierge Team for assistance with the network and make sure the dr. will accept it. He will also ask MPB Concierge Team about WHLC for discounts on alternative care. He tried calling them once and never got a call back. He''ll try again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-03-01 13:03:47', '2023-03-01 13:03:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114977013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, 'Lori called about a bill she received from Planstin so I warm transferred her over for explanation. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-03-01 12:47:30', '2023-03-01 12:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114968053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179009', 'Torey Gonzales', NULL, 'Torey returned my call, she wanted to cancel based on monthly cost. I suggested changing her IUA and gave her pricing, she was ok with the price at the $2,500 IUA. Sent plan change form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-03-01 12:14:28', '2023-03-01 12:14:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114998003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '03.01.2023 Michelle wants to get a physical done within the next two weeks. She called to confirm how to attain a family practice office that is in the PHCS network, and she happened to be dabbling with the MultiPlan site when she called. 
She was able to generate a list of practices under the PHCS network, and asked if they charge her for Initial Patient Visit, how would she bill that. I had remembered a member that had JUST gone through the same billing discomfort and Cari was helping her through. I consulted with Cari via teams.
Cari shared we can''t do much re: this dilemma.  That in the past even the doctor didn''t seem to have much ability to ensure the ''prev care'' medical coding.  It will all depend on the office & their billing.
Both Michelle and I realized that even if they do succeed and code both appointments as Preventative, now the patient has TWO preventative physicals, when a member only receives one. 
Cari offered to be on the call, since many questions were surfacing with Michelle, and she clarified this initial patient visit fee has only happened once that we know of, and described the difference between Preventative with Planstin VS. Medical Cost Sharing with Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-03-01 11:58:01', '2023-03-01 17:48:23'),
