  ('zcrm_1579374000114930016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070248114', 'John Spalvins', NULL, '2-27-2023:  Jill (John''s wife) called.  She had questions about his plan, but they haven''t filled out the ''Prem to Discuss'' forms for each other.  So, I let her know I could talk about her plan & that might help her understand (I didn''t tell her they have the same plan, but they do) and give her guidance until we can discuss his details.  She was very nice about it & will get hat done.
     - They have been staying a few mos a yr in Costa Rica & her friend had a scare, so we discussed emerg med care w/Zion.  She was thrilled to hear they may have help in an emerg situation while they are away.
     - Disc ''Medical Tourism'' may be pre-approved in the right situation.
     - Trained her on HCBB so they can find docs for her husb echocardiogram and see prices.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-28 22:41:23', '2023-02-28 22:41:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114930011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005591031', 'Bryan Holland', NULL, '2-27-2023:  Bryan called looking for info on his ''prev care''.  He''s thinking he''ll wait since the RBP seems to be close.  He''ll call us in a mo or two if he hasn''t rec''d his new Planstin pdf card w/out the PHCS logo.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-28 22:40:26', '2023-02-28 22:40:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114930003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, '2-28-2023:  Lisa called to find out how we handle RX Quotes.  She only needed one, so took the info over the phone this time, then showed her the form & let her know a 5-7 day pre-pickup request works best.  She likes Giant Pharmacy at 6050 Daybreak Cir.  RXGo had the best price, but no Giant logo.  She seemed open to trying it & asking them to call the 1-800# to see if they could become contracted, so I sent two coupons (one for backup if the RXGo doesn''t work).  My e-mail also gave instructions on RXGo & their becoming contracted w/Giant.
     - Sertraline HCL (= gen Zoloft)  100mg, #135 tabs (1-1/2 tabs daily = 90ds):
               $16.26 on RXGo [no logo, so assume not contracted.  Went over w/Lisa & she''s going to see what happens & also see if RXGo can get a contract since it''s her favorite pharmacy]
               $18.02 on GoodRX - sent this coupon in case RXGo doesn''t work.  Does show logo.  Price not drastically higher this time anyway.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-28 18:10:54', '2023-02-28 18:10:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114891050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113668002', 'Steven Valdez', NULL, '02.28.2023 Kris called to understand how to present herself for her 3 days old son''s tongue surgery.
I guided her to present herself as a cash-pay patient and ask for the cash-pay discount. The present procedure cash-pay discount is not more than $300, so she will not open a medical need for that. However, if there are complications during or after the procedure on 3/7/2023, she then will open a medical need and stay compliant in the 6 month deadline. 
Kris has not had her welcome call yet, so I sent her the link to schedule one, so she can further learn about her plan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-28 17:05:21', '2023-02-28 17:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114891042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106029002', 'Alexandria Mullen', NULL, '02.28.2023 Alexandria called to confirm her plan with us, Secure, is eligible for high deductible. I confirmed that it is. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-28 16:47:14', '2023-02-28 16:47:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114891037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', 'SENT - Perm to Disc MPB Plan wDante Chupek 2/28/2023', '02.28.2023 Cameron called to give her spouse, Dante, permission to speak to her plan and ask questions. I forwarded her the link to the form via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-28 16:44:42', '2023-02-28 16:48:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114891032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059755459', 'Andrew Goldman', NULL, '02.28.2023 Andrew called to confirm we received his change form request for his banking information. I did not see the form in the cognito forms, so I sent him the link for the form, via CRM, from the MPB website member portals &amp; updates page. I told him they will get it instantly, and complete it first thing tomorrow morning due to time zones. Andrew was receptive and moving forward towards completing the form I sent him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-28 16:26:13', '2023-02-28 16:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114891027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111978002', 'Robin Athey', NULL, '02.28.2023 Robin called to confirm that the centura healthgroup radiology is in the PHCS network. I was able to find them in the PHCS system via zip code 80501. I did guide Robin to confirm if they are in the PHCS network when she called to make an appointment NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-28 16:12:19', '2023-02-28 18:02:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114891013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078939464', 'Krista Irmischer', NULL, '02.28.2023 Krista called to get clarification on the 1095C form she seemed to have received.
Her Concerns & QUESTIONS:
$60 / month can be claimed in taxes
how does it apply to Krista?
she does not work with MPB
the form sent to her says Employer=MPB, 1095C
it''s reading on line 15 required contribution. She pays the whole thing. It''s not listed there. 

I consulted with Cari, and she guided me to guide Krista to speak to an accountant to explain the form better. Krista was extra concerned regarding the naming of HER EMPLOYER, as MPB, while she is her own employer by having her own business. 
Krista wanted to know who fills these forms out and sends them, and from I''ve been learning, I told her Planstin, her preventative portion company of the plan with MEC. She said she spoke with them and they told her to contact us, MPB. I eventually transferred her to Planstin to discuss the form thoroughly. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-28 15:35:10', '2023-02-28 16:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114922013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/23 at the last minute I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-28 14:58:43', '2023-02-28 14:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114878008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010220053', 'Matthew Freije', NULL, '2-28-23 Matt just cancelled his MEC since he won''t use it. He really just wants to seek out naturopathic doctors and methods. He doesn''t want to be prescribed drugs. He doesn''t have any issues but his mom his bugging him to get screened. I explained how to access labs on his own with the help of MPB Concierge Team. Also, if he wants to seek alternative care for anything other than a screening, he will need pre-approval for that and to call Concierge Team for help with that as well. I also told him WA state has banned these memberships but he''s grandfathered. He might not be allowed to remain a member in 2024. He''s not pleased about that. He doesn''t seem to want traditional insurance or care. I let him know if he has a 2nd home somewhere that would be sufficient. He understands all of it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-28 14:53:56', '2023-02-28 14:53:56'),
