  ('zcrm_1579374000114891008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109093012', 'Yuwen Cen', NULL, '02.28.2023 Yuwen called to follow up on receiving her MPB card, because she''s trying to set up her QR Code in the system. She has received the soft version of Planstin and Zion. Has not had her welcome call yet, but will schedule it.
