  ('zcrm_1579374000114878003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, '2-28-23 Sherry''s husband went onto C4 and thinks she qualifies for APTC and her plan would only be $128 with Kaiser. But, we''re outside of open enrollment and I''m not sure if the tax time enrollment is relevant yet. Plus enrolling today would auto default to an April 1st start date, especially without a SEP. I will talk with her husband later today to make sure it''s all going to work how they think it is. I need to make sure he put in their household income, not just her income as well.  She seems to think it''s because she just turned 62 which is a bit of a moot point.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-28 11:15:17', '2023-02-28 11:15:17'),
