  ('zcrm_1579374000114844008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, '2-28-23 Sherry left me a vm wanting to cancel bc they found something else that will save them significant $. I can''t imagine what could be cheaper than $265/$1000 for a 62 year old unless she''s getting a subsidy. I left her a vm just now letting her know she must call me today and I''ll show her how to cancel and she has to sign off on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-28 10:14:45', '2023-02-28 10:14:45'),
