  ('zcrm_1579374000114753038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'Sherry called to cancel so I transferred her directly to her advisory, Wendy. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-28 09:13:22', '2023-02-28 09:13:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114753033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081381002', 'Bren Frisch', NULL, 'Bren called in because she has a prev. colonoscopy coming up Friday and she thought she had to pay out of pocket and then get reimbursed by Planstin. I explained to Bren that she needed to call the facility, verify that the doc/facility/etc. are in-network and then provide her Planstin card info for billing. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-28 09:08:48', '2023-02-28 09:08:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114753028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092228002', 'David Bradley', NULL, 'David called because his wife is having some pain around her gall bladder and was wanting to know the procedure for Urgent Care. We went through the cash-pay process and I advised David to take this one step at a time. If the Urgent Care decides that his wife needs to go to the ER, I explained that he should present as cash-pay again. I also advised David to give us a call once they are settled and know what happening so that we can assist them with the next steps. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-28 09:06:34', '2023-02-28 09:06:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114753023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074898032', 'Thanomsack Souksavong', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/1 citing employer coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-28 08:59:57', '2023-02-28 08:59:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114798008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119797010', 'Ron Porter', NULL, 'Spoke to Ron, Nice guy. He is retired and is looking to get away from traditional insurance, primarily based on cost. He, his wife, and 20 year old daughter are all in good health. However, Ron has a knee issue, which I told him would likely be considered a pre-existing, he understands. Discussed Direct and Care Plus. Direct my be a better fit. Wife out of town, coming back this weekend. He will discuss with her, but likes what the plan offers.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-28 08:35:40', '2023-02-28 08:35:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114753018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118300', 'Rick Papaleo', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/1.  I will notify RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-28 07:53:59', '2023-02-28 07:53:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114753013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096121002', 'Sarah Fuquay', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation  eff 3/23 due to the fact that they now have employer coverage thru spouse.  I will process &amp; refund 3/23.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-28 07:47:41', '2023-02-28 07:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114798003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097302002', 'Amy Cummans', NULL, 'Spoke to Amy this morning, she''s getting major medical coverage, and no longer wants to stay on the Care Plus plan. She wants a refund and cancellation for March 1, 2023. I spoke to John Kach, and he authorized the refund.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-28 07:31:52', '2023-02-28 07:31:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114738031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107281002', 'Devorrah Moss', NULL, '02.27.2023 Devorrah called to confirm that colonoscopies are covered under preventative. I explained the difference between Preventative, her Planstin, and medical cost sharing, through Zion.
She proceeded to be confused still, by asking "...so when present myself as a cash-pay patient, it''s significantly less expensive by $250...." I reiterated the phrasing belongs to medical cost sharing, which is how one would present themselves as as a screening turns diagnostic.
Devorrah said she will call the colon. facility and make sure they code it preventative. She said she will call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-27 17:16:41', '2023-02-27 17:17:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114741014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '2-27-2023:  Jill called.  She had questions about her husb''s plan, but they haven''t filled out the ''Prem to Discuss'' forms for each other.  So, I let her know I could talk about her plan & that might help her understand (I didn''t tell her they have the same plan, but they do) and give her guidance until we can discuss his details.  She was very nice about it & will get hat done.
     - They have been staying a few mos a yr in Costa Rica & her friend had a scare, so we discussed emerg med care w/Zion.  She was thrilled to hear they may have help in an emerg situation while they are away.
     - Disc ''Medical Tourism'' may be pre-approved in the right situation.
     - Trained her on HCBB so they can find docs for her husb echocardiogram and see prices.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-27 17:08:06', '2023-02-28 18:58:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114738017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106535002', 'Richard Lancaster', NULL, '02.27.2023 Richard called via concierge line to attain coupons for two RX requests for zip code, 44130, at a Meijer''s Pharmacy. I took the time to write it all down: 
1-Solifenacin .10mg, 30 tablets, 1/day, Generic
2-Latanoprost .005%, 7.5 qty, 1/day, Generic
I had a question and I consulted with Cari, and I am glad I did, because it turns out that it was already processed by Jen earlier, except the notes indicate different medication for one of them. I''m waiting for clarification to proceed on this request, since Richard called twice for the requests. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-27 15:28:57', '2023-02-27 15:45:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114784003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114761044', 'Georgi Abelenda', NULL, '2-27-23 Georgi is 50, lives in HA, is self-employed and W2 as graduate student. She is healthy, no meds, no tobacco. Yes, does wellness visits and had an HSA that she used recently. She had an ER visit in April 2022 for her appendix to be removed and it revealed that her gall bladder isn''t working well. Surgeons wanted to remove it but her dr. recommended against removal. Instead they recommended treating it with diet and lifestyle. She''s been doing just that and hasn''t had any problems since.  She happy to fund her HSA again as much as she can. She''s only paying $350 with ACA bc she gets a subsidy. So, she will stay healthy for one more year and keep this in mind for May of 2024 once she''s past the pre-x clause concern. She has a low ded of $1000-$2000 right now as well. Best choice to wait to enroll in a year or so. She was super nice and appreciative. Came to me via David Peck.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-27 15:24:37', '2023-02-27 15:24:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114738012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479018', 'Steven Wagar', NULL, '02.27.2023 Steven was inquisitive about the pricing information provided to him by the urology facility he has used before. He states they were bought out, and now their pricing are no longer the same and they keep changing (possible based on how long the doctor spends with the patient). He requested that I walk him through some fair pricing research, so I guided him to find the post welcome call email that Vanessa sent him, and click on the HCBB link.
Together we accessed the site and searched for urology in his the preferred zip code. 
His biggest concerns, especially after learning more on HCBB are: the pricing presently stated on there in different times, and the lack of the facilities he''s aware that exist that are not on the site.
I told him I would check with my trainers to learn more about this uneven delivery of resources, and if I learn something other that what him and I discussed, I''ll reach back out to him.
He''s going to call the facility he went to and discuss how and why the pricing keeps changing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-27 14:48:02', '2023-02-27 14:48:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114733008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105103002', 'Brian Young', NULL, 'Processed cancellation re:below', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-27 14:29:58', '2023-02-27 14:29:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114753008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097302002', 'Amy Cummans', NULL, 'Amy called to cancel because she is having some major medical issues. She decided to go with traditional insurance. I sent her Jeffrey''s way since Guy is no longer with us. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-27 14:26:20', '2023-02-27 14:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114753003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106535002', 'Richard Lancaster', NULL, 'Richard called in for pricing on Timolol .5 ml and Latanoprost .5 mg - I sent him coupons for both at Meijer pharmacy. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-27 14:02:34', '2023-02-27 14:02:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114741003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '2-27-2023:  Jim called.  He has an appt for a colonoscopy in April.  The doctor he sched w/was on the list, but now they just said they are no longer in ntwk.  Tried to let him know may/may not be an issue due to the trans to RBP.  He''ll watch for the new Planstin e-mail w/the new pdf card without a PHCS logo &amp; will call so we can go over how to present.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-27 13:39:15', '2023-03-03 17:54:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114733003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371001', 'Evan Bellini', NULL, 'Received cancellation from this member.  Per John''s direction I will refund  all monies back.  Cancel as if never started.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-27 13:30:55', '2023-02-27 13:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114724021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032445', 'David Hammer', NULL, '02.27.2023 David called inquiring about coverage for his colonoscopy on 3/7.
Given David''s plan, I directed him to open a medical need, regarding a preventative visit, through Zion.
I sent him the template email, asked him to flag the email for future reference, we filled it out together, I coached him to revisit the link to upload his invoices/receipts. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-27 13:28:48', '2023-02-27 13:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114724016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605292', 'Annika Gagne', NULL, '02.27.2023 Annika called to request a PHCS list for Gynos in her area. While she was on the phone with me, I generated and sent her the list.
Annika was also inquiring about the RCI card she recently requested from them, I asked her to make sure to give them around 10 days to have it delivered. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-27 13:27:33', '2023-02-27 13:37:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114671095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104776002', 'Nichole Patrick', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing the fact that her bills have not been paid.  Only on plan 4 mos.  I will refund March share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-27 13:15:33', '2023-02-27 13:15:33'),
