  ('zcrm_1579374000114709011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '2-27-2023:  Cameron''s husb called to ask about the pregnancy.  I don''t see a signed "Perm to Discuss the MPB Health Plan", so I answered the questions in general, not Cameron specific.  I DID NOT send the form for Cameron to sign because all e-mails are going to her husb.  Instead, I asked him to gather Cameron on a call & we''d show her how to find the form so she can sign (didn''t want him just doing it for her).
