  ('zcrm_1579374000114671006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679122', 'Marty Kirby', NULL, 'I received email from these members asking why their price went up so much.  I looked into this and member was enrolled in the Redirect and should have been enrolled in the Direct plan.  Difference in price $240.  I refunded 2 pmt to member.  left VM for her explaining.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-27 08:59:26', '2023-02-27 08:59:26'),
