     Also, the 2 above options, it''s best to call them for this info during the norm bus hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-24 16:54:26', '2023-02-24 16:54:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114605040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, '2-24-2023:  Amy called.  She thought they had commercial drug ins because Citizen RX is listed on the back of their RCI card.  I explained that the ACA MEC plan has a few items it covers & those are the only items - this isn''t comm drug ins.  She was bummed.  Her husb wants to take some drug (which she didn''t want to divulge) and the mfg offers a drug card if you have comm ins.  Let her know RCI could confirm for her, but I didn''t think that''s what her''s is.  Let her know we search 6-8 disc sites & have our int shopper.   She doesn''t sound interested ("I already do that") but now she knows how if she desires.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-24 16:25:55', '2023-02-24 16:32:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114605032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107684002', 'John Newton', NULL, 'This note is out of order.  I didn''t get it saved before Wendy''s above.  
