  ('zcrm_1579374000114610047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659288', 'John Kovach', NULL, '02.24.2023 John called with a question about Zion: has to get surgery on hands, went to doctor, presented with Planstin card. But realizes this is medical cost sharing, so he called us to for help to open a medical need.
