  ('zcrm_1579374000114592036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107684002', 'John Newton', NULL, '2-24-23 Gabriel, son of John, called to get a copy of the Sharing Guidelines. I sent him the SECURE overview email. I let him know anything pre-x will not be shared. He assured me his issue is new. He understands he has to pay the first $1000. He just wants his knee checked out. He knows to pay cash and call upon the MPB Concierge Team for assistance with x-rays, MRI''s, highest quality care at a fair price, etc. He also asked about mental health counseling. He didn''t realize that''s included as well and he''s pleased and will call MPB Concierge Team to access that benefit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-24 14:47:06', '2023-02-24 14:47:06'),
