  ('zcrm_1579374000114605024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093929002', 'Aaron Clemons', NULL, '2-24-2023:  Aaron called.  His daughter Dorothy has just been diagnosed w/leukemia.  They have the Direct plan (which I didn''t catch orig).  He''s not using DPC, but concierge doctor & it was throwing me.  Dorothy''s been admitted to the Children''s Hosp for more testing.  I sent him the temp & walked him through how to sub the need.  How to present as ''cash-pay'', ask for disc, he''s resp for up to $2500 IUA, but we are starting the ''med need'' right now to get the process going.  They''ve admitted her to the hospital, so they''ll easily go over the IUA.  Also let him know how the IUA works & it closes w/12mos or more w/no activity (treatments, etc.)
