  ('zcrm_1579374000114608021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110975002', 'Cathy Tiffany', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-24 11:25:22', '2023-02-24 11:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114592016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115651002', 'Scott Groza', NULL, 'Spoke to Scott, he called in on the sales line. He''s currently with CHM, not happy. Long conversation, he had a lot of questions. Discussed Secure plan. Is going to talk with his wife, but loved the customer service I gave him, and will most likely enroll. In addition, his wife is involved in home schooling and is a social media influencer. she has 262k followers and an email list of 11k people. We are going to coordinate a meeting to potentially bring his wife Christy on as an influencer. -JB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-24 11:19:07', '2023-02-24 11:19:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114605014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097302002', 'Amy Cummans', NULL, '2-24-2023:  Amy''s at the doc''s office to get refills on her RXs.  She wondered what she should show them.  I let her know she has a catastrophic plan.  So present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a discount, &amp; if something comes up, she has a 6mos deadline to sub a ''med need'' (where she''s resp for the first 1k IUA).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-24 11:17:21', '2023-02-24 11:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114608016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111230001', 'Larisa Falcon', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-24 11:15:15', '2023-02-24 11:15:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114602008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118299002', 'Alex Platz', NULL, 'Spoke to Alex, nice guy, looking for a plan with HSA compatibility, has done health share in the past. Discussed Secure plan.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-24 11:13:49', '2023-02-24 11:13:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114608011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111539002', 'Travis Jansen', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-24 10:48:07', '2023-02-24 10:48:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114610003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068229', 'Sharon Heiney', NULL, '02.24.2023 Sharon called to confirm she has a plan that can carry an HSA. I am still getting familiar with the older plans, so I consulted with Cari via teams.
Cari shared and I relayed: as long as there''s an ACA/MEC part of the plan and on stated on the card, that is all she needs to present to the financial institution of her choice, and to just make sure to compare fees.
Sharon also requested an email to confirm that from us, I was not sure in my voice on that topic and paper trail would have any weight on it, so I asked Cari and she said that Sharon only needs to show her card that states the above.
Sharon wanted to learn more about the details of her plan, I referred her to her advisor Kevin Michaels. Sharon said she will reach out to him
Cari asked me if she''s had her welcome call, I saw that she has back in 2018, we recommended that she have another one to refresh her knowledge and learn more about her services on hand. I sent her the welcome call link scheduler via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-24 10:37:13', '2023-02-24 11:50:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114608003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104790012', 'Jessica Perez', NULL, 'Attempt 6. No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-24 10:33:08', '2023-02-24 10:33:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114605003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041599023', 'Amber Neumann', NULL, '2-24-2023:  Amber called.  In Dec she rec''d info from Sedera re pricing &amp; now the bill is ~$100 more than they said.  I asked if she''d rec''d the e-mails from us with accurate pricing &amp; she says she didn''t think so.  Trans her to Patti hoping she can help her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-24 10:19:42', '2023-02-24 10:33:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114592011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494026', 'Erica Overman', NULL, 'Erica called into me while I am covering the Concierge line this morning, which Erica needed help with a few things. One being how to start a Need with Zion. I sent her the how to submit bills and start a need with Zion email, along with telling her over the phone how the process works and what she needs to do until she reaches her IUA of the $1000, etc. I explained everything Erica needed to know and asked for help about ending with her question''s answered and all info sent her way that should possibly have needed when she called. Erica is all set now :)- KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-24 10:11:43', '2023-02-24 10:11:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114592006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109501001', 'Sophia Guzman', NULL, 'Sophia called in and said she needed help making and finding a specific provider for her to make an appointment. She said she needs either a Phycologist or anyone in those types of counseling fields to fill out and have a form signed she needs to give her Apartment complex for her Emotional Support Animal she has. Her current/previous form is expired and needs to get a new updated form. I confirmed with Patti here at the office before I explained to Sophia what to do. Sophia needs to contact MSEAP with having the MAP Program included in her Plan she has with us here. I explained who MSEAP is and what everything is that she can do with them. Secondly and lastly, Sophia asked about a super bill she just got for her first Need she said she is getting up to reaching her IUA of $1000 and asked what she does now with this new super bill. I told Sophia how a Need works, everything she needs to do correctly for Zion, and let her know when she can to simply just call Zion Health. Zion will walk her through everything with her and Zion will be the ones that Sophia will directly reach out to from here on out about her Need as they are the ones that deal directly with members and their Need''s. I let Sophia know I was sending her 2 different emails, first being how to access and start using the MAP Program, and lastly the How to Submit Bills to Zion Health to Start a Need. Gave all phone numbers she would need for Zion & MAP. Sophia is all set for now. She said I was a HUGE help and I let her know if she can''t or doesn''t have time for a phone call in the future, there is a Chat system on our website I personally am the one that monitors it every day all day during operating hours of the business here in office Mon-Fri from 9am-5pm EST. Sophia is all set and ready to go. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-24 10:05:33', '2023-02-24 10:05:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114524016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113409020', 'William May', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Katy. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-24 09:33:00', '2023-02-24 09:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114530036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114514002', 'Kevin Bayerlein', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-24 09:23:30', '2023-02-24 09:23:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114530031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114512002', 'Brenda Banwell', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-24 09:21:02', '2023-02-24 09:21:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114524011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108629002', 'Alexander Richardson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Kelly. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-24 09:10:54', '2023-02-24 09:10:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114530026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-24 09:10:32', '2023-02-24 09:10:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114530021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, 'Member requested a 3/1/23 start date', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-24 09:10:16', '2023-02-24 09:10:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114530016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114430002', 'Asif Khan', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-24 08:47:42', '2023-02-24 08:47:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114544008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109797002', 'Kim Vailati', NULL, '02.21.23:  Kim called to ask about the status of her refund check. I was at the office w/Bern so we both spoke to her.  I asked if she submitted her cancellation form. She said she did, so I told her I would check w/Karina for the refund. Karina said she sent it overnight the previous evening. I relayed this to Kim and mentioned she would be getting a full refund.  She was so appreciative we would do this and told me how impressed she was with our honesty, transparency and the manner in which we handled her issues. She said she will definitely enroll in one of our plans when she stops using the subsidized insurance. I asked if she would do a video commentary for our newsletter re: how MPB managed her issue and she said she''d be very happy to do so.  I also asked if she would be interested in joining MPB as an Advisor.  She said she would certainly consider this opportunity.  I emailed Kim the link to the Video creator platform and instructions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-24 08:45:58', '2023-02-24 10:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114544003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '02.24.23:  Recvd. an email from Martha letting me know she didn''t  get our newsletter (wasn''t in junk mail either).  Would like it so she can get the instructions to do the video for us.  I responded telling her I will check again w/Kelly to confirm her name is on our newsletter email list.  I sent her my newsletter email so she could read it and get the instructions she needs.  I told her I would run through the video making process with her if she likes.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-24 08:44:01', '2023-02-24 08:44:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114530011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085539002', 'Carl Harris', NULL, 'Member''s 3/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM -2/24 2/27 member submitted updated Pmt info I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-24 08:32:07', '2023-02-27 10:30:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114530003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082148002', 'Angela Johnson', NULL, 'Angela called into the Concierge line a few moments ago while I am covering the line until 12pm today, but Angela called in because she stated that she is currently at her daughter''s GI appointment to get an X-Ray done. Angela said she has never gotten her Zion Health card and the billing people at the Doctor''s office right then were asking for some sort of Membership ID number or anything similar. Otherwise, the doctor''s office said they have to book Angela''s daughter out and get the X-Ray done another time. But they are ready to take her back right this second to get it done if Angela can give them the info that would be on the card Angela told me. I let her know for this type of appointment and anything else that is similar to this situation, whereas it is Injury/Illness or some sort of diagnosis, so they are just trying to figure out what is wrong with Angela''s daughter, nobody knows yet so that is why they are needing to do the X-Ray. I told her she is to present herself as a Cash Paying Patient and get the best cash discount. Agnela is responsible for ONLY her IUA of $1000, nothing more. Everything else for all the medical bills and statements, along with her receipts of proof she paid her IUA of $1000, submit them all into Zion Health and start what is called a Need with them. They will then review everything and get in contact with the Provider themselves, and Zion takes it from there and speaks with/pays the doctors directly. Angela does not have to worry about negotiating and the stress of wondering what''s next or what will happen about her bills. Zion will be there with her every step of the way. I told her that I was going to transfer her directly to Zion Health so Angela can get the doctor''s office the info from Zion that they need to get Angela''s daughter her X-Ray. I lastly let Angela know that from this point forward, Zion will be the ones that she will need to contact about this specific Need with her daughter. Angela was thrilled I was able to get her over to Zion and get the info she needs to give the billing dept. Angela is all set for now. 

P.S. Angela let me know that this X-Ray isn''t the 1st appointment and that they have had multiple other appointments for her daughter before this. Angela said her and her husband have paid a total of about $1,100. $100 more than their IUA. That was one of the other biggest reasons she needed to speak with Zion to get reimbursed for that or however they will go about it. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-24 07:52:31', '2023-02-24 07:52:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114509013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '2-23-2023:  Stephanie called back.  She lives in HI which does not curr have a single PHCS gyno.  I let her know the only option was to wait until they have the new RBP pricing & to watch for the e-mail w/the new Planstin card that no longer has PHCS logo on the back of the card.  She was a bit snippy & upset "that I have to risk my health until then?".  I let her know this situation is exactly why we are woking so hard to correct the issue.  She asked if she can just pay.  I said she''s always welcome to pay out of pkt, but they do not reimb.  I don''t think she was happy, but she seemed somewhat better at the end of the call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-23 16:42:12', '2023-03-30 02:17:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114509008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093982002', 'Gabriella Carenza', NULL, '2-23-2023:  Gabriella called.  She wanted to see if her normal mammogram cntr was in ntwk.  We did not find them listed in the PHCS search tool, so I sent her the radiology centers that came up so she can see if they do mamm.  I also let her know we are working to chg to no req''d ntwk, yet I cannot say when that will happen.  She''ll watch for the new Planstin card w/no PHCS logo on the back.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-23 16:28:27', '2023-02-23 16:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114507031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096042001', 'Jacqueline Schaible', NULL, '02.23.2023 Jacqueline called to know how to apply her medical need towards physical therapy. She was concerned about the 6 months timeline that she needs to adhere to. "Do i have to have all treatments completed in order to submit?"
I brought Cari onto the call, and Cari says no, as long as the need is ongoing. 
As long as it''s ongoing, it goes towards the medical need. As long as there''s movement, you just add onto the need. Cari recommended that she attain a treatment plan from her doctor to upload to the medical need. 
Theodore Park is the ortho doctor she would like to stick with for treatment, Cari searched for him on HCBB. 
Cari discussed CareConnect bill and services packaging and the options and process of it.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-23 16:08:41', '2023-02-23 16:17:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114507023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '02.23.2023 Stephanie called stating she has a medical condition that she would like looked at, maybe telehealth, but she''s not sure what''s available to her. Due to her having an older plan, I consulted with Cari via teams.
Cari shared that they''ve evened out the different plans.  Everyone has the base Essentials: CirrusMD, WHLC, MAP, etc. So I shared that with Stephanie, and while I was still on line with her, she signed into CirrusMD, gladly.
Stephanie also wanted guidance on choosing new providers, due to a move. I emailed her the MultiPlan Link via CRM to peruse all the providers she is searching for. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-23 15:37:20', '2023-02-23 15:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114505013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003785031', 'Susan Wojciechowski', NULL, '2-23-23 From John Kach, Patti verified, we billed her for three payments, she is up to date. &nbsp;Thanks for the help!"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-23 15:30:17', '2023-02-23 15:30:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114457114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408002', 'Anthony Nelson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp 2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-23 14:52:43', '2023-02-23 14:52:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114457109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114355002', 'Michael Tovey', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-23 14:46:55', '2023-02-23 14:46:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114501023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114217027', 'Erin Porter', NULL, 'I left another message for Erin to return my call.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-23 14:42:05', '2023-02-23 14:42:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114507018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106861002', 'Timothy Sadusky', NULL, '02.23.2023 Connie put in an RX request for Estrodial .075mg, 30 days, 2/week.
The search raised a couple of questions regarding 30 patches OR 30 days. I called and left Connie a VM to call us back, in order to complete the request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-23 14:40:55', '2023-02-23 14:40:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114473018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109802002', 'Debra Black', NULL, 'Called Debbie to do her welcome call but she unfortunately had to reschedule. I sent her a new link and told her to give the concierge a call if she needs anything in the meantime. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-23 14:32:52', '2023-02-23 14:32:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114457104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082384010', 'Karabo Molakwane', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-23 14:23:09', '2023-02-23 14:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114457099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104598010', 'Anna Hopkins', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-23 14:16:10', '2023-02-23 14:16:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114507013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009836013', 'James Brignall', NULL, '02.23.2023 Sadie from Zion called to help James in cancelling his membership that he''s attempted to cancel, according to Sadie. 
He shows up in CRM as clear as day, no attempt to cancellation, but does not show up in the ADMIN123 platform at all. 
I forwarded her to Patti for clarification. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-23 13:15:54', '2023-02-23 13:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114507008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063695002', 'Erika Joy', NULL, '02.23.2023 Erika called to learn how to upload additional invoices/receipts to her medical need that is still open, to get reimbursed. She attempted to use the email link that Zion shared for adding more PDF to the need, but it was not working. Therefore I guided her to use our member portal page, and/or the link that was initially sent to her by Cari on 12/15/2022. Choosing Additional Doc Submission option from the drop down menu, in the medical need request link.
Erika had to do it twice to receive confirmation it was processed to Zion, but it was successful in the end. She uploaded the additional documents from the procedure and then her prescriptions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-23 12:59:29', '2023-02-23 12:59:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114509003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109175019', 'Juliann Jordan', NULL, '2-23-2023:  Juliann called.  She wants to see her counselor on our counseling component.  I gave Mazz &amp; Sull ph # &amp; let her know she can nominate her counselor to see if they are willing to become part of the ntwk.  If not, she''d have to use one of the in ntwk counselors.  We went over the structure as well.  She''ll call them to get started.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-23 12:57:51', '2023-02-23 12:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114457091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114217027', 'Erin Porter', NULL, 'Members 3/23 share Amount declined 1st notice sent via EMail &amp; VM-2/23 2nd notice sent 2/27 Member submitted updated pmt info I will rerun notification via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-23 12:34:39', '2023-03-02 08:01:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114505008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '2-23-23 Joy called to let me know her income for 2021 was $74K for household! That appears to qualify her just below the threshold of $78,880 for the ability to participate in the possible new company JT is vetting for hospital bill eraser. Her surgery date is 3/29/23 and hoping to know if we''ve committed to this program by then or not. I let her know she''s top of my mind for this.  Also, income for 2022 will be getting an extension bc accountants wife passed away recently and he''s unavailable now. 2022 they lost some money due to a vacant rental property which they planned to sell. Not sure if it sold or not. 2023 income has been less again since dealing with her health issues and not working as much as usual.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-23 12:29:33', '2023-02-23 12:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114507003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628010', 'Hunter Stirm', NULL, '02.23.2023 Tatiana called to learn how to get her son''s ENT appointments covered.
I explained that it is not preventative, so Planstin won''t kick in, and it''s not large enough for medical cost sharing to kick in. However, I asked her to present herself as a ''cash-pay'' patient, and request the ''cash-pay'' discount, and save all her receipts. Based on the background she shared that it sounds like he has what she grew up with, and with that information, I offered that they open a medical need, and when their IUA is fulfilled then the medical cost sharing kicks in.
I requested that they call us back to get guidance on how to complete the medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-23 11:34:32', '2023-02-23 11:34:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114505003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012048004', 'Paula Slick', NULL, '2-23-23 Paula realizes her accountant gave her a wrong amount for her income. She didn''t apply for an APTC bc her income was too high. Now she realizes she needs to do so with the correct income moving forward. I gave her instructions to do so or told her to call me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-23 11:25:17', '2023-07-24 10:35:25');
