  ('zcrm_1579374000114473008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109380026', 'Caesare Sanchez', NULL, '2/23/23 - Caesare called in this morning regarding her daughter''s OBGYN visit and her Depo (birth control) shot. She wanted to know if either of these were going to be covered considering she wasn''t going to a DPC. I explained how she would present as self-pay for this visit and shot. Caesare will be giving Bern a call today regarding her DPC options. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-23 08:01:53', '2023-02-23 08:01:53'),
