  ('zcrm_1579374000114425030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109781008', 'Lauren Guida', NULL, '2-22-2023:  Lauren sent in an RX Quote request yesterday.  When I got to the last item, she had 2 diff strengths, but from an e-mail she sent over to Nahla it said she wanted prices on diff quantities so, I sent her an e-mail requesting clarification.
     In her response, she not only decided she wanted diff quantites on each item, but coupons for diff pharmacies, then said she should have picked these up yesterday, so I''ll need them right away.  I tried calling her to go over what I discovered, but probably missed her since she was headed to pick them up early today.
