  ('zcrm_1579374000114382089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003785031', 'Susan Wojciechowski', NULL, '2-22-23 From John Kach, " She was cancelled inadvertently during a mass update for members who hadn''t converted.  I added the new product - Direct T3.  this is a screenshot of the pricing change.  If you can, reach out to Susan and confirm the pricing, or change IUA etc.  Once that is confirmed, we will have Sedera re-instate her and we can then discuss what we want to do with the unpaid billing."

