  ('zcrm_1579374000114382057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109365015', 'Ann Parker', NULL, '2-22-23 Helped Advisor Christine Corsini with this client. Ann Parker''s daughter got new employer coverage and needs to be removed from membership. Missed the deadline for March 1st end date. Employer is asking for proof of no other insurance before they get her going for March 1st. So, now that she''s still active through March, they will try to push the other new start date off until April 1st, so they don''t have double coverage/benefits and payments. Seems to be hopefully resolved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-22 14:18:06', '2023-02-22 14:36:01'),
