  ('zcrm_1579374000114420023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '02.22.2023 Melissa called for a prescription for Kenalog in orabase.
The dosage stated on the request does not match the options offered on the discount sites, so I gave Melissa a call to confirm, and she said to search for the least amount offered, and that would be 15mg, cream tube.
*****
I needed more information to complete her quote, so I emailed Melissa, via Outlook, to verify the strength of Kenalog; via 10, 40, or 80 OR via .1%, .25%, .5%.
With the help from Cari, via teams, I was able to inform Melissa that the gen Kenalog in Orabase, which is the only liquid (not gel, cream, etc) is in a vial form & that says the doctor administers it. Therefore, I asked her, if she would be comfortable with Cari to trying to read her prescription, since she has 29 years of experience working with pharmacies reading prescriptions. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-22 13:16:37', '2023-02-22 17:19:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114367079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107379001', 'Richard Wright', NULL, 'Member''s 3/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 2/22. 2/27-Member directed me to rerun pmt on existing card.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-22 13:15:15', '2023-02-27 11:02:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114420018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108629002', 'Alexander Richardson', NULL, '02.22.2023 Kelly called concerned about how to present herself at the doctor''s office for her son''s ear(s). The doctor''s office was requesting insurance HMP or PPO information.  I explained it''s neither, because they do not have insurance, they are cash-pay patient and should be presenting themselves as such and requesting the cash-pay discount, saving all their receipts (in case the ''incident'' converts to medical cost sharing after their $2500 IUA). 
The question remains if both his ears would be considered separate IUA''s or a combined incident of one IUA. I recommended they speak to Zion regarding that question, should it come to opening a medical need.
Then they raised an interest in changing plans to have preventative, and possibly changing IUA''s and I recommended they speak to their advisor, Michael Montes to discuss those two options, especially with an incident already at hand.
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams after our call, as they were providing guidance during our call, and Jen will be taking the initiative in contacting Michael directly to make him aware of the matter at hand, so he can address it in a timely manner, given the urgent care and concerns the members have. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-22 13:13:36', '2023-02-22 13:13:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114367074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082042002', 'Christel Scomparin', NULL, 'After sending out the email (that was returned) and trying to reach member via phone (VMailbox was full) I messaged Karen in team to get in touch with member - 2/22 3/7-sent final notice to member (VMailbox was full)  deadline 3/8 3/8-Member submitted PU  I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-22 13:12:22', '2023-03-08 09:00:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114367069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082042002', 'Christel Scomparin', 'New membership eff 11/1/22', 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-22 13:04:01', '2023-02-22 13:04:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114420013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004658165', 'David Abookire', NULL, '02.22.2023 Elsa called to get clarification on how to present herself at the mamm, and what happens if it goes to diagnostic, due to her dense breasts. She also wanted to know if Echo Cardiograms are considered preventative, which I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, and they said no but save the receipts for just in case it turns into a medical need. Lastly, she wanted to attain mental wellness services for her son, so I guided her to the M&S page with MPB for resources and making appointments. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-22 13:03:21', '2023-02-22 13:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114367064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082042002', 'Christel Scomparin', NULL, 'Because of the fact that this member''s 3/23 payment declined I found out that she had re-enrolled eff 11/1/22.  Nothing was changed in A123 to reflect new membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-22 13:03:17', '2023-02-22 13:03:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114425011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380018', 'Daniel Cardoza', NULL, '2-22-2023:  Leah &amp; Daniel called trying to sub a ''med need'' to Zion.  His computer is blocking things so they are trying to do this together, but didn''t have his memb #.  I walked them thru things to expect (which is a duplicate for Daniel, but that was way back on 12/1/2022), etc, then made sure they have Zion''s ph # &amp; trans them there to get his memb #.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-22 12:56:47', '2023-02-22 12:56:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114367056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101897001', 'Daniel Kane', NULL, 'Member''s 3/23 payment declined 1st notice sent 2/22 via VM &amp; email 2/24 received payment update from member I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-22 12:48:26', '2023-02-24 09:54:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114382044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106218014', 'Alexander Tocco', NULL, '2-22-23 Alexander has to update his C4 file to get onto Medicaid since he no longer has his other job. He thinks he automatically gets Medicaid and didn''t understand that he qualified for C4 and therefore, not Medicaid. He finally understood by the end that he has to update his file in order to get his current bills paid for by Medicaid.  He''s working to get a new job. He can''t afford $34.66 right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-22 12:45:53', '2023-02-22 12:45:53'),
