  ('zcrm_1579374000114417003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066713058', 'Dena Conine', NULL, 'I spoke today with Mike Conine. He was a little abusive at first, said he went on our site after he called in. I called him because it was a missed call. He then opened up about the past with us and they would like to re-enroll. I spoke with Michelle, Patti, and Karina. Based on the way things happened before, as well as the fact Dena has a pre-existing, we decided it''s best not to re-enroll them at this time.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-22 10:35:14', '2023-02-22 10:35:14'),
