  ('zcrm_1579374000114290065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', NULL, '2-17-2023:  Sent the following coupons to Laura.  Meijer pharmacy was cheapest & she was fine w/that.
     - Spironolactone (ok to go w/Generic Aldactone) 50mg, #180 tabs (1 twice a day) = $14.37 on RXGo
     - Vilazodone (= Gen Viibryd) 40mg, #90 tabs (1 daily) = $72.12 on GoodRX
     - Acyclovir (= Gen Zovirax) 400mg, #180 tabs (1 twice a day) = $20.57 on RXGo
     - Atorvastatin Calc (= Gen Lipitor) 20mg, #90 (1 daily) = $10.84 on GoodRX
     - Alprazolam (=Gen Xanax) 0.25mg, #20 tabs = $5.72 on RXGo
     - Albuterol HFA (=Gen Ventolin or Proventil) 8.5gms if 90mcg x 2 inhalers = $30.27 RXGo
     - Pregabalin (= Gen Lyrica) 50mg, #166 caps (1d x 2 wks, then 1bid = #166 this time) = $29.39 on GoodRX

Will need down the road, but not today:
     - Tazarotene 0.1% cr, 60gms.  Lasts her a long time.  Est today:  $73.29     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-22 00:05:45', '2023-02-22 00:05:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114331032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086614014', 'Fernando Ortega', NULL, '02.21.2023 Fernando called regarding the charge from MPB yesterday, 02.21.2023. I checked the Admin123 platform, and it shows he was charged for sure. I forwarded him to Patti to leave her a VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-21 17:26:09', '2023-02-21 17:26:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114322026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002834005', 'Anthony Moreno', NULL, '2-21-23 I talked with Cari and Nahla about this client bc they can''t reach Jeff Kanter. I left a vm for Jeff and a vm for Anthony. I let Anthony know Jeff can better help him and gave him Jeff''s #. We don''t know if the client wants to cancel or would prefer to keep his membership active. Sounds like he purposefully allowed his account to lapse in regard to not completing the upgrade. Not sure what he wants moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-21 17:03:14', '2023-02-21 17:03:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114331027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107380001', 'Edward Barlow', NULL, '02.21.2023 Edward called inquiring about their Zion card and member ID information. They searched their emails  and did not see any welcome email from Zion. I assured them they would not have sent anything via snail mail, as they stopped doing that around a year ago.
I did transfer them to Zion, after I offered them to write their number down, so they could request their membership information. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-21 17:02:40', '2023-02-21 17:02:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114322021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '2-21-23 I called Jim and let him know there''s no network for the HMA. He can use the card like cash. But, it was getting rejected for his prescriptions. I let him know it must be coded properly as a prescription when they run the charge, otherwise it will be rejected or seen as  a general purchase. He knows he can call HMA and get reimbursed if he wants. This one wasn''t a big dollar amount, so he''s not worried about it. He''ll try to get it to work next time as he proceeds. Very nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-21 15:34:59', '2023-02-21 15:34:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114290045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082384010', 'Karabo Molakwane', NULL, '2-21-2023:  Karabo called Planstin & Carmen trans him to us.  He said he can''t get the pymt to update on the portal (he''s using Planstin''s portal, so I let him know they do not take care of his pymts, that goes thru MPB.Health.   I walked him thru the process w/a pymt chg form on MPB.Health''s site & can see he sub the form.
     - He has never had his ''Welcome Call'' (& is completely clueless as to what he''s purch).  Sent the invite to both him & his wife, encouraging them to do the call together so they can both hear how this works.  To use the phone # they want us to call them on for the call.
     - He decided he wants to chg his e-mail address.  Walked him thru the form & see he sub that.
     - Re: CirrusMD (since he''s chging his e-mail) - it doesn''t sound like he''s ever used the srvc.  In fact I don''t think he will.  Kind of seemed completely uninterested in telehealth.
     - I made sure he knew to call the Concierge Line for guidance (not Planstin).  Let him know the Welcome Call will also help & they will make sure he understands his ID Card(s).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-21 15:33:44', '2023-02-21 16:28:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114331019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002834005', 'Anthony Moreno', NULL, '02.21.2023 Anthony called saying was he was a member with Sedera. 
DID not do the conversion, and was under the impression Sedera would cancel his plan if not complied, BUT we still charged him.
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, and Cari recommended that he speak to his advisor.
I recommended that Anthony speak to his advisor, and he said he does not have one. I said, James Ashford is listed as his advisor. Anthony said he''s never heard of him.
Anthony seemed peeved but was still respectful and kind.
I offered Anthony James Ashford''s phone number, and to call us if he has anymore questions. *****
Cari later messaged me via teams stating that Anthony''s advisor is showing up inactive, so to try his parent advisor, Jeff Kanter. Cari tried Jeff first, before recommending him to Anthony, and both Jeff''s number and the company are not in service, and call could not be completed.
Cari and I then proceeded to search for someone who can call Anthony back and assist with his plan and charges. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-21 15:04:47', '2023-02-21 15:37:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114290037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082061010', 'Lauren Beattie', NULL, '2-21-2023:  Lauren called in re: mental health counseling thru MAP.  She wanted to know how many visits & how it works, total # of visits, etc.  She''s in CO, so I let her know the structure & the total annual visits, that she can pay during the waiting periods.  Her response was: "that won''t work for me".  I told her we bring the different products together, but the program is thru Mazz & Sull.  They would be the ones to discuss this with as we have no input in their offerings.  I offered to get her over to them & her response was: "I need to calm down before I talk with them.  I''ll have to call them later."     - CA

I called Planstin after our call (to make sure from my 12/12/22 note) & tt Evette.  She was able to confirm they show Lauren''s memb as active now.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-21 14:41:12', '2023-02-21 14:47:55'),
