  ('zcrm_1579374000114290026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108050001', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, '2-21-2023:  Jennifer called.  She wants to go in for her ''prev care'' PCP visit & get her mamm.  She wondered if the new RBP was ready yet (even disc bal billing during the conv).  I let her know we do not have a definitive date yet.  She''ll be on the lookout for the e-mail from Planstin w/her new pdf card w/out the PHCS logo on the back.  We walked thru options now if she doesn''t want to wait.  I helped her find & learn both the PHCS search tool & HCBB.  She''ll call if she has further questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-21 11:13:24', '2023-02-21 11:24:48'),
