  ('zcrm_1579374000114290018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096121002', 'Sarah Fuquay', NULL, '2-21-2023:  Sarah called.  As of 3/1/2023, her husb''s emp is covering them.  I made sure she has her advisor''s ph #: 800-913-2195 & trans her to Michael Montes'' #.  She will LM & if she hasn''t heard back by Friday, she''ll call us so we can help with the cancellation process.  She knows there''s a cancellation form she''ll need to complete once tt Michael.  She also wondered, since they processed March''s mo contribution yesterday, how long would the refund of those funds take.  I told her our Ben Admin would be able to let her know that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-21 10:44:21', '2023-02-21 10:46:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114263066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059893072', 'Elaine Roth', NULL, 'Member''s  3/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via Email &amp; VM  2/23-member updated CC I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-21 10:38:08', '2023-02-23 13:12:20'),
