  ('zcrm_1579374000114322003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '2-21-23 Abe is most likely going to get ins on his own and his son will get onto his mom''s policy. They are sorting that out in the next few days. Abe''s current wife makes enough money so they don''t want to bother with combining taxes to get a subsidy. He''s ok paying full price at $411.26 Friday Bronze Copay or Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0 at $482.33. He will decide and complete the process possibly on his own. He knows to make the payment directly to carrier in 7-10 days following enrollment. He also knows he has to show proof of SEP with Cobra notice or cancellation notice from carrier. I might need to show him how to upload it. He will let me know if he decides to complete it all on his own. Knows the deadline of the 28th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-21 10:22:59', '2023-02-21 10:22:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114263056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109369027', 'Shandy Broom', NULL, 'Member submitted PU from member.  I have updated in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-21 10:16:22', '2023-02-21 10:16:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114263051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106816002', 'Jessica Ullman', NULL, 'I received an email from members boyfriend stating that both of them wanted to cancel.  This is due to the fact that she has a chronic condition.  She did not disclose this on the application, if so she would have been discouraged from enrolling.  I will send out cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-21 09:56:14', '2023-02-21 09:56:14'),
