  ('zcrm_1579374000114263041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371001', 'Evan Bellini', NULL, 'Member emailed me requesting cancellation and a refund of all his monies back since this membership is not for him.  He was referred by his Girlfriend Jessica Ulman who has a Prex condition that she did not disclose.  Per John will refund all monies when I receive cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-21 09:46:42', '2023-02-21 09:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114284041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479018', 'Steven Wagar', NULL, 'Mr. Wagar was informed by Sally that the concierge team will negotiate his pricing and make ALL of his appointments for him and his wife. I informed Mr. Wagar that the concierge does not do those things but that we can find him fair pricing in his area for the specialist of choice along with a list of fair priced providers. Mr. Wagar told me that he was informed that the concierge team does everything and that we should not tell people such information. I apologized and will be sending him the fair pricing for a spine specialist in his area. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 09:39:54', '2023-02-21 09:39:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114290013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111990002', 'John Hill', NULL, 'Welcome call  complete with John and Mary. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-21 09:23:31', '2023-02-21 09:23:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114284033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101104002', 'Tennison Barry II', NULL, 'Tennison called because he needed to update his payment method but wanted to let Patti know that he thinks his former payment method will reject this months payment. I sent him to Patti for that reason and also sent him the member payment update form. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 09:05:48', '2023-02-21 09:06:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114306001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109886002', 'James Evans lll', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Leonardo Moraes', 'Visit ID : 2865 Question : how do i create a log in page', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-02-21 09:00:40', '2023-02-21 09:00:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114284028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '2/21/23 - Jim called for guidance on how to use his HMA card. I direct transferred him to Wendy so she could assist him with this since the concierge does not handle the HMA''s or HSA''s. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 08:59:08', '2023-02-21 08:59:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114284023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, 'Tina called in because she is getting ready to take Fred to urgent care. Tina wanted to know what to do in case they want Fred to go to the ER: should she shop around for the better priced ER? I advised Tina that if urgent care decides that Fred needs to go to the ER, to get to the nearest one, present as self-pay, and once they are home and Fred is stabilized, to call the concierge line and we will direct her further. Tina was thankful for the help. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 08:54:29', '2023-02-21 08:54:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114303003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100459012', 'Kelly Matthews', NULL, 'I spoke with Kelly, she wanted to cancel, because the plan she purchased didn''t have any preventative. I spoke to her about the other plans, she doesn''t qualify for Secure. I went over Direct with her, and she likes the plan and decided to upgrade. Difference $30 per month. Patti sent plan change form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-21 08:44:05', '2023-02-21 08:44:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114284018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108674016', 'Thomas Langworthy', NULL, 'Thomas called because he changed his payment method but hasn''t seen the payment come out of the correct account yet. I direct transferred him to Patti. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 08:26:49', '2023-02-21 08:26:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114284013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065985001', 'Denise Uhlig', NULL, 'Denise called because she wants to have a certain lab done but does not have an order. We discussed Jasonhealth.com and the self-pay process. Denise will call with any other questions. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 08:19:55', '2023-02-21 08:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114284008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, 'Tessa called because she is in Mexico and tried to use her CirrusMD services. The CirrusMD doc told her that he could not assist her since she was not in the US. Tessa asked what she could do, so we went over how to present as a self-pay patient and to be sure to get the bills translated into English in case this goes above her IUA. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 08:11:20', '2023-02-21 08:11:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114290008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111977009', 'Roseann Hummel', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-21 08:05:25', '2023-02-21 08:05:25'),
