  ('zcrm_1579374000114284003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100459012', 'Kelly Matthews', NULL, '2/21/23 - Kelly thought she had purchased a plan that had preventative care included. Upon speaking with Kelly, she was very upset to find out that the plan she had was specifically for catastrophic care. Kelly told me that this was "bullshit" but thanked me for explaining everything to her. She wanted to be transferred to Justin so that she could cancel but I could not find any contact info in the CRM for him, so I transferred her to Jeffrey so that she could speak with him. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 07:50:32', '2023-02-21 07:50:32'),
