  ('zcrm_1579374000114263003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114236001', 'Carlos Salazar', NULL, 'Member did not fill out SS#''s for spouse &amp; Dependents.  Requested this from Jeffrey.  Member called in and gave this info to me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-21 07:32:51', '2023-02-21 07:53:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114249003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114234002', 'Kenneth Storm', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-21 07:24:08', '2023-02-21 07:24:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114248003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086528002', 'Cynthia Colandrea', NULL, 'Cynthia called in because she received a bill for her lab work. Cynthia stated that "whoever she spoke to on the MPB concierge line stated that all of my lab work would be paid for". Upon reading my note below, I had told Cynthia that anything outside of preventative care bloodwork would be considered an expense to her and to present as self-pay for those labs. Cynthia then back tracked and stated that she knew that but wanted to know why the bloodwork was not paid. I advised Cynthia again that anything outside of her preventative care lab work (i.e. lipid panel) would be an expense to her and she asked to speak with Planstin at that point so I transferred her directly. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-21 07:23:35', '2023-02-21 07:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114186068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109380026', 'Caesare Sanchez', NULL, '2-20-2023:  RX Quotes:
     - Levocetirizine 5mg, #90 tabs = $16.53 at Publix on GoodRX
     - Sertraline HCL 100mg, #90 tabs = $7.50 on RXGo
     - Phentermine HCL 37.5mg, #90 tabs = $16.80 on GoodRX
     - Vitamin D2 1.25mg, #12 caps = "As low as" $7.20 on WellRX (her "new" store not listed), so also sent $12.93 from RXGo
     - Albuterol Sulf HFA 8.5gm of 90mcg x 3 inhalers = $48.70 on RXGo
     - Trelegy Ellipta (disc sites locally $1600-$1900!) - Sent Reid''s quote = $186.94 + $9.95 = $196.89  [no mfg coup for cash-pay, only comm ins patients]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-20 19:16:32', '2023-02-20 19:16:32'),
