  ('zcrm_1579374000114226049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114234002', 'Kenneth Storm', NULL, '2-20-23 Ken enrolled in SECURE EF $715/$1000. He was able to determine Dr. Hoch is in the network but hasn''t been able to do so with the Pediatrician Dr. Lauren Brave. He tried calling BMC today but it''s a holiday. So, he just enrolled since today is the deadline. John T says we will a date by noon tomorrow to let us know when the RBP will be rolled out. These clients are wanting to make sure the Pediatrician will be accepted. Hopefully it won''t be an issue. They don''t need their wellness visit immediately either.  They are all set for March 1st, 2023 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-20 16:11:59', '2023-02-20 16:11:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114226041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '2-20-23 Suzanne hasn''t received her card from Cigna but an old address is showing in C4 with 2 different zip codes. Her zip wasn''t working when Cigna''s automated system called her. So, she will call C4 next to fix that to get her card, etc. I also told her the name of her plan, so she can properly check the network now for appointments.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-20 16:01:20', '2023-02-20 16:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114226036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '2-20-23  Left vm in case she wants a March 1st start date!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-20 15:49:28', '2023-02-20 15:49:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114235003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103256002', 'Vanessa Edwards', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/1 as she now qualifies for disability.  Jane helped client so she knows.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-20 15:32:50', '2023-02-20 15:32:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114186052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885296', 'David Steiner', NULL, '2-20-2023:  David called.  Wants to sched his colonoscopy.  Has no idea where his RCI card is, so at the end of the call I made sure he has RCI''s ph # &amp; trans him directly to them - he wants a pdf copy (doesn''t like hard cards).  Also e-mailed him a copy of the PHCS gasteroenterolgists near him.  Went over conf all prov in ntwk, what happens if becomes diag (1k IUA, call us to begin a ''med need''), etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-20 14:58:46', '2023-02-20 15:12:59'),
