  ('zcrm_1579374000114219018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, '02.20.2023 Kelly called to learn more about mental health wellness. I guided her to the M&amp;S MAP program with us, had her sign in.
I consulted with Jen via teams to confirm the number of sessions per year and how the are divided. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-20 14:43:00', '2023-02-20 14:43:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114232003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '02.20.23:  Emailed Martha to let her know we changed the primary email to hers and to check to see if she gets our newsletter tomorrow.  Also check her spam/junk folder.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 14:38:03', '2023-02-20 14:38:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114226028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114233002', 'Dilan Bollmann', NULL, '2-20-23 Dilan is Sara Brandenburg''s boyfriend. She gave him all of the information that I sent to her for Dilan. He''s choosing CARE+ and knows that he will pay for wellness on his own and not get reimbursed. He''s healthy, born in 1994, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco.  He''s 28 now and $1000/$215. His parent''s business is called Patriot Plumbers. That comes up on his phone. It''s not his business. He''s enrolling for a March 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-20 14:37:59', '2023-02-20 14:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114226023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '02-20-23 Helen and I walked through the re-enrollment process and she got the page where it says Thank you for your enrollment. She should be all set now to keep her account active moving forward. She already has been paying the higher amount of $1110.28 and she knows the amount of $500+ showing on Sedera''s site is not her full cost. She included Everyday Care with Redirect Health on the application and kept the $1000 IUA. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-20 14:15:37', '2023-02-20 14:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114183113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114230002', 'Mary Jo Mooring', NULL, 'Member only $5000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-20 13:30:13', '2023-02-20 13:30:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114225039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '02.14.23:  Send Dr. Lee''s podcast link to Ali to insert in the newsletter.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 13:09:09', '2023-02-20 13:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114225034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '02.08.23:  Dr. Lee emailed me to thank me for all my support and referral efforts.  Said "my kindness warms her heart" and if there is ever anything she can do for me just to let her know - how nice of her!', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 13:08:24', '2023-02-20 13:08:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114225026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '02.04.23:  Emailed Dr. Lee, thanked her for her CV. Explained my discussion w/Melanie Pinado of WHLC who said they do not currently do business in the behavioral health space but are working toward it. Said I would speak to MSEAP when I returned from my conference.
Also emailed Jack Rome to thank him for sending the podcast. He responded thanking me for my email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 13:03:54', '2023-02-20 13:05:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114186041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104790012', 'Jessica Perez', NULL, 'Attempt 5. Left vm and sent new scheduling link. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-20 13:01:52', '2023-02-20 13:01:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114183108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Wendy', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-20 12:58:54', '2023-02-20 12:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114226008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, '2-20-23 Leo is cancelling bc his wife just got a new job and they are offering insurance for cheaper than what he''s paying now, it includes wellness and has slightly more benefits. He likes MPB and Sedera and it worked for him when he needed it. But, this makes financial sense for them now with the new job.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-20 12:44:26', '2023-02-20 12:44:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114225021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '02.02.23:  Recvd. the podcast from both Dr. Lee and Jack Rome.  Emailed Dr. Lee to thank her and comment on how good it was.  Told her I wil be sending it along with her bio to MSEAP.  Also told her I spoke w/Hannah Butler of Uberdoc. Dr. Lee can join their network as long as she is licensed and is Board certified.  I asked for her CV.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 12:37:47', '2023-02-20 12:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114226003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919064', 'Steve Godber', NULL, '2-20-23 Steve asked how to cancel his membership. He''s not aware he''s already been cancelled. I left him a vm to make sure he doesn''t have any surprises. I had emailed him the link to cancel and Patti let me know he was cancelled as of 12/1/22.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-20 12:35:57', '2023-02-20 12:35:57'),
