  ('zcrm_1579374000114225016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '01.31.23:  Recvd. an email from Dr. Lee. She did the podcast and is sending it tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 12:08:22', '2023-02-20 12:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114186036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', NULL, '2-20-2023:  Patricia called.  Still trying to get her mammogram.  We have not rec''d the got on the RBP pricing.  I sent her the 4 radiology locations near her to see if they might work for her in the meantime.  She''ll be on the lookout for the new pdf Planstin card w/out the PHCS logo on the back down the road.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-20 12:08:11', '2023-02-20 13:25:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114219013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081509011', 'Tammy Goen', NULL, '02.20.2023 Tammy called to confirm she would get reimbursed from Zion regarding a bill for an open medical need.
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams and they agreed that she needs to speak to Zion directly.
Prior to transferring her, she did ask me if I could leave Patti a message or let her know as a reminder that she will be billed in March for her new plan, Secure, in April. I left Patti a message via teams. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-20 12:01:57', '2023-02-20 12:01:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114225011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '01.19.23:  During our Zoom call, Dr. Lee explained how she came to develop a career in integrative psychiatry and explained what that specialty involved.  I suggested she do a video for our newsletter to introduce herself and follow up with one of her podcasts.  She offered to do her next podcast on what we had discussed and I suggested she frame it from her personal perspective (to be more relevant to our members, than scientific.  She liked that approach and said she would do so.  Said she would be doing this podcast with her producer/interviewer, Jack within the next two weeks and would send it to me when it is done.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 12:01:42', '2023-02-20 12:01:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114225003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '01.17.23:  Recvd.  an email from Dr. Lee  asking me how she could join our health network as a provider to help our members.  Dr. Lee is a holistic (integrative) psychiatrist who helps people use nutritional interventions and energy medicine techniques to minimize the need for psychiatric medications. She also specializes in helping patients withdraw from their psychiatric medications safely.  I emailed Dr. Lee back and asked if we could schedule a meeting to discuss some options for her w/the MPB services (MAP, WHLC, CirrusMD). Dr. Lee called me and we scheduled a zoom call for 1/19/23 to discuss these options, etc.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-20 11:52:47', '2023-02-20 11:53:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114186026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109092002', 'Tara Bobesku', NULL, '2-20-2023:  Tara called.  Her daughter is headed to camp & she didn''t know which doctor to list.  We talked about since it won''t be ''prev care'' her current regular doc is fine (they haven''t found in ntwk for her ''prev care'' yet).  I let her know we are working to chg to no ntwk on ''prev care'' too, so to watch her e-mail for the new pdf Planstin care w/out the PHCS on the back.
     - Also went over how to present if it is an emerg: ''cash-pay'', no ins, ask for disc, offer to pay $2500 & ask them to bill her for the balance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-20 11:52:38', '2023-02-20 13:34:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114183073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079574001', 'ronald rawdon', 'Membership eff 3/1/23', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-20 11:24:13', '2023-02-20 11:24:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114219008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109802002', 'Debra Black', NULL, '02.20.2023 Debra called to learn how to be seen by a doctor, she has shingles.
I asked her if she has had her welcome call, and she has not. I sent her the welcome call registration link, via CRM, and she signed up immediately. 
I then forwarded her the healthcare bluebook link to peruse some doctors she can go see.
I explained that her plan does not have preventative, so to present herself as a cash-pay patient and request the cash-pay discount. I also asked her to save all her receipts, so if this goes past $1000, we can open a medical need for her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-20 11:21:43', '2023-02-20 11:21:43'),
