  ('zcrm_1579374000114219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176037', 'Kathleen Burke', NULL, '02.20.2023 Kathleen called stating they signed up with us last night, 2/19, but the email confirmation showed a different IUA (1000 instead of 2500), and the spouse was not included.
