  ('zcrm_1579374000114150001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 2862 Question : I’m needing help registering my telehealth account. I’m needing to be seen by a doctor.

2/20/23 - I had to reach out to CirrusMD support and tag the member in the email because CirrusMD is stating that the member cannot be found in their system. I''m hoping that CirrusMD support answers soon because Abbi needs to be seen ASAP. JAT', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-02-20 06:45:52', '2023-02-20 07:42:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084176', 'Stephanie Raymond', NULL, '2-16-2023:  Stephanie called us because Redirect told her they could not help her w/a ''med need''.  I made sure she has instructions on how to sub a need w/Sedera &amp; told her I was surprised because Redirect used to help members w/that for continuity of care, but it didn''t matter, she can do it directly w/Sedera.  Told her to make sure if they require ''2nd MD'' to do it because otherwise they do not share as fully.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-18 02:30:23', '2023-02-18 02:30:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106715002', 'Bern Philipp', NULL, '2-16-2023:  Bern called to get help re: ''prev care'' (I think).  We were so swamped, my documentation did not get completed.  What we talked about we details for what he was doing, to make sure he knew how to present, what to say, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-18 02:26:38', '2023-02-18 02:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '2/18/2023:  Robin e-mailed me thinking she would be stuck paying the $850 penalty for non-compliance since she had Zion Healthshare.  I assured her she is compliant and to watch her e-mail at the beginning of March (the gvmt''s deadline for the form) for the information coming from ''Planstin'' = her ACA MEC component.  Told her if by 3/8/2023 she has not rec''d it, to plez call Concierge Line so we can trans her to Patti for a copy.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-18 02:23:28', '2023-02-18 02:23:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '2/18/2023:  Josh e-mailed asking for details on how to get his annual exam.  I replied w/some details, but encouraged our finding a time to discuss since there''s so much for this care.  In the back of my mind, Josh''s chosen doctor in not in ntwk, so I mentioned we will want to ck &amp; that we are trying to change this requirement.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-18 02:09:33', '2023-02-18 02:09:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '2/17/2023:  Kyle sent me an e-mail asking about pre-existing conditions.  Sent her details for Robert''s issue, but it doesn''t sound like it will fall in pre-existing from her brief description.  I let her know we have a deadline for sub the ''med need''.  Told her how to have him present, 1k IUA, etc.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-18 02:03:47', '2023-02-18 02:03:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114082046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081704002', 'Carmen Davis', NULL, '02.17.2023 Carmen called to attain her tax form for tax preparation. I told her I''d need to transfer her to Patti, our benefits administrator. She did ask to confirm the dates of her plan with us, and the amount extracted per month. I used CRM and Admin123 to confirm the requested details. Then I transferred her to Patti to leave a message. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-17 17:02:00', '2023-02-17 17:02:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114082041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785001', 'Piotr Kaczmarowski', NULL, '02.17.2023 Piotr called to learn more about the preventative care in his plan. Piotr had not had his welcome call, so I told him about it and that it is a required action to learn about all the services that is in their plan. I emailed him the template for the first time welcome call via CRM.
I did share a little about what is covered in their preventative, and shared that each member gets a mammogram and a colonoscopy and their required timelines to adhere to. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-17 16:09:38', '2023-02-17 16:09:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114133011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '02.17.23:  Martha called.  Had an excellent conversation w/her.  She LOVES our plan. Said she''s had other MCS plans and there is no comparison - ours is the best by far.  Said she''d like to have her son join their Secure plan.  (Said she last spoke w/Tony (Tupac).  Likes Leslie but couldn''t get hold of her a few months ago.)  I told her she could do a group plan with her husband, son and her, if she wants.  She liked that idea.  She will do a video for us to talk about the great services she''s using.  Asked me to help her set it up. I told her to watch for our next newsletter to see how to access the video making program. Also she asked to have the newsletter sent to her email address instead of Daniel''s.  Said I would have Kelly change the address.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-17 15:39:25', '2023-02-17 15:40:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103252010', 'Jayleen Landstrom', NULL, '2-17-2023:  Layken had a breathing emerg last week that included an ambulance ride & ER visit.  They will have follow-up visits, tests, etc.  However, the soonest the doc can see them is 3/21/23 & they req $375 at the time of visit for ''cash-pay'' pts.  I walked Jayleen thru sub a ''med need''.  Once they have her ''need'' started, she''s going to call Zion & pay her 1k IUA, so she can get a virtual cc for the March visit.  She''s waiting for ''cash-pay'' detailed inv from the ER & will also ck w/the ambulance comp to see if they offer a ''cash-pay'' disc.  She seems to have a handle on this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-17 15:32:23', '2023-02-17 15:55:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114082036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', 'SENT: Perm. to Discuss MPB Plan Form', '02.17.2023 Spouse called to gain access to discounted options for organic food purchases. All I could think of for this service is researching whole health living for coupon/discounts.
When I confirmed the account, the spouse was not added to the plan, so I could not discuss anything with her. I sent her the permission to add a person to discuss MPB plan form via CRM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-17 15:16:01', '2023-02-17 15:16:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '2-17-23 Talked with Joy about the income threshold is $78.880 as couple from what it looks like on gov sites if to FPL x 4. She said they lost a bunch of $ this year so MAYBE their income would fall below the threshold but more likely not.   She''s already been getting her services discounted by about 50%. She believes she will need to stay in hospital for 1 week which can be expensive. She''s learned a hospital stay is about $3K per day x 7 = $21K / 2 = $10,500.  Plus doctor fees and everything else. She has sharing of $50K alloted. She will look at the gov link I sent relevant to non-profit hospitals - https://www.irs.gov/charities-non-profits/billing-and-collections-section-501r6. BCH is one of 2 independently owned non-profits left in CO! UCH is also non-profit but not independent.  She''s not panicked. She will do the surgery either way and work with the hospital on the price and go in armed with information. She might also be able to apply for the Special Needs sharing through Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-17 15:10:52', '2023-02-17 15:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114070088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064604259', 'Christine Riley', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to cancel her plan.  I will update in A123 &amp; CRM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-17 14:55:00', '2023-02-17 14:55:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114082031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089138002', 'Karen Jones', NULL, '02.17.2023 Karen called not feeling well, and wanting to know her options. While looking up her account, she also shared that she moved and needs to change her physical address.
When confirming her account, I noticed her email misspelled by missing a letter. So while she was filling out the change form for her address, she also put in to change her email to Karenjones6122@gmail.com FROM Karenjones6122@gmil.com.
In the meantime, she needs to see a doctor to receive antibiotics. 
I will send an email with Cari to CirrusMD to clear her email.
I did tell Karen that the change won''t be right away, so to make sure to see a doctor and not wait, but present herself as a ''cash-pay'' patient and request the cash-pay discount. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-17 14:54:48', '2023-02-17 14:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114070083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055720124', 'Robert Prieto', 'New Plan eff 3/1/23', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-17 14:52:53', '2023-02-17 14:52:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114070078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113156002', 'Jimmy Harris', NULL, 'Member cancelled enrollment', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-17 14:48:15', '2023-02-17 14:48:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '2-17-23 Joy called to find out if it makes sense to schedule her appt for her surgery the 3rd week in March in regard to the Hospital Bill Eraser program. I talked with John T and that is still moving forward and possibly agreed upon in March. He said the program allows hospital bills that go back as far as 270 days. So, there''s nothing to do in advance. The hospital she uses Must be a non-profit 501-C3R. Her income must be within 4x the National Poverty level. His income was about $109K last year in 2022. She got married last Dec., I think in 2021. He''s self employed so he''s not generating any income yet. It''s breaking even. I believe John T had said her income needs to be below $130K. But, looking up FPL on gov site shows $19720. So, those numbers don''t work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-17 14:41:18', '2023-02-17 14:41:18'),
