  ('zcrm_1579374000114125037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114234002', 'Kenneth Storm', NULL, '2-14-23 Elizabeth called to find out the name of the network to review BMC''s site  which shows PHCS Multi Plan PPO as in network. It wasn''t showing each Dr. which was Dr. Lauren Brave or Dr. Hoch. But, shows hospital wide networks accepted. She knows the network might be  a moot point once the RBP is ready to roll hopefully by March 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-17 13:53:16', '2023-02-20 16:09:00'),
