  ('zcrm_1579374000114070028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090966002', 'Angela Bryan', 'Dependent Name Change', 'Carian should be Carina changed in CRM &amp; A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-17 13:40:43', '2023-02-17 13:40:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114070023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090966002', 'Angela Bryan', NULL, 'After speaking with Cari member realized that the spelling of her daughters name was wrong.  This is a problem because she needs to utilize Cirrus MD and she is registered under misspelled name.  I will correct so file can go over to Cirrus this evening.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-17 13:39:21', '2023-02-17 13:39:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '2-17-2023:  Kelley (& Doug) called re: a stomach/digestion (?) issue she''s had off and on since 2012-ish?  She says the issue is off & on, but it''s been consistent at least the last 6-months.  I walked them thru sub a ''med need'' & told her they have a 6-mos deadline, but worstcase scenario, you include > time period, they may just exclude some.  We talked about what it looks like if it is determined to be pre-x (which they seem to understand it could be), they are in their 3rd yr of memb so would have up to 50k available if needed.  I think they understand pretty well, but it''s a lot of info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-17 13:37:31', '2023-02-17 15:58:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114125027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090966002', 'Angela Bryan', NULL, '2-17-2023:  tt Nahla when she asked for help on Carina.  We decided I would tt Patti to see the best way to handle this.
     - Patti & I agreed, IF Carina has to get into her CirrusMD today, we will have to register her w/the incorrect spelling of her name AND we do NOT know if the doctor will be willing to work w/her since the medical records will show the wrong name.  Angela did send in the req to update the name, but even though Patti''s corr the issue now, it''ll be Monday before it''ll be reflected.
       So, IF Carina needs CirrusMD immediately, we will register her under Carian, making sure we do not know if the doc will have issue w/that.  Then, Monday we will have to send a supp e-mail to CirrusMD to correct her account, because the corr will have gone thru by then.
       Nahla called Angela to let her know what we found out & had to LM.  If they don''t call back, we won''t have to fix the acct, so it''s completely up in the air until we know what the membs decide to do.  It sounds like Carina has a stomach bug.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-17 13:27:40', '2023-02-18 00:38:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114106013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082151010', 'Peter Benjamin', NULL, '2/17/23 - Welcome call completed! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-17 13:09:54', '2023-02-17 13:09:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114065033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113793001', 'Reid Smith-Vaniz', NULL, 'I reached out to Reid today to find out if he''s made a decision to move forward with this. He was in the car with his family, going away for the weekend.  He''s still thinking about it and discussing it with his wife. I reminded him of the deadline, he''s in no hurry, and will try to follow up with me next week.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-17 13:09:53', '2023-02-17 13:09:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114082026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380018', 'Daniel Cardoza', NULL, '02.17.2023 Leah called concerned about some of Daniel''s hospitalization bills, from the visit back 11/2022. Based on the previous notes, Daniel experienced technical issues when trying to open a Zion medical need with Cari, so she transferred him to Zion to open one directly with them.
We are not sure if he was able to do that with Zion, so Leah might be able to help him with opening the need before the 6 months deadline. I emailed Leah the "template for opening a medical need with Zion". NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-17 12:59:13', '2023-02-17 12:59:13'),
